window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2101,"title":"Chapter 2101: Chapter 2100 The Fractured Dimensions! II","paragraphs":["Guinevere felt the change quicker than everyone else the moment that the Avalon Dimension completely finished being displaced as internally, she gave a sigh of relief!","After the events of this Dimensional Conclave, every Dimension had to be fearful of what was to come as Avalon Dimension...would now be protected and hidden under the Imperius Avallonis!","But this was internally.","Externally, her face became livid as she bellowed out with a fearsome draconic roar, Absolute Avalon Authority raging as she called out!","<Avalon!>","Her bellow affirmed many things for all others as they momentarily felt the Source of Avalon tremble, and now one of its core Rulers bellowed out as she didn't stop there.","Guinevere's face was livid as Morgana, Arthus, and others rose up with similar looks as even the Imperius Avallonis...he seemed to be grasping the Sword of Avalon tighter as his gaze was solemn and drawn down.","<While you all scheme and plan here, my very home has been taken as I shall not sit idle any longer!>","Authority bloomed as a spatial light began to wrap around the Avalon Dimensional Rulers.","The environment here was too tense and dangerous currently as they could utilize this chance to leave and reorganize","But...","HOOOONG!","A terrifying authority erupted from CHARLEMAGNE and the Mikado of Old and Strength as it erased any authority from the Avalon Dimensional Rulers.","With a cold gaze, CHARLEMAGNE voiced out.","<Nobody may leave this Conclave.>","BOOM!","The beautifully radiant multicolored rings of light around everyone pulsed as they began to spin.","The very fabric of Reality around them vibrated as space itself seemed to be getting carved out as the rings of light spun, dazzling Absolute Quantum Authority and Absolute Relativity Authority wrapping around everything in a show of wonder!","<We are isolated from space and time at this moment as nobody may leave until we come to an understanding.>","The resonant voice emerged again as the bodies of all Rulers were already blazing with authority and prepared for anything.","<What understanding? Do you truly want a war? Do you want to fracture the very bonds of Dimensions today as you what, hasten the destruction of all Dimensions yourselves?!>","Lilith's booming voice echoed out at this moment as her Will was also very much focused around a certain Imperius Avallonis, many thoughts surging within her as she made her preparations!","<We remain here for no other reason than the Dimensional Inimicus and the displacement of Dimensions.>","The sonorous voice of none other than The Empress rang out as the 4 Tribunal Rulers beside her remained floating like unbreakable pillars.","She gazed towards CHARLEMAGNE with a smile as she continued.","<You suspect that the Dimensional Inimicus is here? Among us in all this as he hides in plain sight?>","BOOM!","Her eyes shone with ingenuity as she asked.","And CHARLEMAGNE gave a light nod as he gazed towards Lilith and then multiple areas within this dazzling circular enclosure!","<Yes. The possibilities are limited in the Barren Lands as The Enders of Reality come to the top of the list, and we have already sent out Rulers to affirm this in the Desolate Mausoleum. As for those here...we have discerned that those with a connection to the Dimensional Inimicus are here as I shall seek cooperation from you all to affirm this and erase any suspicion.>","...!","<Cooperation?>","The ancient voice of the existence from the Prana Dimension rang out with age and life as CHARLEMAGNE nodded.","<Yes. Just open your Souls to a search of Providence, be cleared of any association, and go do what you wish.>","Open your souls.","A simple and yet extremely complex thing to do as one had to essentially leave themselves defenseless while another probed with Providence whether they knew a specific set of information!","<Haha....>","The demonic laughter of Lilith resounded at such a juncture as CHARLEMAGNE ignored it and continued!","<And we shall start with those most recently affected by the Dimensional Inimicus as well as the one being openly opposed to us...The Apollyon, Dream, and Avalon Dimensions.>","WAA!","Providence raged as the targets were set.","Lilith was under suspicion due to her open opposition, while the Dream Dimension was the one that was first affected!","Now, the Avalon Dimension was added to this as all gazes fell on them.","<I see.>","Lilith nodded as her humanoid form slowly began to transform into a valiant demonic figure.","<You truly did just want a war. You should've said that early and not gone about this in such a roundabout way.>","HUUUM!","The Rulers around her pulsed with authority and rallied around her as in pure numbers, The Rulers behind Lilith exceeded any other party here!","<The 9 Dimensions have strived together for eons and carried out a mission handed down by those before us.>","Providence surged around her as her visage began to enlarge and grow with power.","<We have now been abandoned by those very same Ancestors as we must fight with our lives on the line to ensure not just our safety...but the safety of the very Dimensions we called homes! This...is not something I can do alone, so I shall openly seek aid from you all to fight for our homes.>","Her words extended to the Prana and Elysium Dimensional Ruler as well as Avalon and Dream!","The Dimensional Queen truly centered herself as the point of opposition as at this moment, the balance and workings of the Dimensions were on the brink.","At such a time, CHARLEMAGNE rose from his throne while shaking his head.","<You still do not understand. It is not a matter of enemies and allies any longer. It is not a matter of if the Dimensional Inimicus displacing Dimensions will perish or if the Anchors and Desolate Mausoleum will meet their end. It is a forgone conclusion...it is only a matter of when all of this occurs.>","WAA!","<This is because it involves something so much larger and greater. It involves the Will of the Ancestors in the past and the Ancestors now...and these beings wish to protect and assure their interests. Do you know why there are only two Mikados here today? They are guarding the Pylon of Ascension as usual, but today...they are also preparing a welcoming ceremony.>","...!"]},{"number":2102,"title":"Chapter 2102: Chapter 2101 The Fractured Dimensions! III","paragraphs":["<...Do you know why there are only two Mikados here today? They are guarding the Pylon of Ascension as usual, but today...they are also preparing a welcoming ceremony.>","...!","Words that even caused the smile on The Empress to fade were uttered as everything became exceedingly silent.","Only the raging aura potency of multiple Rulers reigned Supreme as the verdant hairs on the ancient Prana Dimensional Ruler that had been vocal this entire time rose in waves.","He was known as Albus.","One of the first generations of trees to sprout in the Prana Dimension.","He was an existence full of experience and wonder as his power could be veiled in ways others could not even imagine.","CHARLEMAGNE had spoken to him directly as they knew each other when they were very young, and very few could say they truly knew his power as he was among the Rulers that were simply unfathomable!","But even he turned somber when he heard CHARLEMAGNE's words.","<The Ancestors are so intent on letting everything end that they would even send others to descend? To become tainted by the Natural Laws and decreta once more?>","...!","Albus couldn't help but ask.","CHARLEMAGNE retained his calm gaze as he replied.","<It is a heavy task for the Ancestors to descend, it is why I want you all to realize the gravity of this situation for them. It is why I want to tell you all not to fight against an unstoppable force. Those coming are existences that may have been True Emperors of a past Age, their colleagues, or even more frighteningly...a First Generation Ancestor. Even I do not know. What I do know is that all resistance is futile. What I know is that once they descend...this Age of Quintessence will become more tumultuous and cataclysmic than even the Age of Chaos, or any other destructive Ages past!>","WAA!","A True Emperor of a Past Age!","Any variation of an Ancestor!","It was a terrifying thought as even the hearts of the strongest Rulers would feel strained at this.","So much so that...","BZZZT!","Auras blazed in the designated thrones of the Apollyon Dimension.","Among those behind Lilith, multiple Rulers suddenly flew out and went towards the side of the Quantum Dimension as a Niflheim Dimensional Ruler with flaming eyes and a skull turned around and spoke with a somber tone.","<You told us before that you would never ask us to lay down our lives for you. We do not wish to lay them down now as we...shall follow the Will of the Ancestors. We cannot stand against them if they are truly descending!>","Deserters began to appear.","It was a development that was to be expected in the face of immense power!","As existences that had integrated with the very fabric of Nature and reached such a height of power, would they truly sacrifice it all just for their Dimension and the countless lives within?","It required a sense of great duty or personal belief to be able to stand against certain death to fight for what one believed!","CHARLEMAGNE said nothing at the Rulers changing sides as his focus was on Lilith and the Dream and Avalon Dimensional Rulers.","<Will you open your Souls the easy way...or shall we do it the hard way?>","...!","A bold question that caused Lilith to burn with even more hatred.","So much hatred that she was about to bellow out when-","BOOOM...CRACK!","An extremely heavy and explosive sound rang out as the rotating multicolored rings of light that encircled this domain and everyone in it...a portion of them ripped and ruptured!","It was an action so out of line that even the Mikado and CHARLEMAGNE looked up with sharp lights in their eyes that showed even they didn't expect this.","After all, they were locked away from space and time as even Rulers of Lilith's caliber would need some time to break through.","As for others locating this domain deep in the Quantum Dimension? This was even more of an impossibility as even though the space they were in was vast, it was currently contained in a single speck of dust smaller than an atom that was floating in the multicolored hazy space of the Quantum Dimension!","Yet now...","<<What a lively cluster of food this is.>>","HOOONG!","From the ruptured ring of light, a claw came in and tore everything open and even wider as the beastial head of a dragon came on soon after.","A dragon whose scales from head to toe crackled with equal concentrations of Absolute Fundamental Authorities of Entropy and Manadynamics as ten pairs of wings radiantly lined up behind its back, its visage stepping into this space as its aura potency...was shockingly at the same level as Lilith, the Mikado, and even CHARLEMAGNE!","It was a new entrant that caused all Rulers to gaze with a sense of incredulity as in an already chaotic Conclave that had too many participating parties...another one was seemingly making an entrance now!","And shockingly...the aura was that of an Ender of Reality.","A Primordial Beast!","—","Its eyes blazed with authority as it gazed at the masses of Sealers and Apostates.","Sealers.","Those who chose to oppress and seal the very home that nurtured them.","Apostates.","Those who chose to shatter its consciousness into countless pieces.","But they did not know...that Reality had been steadily strengthening itself even with its Will fractured.","Even with its will spread out across the countless blooming Realities, it still grew in power!","The Primordial Beasts came to be as they stemmed from the power of Reality itself, being born from the Primordial Seas and Seas of RUINATION within the very fabric of Reality.","Even then, Primordial Beasts were looked down upon!","They couldn't rise in power as much as those who had been living in Anchors this whole time.","Not from the end of one Age to another.","But Reality was still successful in attaining multiple Nature Integration Enders as it could easily integrate natural laws into Beasts that could handle it!","But then not too long ago...Anchors began to lose their power.","And even more recently, an Anchor had fully lost its function as the power that Reality gained...was not fathomable even in the mind of the Sealers and Apostates!","After lying dormant and collecting its power this whole time, this new explosive burst of strength caused Reality to make moves in ways not even possible before.","Like learning about the meeting of Sealers in one place.","After all, they schemed and plotted within the bounds of Reality.","Within the fabric of Reality! How could they escape the eyes of Reality itself?!","And so it had waited at the designated location with the others.","They had to strike at the perfect time as even though one Anchor had lost its function, the power of Reality was still greatly restricted!","But then moments ago...another Anchor was lifted off its function.","Even in its half-slumbering state, Reality had managed to gaze upon the being responsible for this.","He was veiled uniquely, but even he moved within the bounds of Reality as even he...could not escape its gaze.","And with the Seal of another Anchor being lifted, the power that Reality could release was that much more immense as they did not need to wait for a perfect moment any longer!","So now, the First Ender of Entropy and Mana pushed its claws across the rings of essence as its draconic eyes gazed upon the masses.","At the Sealers and Apostates.","And as the rest of its brethren tore open this domain ever wider and began to appear beside him.","As the Second, Third, and Fourth Enders of Entropy and Mana appeared.","As the First to the Tenth Enders of Gravitation lined up further behind them.","As the First Ender of Providence watched in the back.","As many Enders of Nature appeared....the First Ender of Entropy and Mana echoed out as its body began to overflow with power and its jaws opened to release a Dragon's Breath that could erase Nature itself.","<<Reality sends its regards.>>","...!"]},{"number":2103,"title":"Chapter 2103: Chapter 2102 The Cruel Reality! I","paragraphs":["A Lineage that didn't quite get their footing in the Desolate Mausoleum and Nine Dimensions even though they were constructs born from the very fabric of Reality.","Their sole purpose was to return Reality to how it was as they moved with autonomy before, but now...Reality itself was taking a great deal of control!","Control over one of its weapons as with the recent rounds of unsealing, terrifying Enders of Nature were born.","A distinction that was now relevant not just to Enders of Reality who had attained Nature Integration- with a shocking difference now being the augmentation of a specific natural law to birth Enders of Nature!","Thus, the Enders of Entropy and Mana were born.","Then the Enders of Providence, Relativity...many variations of Enders rose as now, their grandeur was being put on full display as they launched an unexpected Siege against the most powerful existences within all Dimensions and even those currently overseeing the Main Reality!","It was an unexpected phenomenon that nobody truly expected, but once it occurred...","<Haha!>","Lilith laughed madly from her position as her body overflowed and exploded with power.","CHARLEMAGNE's figure released a resonant light as the Mikados around him also moved, the many Quantum Dimensional Rulers exploding out with power as multicolored grandeur overflowed!","The Empress and the Tribunal Rulers...their party was even more pristine as all around them...","SHAAA!","Legions of robust and glistening dark gray Abominations began to appear en masse.","Their stature and power seemed to be much greater than any other Abominations as the aura potency of 4 in particular was utterly dreadful!","They all blazed with authority as their power and claws came to be pointed towards the Enders of Nature that continued to pour into the massive rapture from above.","This was the shocking scene blooming out as even at this juncture, some still had the roles of observers as while trying to see how he could best reap benefits from this event and location, Noah was exposed to the power of Rulers firsthand to allow him to quantify just what power they had all reached.","This was because whatever Quadrillions they could dish out in Damage Values just a day ago, they could now have an output much greater after the elevation of the Laws of Reality!","So this...was a perfect opportunity to learn as he himself prepared.","He also didn't have a long period of time as he gazed at everything quickly!","And what he came to find...","The terrifying waves of a few Quadrillion Damage Values were minimal.","Most Rulers on an average scale currently showed a quantified value above 10 Quadrillion as those at the stage of Lilith, CHARLEMAGNE, and the Enders of Entropy and Mana...their power was scaled much greater than this value as their means were grand!","As for the Enders of Nature...","The Ender of Providence continued to remain outside of the rapture as shockingly, more and more Enders than previously seen continued to pour in.","Enders of Polarity. Enders of Strong Nuclear Force. Enders of Relativity!","The Visage of the Ender of Providence was singular and veiled as it seemed to watch everything occurring and only direct it all as with the number of Enders they sent here today....they truly came to hold a grand massacre!","The most powerful and ridiculously buffed Enders of Entropy and Mana that held the two most offensive Fundamental Natural Laws...their bodies released Values reaching tens of Quadrillions as even the fabric of Reality was erased before their grandeur.","And yet even amidst all this...Noah did not receive the prompt of his two Clones here entering the Point of Death and Rebirth.","Why was this?","When creatures as terrifying if not more terrifying than the most powerful Rulers appeared to target everyone here, why were his Clones not put in danger?!","His own power had increased immensely after his Base Values exploded due to the formation of the Fifth and Sixth Dimensional Layers, and they exploded further when integrating with the Source of Dreams by receiving a ridiculous boost of 5,000% Augmentation!","His output also exceeded average Nature Integration Realm existences currently as he could easily dish out over 10 Quadrillion with his skills.","He had grown far in a period of a day as even this...he knew was still not enough to withstand the terrors before him.","So his Avalon Dimensional Chassis rose while grasping the Sword of Avalon while his Dream Dimensional Chassis stood up with the Rulers around it.","He wanted to make gains from this event while understanding the many mysteries that covered it as far, far away from here...his Main Body was still forging ahead.","—","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality underwent yet another round of robust elevation in a short period of time as above the massive planar layer of Dreams, another equally massive and radiant purple layer of Avalon was forged!","Incandescent purple Cosmos could be seen spinning with Seas of purple essence around them, idyllic floating landmasses stretched throughout this vast plane as uniquely, the most radiant idyllic floating landmass was not present within this reformed Avalon Dimension.","Insula Avallonis was actually found in a different location as Suzerain Avallonis Beasts currently gazed around in shock at the depths of the Dimensional Holy Land.","The domain that currently had even greater concentrations of Natural Laws as truly...swirling particles of the Essence of these Laws were surging in a maddening fashion as one could very easily mistake this place for an Empyral Domain of Nature!","Within Insula Avallonis, Lancelot was among the very few beings present who gazed at everything in disbelief as he questioned just who the being he had walked into the Avalon Dimension days ago was.","He brought him towards his father since his intuition had told him this was the being who would aid them- he just didn't expect the extent to be this much and for it to occur in such a short period of time!","He wanted to seek for him and approach him in this location but...the concentration of essences was currently so dense and heavy that even he couldn't move freely.","Part of the reason for this was the Dimensional Holy Land.","Another reason...was the billowing aura budding at the center of the Dream Dimension far below the Holy Land where at this juncture, Noah was already in the process of Integrating the Source of Avalon as he wasted no time!","The figure of Eowyn was off to the side stabilizing her completely reformed Haven as she breathed out in shock, where even she remained still while watching Noah's figure that was surrounded by surging Absolute Authorities while he achieved improbable things.","His stellar humanoid visage pulsed with Six vibrant Dimensional Layers as his Aspects of Existence pulled upon a Source through the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality- this fantastical construct of his that at this juncture...","<Master.>","Interrupted Noah in this extremely crucial moment.","And it had to do so.","<We have been discovered.>","HOOONG!","Noah's eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor opened with grandiosity and power as he heard the words of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, his Will already connected to it as his senses extended to match this construct when he saw...","Four shockingly austere figures of Enders of Nature floating outside the foldings of space that the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality was moving in!","All four shone with golden grandeur as they were all Enders of Providence!!!","Noah could hide from the gaze of many, many beings.","But he still moved within the bounds of Reality.","And nobody...could hide from Reality itself!"]},{"number":2104,"title":"Chapter 2104: Chapter 2103 The Cruel Reality! II","paragraphs":["Four Enders of Nature shockingly gazed at the moving Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality in a progression of events that even Noah did not calculate!","After all, even CHARLEMAGNE, Lilith, and all others in the Dimensional Conclave did not predict the Siege of Reality to arrive.","They were all proficient in Destiny and Providence.","They all knew to ponder fate as some even delved into the Parallel Paths similar to Noah to gaze upon the countless possibilities.","But nobody caught on to the moves of Reality.","Reality whose constructs currently moved with such precision and ferocity that apart from sending Enders of Nature into the Quantum Dimension...there now stood Four Enders of Providence outside Noah's Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","Each one shone with power that no average Nature Integration Realm existence could match as any Enders of Nature that were augmented by Fundamental Natural Laws...were not to be taken lightly.","Hell, there was even a single Ender of Providence floating silently in the back of the ruptured space of the location of the Dimensional Conclave that discovered everything- seemingly ready to send commands to adapt to the other Enders at any moment.","And now, four of such creatures shining with utmost glory and power floated outside Noah's home.","HUUUM!","Providence surged with grandeur as within a Cosmos of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, Hyperion awoke as his eyes released blinding blue light- his draconic elephantine face gazing upwards.","Little Henry, Kazuhiko, Halcyon, and many others were also remaining in this region as there eyes also turned up!","Those with enough power could see across the folds of space and Cosmos to gaze upon many things as Little Henry and a few others...became somber at seeing the hazy phantoms of four Enders buzzing with power that they had yet to see!","Where even Noah's upgrades and increase in aura that they constantly come across...this was the first they felt this type of Aura Potency!","And it came from four separate Existences as they realized they were facing an utterly unprecedented event.","HUUUM!","The figure of Hyperion released a blinding light as space around him fluctuated, his body forming into a beam of light that began to surge upwards.","...!","An ordeal had begun as at this juncture, nobody fully knew how it would play out!","---","The Second Ender of Providence gazed at the hidden construct before that was giving off the allure of three Sources.","Two it recognized very well as these Sources had been suppressing Reality for the past Ages, and another was a weak but budding force that it also felt a sense of familiarity with!","This was the Domain that the Will of Reality had been observing ever since it rose on its radar.","The importance granted to this endeavor today was just as great if not greater than the many other areas Enders of Nature were deployed, with the being in question...","SHAA!","Appearing at this juncture in a stellar fashion.","The folds of space opened to reveal an incandescent bring whose body glimmered with waves of light, but this meant nothing to the Four Enders of Providence here as what they focused on was this being's Aspects of Existence.","They affirmed what Reality had seen from its recent observations that this being had truly bound the Source of Dreams that was placed by the Sealers so long ago, and he had now done the same thing to the Source of Avalon as he was binding it to himself as well!","These sets of actions were extremely unique as in a sense, this being had aided greatly in the empowerment and freedom that Reality had right now, but Reality itself...could not leave him be.","The unique power he had to do what he did was too great.","Its repercussions too grand!","And he was taking while binding it to himself as in the end, he would attain a great power.","A power that might be more than sufficient for him to do whatever he wanted in the Desolate Mausoleum...and to the Desolate Mausoleum.","Reality could not have this.","After all, the very beings that moved within it countless eons ago- they had absconded after using its own power to seal it!","To oppress it in unimaginable ways as from this, Reality learned it could not trust those it could not control.","Years after its suppression, it once more faced an unprecedented event where it was split into countless fragments- an action that doomed it to damnation as this time, it was those that resided in its depths.","Apostates!","Sealers and Apostates- all born from the same branch.","So now, even though this existence had aided and even conducted a recent action that continued to aid and free it from its binds- Reality was unconvinced.","It could not trust what it could not control.","It was shown this time and time again!","Their actions had turned Reality cautious. Their actions had turned Reality calculative.","Their continued actions...had made Reality cruel!","So the Second, Third, and Fourth Enders of Providence was here.","They were here for no other purpose than...","<<Judgment.>>","HUUUM!","The four Enders of Providence spoke at the same time as the fabric of Reality trembled.","From the foldings of space, a figure wrapped in light broke through as it was a reclamation of another one of the constructs of Reality- it was the visage of Hyperion!","The eyes of the Irregularity flashed at this moment as a radiant Xyston appeared in his hands, his eyes wild and unfettered as if he could even stand against the Four Enders of Providence without multiple of his Clones perishing.","The Third Ender of Providence moved to receive Hyperion as it was a creature in the form of a 9-Headed Phoenix, its many eyes sharp and shining with ingenuity as its flaming claws grabbed onto Hyperion.","Hyperion whose body was struggling all this time, but paused and became still soon after as a resonance of Lineage shone from him and the Third Ender of Providence whose eyes showed scenes dating back the past years!","The 9 pairs of eyes on this incandescent gold Phoenix then shone as its voice filled with authority thundered out.","<<Irregularity Noah Osmont...cede control of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.>>","BOOOOM!"]},{"number":2105,"title":"Chapter 2105: Chapter 2104 Control! I","paragraphs":["<<Irregularity Noah Osmont...cede control of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.>>","...!","The Enders of Providence began a line of communication as it was a truly heavy sentence!","It wasn't truly a communication with the Enders of Nature as much as it was a communication with Reality, the eyes of the Enders releasing radiant white blue light as an extremely powerful will coagulated here!","It saw many things.","It was how even at this moment, radiant phantom golden lines erupted from the Irregularity before it as the authoritative voice continued, this time from another Ender of Providence that had the form of an Empyral Ten-Winged Providential Tigress.","<<Whether on the Main Path or Parallel Paths, the result is all the same as Reality pervades all paths. Reality thanks you for your actions thus far and seeks control of the construct you are bound to.>>","HUUM!","Extremely cold words echoed out as Reality truly could not have things repeat themselves again.","Time and time again over countless eons, it had been failed. This time, it sought control over the things that would affect it the most!","The only issue was that it had tried to reclaim the parts of Reality in the construct below. It could not do it as there was too much of a bond.","The issue was the being in question.","The being whose eyes shone with the same grandiosity and Tyranny it remembered from the Sealers eons ago.","The being that it had seen in other Paths say the same thing with utmost Tyranny.","At this juncture, it knew that it was about to hear the same thing again.","But it had planned for too many possibilities as even then, it knew what had to be done!","—","Noah felt himself facing an unprecedented situation that he had actually brought upon himself in his search for power!","Had he not freed the Dream and Avalon Dimensions to bind them to himself, he wouldn't have made Reality regain so much of its power that now...its power seemed like a ridiculously strong contender for everything!","This was because one must understand...only two of its Seals had been lifted.","Only the Dream and Avalon Anchors had lost their functions as the mere full Understanding of Natural Laws had their boosts moved from 1,000% to now 3,000% in augmentations.","For every single natural law.","Those who understood and then integrated Natural Laws gained greatly in power. As for Reality itself that was made by these very Laws...it had grown capable of producing Enders of Nature that could match beings at the level of Lilith currently!","At only the freeing of 2 Seals. If Noah continued on his path for power and assimilated another Dimension or two into his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality...just how terrible would the power that Reality can wield become?","An even more stupendous question was the strength of Natural Laws...each one would gain an equivalent augmentation of 10,000% after the remaining 7 Dimensions were removed. With such a power in terms of Natural Laws and the height of glory of the fabric of Reality...how had the Ancestors managed to seal it with the 9 Anchors?","There were too many gaps to fill.","There were too many questions!","But one thing remained abundantly clear.","Reality was an extremely difficult enemy as one could not escape it.","So when its forces came knocking and sought control of the construct that made so many things possible for him...what move was the best for Noah to make?","SHIING!","Even after hearing the Enders of Providence utter out that the Parallel Paths did not matter, Noah still perused what he could while utilizing <I Am the Main Character>.","And in every possible path...Destiny and Providence turned tumultuous as the future was unknown!","But the light of Tyranny began to burn bright in his eyes.","As he finished connecting with a Second Source and his Aspects of Existence pulsed with an even greater change...an epiphany bloomed in his mind!","Why was the Will of Reality acting like this?","When he had aided and freed it of its bonds, why did it seek to take the tools he utilized to do it?","Noah's mind was robust and powerful as he didn't have to think for too long for things to become clear. His mind traversed to the events of the Ancestors eons ago and then the actions of OPPENHEIMER in the last Age.","These events...had twisted Reality into gaining a shocking sense of hate and distrust!","So the way to deal with this...","The path before him gradually cleared as he realized exactly how to deal with Reality itself.","What seemed like the most direct and clear answer of fighting...was incorrect!","So instead, he voiced out grandly while staring at the celestial beastial visage of four Enders of Providence.","\"The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality I've forged this whole time...it lives and dies with me.\"","...!","Without a speck of authority.","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor addressed the Will of the Barren Lands!","Out of the many possible paths, the one with least resistance was taken.","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality lives and dies with me!","It was a very clear answer that stated no matter what...this construct would remain bound to him until the end of his life.","He did not have to pull every card he had out and begin a deadly fight against Reality.","So he instead threatened it with the very thing it sought by bringing for Enders of Nature here!","But Reality truly had turned cruel as in the next instant...","<<You would not be capable of choosing the path of mutual destruction. I have seen you. I have seen those you hold dear within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality. Even though you may be binding Sources of Nature, you are bound even more by the same emotions that bound Sealers and Apostates. You would not choose a path that will lead to the destruction of all things in this construct. You...have not reached the stage to ascend and overcome such karmic bonds.>>","...!"]},{"number":2106,"title":"Chapter 2106: Chapter 2105 Control! II","paragraphs":["<< You...have not reached the stage to ascend and overcome such karmic bonds.>>","The pairs of eyes of the foremost Ender glanced down with a burning gaze as Noah returned with calm eyes, putting away the Dimensional Xyston entirely as he replied.","\"I have faced many enemies and allies in my short life. I've gone against what were believed to be insurmountable enemies and come out on top. I can make Reality my enemy...but what I wish to do is too connected to Reality for me to do that. I have goals...I have ideals!\"","WAA!","Noah's dazzling hair whipped around with tyranny as he continued!","\"All these goals and ideals though...are dependent on the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality. On this home I have made. It truly cannot be given away as even if I have to take the most drastic action that would hurt me the most...it would hurt you a great deal more as Reality would continue towards Cataclysm. Dimensions would continue towards Cataclysm. But with my means, I can stop this. With my means, I can continue to unseal all Anchors as we both win! Why can things not be done this way?\"","...!","Waves of destiny and Providence rose as they were quickly ground down to Dust by the 4 Enders of Providence.","Why could it not allow Noah to continue holding this terrifying tool in his hands? Why did it want him to cede control of the capability to free it that he had been utilizing this whole time?!","The answer was something Reality understood the most as it did not relent, pulling out one last card before everything fell apart.","<<Do you wish to attain the Seat of the True Emperor of this Age? Even that is a construct connected to the Source of Reality. It is not an impossibility to bend what was forged long ago and focus this authority on you. Just leave the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality behind...and I can pull the strings to make you the True Emperor of this Age.>>","...!","Reality's greatest weapon was unveiled.","Rulership.","True Emperor!","Everything turned silent.","But soon after...","Noah's vibrant eyes released vibrant splendor as he replied calmly.","\"No.\"","WAA!","His Main Body was radiant as his Kainos Authority and title fully blared and released themselves, the words QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR shining brightly above him.","\"I do not need the allure of Rulership as in this Age, nobody but me shall attain the Seat of the True Emperor.\"","<<That is not guaranteed. There are others exceeding you in Aspects of Quintessence as they receive aid from outside these Lands. I can guarantee it for you.>>","An abrupt reply came as towards this, Noah only shook his head.","The surroundings churned with essence as the dominant auras of 4 Enders of Nature cascaded down, things becoming extremely tense and oppressive at this juncture!","Why could the Irregularity not be left alone as he continued to remove the Anchors?","This was a question that this Irregularity had posed as the answer...was simply that he would achieve a power that would be capable of greatly affecting Reality if he really came to bind all Nine Anchors.","When that time came, what was to prevent what occurred in the past from repeating again? From the actions of Sealers and Apostates?!","\"How about this? You cannot deny my nature as from Hyperion, you have seen why I do the things that I do. It is fine if you do not trust me. In fact, it is understandable after all the events that have occurred throughout history. So...why don't you watch me and what I continue to do? As I continue to unseal the Anchors and grant you a level of freedom you haven't had in eons?\"","<<...>>","The Enders of Providence gazed at Noah coldly as they did not reply.","\"Gaze upon the countless Parallel Paths and see...what actions do I take time and time again?\"","Dense silence descended once more as a second later...the deep voice of Reality bellowed out slowly and with solemnity.","<<Irregularity...you are not truly within any of the Parallel Paths.>>","BOOOM!","Providence surged as a shocking statement was uttered from the mouth of the Third Ender of Providence as it transmitted the Will of Reality!","<<What you see when you gaze upon the myriad Paths and what I saw were mere reflections of yourself that exist only when focusing on the you that is here and your probabilities. When ignoring you and focusing on others...Noah Osmont is not prevalent in any Parallel Paths. His actions are not heard of. His accomplishments are nonexistent. The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality does not exist in any other Parallel Paths, otherwise I would have simply attained it from countless possibilities. Irregularity...you are such a being as you seem to only be moving on this Main Path.>","HOONG!","Noah's Origin shuddered as the Integration with the Source of Avalon was nearly affected!","The words released were too unbelievable as Reality itself asserted that he was not present in the myriad Parallel Paths!","When he gazed at himself through <I Am The Main Character> or when being like Guinevere gazed back at his parallel self in the Avalon Dimension...it was only a reflection of himself.","If he was not focused on by those from this Main Path, nobody would be able to locate a Noah Osmont in the myriad of Parallel Paths!","It was a set of information that caused many questions to rise as even Noah's mind was computing millions of thoughts at this juncture.","His eyes retained their bright light of Tyranny as after a few short seconds of solemnity, he shook his head while gazing back at the Enders of Nature sharply.","\"It matters not. I've removed only two Anchors as you have regained such a level of power that can likely overwhelm me if you so choose. When I remove a third or fourth anchor...won't you become even more powerful and reclaim a stupendous amount of authority. When all 9 Anchors are released, can anyone in these Barren Lands even stand against you? Something with your grandiosity...do you truly need to fear someone like me? If it is a matter of trust, have these Enders remain here to watch and ascertain. My answer to you is that I will not cede control of what I have worked so hard to achieve, but you are always welcome to observe as I continue to aid you and stop the coming Cataclysm!\"","WAA!","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor remained standing on his radiant ground even in the face of the Will of the Barren Lands!","No matter what treasures and authority were dangled before his eyes.","No matter what explosive knowledge or truth came out!","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor did not waver!"]},{"number":2107,"title":"Chapter 2107: Chapter 2106 Extinction Of Nature! I","paragraphs":["\"You've had many enemies across eons.\"","The voice of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor was resonant as he spoke fearlessly towards the Four Enders of Providence.","The atmosphere was tense without a proper pathway set to occur as Noah continued.","\"Those within the Main Reality are your enemies, those outside of it in the Dimensions are your enemies...and even those outside these Barren Lands are your enemies, with some of them even set to descend in the future to come. You are the very fabric of Reality, and yet nobody is standing by your side. Why make yet another enemy when you could possibly have someone fighting for you after all these eons?\"","<<You do not fight for the sake of Reality. You did not remove the 2 Anchors for anybody other than yourself.>>","\"Yes. But it still stands that it benefitted you. It still stands that when I remove another Anchor, you will once more regain greater levels of power. Even though it is for myself- it is also Reality in the end that benefits!\"","HUUM!","The Will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor was unshaken as at this moment, his vibrant body actually turned around and gazed at the hidden boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality below him as his figure...actually began to descend into it!","\"Attack me and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality if you wish, or watch and observe as I remove Anchors and you continue to elevate to greater heights. We have better things to do than go back and forth when in actuality, the goals we seek are the same.\"","...!","Shockingly, Noah turned his back and returned to the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as he left behind words that could be heard with astounding clarity for the Endeds of Nature!","\"The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality is open to you...just know that the Rulers of the Sources I have bound are extended the banner of allies as even though they were past Rulers of Anchors that bound you- they are now under me and will only be utilized to further achieve my aims.\"","<<...>>","Against an unprecedented nexus event and possible threat against the very fabric of Reality, the Quintessential Kainos Emperor said what he had to say as he promptly returned back to his abode!","The Four Enders gazed at this sight with sharp eyes as the fabric of space around them trembled.","The folds of space became twisted and torn as soon after, it ripped apart to reveal multiple more terrifying auras of Enders of Nature as at their forefront, an Ender that looked to be an ancient species of beast from the Age of Power could be seen.","Its body looked like a chimera of a Draconian Qilin Phoenix as it swirled with three Absolute Fundamental Authorities of Entropy, Manadynamics, and Relativity!","Its body shone with radiant blue, black, and purple fur and scales as ten pairs of flaming aurora of wings burned on its back.","It had pupils that looked like clusters of Realities that flashed with power at this moment as it voiced out.","<<Go. Cover it on all sides and keep watch.>>","WAA!","Behind it, 5 Enders of Relativity flew out and went towards the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, another 5 Enders of Manadynamics and 5 of Entropy also flying out as they seamlessly passed through the Boundary!","At the same time, the figure of Hyperion was released as his eyes regained their countenance, looking around with solemnity as his gaze came to land on the Draconian Qilin Phoenix that looked at him coldly and flicked his figure into the unique construct below them.","<<You also keep watch, and remember the Source you stemmed from.>>","...!","A terrifying development occurred as the Will of Reality had not even shown most of its terrific force, where if Noah truly had chosen the path of fighting and mutual destruction...it would be hard to predict what would have unfolded!","But now, 15 powerful Enders of Nature entered the bounds of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as for the Will of the Barren Lands...this location was more important than anything else currently.","It could not rely on the Irregularity alone if it could not gain control of the construct, and it had to guard it to make sure it wasn't destroyed!","After all, it was one of a kind across the many Parallel Paths.","The Draconian Qilin Phoenix that spoke coldly as its eyes filled with clusters of Reality shone with pure white light as it commanded the Four Enders of Providence before it.","<<Cover its four directions as it traverses across the Boundary Between Realities. Veil it with Providence and prevent any Apostates or Sealers from discovering it! Keep an eye on the Irregularity and any new authorities he attains.>>","...!","An austere development bloomed as a very hidden and fortified land was gradually becoming an impenetrable fortress, the Auras hidden within it would be enough to cause some particularly powerful existences to turn somber!","The Draconian Qilin Phoenix watched all this occur with coldness as being the first Ender of Nature to be reforged with three Fundamental Natural Laws, its power was mighty as its authority and responsibility were even more so!","After achieving one of the possible results here- albeit one it didn't truly like, its gaze turned towards a certain direction as it pierced across the veils of space.","It stared towards the direction of none other than the Main Reality!","—","Parallel Paths.","The sum of all probabilities that stemmed from major Nexus Events in the Main Path.","The myriad of Parallel Paths are constantly transposed on each other...and at the same time they're not as very few existences could gain access to them to view their Parallel Selves, nor could they do anything more complex than viewing!","The Parallel Paths were different versions of probable Realities that did not occur in the Main Path, existing alongside it as with them- others could extrapolate possible futures or try to better grasp possibilities with Fate, Destiny, or Providence.","And others...well, they did much, much more!"]},{"number":2108,"title":"Chapter 2108: Chapter 2107 Extinction Of Nature! II","paragraphs":["In the Quantum Dimension.","In a region of a multicolored sea of Quantum Essence that stretched out endlessly.","HOOONG!","Terrifying waves of power were felt within this sea as an object smaller than even a grain of sand held some of the most terrifying contenders of the current Age within- this circular domain being the location of the Dimensional Conclave as currently, an Ender of Providence was outside a pulsing rupture of space watching the chaos within!","A chaos that held Enders, Dimensional Rulers, Tribunal Rulers, and even bodies of the Irregularity!","The Ender of Providence watched all this as in her mind, countless commands were sent out to the Enders of Entropy and Mana, Relativity, Gravitation...multiple Enders of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws weaved in as many were directed towards Lilith and the rows of Rulers behind her, towards The Empress and the Tribunal Rulers around her surrounded by Legions of Abominations, but even more were directed towards the Quantum Dimensional Rulers.","The reason for this was not the Mikado of Old or the Mikado of Strength.","They were powerful to be the one of the two that guarded the Pylon of Ascension.","But they still weren't the reason why two of the Enders of Entropy and Mana surged towards them along with over a dozen other Enders in tow!","It was for...none other than the visage of the INSURMOUNTABLE DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR.","The being who had taken the lead in the Dimensional Conclave!","Just what was his power?","As he faced this unexpected situation, his calmness had already returned as his body released a wave of unique power.","And a moment later...","SHIING!","Golden doorways began to open around him as from them, figures that looked exactly like him in form but had variations in their adornments appeared.","Their eyes shone with the same triangular pupils as they held great power and purpose within them, their bodies lighting up with Absolute Quantum Authority and multiple Fundamental Natural Laws as 10 of such figures shot out towards the ancient beastial bodies of Enders of Nature!","They were not Clones.","They were existences that seemed exactly like CHARLEMAGNE but at the same time not as these...were his Parallel Selves that he had called out from Parallel Paths!","It was a unique capability that someone in the Age of Destiny had expressed as a major part of his power that very few could replicate.","It was something most Rulers knew well because of the Legends of this being as when it was seen by all, Lilith was the one to erupt with unbound rage while bellowing out!","<YOU DARE?!>","BOOOM!","Her figure ignored the Enders of Nature around her as she instantly turned onto a streak of light towards none other than CHARLEMAGNE.","CHARLEMAGNE who was currently not just using an ability similar to the existence that was Hatred- but exactly the same one without an ounce of fear!","But this wasn't all.","The body of CHARLEMAGNE that had called out his parallel selves breathed in as his chest expanded, his hand folding into a fist that he threw out to the space below him.","A fist that seemed to be moving slowly, but as it moved across space...an incandescent glow of gray light began to build around this fist with great concentration.","...!","It was the light of NULLITY.","BZZZT...CRACK!","It felt so immensely dense and concentrated even more than the NULLITY Beasts surrounding the Tribunal Rulers that also gazed over this direction with surprise and solemnity- their eyes and the eyes of all here only being able to catch his fist smashing onto the fabric of Reality as soon after, circular waves of NULLITY began to spread out with his fist at the center!","Waves of NULLITY that instantly erased all the surging authorities from all being in this space emanated out as the only authorities still raging were from Manadynamics!","And before the shocking dust could even settle to allow others to react, the interminable gaze of CHARLEMAGNE released splendorous light as his fist unfolded and turned into a palm.","A palm that he brought to cover the left side of his chest as his body began to illuminate with an indescribable light.","A light that formed into rays of terrifying lights as with his figure at the center, countless rays of Obsidian green essence that very few were familiar with emanated from him and targeted all those labeled as enemies by him!","...!","It was a shocking show of power.","A power that seemed to far exceed the upper tier of beings as fearlessly, CHARLEMAGNE targeted all enemies here himself!","—","Parallel selves, NULLITY, and the Absolute Authority of Poison that was utilized by the True Emperor of the Age of Terror.","CHARLEMAGNE felt all of these coursing within his body as he released it all without a delay, his eyes cold and calculating as even if Reality itself stood before him- he would not falter!","But of course, Reality was still a fortress to tackle as he didn't need to expend all his strength on it now.","So while the innumerable rays of Absolute Authority of Poison emanated from him and all nearby enemy Rulers tried to defend, he called out once more.","<Age of Haven.>","HUUM!","Abstruse and immense power from a past Age filled him once again, his body swirling with four foreign essences as his figure turned into particles of pure light.","Particles of light that were so fast that he instantly appeared behind Lilith's enraged figure, his hands pulsing with NULLITY as they slashed down with great killing intent!","BZZZT!","Time was moving extremely slowly as shockingly, Lilith did not even turn around as her butterfly-like wings that had bloomed behind her fluttered with a spatial light, her figure instantly becoming displaced as in her place- an incredulous and confused Niflheim Dimensional Ruler appeared!","Before he could even ascertain what was happening, the hand of CHARLEMAGNE pulsing with NULLITY smashed down as the Aspects of Existence of this Dimensional Ruler trembled.","It was a Wraith Lich Emperor whose incorporated body wheezed with fear at this moment as it felt its multiple Lines of Integration to Niflheim, Gravity, Polarity, and Weak Nuclear Force all become shredded and desegregation in a mere instant!","The hand of CHARLEMAGNE then seemingly enlarged to cover everything about this Ruler as it crushed down upon everything it enveloped, a life being snuffed out right after.","...!","An existence that had been Integration with Nature...had fallen so easily as he had received tens of Quadrillions of Damage Values that emptied his Barrier, Vitality, and an instant desegregation of all integrated Sources as Nature was extinguished soon after!","HOOONG!","A dying light illuminated as a Ruler fell, CHARLEMAGNE's figure being seen in this location as Lilith's displaced figure gazed forward with eyes of utter madness, a bellow rising from the depths of her soul as her forehead split open to reveal a terrifying crimson demonic eye.","An eye that pulsed with wonder as an instant later, three crimson portals opened to reveal the figures of Undead Emperor Feng and other fantastical amalgamations of Undead that had the auras of Rulers!","It was a breathtaking scene to see amidst the Dimensional Conclave that had become one of utmost chaos.","Dimensional Rulers began to fall as nature itself was extinguished!","Too many beings were involved and moving as amidst all of this, very few were paying attention to the forces of Dream and Avalon that had also begun to move at this moment!"]},{"number":2109,"title":"Chapter 2109: Chapter 2108 Extinction Of Nature! III","paragraphs":["The current battlefield was filled with monsters.","Genuine and increasingly terrifying monsters that at the very peak, one of them was casually releasing attacks that could evaporate average Nature Integration Realm existences within an instant- their integrated Laws being desegregated and their bodies destroyed soon after!","And while this being did this, his Parallel Selves were also moving against other Rulers and Enders as they stood toe to toe with them or even overpowered them in aura.","Then, there was a demoness that was currently enraged while three Undead Nature Integration existences surged beside her!","<To even dare to use his legacy?! You are not worthy!>","HUUM!","Her body resonated with Undead Emperor Feng and the other two Undead Emperors beside her, drawing upon their authority as it surged into the crimson eye on her forehead and kept her on the same level as her attacker- CHARLEMAGNE.","The existence that would not be denied what he wished for!","He attained shocking speed that only the fastest True Emperor from the Age of Haven was famous for, his figure constantly staying at Lilith's tail as his Parallel Selves focused on the other parties he needed to scrutinize.","At this juncture in this increasingly chaotic battlefield, one of his Parallel Selves gazed towards the Dream and Avalon Dimensional Rulers.","And his eyes became ever sharper as these beings...were being wrapped in a silvery spatial light while surging towards the only exit that was the ruptured space amidst the Quantum Rings!","The only exit that had Enders of Reality blocking in and continuing to pour more of their forces through.","CHARLEMAGNE looked at the scene and snorted as one of his parallel selves began to surge towards the two parties.","He expected them to be held back greatly by the Enders of Nature as thereafter, he wanted to focus on capturing a few beings in particular!","One of them was the newly crowned Imperious Avallonis whom all the Avalonian Dimensional Rulers listened to.","The other one was the newly appearing Dream Dimensional Ruler that also fell under suspicion, CHARLEMAGNE wishing to put all these suspicions to rest as he surged towards them with purpose!","That was until moments later...his eyes shone with incredulity and surprise as the interference he expected from the Enders of Nature along with the chaotic battle where they fought for their lives while trying to escape...did not occur.","He instead saw the Avalon and Dream Dimensional Rulers with confidence completely wrapping their Authority around enhancing their speed and spatial waves of light as they actually passed the Enders of Nature as if they did not exist!","The terrifying Enders of Nature with their vibrant beastial forms also didn't pay any heed to them as they continued surging inwards towards the Abominations and Tribunal Rulers as well as CHARLEMAGNE's forces.","It was a shocking scene as even some of the Dream and Avalon and Dimensional Rulers seemed surprised that things were playing out in this manner, with the one wielding the Sword of Avalon at the forefront as one by one...they disappeared into the ruptured ring of light as the Ender of Providence that stood at the very center of it only spared them a cold glance while continuing to watch the chaotic battle unfolding within!","This unbelievable scene was caught by the eyes of many, the most important ones being Lilith, CHARLEMAGNE, and the Tribunal Rulers-the latter groups instantly becoming somber as in their minds, the act of the Enders of Nature utterly ignoring the two groups of Dimensional Rulers that had their Anchors lifted from the Desolate Mausoleum meant only a single thing.","That these beings had defected under the banner of Reality as somehow...it was Reality itself that had gained enough power to begin lifting the Anchors with the aid of these Rulers!","The genuine possibility that the very Fabric of Reality was the Dimensional Inimicus rose in their hearts at this moment, although in the mind of Lilith who was convinced of the identity of the Dimensional Inimicus- she only gained a greater level of shock as she attached even more importance to the Irregular that she knew much more than others here.","HOONG!","At this juncture, the figure of Charlemagne released a dazzling wave of power as while chasing Lilith, his main Visage bellowed out.","<The Will of Reality is behind the disappearance of the two Anchors! Find the Dream and Avalon Dimensional rulers and you shall find the two Anchors!>","...!","Entropy surged as in a chaotic battle with combatants that could easily wipe out average Nature Integration Realm existences, Noah had conducted a single move that changed many things.","One of the major changes was the most powerful enemies had now placed the target of the Dimensional Inimicus on none other than Reality, their already valid suspicions of the Dream and Avalon Dimensional Rulers were also affirmed, as CHARLEMAGNE was not given the chance to search any souls!","Noah had taken this option away as he instead took his Avalon and the Dream Dimensional Chassis to safety as the moment this was accomplished, another change occurred in the Rapture that the Ender of Providence guarded.","The aura of a True Sanguine Clone appeared as even though Noah couldn't jeopardize the Avalon and the Dream Dimensional Chassis as they were too important, he also could not miss out on such an enormous Nexus Event that had large clusters of loot along with its intense dangers.","So a True Sanguine Clone was sent forth.","And at this moment, time slowed and nearly came to a stop in his eyes.","Time slowed as he did something he had done a few times before.","He stopped an instant...and he stretched it out as much as possible with the time dilation effect of the Dimensional Holy Land and his own mind that could compute countless thoughts within a moment.","The events of the Dimensional Conclave and the abundantly powerful existences within it seemingly came to a stop as his perspective entirely shifted to his main body!"]},{"number":2110,"title":"Chapter 2110: Chapter 2109 A Moment In Time! I","paragraphs":["Noah's eyes and Will were turned upwards as he gazed at the wonders he had contributed to.","\"Hoo...\"","He breathed out calmly as he reflected on the precipice he stood on right now, where a large portion of his actions were always done with the ideology of only moving forward!","Yet he had truly arrived at a grand point in time as even if it wasn't normally registered in his mind after it had been warped from him dreaming for millions of years and everything else he went through, he had arrived at a place others could not even imagine.","This was exemplified greatly by the scene that he currently looked at.","Across the folds of space from the Dimensional Holy Land his main body had relocated to, he could see the outline of an Ender of Nature stationed inside the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality- albeit near its boundary...as it spread its aura out and gazed both afar and within!","There were multiple Enders like it spread out across the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as there were even Four Enders of Providence in all 4 directions actively releasing an imperceptible golden veil over this whole construct!","This...was the precipice he had arrived at.","Where someone within less than 2 years, from a life of normalcy on a blue planet...he was now communicating and tangling with the very Fabric of Reality.","It was surreal to see as even for him who rarely looked back and only continued to forge forward, he was brought to a stop!","But...even this reflection could not last long.","Because as much as he could look at where he was then and the place he had arrived now, the present was always ever changing as all of these accomplishments...they could all be taken away if he was not careful enough!","So his path had to be clear in his mind.","As he stared out into the expanse of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality and felt the successful binding of the Source of Avalon to him and the grand changes it caused as his body erupted into incandescent waves of light...he affirmed many plans and possibilities.","The most important thing he sought was power, but on the side of binding Sources of Decreta...he had to bring it to a halt after Avalon as too many uncertainties were arising with his actions!","He was strengthening his enemies at a greater pace than himself every time he pulled out an Anchor as even Reality itself was strengthened to an alarming degree.","The Rulers that had lived for billions and Trillions of years had too strong of a foundation and had already bound multiple Natural Laws.","The foundation of Reality didn't even need to be mentioned as it showed its prowess in the recent day!","But what about him?","He had only bound two Sources of Nature and no Natural Laws as his foundation...even though it was robust, it was still much lesser than the strongest beings!","And this was only logical and natural as ridiculously, it had only been around a week since Noah jumped from the Firmaments of Ascendancy and into the stage of Nature Integration.","Even his Refinement of EMPYRAL Bones, Organs, and Musculature was only coming to completion now as it was propelled upwards with the constant boosts in power his Aspects of Existence experienced!","But he needed a more robust foundation.","He needed to integrate with Natural Laws so he could truly enjoy the boosts of the removal of Anchors just like everyone else.","Because the power of beings like CHARLEMAGNE and Lilith was reaching destructive and unimaginable levels- and they would only continue to rise as time passed!","And when it came to binding the Sources of Reality...","<There should be enough of an accumulated Source for three Natural Laws or possibly one Fundamental Natural Law currently, Master.>","The voice of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality rang out in his mind as the pathway to binding Natural Laws was already laid out. He had to simply bind these Sources of Nature that were pervasive across the fabric of Reality...and he had swallowed enough of Reality to slowly build up a Source that the Enders of Nature themselves saw when they first appeared!","They had seen the Sources of Avalon and Dream within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, as well as a budding Source of this unique construct itself.","A Source that had only continued to grow in power as for Noah to bind more and more Natural Laws, he only needed to devour more of the Fabric of Reality!","It wasn't just the Realities in the Desolate Mausoleum- even the Dimensions were part of Reality as Natural Laws affected them as well, and the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality had been greatly strengthened when Dream and Avalon Dimensions were assimilated into it.","And Noah had attained enough of a Source of Reality- even if it was a minuscule portion of it, to bind some Laws to himself.","This would be a part of his strength as to survive on a battlefield where beings like The Empress, Lilith, and CHARLEMAGNE moved in, Noah would need even greater sources of power!","Enough to withstand tens of Quadrillions of Damage Values safely while dishing out something similar.","So in this 'instant' that was stretched out into an extended period of time for him, a lot had to be done for him to prepare!","\"Begin the design of the next form of the Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Techniques, Empower everything that can be Empowered, fuse all Ascendant Edicts into the Stanchions...\"","HUUM!","Space began to vibrate with splendor as his Origin began to move.","His Origin that along with his body and soul were currently undergoing their own unfinished changes brought by the Integration of the Source of Dreams and Avalon!","\"As for the Natural Law to bind...you mentioned the word 'probably' when talking about Fundamental Natural Laws?\"","<Yes, Master. You would not be able to attain true and full Integration as Fundamental Natural Laws are too pervasively connected to the fabric of Reality and cannot have their entire Source contained within me. I might only be able to give you a semblance of control, but it will not be as profound as the Sources of Dimensions.>","...!","Things would never be made so easy for him as his eyes shone with brightness at these words, his Will ringing out again.","\"No matter, we shall see what comes of it. Begin with the Integration of Manadynamics.\"","WAA!","His body was already surrounded by surging waves of radiant light. But they seemed to always increase in concentration and grandeur as Noah sought to boost himself in order to survive against some of the strongest beings within the Barren Lands!"]},{"number":2111,"title":"Chapter 2111: Chapter 2110 A Moment In Time! II","paragraphs":["Every single one of his actions came with purpose as they all went towards making him progressively more powerful as he accumulated grander and grander levels of authority.","As Noah finished putting together Ascendant Edicts into his Stanchions and began the process of Integrating with the Fundamental Natural Law of Manadynamics, he looked at the result of the grand action of integrating with the Source of Avalon that came with its own wonders!","<The Source of Avalon has been Opened.>","<The Source of Avalon has been Bound by the Quintessential Kainos Emperor.>","<Another quintessential action has been taken!>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","Boundlessly radiant prompts had come down over the past few seconds as the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality had taken the task of bearing the weight of yet another Source for him while he bound it to himself.","With this Source as well...Noah's will instantly connected to it as he saw the dozens of Rulers integrated with it, once more choosing those that Providence did not warn him about as the targets for <Neural Encroachment>!","<You have integrated your Will into another Nature as you gaze upon the profundity of Avalon.>","<You can freely utilize Absolute Avalon Authority to the extent that your Soul can bear.>","<The Augmentation from the Source of Avalon has been greatly elevated.>","<You have gained an unprecedented level of control over the Source of Avalon and those it is bound to.>","Similar prompts to when he bound the Source of Dreams arose as when he focused on the details of the Decretum itself, he saw the augmentations of 5,000% Augmentation to True Damage Values, True Defense Values, and True Vitality Values along with the 75% nullification whenever he received attacks containing either the Essence of Avalon or the Absolute Avalon Authority!","But the Decretum of Avalon carried something extra similar to how the Decretum of Dreams had its own uniqueness of the Dream of the Oneiric.","It was a particularly dazzling excerpt from the description of Avalon!","<Decretum of Avalon>::... With Absolute Avalon Authority, you can form the Absolute Avalon Clone that can negate all incoming True Dimensional Avalon Damage Values, or you can utilize Absolute Avalon Authority to wrap around you in a protective shield that can also negate all incoming True Dimensional Avalon Damage Values...","Every decretum had its perks.","Avalon's perk was complete dominance as Noah knew this to be uniquely applicable to him, with those who did not bind the Source like him only enjoying 90% Nullification if they enact an Absolute Avalon Clone or spend large reserves of Absolute Avalon Authority that he could now use endlessly to the extent his soul could bear!","All these...were just part of the major gains from Avalon.","What was even greater was something that Noah had come across when he first bound the Source of Dreams as well, only this time...quantifiable results were shown as his body began to glitter with a pure milky white gold light.","<Due to the Integration with the Source of Dreams and Avalon, your Aspects of Existence have accelerated their transformation to reach a higher stage.>","The light was profound and full of roaring calm, tearing across his body this whole time as its presence was enough to cause a domino effect on many things!","<All of your Bones, Organs, and Musculature have attained the EMPYRAL State.>","HUUUM!","An austere symphony of revelation and transformation played as his stellar main body changed his very surroundings to cause a sea of multicolored essences to bloom around him.","His fair skin twinkled with the cosmic light of reality as it turned translucent sometimes, where one could occasionally see shining golden bones underneath this skin along with musculature that was tout with the allure of crimson gold light!","THUMP!","The beat of his heart caused crimson, gold, and blue glimmering blood of Mana and power to surge across every part of him as his organs were suffused with rainbow colored resplendence, his pupils spinning like cosmos in his eyes as his whole body seemed an ancient celestial treasure undergoing forging!","<Your constitution can now more easily integrate with Nature.>","<You have exceeded the Mythical Paragon's Empyral Foundation and attained a foundation in the upper ranks in this Age.>","<You are the 3rd to attain the distinction of a type of a Quintessential Empyral Foundation.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age significantly decreases.>","<...>","Noah's luminous eyes flashed with a tyrannical authority at this last prompt as he continued on regardless!","<Your robust foundation has greatly affected your physique, with each Cycle of the Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique now granting 3,000 Base True Damage and Defense Values, +150 Million Units to the Maximum Essence Reserves the Essence of All Established Dimensions, and the capability to withstand 12 Quintessential Dimensional Infinite Reality Passages...>","His body had become tough and robust as his life force...ah, it was so dense!","<The VITALITY Ecritures are now produced from your EMPYRAL Bones, Musculature, and Organs at a pace 1,000 times faster than the usage of the Essence of Reality. The total number of VITALITY Ecritures after the recent transformation is 15,000.>","Weaved at the very depths of his blood cells, vibrant green ecritures of VITALITY glimmered with glory as they elevated his life force to even greater levels.","But this wasn't the extent of the transformation brought about through the integration of the Sources of Dreams and Avalon.","The transformation to his Aspects of Existence was something much greater that granted him...","<Your Existence has been elevated.>","<The Authority accessible to the True Emperor of an Age is becoming quantified under your gaze. Utilization of it is possible when the distinction of your Existence elevates even further.>","...!","The Authority accessible to the True Emperor of an Age!","For the Age of Quintessence...it was Quintessential Kainos Authority that Noah had been reading over and over again on it being greatly increased, significantly increased, or Quintessentially increased.","It was the crown and throne above him that was still forming even now!","This authority...could also be utilized!"]},{"number":2112,"title":"Chapter 2112: Chapter 2111 A Moment In Time! III","paragraphs":["In a raging multicolored sea of essence, Noah's will focused on the crown and throne above him as the surging grandeur and authority of these constructs he had looked at many times...they seemed to be getting more clear under his gaze!","An authority that could be molded by True Emperors.","How infinitely close was Noah to this stage that he could now quantify this authority?","There were many questions about it, but its quantification was just beginning as Noah would have to wait before he could even see how it could be utilized.","As he marveled at this, the transformation hastened other changes within his body as the multicolored pillars of light that connected his Dimensional Layers began to suffuse with light.","The Ascendancy Stanchions were next to release grand light as Noah was successful in filling each one with Ascendant TABOO Edicts, their comprehensive boosts becoming ever greater as the augmentations it granted Noah rose higher!","<For every 10 Ascendancy Stanchions resonated within your Origin to achieve the strongest Quintessential True Form, the base AND additional multiplier of 30,000 total is granted for your Damage and Defense Values.>","From 15,000 Augmentation per 10 Ascendancy Stanchions, the number was doubled as Noah continued to scale upwards with his power.","At this moment in time, he was also doing one of the most important things yet.","The Integration of a Fundamental Natural Law.","His body was already covered with countless radiant rays of colors, but the allure of blue never left him as his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality had already begun the process of Integrating with Manadynamics.","The Source being utilized was the Source accumulated in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality itself!","So this process...was actually much easier than even the Integration with the Source of Dreams and Avalon, even if Noah couldn't achieve the same complete integration.","HOOONG!","A glorious symphony played as his Heart of Mana began to radiate glory.","As his very vessels glimmered cerulean blue while the space around him...was forcefully altered as all multicolored essences transformed and because painted with a gorgeous cerulean radiance!","An incandescent color of blue that showed accumulating Absolute Mana Authority and represented something grand.","—","Far away from Noah's position.","Within the Main Reality.","A massive and dense swirling mass of the Essence of Natural Laws formed into a pillar of light stretching out for an unknown number of light years.","It was the Main Empyral Domain of Nature that sat at the very center of the Main Reality!","Within it, terrifying auras of the strongest Primordials dwelled as the True Bodies of multiple Tribunal Rulers would even occasionally be in this location.","The current number of Tribunal Rulers within was unknown, with the vast area calm with the swirling waves of essence that only continued to increase in density due to another Anchor being removed!","At such a time, near the outskirts of this central Domain of Nature.","BZZT!","A spatial crack silently formed as the distinguished visage of a Draconian Qilin Phoenix emerged while emanating absolutely no waves of power.","Blue, black, and golden flames covered its glorious body as its scales and feathers couldn't be clearly seen, its vibrant pupils arriving at this domain but turning around soon after to gaze opposite to it.","Towards a far away construct that it had left multiple Enders of Nature to watch and protect- her gaze was piercing across the layers of space and gazing at the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as it felt a shocking change!","<<He has begun...>>","Brilliance shone within its eyes as they shone with utmost coldness, her gaze returning to the Empyral Domain of Nature before her as she placed her claws on its swirling outer layer.","The appearance of the Ender of Nature here was only natural as she was born from the very Source of Manadynamics, Entropy, and Providence that swirled with most concentration in this Domain of Nature!","And now, with the aid of Reality...","HOOOONG!","The massive and vast stretch of the Emypral Domain of Nature trembled as its swirling mass of essence momentarily came to a halt.","Reality was always there pervasively, and it simply needed a conduit to conduct grand actions!","A halt of the biggest Domain of Nature...was a terrifying phenomenon as this was a location of dense essence that held a significant amount of the Source of Reality at its absolute center.","And yet it came to a halt at this moment as at this moment, multiple Tribunal Rulers remaining in this space burst out with their shocking Wills that emanated great power!","But the enemy this time was Reality.","And Reality never moved unless it was absolutely certain of its actions.","CRAAACK!","Like a piece of a puzzle breaking, the vast stretches of the Domain of Nature broke away from the Main Reality.","Within its frozen space, multiple different essences of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws lit up like bright fireworks as the fabric of space very quickly became twisted- a massive spatial singularity forming with the Draconian Qilin Phoenix at the center as this singularity began to shrink and fade!","Before anyone could react!","Before the Tribunal Rulers training within could even make a move!","A piece of Reality was torn away as in an extremely short period of time...it disappeared!","...!","It was an unbelievable action and occurrence as the extent was too massive.","There was a vibrant Empyral Domain of Nature in one moment as in another, the void of the Boundary Between Realities appeared at the very center of the Main Reality!","4 shockingly resonant auras of Tribunal Rulers were within this space as they locked onto the only other life form near them, their gazes only barely catching the Draconian Qilin Phoenix as it stared at them all with coldness before disappearing.","Reality had made its move today across many locations as at this moment in time, it actually acted against the Main Reality itself to remove a critical piece that made it.","As for where this piece went...","SHIIING!","The Fabric of Reality trembled across the spacetime continuum as utilizing means other entities could not even fathom, a vast torn piece of Reality was shuttled extremely vast distances to reach a single location.","A location where one renowned personage was trying to bind a Fundamental Natural Law unto himself!","HOOONG!","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality began to tremble as a Singularity holding something utterly massive began to bloom at its very center.","It was a long planned attack of Reality in a way that other creatures could not even understand!"]},{"number":2113,"title":"Chapter 2113: Chapter 2112 A Moment In Time! IV","paragraphs":["A long-planned attack of Reality in a way that other creatures could not even understand!","An attack...but who truly was its target?","The Primordials had just lost a crucial piece of their power as a part of the fabric of the Main Reality was torn away- one that granted them a great edge over others across the eons!","They were among the casualties on the path of war.","But the Tribunal Rulers and the Primordials...were only that. They weren't the main target of this action!","HUUUM!","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality trembled in a never before seen fashion as outside of it, the Four Enders of Providence that had a golden film of light surrounding this construct had suddenly glimmered with grandeur.","The thin golden layer they had spread out seemed to actually act as a conduit for a massive traversing singularity- a singularity that was taken across the spacetime continuum and directed into the center of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality they were supposed to be shielding!","And at the very center, it bloomed!","Within the Dimensional Holy Land, it bloomed and covered everything with a maddening concentration of the essence of a myriad of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws.","Was this Reality fully allying with Noah and supporting him with such a grand gesture?","The answer was shockingly in the opposite direction.","<Maste-!!!>","BOOOM!","A terrifying will spread out along with the blooming singularity that contained the Main Empyral Domain of Nature of the Desolate Mausoleum!","The voice of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality had rung out briefly before it was drowned in the raging swirls of the Essence of Natural Laws.","This Empyral Domain of Nature was a crucial part of Reality that held an extremely dense concentration of the Will of Reality.","But even more so, it held dense concentrations of Natural Laws. But nothing was more concentrated and dense than two Fundamental Natural Laws in particular- Manadynamics and Entropy!","And in the Dimensional Holy Land, Noah had been surrounded by the cerulean light of Absolute Mana Authority as he integrated with the Fundamental Natural Law of Manadynamics through the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","And when the singularity of the Empyral Domain of Nature exploded, he was at its very center as an immense influx of the essence of Manadynamics flooded into him and his connection with the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","It was only natural.","After all, it was exactly the Natural Law he was fusing with. But the only issue...was that an extremely dense Will had attached itself with shocking concentrations into the influx of the Essence of Manadynamics surging through Noah and his connection with the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","It was the Will of Reality.","It was the Will that was still seeking control of this stupendous construct!","It had plotted and planned as it acted at an absolutely opportune time, where the moment Noah began integrating with any Natural Laws, Reality would have acted!","It had tried to reassimilate its source of Nature from the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality and unto itself many times before.","But the connection and binding this construct had with Noah was too dense as it could not reassimilate anything!","But if Reality happened to gain access to this connection.","If somehow its Will could penetrate this connection at a crucial time with the permission of the being that bound this construct...","HOOONG!","An unbelievable symphony rose and played grandly as this was exactly what had occurred.","The Fundamental Natural Law was too closely connected with Reality, and Reality used this to its advantage as at this juncture- an unprecedented blade was pointed towards Noah and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","It was a blade that was infusing the Will of Reality through the line of connection between Noah and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality while the Source of Manadynamics was trying to be bound.","It was the perfect attack at a perfect time!","At the center of it all, Noah's body that had been calm this entire time became the center of a storm as the instant all of this happened, his visage trembled as his eyes and mouth bellowed out in shock.","He felt the shockingly ancient and unimaginably strong will of reality enter through with the very Natural Law he was trying to bind, this line of connection expanded greatly to the extent that if it was a thin thread before, it had become a massive pillar of a connection now!","And in this expanded connection, the Will of Reality utilized it to surge into the very Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality that was binding Manadynamics.","It was a sure kill move.","It was the most threatening move to Noah's Hegemony as he didn't even have time to think, only acting on instinct as he bellowed out.","<OOOOOOH!>","A grand and bellowing cry that reverberated all around and caused the souls of all beings in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality to tremble!","A bellow that buzzed in the ears of the cold faced Enders of Nature surrounding the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, as well as the visage of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix that had appeared within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as well.","It was a bellow that came from his very soul as the first instinct he had was to stop the process of Integration to Manadynamics!","But the instant he was about to undertake that action...","<A Source of Reality has been bound by the Quintessential Kainos Emperor!>","<The Source of Manadynamics has been partially integrated into the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality and the Soul of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor.>","<A stupendously quintessential action has been taken!>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increa-!>","...!","Grand prompts came down as their golden luster shone with an almost mocking grandiosity!","BOOOM!","A refulgence of grandeur exploded out as shockingly, the influx of the essence of Manadynamics from none other than the Main Empyral Domain of Nature of the Main Reality was enough to instantly cause the Integration Noah was seeking to complete.","But this was a death sentence!","Because all of this essence was painted with the Will of Reality that forcefully infused itself into the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality and now fought a battle for supremacy.","The Will of Reality moved to entirely control the construct that could allow for great changes in this Age.","And the Quintessential Kainos Emperor turned absolutely livid as when one instinctual move didn't work he instantly tried another as the Source of Dreams and Avalon instantly surged under his command as Absolute Dream and Avalon Authority began to senselessly leak out of him!"]},{"number":2114,"title":"Chapter 2114: Chapter 2113 A Moment In Time! V","paragraphs":["Under his command, the Units of the Absolute Dream and Avalon Authority that he could utilize as much as he wanted to the extent that his soul could bear...countless of such units erupted out as they carried Noah's Will and the Will of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality- Noah directing it all towards the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality where two Wills were battling for Supremacy!","HOOONG!","It was two Wills but frankly, the more ancient one and the one that had lived across countless eons was rapidly devouring the one that barely came to fruition recently.","It was an extremely perilous juncture as a high-paced symphony rang out with haste!","The influx of two new Sources caused a brief and extremely momentary pause as sparks of Singularities bloomed, Noah's livid figure barely being able to catch the communication of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality after it had been cut off before.","<Master! The Will of Reality is too potent! I need more of the Source of Reality to hold it at bay and push it out->","...!","More of the Source of Reality.","What Noah and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality had been accumulating so far by swallowing Realities and two Dimensions!","At these words, Noah's raging Will acted on instinct once more as Absolute Dream Authority flourished.","He wanted to do something, but would he really be left the chance to do it?","When Reality had planned so extensively and with such purpose?","SHIIING!","Just as he began to move, the dazzling visage of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix appeared in the Dimensional Holy Land as its radiant figure shot out towards Noah's incandescent visage like a beam of judgment!","And it was at this same moment that Noah bellowed out.","<Infinite Dream!>","...!","Infinite Dream.","When he had utilized this before, he had been able to segment his soul into a few hundred and then a few thousand portions into Realities to dominate them and assimilate them into the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","But when he utilized it on this day...","HOONG!","His figure radiated power and grandeur as hundreds of thousands of streaks of light shot out.","Portions of his soul that would each seek a Reality as in an instant, this number exploded past 1 Million!","And even more portions of souls still came out as each one was bathed with large reserves of Absolute Dream Authority! An authority that Noah put in place to make from Dream and into Reality only a single thing.","Speed.","The quickest speed to have his portions of Souls instantly release his will to dominate the beings and the loose consciousnesses of the Emerging and Prime Realities he entered as they would be assimilated right after.","The light of providence surged as from the Dream Dimension, Eowyn's figure that had been consolidating her power this whole time felt the shocking changes through her bond to Noah, her figure rising up while erupting with Absolute Dream Authority as she surged towards the Draconian Qilin Phoenix that was moving towards Noah!","But the enemy this time was utterly terrifying.","HUUM!","Her golden figure was instantly blindsided as a visage smashed into her like a meteor of light, a Celestial Titan shining with the aura of Entropy appearing as it was one of the Enders of Entropy placed on the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality to watch!","<ROAR!>","It bellowed out towards Eowyn's figure that trembled at this moment as arcs of Entropy crackled over her body, blood leaking from her mouth as her strength alone had not risen enough to match an Ender like this!","But she grit her teeth as Absolute Dream Authority bubbled forth around her. Her heart trembled with Providence as even she knew a crucial time had come, where many things would be decided in the seconds to come.","And even though she didn't have the strength...","<YAAA!>","Her golden hair whipped around madly as she surged forward to get past this Ender with vibrant authority.","Others like it and even more Enders surged and surrounded the raging Holy Land that was now swirling with countless essences of Natural Laws. The Empyral Domain of Nature fully bloomed at this moment as the concentration of essence in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality was reaching an utterly alarming level.","And at this time...","Rivers of incandescent Realities began to appear above the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","They were wrapped with Absolute Dream Authority that was senselessly leaking from Noah's portion of Soul, making an impossible feat of speed a possibility as these realities very quickly began to stack around the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as their Cosmos began to shoot down with grandeur!","It was a shocking scene that was backed up by the authority of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor as he sought to rapidly increase the accumulation of the Source of Reality for his construct.","His Soul cried out with glory as it bore the weight of utilizing an unknown number of Units of Absolute Dream Authority, thousands of Realities soon beginning to appear above the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as they disappeared into it silently, their Cosmos falling down like stars as for every new Reality assimilated, the concentration of the Source of Reality under the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality strengthened!","HOOONG!","A radiant light of splendor suffused the surroundings of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as this process began, but it would not be left alone so simply.","A Draconian Qilin Phoenix neared the center of the Dimensional Holy Land at this moment.","The terrifying Draconian Qilin Phoenix that could no doubt stand her ground against beings like CHARLEMAGNE neared Noah as her massive draconic claws burning with the golden flames of Providence surged forward- their purpose not being to destroy as they were meant to contain!","After all, the one who was still bound to the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality could not perish!","The claws of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix were within grasp of Noah's visage when at this juncture, his livid eyes burning with pure plasma of Mana turned towards it as the eyelids were shut firm since he had gone into slumber.","Yet his Will was robust as even while slumbering in his Infinite Dream, he spoke out with tyranny!","<Absolute Authority.>","...!","Absolute Authority!","The newest feature of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality that allowed him to reject entry to all those he had bound the Source of!","And just now...he had bound one of the Sources of Reality.","Manadynamics.","It wasn't a complete binding, but it was binding nonetheless as the Ender whose body was forged in three Fundamental Natural Laws including Manadynamics...its astounding visage came to a stop an inch away from Noah's figure that was bathed in Quintessential light!!!"]},{"number":2115,"title":"Chapter 2115: Chapter 2114 A Moment In Time! VI","paragraphs":["The claws of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix were an inch away from Noah's blazing and livid visage as even in a slumber, his eyes burned with rage!","His will gazed at into the cold eyes of this Ender of Nature as if he was gazing at the Will of Reality itself as his authority emanated out.","<You have disappointed me.>","Noah spoke out with eyes of wrath as even though he understood the stance of the Main Reality- he could not agree and sympathize with it.","No matter if it didn't trust and had been betrayed by its own people time and time again!","For it to wage war against him...","He understood history.","He knew that for Reality, it was only logical for it to seek control of the one thing that could change its fate as it knew its reliance on beings had failed time and time again. He knew that even though he understood himself in his Heart and what he was doing was the best for Reality...the Will of Reality was naturally not him as fully leaving its fate into the hands of another being was not ideal.","He knew all this...yes he was still livid at its actions today as if he couldn't let his will be known peacefully, he would make it known tyrannically!","HOOONG!","He rejected the Manadynamics dwelling within the Draconian Qilin Phoenix through the feature of Absolute Authority as its body began to move backwards.","Only a third of it was made up of an essence Noah could reject, but it was still a major part of its Aspects of Existence as its whole body was rejected from the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","Along with it, 5 Enders of Mana that were within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality were pushed out, only leaving behind Enders from other Sources that Noah could not yet reject.","Enders that neared the Dimensional Holy Land and became bathed in its swirling waves of essence as they looked coldly towards Noah's slumbering figure that seemed more awake than ever!","5 Enders of Entropy came the closest at Noah as they didn't attack, with the only reason being the fact that Reality knew this attack did not pan out with the best possible result for it.","This was because at this juncture, tens of thousands of Realities were stacking themselves atop the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as their Cosmos shot down like starry stars, more and more fractions of the Source of Reality reinforcing the Will of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as the fight between it in the budding Source...had reached an impasse where it could not proceed!","Instead, it even began to be pushed back as with the partially bound Source of Manadynamics and the ever-increasing strength of the Will of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality...this stupendous attack actually ended in a failure!","<<Your disappointment means nothing to me. I only seek the best possible result and method to prevent Cataclysm. Putting control in my hands naturally guarantees the best possible results as there is no reliance on the Will of another entity.>>","WAA!","The Will of Reality emanated from the closest 5 Enders of Entropy as Noah's ancient slumbering visage replied coldly.","<I have tried the path of peace. I have told you that I do not wish for a war with the very same thing I am trying to save. Do you truly wish for destruction?!>","...!","The wrath in his voice was clear as Reality replied right after!","<<Control has always been the only thing I seek. If I can gain it, this is the best possible result. If I cannot and the only pathway between destruction is through you continuing your path with the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, then so be it. Take this Empyral Domain of Nature as a gift to further aid you and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality. But make no mistake, when you release another Anchor and I recover more power...or when any other opportunity presents itself for me to bid for control of this construct, I will take it. Past mistakes shall not be repeated again.>>","HUUM!","Providence surged as Reality made a promise.","It would not stop vying for control as it wanted to rely on itself- the actions of the Ancestors and Primordials having truly warped Reality as it solely wanted to rely on itself!","But it was a logical construct.","If it could not gain control, it would protect and aid the tool that would continue to unseal and elevate it.","Until the next time came that a chance presented itself!","<Foolish!>","BZZT!","Noah's will bellowed out as the consequences of the Empyral Domain of Nature settling in the Dimensional Holy Land were just now unfolding.","His boundless will of Tyranny whipped around with glory as hundreds of thousands of points of light that were Cosmos joined his Reality every second, his voice emanating out with utmost coldness!","<Let this serve as a warning as well as another look into my character. I shall gladly take this Empyral Domain of Nature and devour your Will in recompense. If and when you do try this again and ultimately fail, the price will be much higher. For now...your Enders are no longer welcome in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!>","...!","His crown and backbone of a throne shone as his Quintessential Kainos Authority seemed palpable and ready to almost move under his beckoning!","He didn't yet have the authority under <Absolute Authority> to kick them out, but this card had now been revealed to Reality as it was partly the reason for its loss- with the claws of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix not being able to reach him and disrupt his Infinite Dream due to this.","Now, he made his Will known to Reality as this unique Will flashed in the eyes of the Enders of Entropy and other Enders of Nature, their figures becoming warped in a spatial light as they disappeared and rematerialized outside of the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","It was a fantastical scene to witness at this moment in time as from afar, Eowyn's figure breathed a sigh of incredulity as she finally reached the Dimensional Holy Land!"]},{"number":2116,"title":"Chapter 2116: Chapter 2115 A Moment In Time! VII","paragraphs":["Noah's slumbering will gazed at this coldly at the Enders of Nature outside the boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as his wrath subsided.","The actions of Reality were logical and illogical at the same time.","The Desolate Mausoleum and the Nine Anchors...all of it had been warped over the years as the actions they followed could at times be unfathomable!","But the action done today was enough to be considered a Nexus Event by itself.","The Main Empyral Domain of Nature had been taken from the Main Reality and placed into Noah's home as the Primordials had suffered a terrifying setback!","It was an action that no doubt caused other branching Parallel Paths to form that involved all the possibilities of how things could have played out.","But since the one involved was an existence who wasn't truly present in Parallel Paths...how exactly would these versions of Realities look like?","It was a question with no answer as apart from Primordials losing, there was Noah gaining a whole lot from this whole ordeal.","<This is unprecedented...>","The voice of Eowyn rang out as she wiped away the crimson gold blood on her lips while coming to stand by Noah's slumbering Main Body.","This single action today had too many consequences as even now, tens of thousands of Realities were being assimilated as a certain Source was being strengthened greatly!","As the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality overpowered and assimilated the Will of Reality in its Source, its voice finally rang out again with clarity.","<Master, enough fractions of the Source of Reality will have been attained to support the Integration of 2 more Fundamental Natural Laws or 6 Natural Laws by the end of the day.>","WAA!","One of the boons revealed itself as the even bigger boons of partial binding of the Fundamental Natural Law of Manadynamics had yet to fully reveal themselves, their prompts continuing as Noah's slumbering will gazed at them coldly.","<The Integration of Manadynamics is causing a Fundamental change in the Heart of Mana.>","<The Quintessential Kainos Mana Circulation Vessels are being elevated.>","<With the elevation of the Quintessential Kainos Mana Circulation Vessels as the framework, the Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique has undergone a fundamental elevation.>","<Each Cycle of the Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique now grants 6,000 Base True Damage and Defense Values, +300 Million Units to the Maximum Essence Reserves the Essence of All Established Dimensions, the capability to withstand 18 Quintessential Dimensional Infinite Reality Passages, and the capability of evolution as more cycles pass is retained.>","The Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique experienced yet another robust round of Empowerment as it brought Noah to even greater levels, his Damage Values now after all the augmentations approaching tens of Quadrillions close to the numbers he saw from the terrifying beings within the Dimensional Conclave!","As for the exact value, this could only be quantified when he tested it after all boosts settled as for now, they still continued.","This time...it was his Heart.","THUMP!","The glorious Heart of Mana that redefined how Noah cast his abilities shone with a starry blue luminosity as it pumped pure Absolute Mana Authority through Noah's vessels!","The Heart of Mana that could pay for any ability in full so long as its cost was less than 5 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality or 10 Units of Absolute Authority, or 50 Billion Units of Dimensional Essence or the Essence of Natural Laws.","It was an Absolute Connate Reality Engine that fundamentally changed Noah's fighting style and continued to allow him to spam shocking abilities freely!","And now, its radiance was utterly blinding as it was elevated even further.","<The Heart of Mana>:: Born from a mutation of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor and his authority as an Infinite Conduit, it was brought to fruition by Manadynamics and bathed in its Fundamental Absolute Authority to bring about something unique. It has been further strengthened by the Integration of the Fundamental Natural Law of Manadynamics into the Quintessential Kainos Emperor, this Integration allowing for even greater levels of Reality Alterations to arise- especially on the aspect of Mana. At its current stage, the Heart of Mana shall pay all the resource costs of skills requiring less than 30 Units of Absolute Decreta and Natural Law Authority, 20 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality, 200 Billion Units of the Essence of Decreta and Natural Laws, and grant an alteration of an unlimited usage of the essence for concepts below Natural Laws. When exceeding the set numerical boundaries, the Heart of Mana shall pay 75% of the cost of the cast ability as with this Absolute Connate Reality Engine, resources are bound to not be a problem for you. It has resonated with your Vessels as the efficiency of essence has been optimized to greater levels, increasing your True Reality Cast and Attack Speed Values by 50,000%. Its numerical boundaries can be exceeded and changed depending on your own power as the Heart of Mana is nearing its final form...","Grandiosity.","In the midst of swirling essences of Natural Laws, the color blue greatly won in denseness and concentration as Noah's body became even more quintessential!","This was just part of the boons brought by Reality's actions and allowing Noah to have the instant integration with Manadynamics.","The details for integrating this Source itself were yet to be quantified due to Noah's soul being in a slumber and stretched out into millions of portions- where he wasn't able to fully feel the Source of Manadynamics within the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as its percentage augmentations were bound to be astonishing.","But among the many changes, the placement of the Main Empyral Domain of Nature into the center of his Dimensional Reality now meant he could begin comprehending and understand all Natural Laws from now on!","And the assimilation of even more concentrations of the fabric of Reality meant only one thing.","<The features of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality are also undergoing elevation with the continued accumulation of the Source of Reality.>","<The Dimensional Holy Land is currently morphing into the Dimensional Empyral Domain that contains an abundant amount of essence of multiple Natural Laws and Decreta.>","<The Dimensional Reality Xyston is undergoing elevation.>","...!"]},{"number":2117,"title":"Chapter 2117: Chapter 2116 A Moment In Time! VIII","paragraphs":["The moment stretched out in time had many unexpected things occur as it neared its end.","This was because Noah knew he was reaching a sufficient level to survive the shocking battles unfolding, and this was affirmed by nothing else than the boons he had set out to attain when he first began this moment in time, as well as the unexpected boons that came due to the actions of Reality.","The Dimensional Holy Land was transforming into the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature that contained multiple Natural Laws and Decreta, this making many things possible as the influx of new Natural Laws was now an inevitability, as well as the continual increase in understanding of the current Laws Noah held!","The other...was the all-around elevation of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as its Source of Reality was being increased rapidly- more and more Realities still coming down at this moment as Noah continued his Infinite Dream.","When Hundreds of Thousands of portions of his Soul returned...he didn't accept them back into his body as he sent them out again for the same task!","It was a terrifying direction he chose to take as this would soon put a strain on his soul with how much Absolute Authority he was spending, but he still felt okay at this juncture so he continued!","Which caused the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality to grow in wonders. Which caused the Dimensional Reality Xyston to reach another stage.","Its first stage could dish out 1 Quadrillion as in its description, it was stated that future increases in its output would increase exponentially.","It wouldn't just be a doubling of 1 Quadrillion to 2 as Noah's tyrannical will gazed upon its grandeur at this juncture.","<Dimensional Reality Xyston>:: A weaponized form of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality in the shape of a Spear. It holds the weight of the accumulated Realities and Dimensions within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as it has transcended any augmentations from outside sources, with a single swing from it being able to currently release an output of 25 Quadrillion Quintessential Damage Values. Wielding it for the Quintessential Kainos Emperor is akin to an extension of his will as no resource requirement is required...","...!","25 Quadrillion Quintessential Damage Values with every swing.","No resource cost!","This was what the weight of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality could do at its early stages! But what Noah truly looked forward to...was him swinging the equivalent weight of All Dimensions and all of the fabric of Reality!","Now that...would be truly grand as his enemies could only despair.","But apart from the Xyston and other features of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality elevating, there was still the crucial integration of Manadynamics that had granted transformations to the Heart of Mana among others.","But what exactly was its boon after the partial integration with Noah?","Fundamental Natural Law <Manadynamics>:: A ruling authority that governs the absolute workings of Reality. Understanding it to completion means comprehending this aspect of Reality as you can easily influence it in an unimaginable manner... After the partial binding of the Source of Manadynamics, the Current Boosts are elevated to 15,000% Augmentation to All Essence Reserves, Essence Exchange Value, True Damage Values, True Defense Values, and True Vitality Values. With the partial binding of this Source, you have come closer to understanding the Undefined Authority as you have unlocked Quintessential Nature Resonance. The more Keys of Reality you bind to yourself, the greater your Quintessential Natural Resonance Value becomes and the closer you come to the understanding and utilization of the Undefined Absolute Authority...","HUUM!","The cerulean sea of essence around Noah surged as his Soul reacted to the ridiculous wonders...as well as something new.","Quintessential Nature Resonance!","Noah's will focused on this new construct right away as new details arose.","<Quintessential Nature Resonance>:: You have begun integrating with Nature as the Sources bound to you resonate at the depths of your Soul to grant a Resonance Value. This Resonance Value will augment your Defense, Damage, Vitality, Resource...all Values under you after all other augmentations have been accounted for. The greater the Resonance Value, the greater power you can exert through Nature. Current Resonance Value- .15( Dream ~.025, Avalon ~.025, Manadynamics ~.1)","<...>","A new form of a multiplicative augmentation to Noah's already impressive roster!","To fully understand just what this seemingly small value actually signified, we have to look at Noah's current Damage Value which had been elevated by tens of Quadrillions.","His Base Values came from his Six fully saturated Dimensional Realities in his Origin, the values from his Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique, and a few other smaller sources- and then all these values were multiplied by the augmentations from his Throne of Quintessential Tyranny, the Ascendancy Stanchions, and lastly the Decreta and Natural Laws!","The above-mentioned augmentations were three multipliers.","When multiplying his Base Values and these multipliers, Noah's Damage Value Output exceeded 50 Quadrillion and was in fact teetering at a value of 52 Quadrillion!","Now, a fourth multiplier apart from the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny, the Ascendancy Stanchions, and the augmentations from Decreta and Natural Laws came.","It was the Quintessential Nature Resonance Value of .15!","After all the prior augmentations, Noah's Damage Value of 52 Quadrillion was elevated even further by the Resonance Value of .15 as his true output now became 59.8 Quadrillion!","And this Resonance...was just coming from the Integration to Manadynamics, Dream, and Avalon. When he added more decreta and Laws in the future, the Resonance Value would continue rising as his power would also elevate even higher!","<Hoo...>","His will calmed after being disrupted by Reality's actions as he gazed at everything.","The assimilation of hundreds of thousands of Realities continued as his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality continued to strengthen.","He could bind 2 more Fundamental Natural Laws or 6 Natural Laws as with the words of Reality that it would always continue seeking control, Noah had to be careful whenever he bound new Sources of Nature!","But as he finished his preparations now, his slumbering will still in the middle of an Infinite Dream bellowed out authoritatively.","<Begin the Integration of Providence...>","WAA!","He forged forward fearlessly as he would like to see Reality try something similar while the Source of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality was continuing to get strengthened!","—","<Author's Notes>:: Breakdown of Noah Damage Value, courtesy of @Banra. Breakdowns of Defense, Vitality, and other Values can also be located in the Privilege Spoiler Channel of our Discord!","__**Base Damage**__","6 Saturated Paramount Kainos Dimensional Realities = 6,080,000 TDV","Quintessential Natural Born Mana Physique = 170 Completed Physique Refinement Cycles * 6,000 TDV per Completed Physique Refinement Cycle = 1,020,000 TDV","[Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor] = 5,000 TDV","TABOO LETHE's [Oblivion] = 100 TDV","Quasi-TABOO Relics = 25 TDV","TOTAL BASE DAMAGE CALCULATION — 6,080,000 TDV + 1,020,000 TDV + 5,000 TDV + 100 TDV + 25 TDV = 7,105,125 TDV","— — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — —","__**Multipliers**__","[Throne of Quintessential Tyranny] = 5x","Ascendant Quintessential Kainos Emperor True Form = 4,507,500x","Fundamental Natural Laws, Natural Laws, & Decreta = 0.177x from Gravitation + 0.165x from Polarity + 150x from Manadynamics + 3x from Entropy + 30x from Providence + 60x from Dream + 5x from Prana + 60x from Avalon + 5x from Mirror + 5x from Apollyon + 5x from Niflheim + 1x = 324.342x","TOTAL MULTIPLIER CALCULATION — 5x * 4,507,500x * 324.342x = 7,309,857,825x","— — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — —","__**TOTAL TDV CALCULATION**__ — (6,080,000 TDV + 1,020,000 TDV + 5,000 TDV + 100 TDV + 25 TDV) * = 7,105,125 TDV * 7,309,857,825x = 51,937,453,578,853,125 True Dimensional Damage Values!"]},{"number":2118,"title":"Chapter 2118: Chapter 2117 A Moment In Time! IX","paragraphs":["Reality had stated that it would always bid for control whenever another chance arose, so just the Integration of another Natural Law where Noah was prepared might not be an event that Reality considered an opportunity.","It would try to hit Noah when he least expected it just like the initial try with the transportation of the Main Empyral Domain of Nature!","This was why he forged forward without fear as he finished his preparations.","He was ready to have his True Sanguine Clone make a move in the Quantum Dimension as the last piece of the puzzle before he fully participated in this battle was the formation of an ability.","The Fifth Form of the Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Technique!","The Third and Fourth Forms were respectively the Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg and the Beacon of Thorny Consecration as the Fifth Form that was being designed this whole time...it was at its completion!","Its design had to be even more special than the prior abilities, and the mixture of skills did not disappoint as a wondrous ability was born.","[Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Technique- Fifth Form]:: An amalgamation of 6 abilities of the Assassin Emperor of Severance, the Saintess of Fiery Damnation, Domain of Apocalypse, Bloodfiend, Incarnation of Fire, and Ashes to Ashes Dust to Dust. It has brought to fruition the ability of Quintessential Singularity Ignition that releases a manifestation of your blood and Will into raging flames around your body- flames that are made up of miniaturized modified engines of the Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkriegs that will latch and burn upon contact. When active, your body becomes a Singularity of Flames as you can affect the laws of the spacetime continuum around you, being able to release a barrage of enemies on enemies from afar or gravitate your enemies towards you to burn even closer. When receiving damage from any source while this ability is active, there is a 50% Chance to release a burst of Quintessential Retribution that releases Damage Values equivalent to 50% of your maximum possible Damage Value Output. All enemies that are damaged through this skill will be affected by the Bleeding Flames Reality Altering Affix, where the target will bleed Quintessential Flames that can spread around their bodies to deal 50% of the maximum damage output of the skill every microsecond until the flames are extinguished. When an enemy dies to Quintessential Singularity Ignition, their corpse will automatically explode to deal 200% of the skill's initial damage output. The final output Damage Value of this ability is set to a minimum of 10 Quadrillion True Dimensional Damage Values after accounting for your base boosts and multipliers. The minimum Damage can change and fluctuate in the future depending on your own base Damage Values and multipliers. Cost to cast: 10 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality and 10,000 Trillion Mana. Cost to keep active past 5 Microseconds: 1 Billion Million Units of the Essence of Reality every Microsecond.","A grand ability.","An ability that loosely allowed him to turn his body into a singularity of flames after he incorporated the Saintess of Fiery Damnation and Incarnation of Fire that stemmed from a long untouched skill tree of the <Herald of Fire>!","These two abilities along with the prior ones utilized to make the Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg...allowed for Noah to birth Quintessential Singularity Ignition as flames made up of countless miniaturized Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkriegs were born.","Quintessential Singularity Ignition that came with multiple.reality Altering concepts that would cause great headaches to Noah's enemies!","This was the Fifth Form of the Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Techniques, and it didn't mean Noah had to use it alone. He was keeping the Beacon of Thorny Consecration active as the Heart of Mana paid the price for it.","He could also call down the massive blue domain of the Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg whenever he wished.","He could then call down the Quintessential Singularity Ignition as his enemies...oh they were in for a surprise!","With this...he left ready.","He was now ready to go as he finished off all preparations by giving one last gaze of his Will over the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature!","Other boons from the actions of Reality had yet to show their true effect as when the Main Empyral Domain of Nature exploded in the Dimensional Holy Land, the forging process for the elevation of RUINATION and the Primordial Disk was still ongoing.","The sudden surge of the Essence of a myriad of Natural Laws had been drawn into the Blacksmith's Forge and tainted the process of forging with a dense infusion of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws to the extent that Noah himself could not fathom what changes this would bring.","He would only know with time as alone with the Integration with Providence, Noah left behind some more commands as the moment in time was about to end.","<Absorb the essences of foreign Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws, focus on increasing understanding of Gravity and Polarity...and let us bring Entropy to completion.>","...!","He had many cards up his sleeves.","He had enough Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds.","He had Loot from NULLITY Beasts that would be getting utilized and he was about to gain even more of such loot in the Quantum Dimension.","He had many things that he was simultaneously doing while he revealed himself in the Quantum Dimension!","In his mind, the flow of time began to change.","Even while in slumber with his Main Body, his perspective switched to the True Sanguine Clone in the opening rift of the Quantum Rings while in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, the bodies of The Avalon and Dream Dimensional Rulers that had escaped from this location were just now arriving!","They would get to view the battle occurring here through the eyes of Noah's Dimensional Chassis as for now...","HUUUM!","Essence began to vibrate around Noah's True Sanguine clone as many gazes of Rulers were on him as he floated beside the Ender of Providence.","He even turned to give this Ender a cold gaze to serve as a reminder and warning before his figure floated into the deadly battlefield!","The Visage of CHARLEMAGNE was prominent as he and his Parallel Selves controlled a portion of the battlefield which was the Dimensional Conclave.","Then there was Lilith and her forces, lone Dimensional Rulers, and then the Tribunal Rulers that were all paying attention to his arriving figure as the winds of Destiny and Providence weaved madly!"]},{"number":2119,"title":"Chapter 2119: Chapter 2118 Singularity Ignition And Retribution! I","paragraphs":["Vibrant multicolored rings surrounded everything as the only exit had Enders of Nature surrounding it, this whole domain where the Dimensional Conclave took place floating in the midst of a vibrant multicolored sea within the Quantum Dimension.","The powerhouses within were abundant as they ranged from all Dimensions but Dream and Avalon as these Rulers had taken the path of veering away from this bloody conflict!","In the midst of all this, the visage of Noah's True Sanguine clone gazed coldly at the Ender of Nature before floating into this deadly domain.","His gaze was pertinent to the eyes of many as those that had seen him before- he held the same face as the Avalon Dimensional Chassis to them as CHARLEMAGNE's words of the Dimensional Inimicus being Reality with Avalon and Dream siding with it resonated brightly!","If they could capture this being, the whereabouts of Avalon and Dream could be unveiled.","This issue...was important to a few specific parties at this juncture.","One of them was the Tribunal Rulers and the other was the Quantum Dimension!","But the former weren't the first to make a move at Noah's appearance as the gaze of The Empress and the rest of the Tribunal Rulers changed soon after.","This was because they had gotten word of the disappearance of the Main Empyral Domain of Nature and the image of an Ender that was captured at its moment of disappearance!","This caused the gazes of Aegon and Althea to turn bright with wrath as among the 5 Tribunal Rulers, the two of them exploded out with power as their massive NULLITY Repics appeared within their hands- their eyes targeting none other than the Enders.","This left behind the Quantum Dimension as the party with the most interest to find the location of Avalon and Dream Dimensions as it was their people that moved towards Noah!","More accurately, CHARLEMAGNE watched on coldly as it wasn't even him who made the move this time.","He was one of the most powerful beings here, but he wasn't the only one.","There were the Mikado of Old and Strength who guarded the Pylon of Ascension.","Their power was mighty as they could not be discredited!","At this juncture, the Mikado of Old was the nearest to Noah's visage apart from CHARLEMAGNE as she made the first move.","Her figure was no longer in a human form as she had taken the form of her racial Lineage of the Royal Quantum Lightwalker.","Lightwalker!","A unique race of existences that were few in number as their Bloodline was VENERABLE at the start, and as they grew more powerful and refined it...ZENITH was not out of the picture!","As the name implied, they were made of a unique form of light at their core as the Mikado of Old had the star-like form of a regal multicolored creature with four pointed edges, a singular pristine eye present on the frontal surface of its face as its four edges were its strongest weapons.","They pulsed with a deadly light of Fundamental Natural Laws and Absolute Quantum Authority as part of the reason for the terror of the Royal Quantum Lightwalker...was their speed.","At birth, they could exceed the speed of light.","At their height of power?","SHIIING!","Not even a microsecond was required as the massive visage of a four-pointed star appeared behind him!","The truly powerful Rulers were the only ones who could follow this shocking speed as among those paying attention, Lilith was the very first.","She sought to understand the extent that this being could pose a threat to others as this was part of the reason she didn't reveal his identity, but when she saw that he couldn't even react against the speed of the Mikado of Old, she was disappointed!","Noah's visage could be seen still floating silently under their sharp eyes as he didn't react in any way to the danger that had appeared behind him- as if he didn't even know it was there.","This caused Lilith to be disappointed as even though he had whatever unique capability he had to affect Anchors, he needed the power to back it. If a Clone of his could so easily be dominated or killed...he wouldn't be able to play a major part in the events to come!","The result of what would happen next could easily be discerned.","Or so they thought.","<A child jumping int->","BZZT!","The words of the Mikado of Old resounded just as its sharp star-like edge filled with multiple Absolute Authorities reached inches of the back of Noah's head, its goal being clear desegregation and destruction as the memories of this being could be read thereafter!","But before this sharp stellar edge could reach his head, the fair hands of its intended target reached out.","Without even turning around.","As if he didn't even need to turn around!","His bare hands reached out as his fingers grasped onto the stellar edge of the Mikado of Old filled with Absolute Authorities, the fabric of Reality pulsing and beginning to shatter at the contact point as his ringers clamped down as if they were made of quintessential metal!","This...was the interception of tens of Quadrillions of Damage Values.","And he did it so easily as how could he not?!","His Beacon of Thorny Consecration alone exceeded 60 Quadrillion Defense Values. His Celestial Lich's Armament of Devotion which was also always active also exceeded 60 Quadrillion Defense Values.","This was already over 120 Quadrillion in Defense Values as his Innate Dimensional Barrier was not even yet brought into the picture!","The Defense Values he had set up encapsulated the extent of the damage that a Mikado had released.","A Mikado!","One of the Four existences that guarded the Pylon of Ascension!","It was preposterous to see as from afar, Lilith's gaze turned utterly bright as a dazzling smile erupted from her face.","From afar, CHARLEMAGNE's gaze turned extremely cold along with a few other existences who could follow this speed!","They all realized that this being had not bothered to even turn around when a Mikado was attacking not because his eyes and will could not even keep up.","It was simply that he didn't even feel the need to turn around.","At this juncture, their eyes and wills were moving in the time scale of nanoseconds as they all saw the eyes of Noah seemingly come to life as his gaze and will landed on each of them.","As he gazed upon all of them while holding back an attack of a Mikado, waves of Haki emanated out of his will as he spoke with authority!","<Dredges of the past and inconsequential Rulers...it is time for you all to step aside.>","WAA!","Boundless Tyranny began to dance wildly as a booming symphony of battle glory began to resound in the surroundings!"]},{"number":2120,"title":"Chapter 2120: Chapter 2119 Singularity Ignition And Retribution! II","paragraphs":["Tyranny!","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor spoke out in the face of exceedingly powerful existences within domineering grandeur as his words caused the minds of all Rulers to be roused!","And while his bare hands grasped the sharp pointed star end of a Royal Quantum Lightwalker, Noah uttered forth coldly.","<Fifth Form.>","...!","<Quintessential Singularity Ignition> was called out.","A stellar blue light then dazzling erupted from Noah as it bloomed into cataclysmic cerulean flames that instantly wrapped around his whole body- flames that pulsed with grandiosity as they seemed to be made up of countless miniaturized cerulean Blitzkriegs of lights!","These raging flames seemingly had a tyrannical Will as they engulfed the resplendent form of the Mikado of Old and caused a massive explosive force akin to the birth of a singularity!","And...it truly was the birth of a Singularity as the visage of the Mikado of Old was knocked backwards at an unprecedented speed as over 60 Quadrillions Quintessential Damage Values smashed into it- in addition to the Thorn Damage from the Beacon of Thorny Consecration.","...!","The eyes of all beings rose with shock at this astounding display from a relatively unknown being as before they could even fully react, they saw the cerulean flames that had bathed this being roar out with waves of Haki as one could barely see Noah's figure within make a beckoning motion towards the figure of the Mikado of Old that was just thrown away.","And within the span of a few nanoseconds...space twisted as a shocking and undeniable Gravitational pull erupted to wrap around the glorious four-pointed star form of the Mikado of Old as her visage reappeared right before Noah, only to be engulfed by the Flames of the Quintessential Singularity Ignition once more!","BZZZT!","The singular eye on this powerful existence trembled as it was shocked to find at this moment that its Innate Dimensional Barrier...had just shattered.","...!","Its Vitality then began to be eaten up as shockingly golden blood of light leaked from it as it actually burned to become hot cerulean flames that further coiled around it!","It was such a shocking development that the Will of the Mikado of Old explosively bellowed out thereafter and exploded with power, trying to put up a distance as fast as possible!","<OOOOOOH!>","SHIING!","The means of truly powerful existences were many.","Her figure of light instantly turned into countless Shards that flashed and disappeared, reforming beside CHARLEMAGNE's visage as her single eye shone with disbelief and rage!","Her will and the Wills of many locked onto the existence currently bathed in exceedingly stellar blue flames.","The flames could seemingly warp the fabric of Reality around him as the spacetime continuum fluctuated as if a singularity was blooming!","It was the reveal of a shocking personage of power that was unknown before this, but he now gazed upon the masses as his power meant too many things.","From afar, Lilith's smile turned into a raucous laugh as her visage released even greater power, the three Undead Emperors beside her shooting out pillars of crimson light that connected to her.","Undead Emperor Feng had an impassive gaze as his eyes stopped on Noah's ignited visage, the other two Undead Emperors being a Glacial Zombie Emperor and an Abyssal Halcyon Titan who burned brightly at this moment- their source of power all connecting and flowing into Lilith as her Aura Potency became maddeningly tyrannical while her figure released a bellow and surged towards CHARLEMAGNE!","The choice of enemies in this battle.","This was a crucial thing as if one chose a certain powerful enemy, they would be left in a bitter battle for nearly the whole duration of the battle!","So the Wills of many observed to see which combatant this new entrant would choose.","And the gaze of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor pressed down on the masses as he moved away from the protected Mikado who now had one of CHARLEMAGNE'S bodies and the Mikado of Strength come near her.","The big bosses could be targeted later when their resource reserves were more depleted as the Quintessential Kainos Emperor would not bind his time to them entirely!","His gaze went to those a level below them.","His gaze went to the somewhat average in power Rulers as well as...the Legions of NULLITY Beasts surrounding the Tribunal Rulers.","His eyes were already seeing the All Source Enhancers as his figure that remained ignited flickered and disappeared!","ZIIP!","The distance between space twisted and malformed as he seemingly squeezed and shorted it to jump from one location to another within a fraction of a nanosecond, his body burning with wild stellar cerulean flames as he reappeared...in the midst of one of the 5 vast NULLITY Beast Legions.","It was the Legion under Aegon as the eyes of this Ruler instantly honed onto Noah.","Noah whose gaze remained placid as with his hands free, he moved them towards his chest as if he was pulling on the very fabric of space around him! This pulling motion caused the stellar cerulean Flames surrounding him to rage as they gave off an obscene Gravitational pull while spreading out like scorching blue waves- the bodies of hundreds of nearby NULLITY Beasts being pulled towards him as they were smashed with an area of effect damage exceeding 60 Quadrillion!","HOOONG!","Their gray scales cracked and shattered as the bodies of over half of these NULLITY Beasts instantly became crushed by the oppressive Absolute Mana Authority that made up most of these terrifying blue flames.","And the moment their bodies shattered...","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","Their corpses exploded into massive scorching waves akin to miniature singularities that utterly decimated any other lifeforms nearby!","BOOM!...","It was akin to a glorious chain reaction that decimated the remaining half of the NULLITY Beasts.","This in turn left the attractive force of the Singularity Ignition to pull in even more NULLITY Beasts as a domineering voice was heard once more!","<Third Form.>","...!","Quintessential Singularity Ignition had the undeniable ability of deploying a force of attraction against enemies to pull them close.","The Third Form of the Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Techniques was the Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg which had a repulsive force that wouldn't even let enemies come close!","After pulling more NULLITY Beasts in as they only just began to burn, Noah's visage erupted with a Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg as a repulsive force smashed out with the deployment of a domain, the newly pulled hundreds of NULLITY Beasts bellowing out as they were reduced to cinders right after- their bodies blown away as their corpses exploded into scorching singularities that burned hundreds more!","<...>","Within a few nanoseconds.","All encompassed in less than a microsecond!","A chain reaction began where the feature of Quintessential Singularity Ignition of exploding the corpses of destroyed enemies for 200% of the Damage...it was too much of an obscene construct as seas of cerulean scorching singularities were spreading all around- each one exceeding 120 Quadrillion Damage Values!!!"]},{"number":2121,"title":"Chapter 2121: Chapter 2120 Singularity Ignition And Retribution! III","paragraphs":["From the Quintessential Singularity Ignition, chains of scorching flames that tore apart the very fabric of Reality exploded from every corpse that was made as a result of the cerulean flames!","Because of this, a number of NULLITY Beasts exceeding a few thousand fell and turned to dust under Noah's gaze as his visage looked like an Incarnation of Apocalyptic flames!","He was truly putting on an Apocalyptic display.","He showed he was powerful.","But he wasn't the only powerful being here.","Radiance erupted in the midst of the NULLITY Beast Legions as Aegon's gaze had a trace of wrath, his hands waving a massive gray greatsword on the path of the bellowing blue explosions of Singularities as a wave of NULLITY shot out to form a wall!","In another direction of the NULLITY Beasts Legions, the cry of a bow rang out as the area above Noah soon became encompassed by simmering gray arrows of vibrant radiance.","Althea had also made a move that came from a NULLITY Relic as a few tens of Quadrillions of Damage Values rained down!","Two Tribunal Rulers made moves to contain Noah and his outburst as he truly seemed like an unstoppable raging Singularity.","While the prompts of loot cascaded over his eyes and he faced the counterattack of two Tribunal Rulers, his head rose up as he bellowed madly!","<OOOOOOH!>","A bellow raging with Haki and power as soon after, the flames of Singularity around him received an infusion of Absolute Dream and Avalon Authorities on top of Billions of the Essence of Reality- the stellar cerulean flames turning into billowing waves of cataclysmic fire that stretched out with him at the center and threatened to down everything!!!","But once more, he wasn't the only powerful being here.","As his body released Seas of scorching flames and he seemed ready to assert his dominance once more...","SHAA!","Two more auras appeared to his left and right.","The Invigilator, Ezekiel could be seen with radiant silver-white hair as he carried a radiant gray Flail in his hands that he pointed forth. The Eminent Mastermind, Noah, carried a dazzling gray Spear that released an aurora of grandiosity!","The both of them shockingly moved in conjunction as they spoke simultaneously.","<Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity>","...!","The fabric of Reality flashed with darkness and a gray radiance for an instant.","From four directions, dark gray walls appeared as they ignored the very fabric of Reality to instantly close in on the raging Incarnation of flames!","His visage that had nearly turned the surroundings into a scorching sea was seemingly instantly snuffed out as it was enclosed into an unbreakable prison of NULLITY.","A prison that looked like a casket as the radiant Spear from the Eminent Mastermind shot out like a nuke that instantly pierced this casket at its very center!","...!","It entered from the front of the casket and pierced through the back in a shocking development.","Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity.","An ability that isolated the target from the very fabric of Reality as what did this mean?","<The arrogant fool is done for.>","Aegon spoke out while extinguishing the remaining blue flames as he knew of the shocking attack that two Tribunal Rulers had thrown out in conjunction really well.","An inescapable prison that cut one off from Reality itself as only NULLITY surrounded them- it meant that they would not even be able to pull upon the Sources of Nature as they were cut off from even the decreta and Laws they were integrated with!","So one could not even usher and call forth Absolute Authority within it.","And while contained in the <Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity>, a NULLITY Relic had pierced through it while the walls themselves constantly attacked and decayed one's Origin with the essence of NULLITY as they would face attacks on all sides while they couldn't even defend, the only fate for them being death!","Yet...","DUM!","The eyes of the Tribunal Rulers sharpened as a droning sound was heard from within the Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity.","DUM! DUM! DUM!","Like drums of War.","Like a beast that couldn't be kept chained breaking out!","But how was this possible?","He should have been blocked off from even Sources of Nature as he wouldn't have been able to protect himself!","But Reality was different.","What they had trapped was not a being that had merely integrated with Nature.","He had bound its source entirely as he could pull upon as much Absolute Authority as his soul could bear, and Absolute Pure Mana Output would change this to pure Authority of Manadynamics!","But this wasn't why the Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity was vibrating while droning sounds bellowed out.","It was because the four walls of this Casket were releasing attacks on all sides- and constantly at that.","The already cast Quintessential Singularity Ignition had multiple Reality Altering affixes alone of them...was Quintessential Retribution activating 50% of the time when he received attacks from any sources!","And within the terrifying casket, Noah was receiving attacks constantly as he didn't even have to lift a linger.","Terrifying waves and arcs of deeply blue flames began to explode and burn around him as they only increased in concentration and frequency!","DUM!","DUM!","CRACK!","The pristine and clear crystalline gray surfaces of the Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity began to crack.","The moment they did, arcs of violent blue flames began to burn in the surroundings as they surged out like flaming tongues of lightning and began to fill the surrounding space.","It was Retribution.","Quintessential Retribution!","DUM! CRACK!","And the cracks extended as the Turbid Casket of Interminable Nullity soon had cerulean gaps freely seen all around it as it was shattered by a shocking force soon after!","...!","The dazzling silver gray Spear gravitated onto the Eminent Mastermind as his eyes twisted coldly, his gaze and the gazes of many landing on the culprit who was surrounded by flaming arcs of Singularities.","Flaming arcs of Retribution that spread out maddeningly and with rage to cause an eruption of a storm of blue flames!","And at the center of it all, the culprit was nonchalant as he even had his hands behind his back.","His tyrannical gaze passed over the Eminent Mastermind, The Invigilator, Aegon, and Althea as they were still surrounded by Legions of Abominations as he voiced out.","<Pathetic.>","WAA!"]},{"number":2122,"title":"Chapter 2122: Chapter 2121 Who Are You?!","paragraphs":["<Pathetic.>","WAA!","His words ushered out crystal clear as 4 Tribunal Rulers had surrounded him, and even they could not hold him down!","So his Tyranny rose ever higher as his voice continued while he tapped the air behind him.","<For you all...it seems that I do not even need to rise from my throne.>","...!","Space fluctuated and vibrated.","It felt like another singularity was blooming, but it emanated within Noah's own body as he called an Innate authority from his own Lineage!","Multicolored with its structural makeup seemingly forged from stellar crystalline connate metals, a massive throne inscribed with dazzling blue lemniscate ecritures bloomed.","It was the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny.","Dazzling in grandeur and magisterial in majesty, it had been moved from the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature as Noah's True Sanguine Clone...sat upon it fearlessly.","<...>","Against terrifying enemies, he truly sat down!","As if they were all beneath him!","As if they couldn't compare!","His figure and throne burned with blue flames as even the Reality around him was melting, the Four Tribunal Rulers gazing towards him coldly as at this juncture, The Empress made a move.","And this move began with a sonorous voice of utter majesty.","<Who are you?>","SHIING!","Ignited with flames of a singularity and situated on a blazing throne, Noah's gaze reacted to this voice as he turned towards the far away Empress.","The one who sat beside OPPENHEIMER.","The one behind his success from what others believed!","She had not truly made any moves in this battle as nobody fully grasped the extent of her power.","Her dazzling dark hair pulsed with grandiosity as she floated forward calmly while voicing out towards Noah!","Who was he?","Who was this new combatant that was connected to the Avalon and Dream Dimensions that seemed to","now be allied with the Will of Reality?","<Who am I?>","HUUUM!","His voice resonated out in the form of Haki as the surrounding space trembled.","His identity.","He had hidden it for the most part in order to not draw attention to himself when he couldn't fully protect himself and his interests.","Even now, he wasn't the most powerful person out there as even on this battlefield, there lay terrifying monsters!","And this wasn't to even mention the hidden powerhouses within Dimensions...or the True Emperors and any Ancestors that would very soon choose to descend in order to fulfill their wishes.","But this name and distinction stood for something.","Unmatched in this Age.","The epitome of multiple Aspects in this Age.","The most prime example of an Emperor in this Age!","Could he truly achieve this if he remained cautious and continued hiding his title?","If he were to freely let it be known, he would be targeted by all those who seriously sought the Seat of the True Emperor!","And if he was targeted...terrifyingly powerful enemies would throw themselves at his feet.","Enemies that if he could overcome...his already insane and unrealistic pace of progression would become even more Reality breaking!","So when the right hand of OPPENHEIMER asked him who he was...","<I have been called many names in the past.>","HOOONG!","Mana and Entropy surged as Providence began to spill around wildly.","Many eyes were focused here as even the battle Enders constricted their pupils as they did not expect what was to come!","As he sat on his throne with beautifully scorching blue flames and arcs of light raging around him, he leaned back and tapped on the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny as he spoke.","<I have been called many names. The 9th Infernal Lord, The Progenitor, the Tyrannical Emperor...and even the Ethereal Dimensional Emperor.>","WAA!","As he spoke, he tapped the handrest of his throne as a dazzling solidified crown appeared above him, the words <ETHEREAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR> blooming with fantastical grandiosity as he wasn't done!","<But you all...can call me by another name!>","....!","The <ETHEREAL> portion next to his distinction fluctuated and changed as the arcs and tendrils of unquenchable flames of authority around him seemingly carved it out.","<QUINTESSENTIAL>","BOOOM!","Billowing streams of Providence surged out from cracks in space as they washed over his grand figure.","Shining brightly under the eyes of all, the distinction of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR was laid bare as it swirled around a solidified crown that floated backwards to stand atop the backbone of a Throne that shone with utter brilliance!","And the Emperor seated upon the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny gazed upon the swathes of truly powerful beings in this Age as his Will emanated out.","<You all can crawl back from the caves you came out of and retire. This Age...is not for you to shine bright in.>","...!","<Gaze upon the embers of your past grandeur and rule. Remember of the Ages past and the Eras gone...because that is the last glimmer of brilliance you all can achieve. From here on out, there will be no fight for the Seat of the True Emperor. There will be no cycles of Ages after mine. Rejoice in your past accomplishments and relish in them as for you all, there is no future. No future...unless you bend under my Will.>","<...>","Stark silence.","Utmost shock and incredulity led to utmost silence as briefly, the chaotic battlefield had no attacks being thrown out as only the sound of crackling cerulean flames surging around a singular figure could be heard!","This single unveiling changed so many things as it took more than a microsecond until the results of all beings were displayed!","From afar, Lilith's smiling and raucous expression froze as the crimson eye on her forehead turned extremely chilly.","She realized she had made a grave mistake.","The being she had chosen not to reveal in order to bring more chaos to the fight for the authority of the True Emperor...he actually had the distinction as the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR!","In this Age of Quintessence!","A seat of authority...that she had to grasp in order to attain her ideals.","She had actually helped keep such a being hidden!","...!","<AWOOO!>","A howl of rage bellowed out from her as the crimson eye on her forehead expanded evermore, her skin cracking and splitting in an obscene way as dense waves of authority swirled around her- the connections she shared with the three Undead Emperors around her only being strengthened as they turned into pillars of light.","Pillars that were so massive that they wrapped around the Undead Emperor Feng, the Glacial Zombie Emperor, and the Abyssal Halcyon Titan as all three terrifying beings became twisted in space and flowed to be absorbed into her expanding crimson eye!","Her form began to change and gigantify as with horrendous waves of power, she shot out like an unchained beast towards the cold faced QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR as she wasn't the only one.","Out of the many blazing auras of power in this enclosed domain, the vast majority all surged towards Noah without so much as a word.","The reveal was done as the intended consequence bloomed at this moment, the Quintessential Kainos Emperor gazing at all of this with eyes and Will that utterly bubbled forth tremendous levels of Tyranny as seated upon his throne- his palm opened to clasp a newly appearing Xyston that he pointed towards all the surging enemies!!!"]},{"number":2123,"title":"Chapter 2123: Chapter 2122 Quintessence! I","paragraphs":["Across the spacetime continuum.","Within the folds of the Boundary Between Realities of the Desolate Mausoleum.","The Visage of an existence was hidden within as he gave off an air of contained power, his eyes luminous as at times they seemed as small as stars while at other times...they were larger than even Cosmos!","This existence was veiled in the layers of space as he was undisturbed since the end of the Last Age, his gaze far-reaching as at this moment, his luminous eyes opened wide to gaze forward.","They peeled across the layers of space as Providence surged around this being, a scene being refracted before him soon after that showed the image of a tyrannical Emperor surrounded by blazing blue flames showing his distinction clearly!","<...The Key has unveiled itself?>","The eyes of this being rose quizzically as he gazed with scrutiny, the identity of this existence being something it was waiting for a long, long time!","And now that his identity was unveiled...","<It seems that time is coming ever closer. The time for the complete end of history...or the ushering of a new one.>","HUUUM!","The fabric of Reality trembled at his thoughts as this existence still didn't make a move.","It wasn't his time yet...even though this time seemed to be infinitely near!","—","Across these very same folds of the Boundary Between Realities.","BZZZT!","The Primordial Temples across Realities were trembling and shaking chaotically as all Primordial Seers overseeing them felt an unprecedented change!","A number of weeks ago, the enemy of Primordials had risen as the statues of the Primordial Temples had bled crimson gold blood.","At this moment, these statues shattered and overflowed with crimson blood as the identity of the enemy was made clear!","Painted in glorious crimson gold, the words QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR luminously showed above all Primordial Temples.","The Seers saw their future enemy clearly as they didn't find out who he was through their own efforts, it was only after he had revealed himself that his identity became clear!","And this unveiling fundamentally changed many things as this being effectively pointed the sword of Primordials and many others directly towards him!","As for whether he would survive as the target of all powerful Emperors of this Age...","Well, this could only be proven if his distinction remained to be true.","If he truly showed and exemplified Quintessence!","And the show of this would be felt by nobody else more than those currently in an enclosed domain with him in one of the many distant multicolored Seas of the Quantum Dimension.","There were a variety of beings who reacted in a unique manner as the distinction of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR being known, with the figure of Lilith howling out in rage and ignoring everyone else as she shot out towards Noah's visage.","In her mind, his words continued to repeat over and over again as she felt like she had been played!","<Remember of the Ages past and the Eras gone...because that is the last glimmer of brilliance you all can achieve...Remember of the Ages past...>","OOOH!","Her figure only increased in stature and speed while such words repeated in her mind, billowing Entropy surging around her as she sought the incandescent Emperor that remained seated this whole time.","Another party that did something similar was the forces of the Quantum Dimension as finally...CHARLEMAGNE made a move.","He and multiple of his Parallel Selves surged even as Enders of Nature placed themselves on his path, with the Mikado and other Rulers of the Quantum Dimension moving towards Noah with utmost coldness as this being stood opposite to their aims and ideals- with the throne of the True Emperor needing to be taken by someone on their side in order to fully achieve what they sought!","The Tribunal Rulers were already close as they blazed with NULLITY and prepared to release Apocalyptic attacks, with even The Empress adopting a sharp expression as her body began to glow with an even more radiant shade of NULLITY.","Then, there were others who took different actions.","There was Albus from the Prana Dimension who gazed at everything with his ancient gaze as he kept the Prana Dimensional Rulers back.","There were the Elysium Dimensional Rulers whose bodies were illuminated by Providence as they stared towards Noah in shock while also not making a move!","But...the vast majority of Rulers from other Dimensions present were surging towards the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR.","How would he face the attacks of the strongest beings here?!","His tyrannical visage retained his grandeur as his Will echoed out amidst enemies nearing his position, his face becoming increasingly radiant and magisterial.","<Let me show you...just what Quintessence is.>","...!","His Will focused on Lilith, CHARLEMAGNE, the Mikado, Tribunal Rulers, and any other Rulers that were rushing in this direction.","He only focused his Will on them as in the next second, most of their figures came to a halt as their eyes turned insurmountably somber, becoming filled with incredulity and shock soon after!","This was because at that instant, they felt a malicious and dominant Will pervading the depths of their very souls through a pristine connection as this will- it carried something extremely nefarious.","Through their own Integration to Decreta!","They felt a dominating will press upon their soul as unbelievably...this will began to burn with cerulean blue flames.","The Quintessential Kainos Mana had the capability of pressing his Will down through the Lines of Integration of the Sources he bound, but he didn't choose the feature of Neural Encroachment that would be rebuffed by the truly powerful beings the moment that they realized a will try to dominate them.","He instead wrapped his will with the flames of the Quintessential Singularity Ignition as he bypassed any and all defenses that his enemies had.","It was a move even he didn't fully know if it would work but...his will carried the Absolute Mana Authority of the flames of Quintessential Singularity Ignition as he achieved a feat that utterly broke the scales of power!","If the ability of Neural Encroachment could pass through the Lines of Integration, why not the scorching flames of a singularity?!","And so...over 60 Quadrillion Quintessential Damage Values coursed through the Dream and Avalon Lines of Integration of his enemies as they smashed directly onto their souls.","An unprecedented result occurred next!"]},{"number":2124,"title":"Chapter 2124: Chapter 2123 Quintessence! II","paragraphs":["The truly powerful Dimensional Rulers more often than not had integrated a majority if not all of the Decreta of Dimensions, with the enemies before Noah either having integrated Dream or Avalon, or some having even integrated both!","They received Damage that seemingly came from the very depths of their souls as even their Innate Dimensional Barriers were not affected.","Beings like CHARLEMAGNE and Lilith came to a halt as Providence shone around them, their expressions turning extremely ugly as their Aspects of Existence acted by instinct.","The Tribunal Rulers and Mikado were the same as the moment they felt their Souls cry out and Providence and Destiny warn them of an utterly disastrous result, their souls painfully took the actions of shattering the Lines of Integration to either Dream or Avalon or both of them right away!","But some Rulers from the Niflheim, Fantasia, Mirror, Quantum...all of them that had begun to surge towards Noah just a step behind the truly powerful figures and had either Avalon or Dream Integrated- all of them became points of dazzling cerulean singularities.","Their defenseless souls could not withstand an initial outburst of tens of Quadrillions of Damage Values before they reacted to even shatter their Lines of Integration as their souls were instantly overcome and began to burn to cinders.","In the fantastical domain surrounded by multicolored Quantum Rings, over a dozen blue singularities burned and then exploded into an even grander expanse of blue flames soon after!","<...>","The cries of flames was the only thing that could be heard as these actions were too shocking!","And all of them came after the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR had said a single sentence.","Let me show you...just what Quintessence is.","This was what he had uttered.","HOOONG!","In response to these shocking actions, the auras of the most powerful Rulers blazed ever higher as they all had the same epiphany!","This being before them was the real deal.","Because if he was working in conjunction with Reality and they had done something to the Avalon and Dream Dimensions...","<The Sources of Dream and Avalon Dimensions have been tainted and can be used to attack you! Desegregate with these Decreta!>","Lilith howled out with immense rage and pain as this was the loss of two Sources of Nature!","The augmentations and capability to utilize their Absolute Authority were shockingly shattered as the capabilities of this existence sitting upon the Throne were truly unfathomable.","But the aura around Lilith, Tribunal Rulers, CHARLEMAGNE, and the two Mikados only raged higher as at this moment- even the dormant aura of the most powerful being among the Mirror Dimensional Rulers came forward to make a move!","Because they all had the same thought.","They could not let this being before them survive as the capability to taint the very Sources of Nature...it could not be allowed to exist!","So they moved forward with even greater resolve and power as one being in particular performed a unique action.","It was CHARLEMAGNE and his calculating gaze as his main body stayed behind.","Instead, his Parallel Selves were the ones that surged forward as shockingly, they weren't affected by the unfathomable attack that the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR had just released.","They were not from this path.","What they integrated with were not the Avalon and Dream Dimensions of this Main Path as they were not affected!","It meant this existence had not gained the capabilities to extend his will across the Parallel Paths.","It was all the more reason to strike him down now!","As the being wielding the most power here and not currently injured, he had his Parallel Selves ignore the attacks of Enders and swarm towards the being seated upon the Throne.","The being that at this moment shook his head dominatingly while hoisting the Dimensional Reality Xyston in his hands.","<You all still do not get it.>","WAA!","The Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor were piercing as they currently dripped with grandiosity!","A foreboding feeling rose in the hearts of all beings as The Empress in particular at this moment...had her eyes release a stellar glimmer that nobody else saw as a radiant gray light erupted to cover her body and soul.","Her eyes were sharp as her fair hands rose while controlling billowing waves of NULLITY while the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR finished his words.","<Quintessence...if showing it to you all is not enough, I will engrave it upon your souls as you perish.>","....!","His Will erupted out.","He had latched upon the Lines of Integration for Dream and Avalon, but this wasn't the only Source he had bound to himself.","He had also integrated himself with an even stronger Source of Nature that all powerful existences relied upon- a Source of Nature that made up the very fabric of Reality!","His will latched onto Manadynamics.","And his visage lit up with beautiful blue flames as he wrapped the Lines of Integration stemming from this Source he had partially bound with blazing blue flames made up of countless miniaturized Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkriegs!","...!","Entropy seethed in turn at the shocking and wanton destruction about to unfold.","The Hearts of the truly powerful Rulers shuddered as they felt the surging flames burn at the very depths of their souls- and from a sacred Natural Law that no single being should be able to alone greatly influence!","The quintessentially blazing flames actually encroached to decimate their souls from this Source.","This was Manadynamics.","A Fundamental Natural Law that governed the very balance of Reality!","Lilith had bellowed for all Rulers to leave behind Avalon and Dream and desegregate them as they alone were a tremendous loss.","But the Integration of a Fundamental Natural Law?","It granted them too great power as to release it from Integration...it was an insurmountably hard choice!","But the truly powerful made this choice right away as they knew what was at stake.","The truly powerful felt the unfathomable incredulity and shock as their instincts instantly allowed them to shatter this connection they felt as they suffered yet another heavy injury, as well as their power receiving a great reduction!","The truly powerful did this.","Others...took a bit longer to make this instant decision.","And this length of time...","It cost them a great deal.","It cost them too much!","HOOONG!","A blaring horn rang out as in the next moment, only silence could be heard as something terrifying became a reality.","A scintillating blue light as if a Reality was burning emanated out as the Mikado of Old and the Mikado of Strength had their figures become bathed with cerulean blue flames that began by destroying their very souls.","Quintessential Treasure Cache was activated silently for the two of them as in an unbelievable turn of events, the bright bodies of two of the Four Mikado that guarded the Pylon of Ascension were being scorched black as their corpses...exploded into massive singularities soon after!","It was an unreal scene.","It was something that should not at all be possible as this next unfolding event seemingly occurred in a void of silence as the stature of these two renowned and powerful Rulers burned.","But they weren't the only ones.","Oh, they weren't the only ones!!!","Among the Tribunal Rulers, one being was also just a nanosecond behind on making the choice of instantly shattering their Integration to Manadynamics!"]},{"number":2125,"title":"Chapter 2125: Chapter 2124 Unfathomable Grandiosity! I","paragraphs":["The Mikado!","They guarded the Pylon of Ascension!","They were extremely powerful existences that had lived through multiple ages as in this Age of Quintessence, their gazes were on a boundless future.","This was because in this Age, the status quo would change as they would not remain guarding the Pylon of Ascension any longer!","The Ancestors were bound to descend as a new path would be opened after the destruction of Dimensions and Reality, with the gazes of the Mikado being on grander frontiers than the Barren Lands.","But even with those hopes and dreams backed by their terrifying strength...neither could have foreseen that it would all go up in flames on this day!","Through the Fundamental Natural Law of Manadynamics, many existences were hurt as the bodies of The Mikado of Old and Strength that had turned into blazing singularities were not the only ones.","Amidst the Primordial NULLITY Legions, a scintillating point of cerulean light burned as the person within the surging blue flames had an expression of incredulity as if he did not believe what was happening.","As if it was something that could not happen!","His hand that held the massive radiant gray sword had its bronze skin crackled and scored beyond measure as from within, his soul had thoroughly been covered by the Flames of a singularity as he was desegregated from all other bound decreta and Natural Laws a moment after, the light of Vitality in his eyes being extinguished as his visage soon exploded into a terrifying singularity that drowned out thousands of NULLITY Beasts!","A Tribunal Ruler.","A Seeker of the End!","Aegon...had fallen.","HOONG!","A piercing cry echoed out silently amidst the scorching flames as the NULLITY Relic he held disappeared amidst the raging flames, this unbelievable development falling under the eyes of all as utter silence pervaded the surroundings!","Disastrous.","It was utterly and cataclysmically disastrous for all those involved as nobody knew the consequences that would arise from the death of a Tribunal Ruler!","—","Albus gazed at everything from the designated thrones of the Prana Dimension, his ancient eyes dim as he and all the Prana Dimensional Rulers he had held behind had yet to suffer an ounce of damage.","He had lived across many Ages and come across multiple True Emperors.","He had seen the Ascension of True Emperors on their path before they took the Throne, and he had seen a variety of them and their disposition!","Some were tyrants who killed indiscriminately as all those in their opposition fell, and others only did enough to attain the authority and power they needed.","In the Age of Slaughter, countless Emperors had perished to the extent that the strongest beings were reduced by 80%!","Currently, it is the Age of Quintessence.","Looking at the burning singularities that used to be Dimensional Rulers, Albus had yet to ascertain how many Emperors would fall before everything drew to a close.","But as he saw the gaze of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR focus on only those attacking him and direct his might only to them, Albus was given an inkling to the character of this existence.","An existence that had somehow managed to grow capable of affecting the Lines of Integration of Nature.","A terrifying capability that would put any Emperor of Age a weapon that could cleave the path towards the Seat of the True Emperor!","But even as he saw all of this unbelievable might that actually cost the life of two of the Four Mikado that guarded the Pylon of Ascension and even a Tribunal Ruler...Albus still shook his head with tiredness and despondency as this Age was truly different from all others.","Other Ages did not have the complete destruction of everything on the line.","Other Ages did not have the interest of the Ancestors...who would be descending to personally achieve the aims that they sought!","So even with all this power that this exceptional being expressed...could it really fare against True Emperors of the past Ages and the Progeny of Ancestors outside these Barren Lands?","It was a despondent thought from the strongest Prana Dimensional Ruler as his body began to light up with a radiant verdant light, his Will also seeing the need to do his part!","—","Austere waves of Providence shone amidst raging waves of other essences.","At the depths of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, the figure of Eowyn watched Noah's main body with an ever changing gaze as she saw the many essences of different Natural Laws flowing into him.","Every part of his seemed to be absorbing the essences of Natural Laws as he would gain an understanding of them sooner or later, while the understanding of his current Laws only continued to elevate to greater levels.","But apart from this, three dazzling Quintessential Treasure Caches had appeared above him as they shone with utmost splendor- these Caches belonging to the defeat of the Mikado of Old, the Mikado of Strength, and the Tribunal Ruler- Aegon!","Along with this, a massive radiant gray greatsword appeared beside the newly appearing Treasure Cache as it was the NULLITY Relic that Aegon used to carry!","Towards this, Eowyn simply heard Noah's billowing Will thundered out as this sword began to move.","<Break it down and Infuse everything about it into RUINATION and the Primordial Disk. This should allow them to complete their transformations.>","WAA!","An ever terrifying concentration of materials was veered towards the relics still burning brightly in the Blacksmith's Forge as the Will of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality did what it was told.","A will so powerful that while all of this occurred, he was binding another Source of Nature through the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","A partial binding that at this moment...","SHIIING!","Completed as rays of utterly magisterial golden light emanated from all around.","The rays of light formed into massive golden pillars that went from incorporeal until they materialized into shocking wonders- a myriad of golden pillars filled with Providence manifesting as Eowyn was shocked to see them smash towards Noah's regal figure!","The impact was immaculate and terrifying as thereafter...everything froze.","<...!>"]},{"number":2126,"title":"Chapter 2126: Chapter 2125 Unfathomable Grandiosity! II","paragraphs":["Eowyn was still connected to Noah in a unique way as what he saw, she saw.","So she saw his actions as he terrifyingly used the Lines of Integration of the Sources he bound to attack those opposing him!","It was a shocking means for him to attain as the worry of his enemies getting stronger the more Dimensions he released was slowly destroyed with this.","So long as he integrated Sources of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws, he could force his enemies to shatter their Lines of Integration as their boons would be cut off!","He would first weaken them, and then he would decimate them.","With such moves in his arsenal, how could the most powerful existences that relied on Natural Laws stand against him?","Their only option was to stop him in the quickest time possible- and that was actually seconds ago!","Because now, he had also bound Providence.","The Natural Law that acted akin to the light that would illuminate the unknown.","If he removed this from his enemies...how could they even foresee the wonders to become? Because Destiny alone would not be enough!","Thinking of this, Eowyn couldn't help but imagine the grand future.","The future that was full of possibilities and yet at the same time...a lot of uncertainties!","And before she could think any further, the complete integration to Providence occurred. The partial binding of the Source of Providence was also accomplished as multiple fantastical golden pillars of light smashed unto Noah.","They released incandescent lights all around that encompassed everything to the point that even Eowyn felt her mind blank out!","All thought stopped.","At the center of it all, Noah was the only one who experienced exactly what shocking change was brought forth. It was a unique sensation he had only come across a few times before where he felt as if his consciousness was entirely taken out of his physical form and placed elsewhere.","This time he seemed to be looking at an expense of gold, and among all of this halcyon grandeur...innumerable White Lines ran parallel amongst each other.","One line in particular was much larger than countless of them combined as it pulsed with a shocking amount of Providence- the same Providence that was also shared by the innumerable branches connected to it!","It was the Main Path and the Myriad of Parallel Paths.","The partial binding of the Source of Providence had somehow allowed Noah to gaze upon the unique scenes of the innumerable Parallel Paths as his consciousness lit up brightly while delving fully into it, intent on understanding exactly what this concept entailed.","While his main body did this, the events in the Quantum Rings that contained the Dimensional Conclave continued to unfold!","Unseen by many, the Elysium Dimensional Rulers had their figures tremble as a golden light pierced across their eyes that then gazed towards the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR in sheer disbelief and wonder.","But there was enough of disbelief and wonder to go around!","Because the action of granting true death to a Tribunal Ruler was more than enough to stop everything in its tracks.","The gaze of the Eminent Mastermind Noah was of utmost solemnity while Ezekiel and Althea had looks of utter Fury and disbelief in their eyes.","Then there was The Empress.","Then there was CHARLEMAGNE who also gazed towards Noah with solemnity as he looked at the scorching Seas of Singularities where the two Mikado used to be!","Off to the side, Lilith had an utterly ashen expression as she realized just the sheer gravity of opportunity she had let slip up and let loose this whole time.","Many did not take action right away, but one being sighed with solemnity as her fair hand reached to tap her chest.","<You should not have done that.>","Her voice was clear as it rang out amidst the blazing flames of Quintessential Singularity Ignition.","From her chest, her hand seemed to be pulling from her heart.","She was The Empress, and she held a special position and power among Primordials.","She may not have taken the first ranking as the most powerful Tribunal Ruler, but this did not matter to her as she exceeded this ranking in another way!","She was connected to OPPENHEIMER.","Others had received many boons and treasures from OPPENHEIMER as they wielded great power, but what about the woman he always had by his side? What would she carry that stemmed out of these Barren Lands? What method of protection and power did OPPENHEIMER grant to the one he left behind?","SHIIING!","From the hand placed over her heart, she made a pulling motion as...a flower came out.","A pure and simple flower that had 10 silver gray petals and a bud that shone with an innumerable light of NULLITY. It moved left and right as if it was alive, its sheer existence causing the fabric of Reality to tremble as it caused grand changes!","Just by appearing outside of her body, the surroundings instantly changed as a sea of NULLITY exploded out and bathed everything around her, the NULLITY Beasts trembling as their bodies rapidly increased in size and power!","And this...was just from its appearance.","Thereafter, The Empress sighed again as she repeated her words while blowing onto the flower.","<You truly should not have done that.>","....!","A single petal fell as The Empress blew...and this petal disappeared an instant after.","And within the shred of a nanosecond...","WAA!","A radiant silver gray light spread out as...","Everything became blanketed by NULLITY.","The scorching flames burning all around were extinguished as any semblance of Natural Laws were denied, everything in the surroundings becoming painted utterly gray!","With her hands cradling the point of incandescent gray light as if it was a rising sun, The Empress called out calmly.","<The Primitivus Nullity Originator>","...!","The gift from OPPENHEIMER to The Empress that exceeded all the NULLITY Relics that Tribunal Rulers had received.","The Primitivus Nullity Originator!","A treasure that would be much sought after even outside the Barren Lands!","An inexhaustible construct that released endless Essence of NULLITY of such pristine quality unlike anything shown so far.","It was activated at this moment as all of Reality turned a shade of gray!"]},{"number":2127,"title":"Chapter 2127: Chapter 2126 Unfathomable Grandiosity! III","paragraphs":["All of Reality turned gray!","All laws and decreta were withdrawn into one's own body and origin as any output outside of this...was an impossibility.","It was a Reality Altering Construct that far exceeded anything others knew as even the grandeur of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR was shadowed as his scorching blue flames all but faded, the only ones still burning being in his immediate surroundings around his Throne of Quintessential Tyranny!","And even these...seemed to be getting threatened by the ever-increasing light of NULLITY that was more potent than anything felt before.","A terrifying tool was pulled out as even the Quintessential Kainos Emperor squinted his eyes while controlling his authority, prompts rising before his eyes as he focused on the flower that caused such great changes to Reality!","<You have fallen under the domain of The Primitivus Nullity Originator.>","<The output of all abilities outside of your body and immediate sphere of influence is nullified.>","<The Augmentations of Natural Laws and Decreta are reduced by half.>","<The Augmentations of all Constructs and Concepts are reduced by half.>","<All Resource utilization has been reduced by half...>","Multiple unavoidable debuffs came down as everything changed the moment that The Empress made a move!","And her move was not wasted in the slightest as the Legions of the Abominations roared out will moving with unprecedented power, their deadly eyes honing in on the Enders of Nature whose body had lost their luster.","Meanwhile, Althea, Ezekiel, and the Eminent Mastermind all turned into gray streaks of light as they were stupendously faster than anything else here- their figures very quickly appearing near Noah's position as they released deadly attacks!","Lilith's figure had transformed into an utterly demonic existence as massive butterfly-like wings erupted from her back, a humanoid daemon form showing itself as her skin was tainted crimson red while 2 pairs of demonic horns pierced towards space. Her limbs turned into massive flaming hooves as her demonic face held three eyes- the one on her forehead spitting out pure Hatred and anger as she voiced out to herself something only she could hear.","<Father...stay with me one last time. Give me the power to rectify what they did to you long ago. Restore my path towards the True Throne!>","...!","A silent cry.","Her third eye bled tears of crimson gold light as she called upon her Lineage- as she called upon Hatred!","BOOOM!","And even more power surged into her as like an unfurled Daemon from the deepest pits of Apollyon, she surged towards the cerulean flaming Emperor situated upon his throne.","And while it took a few nanoseconds to adapt, CHARLEMAGNE also made a move as his own visage was wrapped with NULLITY- all of these powerful existences erupting out with all their power as they only wanted to achieve a singular goal right now.","The extinction of this being before them before he became exceedingly powerful and tainted even more Sources of Nature!","But there were others who didn't seek the same end.","SHIING!","In front of CHARLEMAGNE's main body, the visage of Albus appeared as the Olden existence from the Prana Dimension finally made a move.","In the world of utter gray where all Sources of Nature were repressed, his old figure was covered by a luminous verdant light as his hands swung like the branches of an ancient tree to knock onto CHARLEMAGNE and keep him in his place!","<My friend...you have veered far from the path we used to walk on.>","His ancient voice echoed out as his body bubbled with life force, standing before CHARLEMAGNE as the other Prana Dimensional Rulers surged towards his Parallel Selves.","They weren't the only ones as in the utterly gray space, multiple golden points of light finally made a move to surround CHARLEMAGNE's Parallel Selves as well as Lilith's raging figure!","It was the Elysium Dimensional Rulers that finally joined the fray at this juncture.","They were the most attune with Providence as it told them of something that was an impossibility before, but now seemed like normality when looking at the being involved.","So they chose their side as among all the enemies rushing towards Noah, only the three Tribunal Rulers were able to get through as Enders of Nature were also still in the field standing against others!","A Spear, a Bow, and a Flail all pointed towards Noah as the Eminent Mastermind, Althea, and the Invigilator surrounded the enthroned figure on the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny.","The figure that gazed at everything coldly even while such shocking restrictions were imposed upon him to the extent that half of his Damage Output was nullified!","This prompted the need of understanding NULLITY and even a weapon that could withstand it.","He needed a weapon capable of carving out NULLITY and fighting alongside it.","He needed RUINATION!","But... in a domain like this, there was another weapon that caused him to be just as fearless.","The weapon capable of dealing 25 Quadrillion Quintessential Damage Values with every swing...was also just as valuable.","Its output was not affected in any way. The Weight of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality did not change!","So the Dimensional Reality Xyston rose as Noah moved with his throne and surged forward even with all these limitations!","SHING!","He swung the Xyston that became bathed with the flames of Quintessential Singularity Ignition as he faced the first attack that arrived.","It was a blazing silver-gray arrow that radiated death and NULLITY.","BOOM...BZZZT!","The impact was reality rending as Noah parried the massive arrow from Althea while still sitting on his throne, his hand twisting and directing the Xyston to this right side soon after as he smashed onto a spiked Flail that released suns of NULLITY.","...!","Another resounding impact as if it was the Cataclysm of Realities echoed out as the thin flames of Absolute Mana Authority stopped the scorching suns of the Flail in their tracks!","Noah then gloriously threw the Xyston from his right hand and onto his left as without even looking, its stellar spearhead met another incandescent Spear full of power!","It was the NULLITY Relic in the form of a Spear from the Eminent Mastermind.","From Noah.","HUUUM!","A low thrumming symphony echoed out with wonder as Spear and Spear met as they tore apart the fabric of Reality.","Arcs of NULLITY cried out while Absolute Mana Authority surged around the Dimensional Reality Xyston and fought for supremacy against the NULLITY Spear!","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor then turned his head during this point of impact as he stared at the regal figure of the Eminent Mastermind.","As Noah...stared coldly and with unfathomable grandiosity towards another Noah!","As he rebuffed the attacks against three Tribunal Rulers while still remaining seated on his throne!!!"]},{"number":2128,"title":"Chapter 2128: Chapter 2127 The Pylon Of Ascension Illuminates! I","paragraphs":["Blazing demonic flames of authority surged around Lilith as her devilish hand in the form of a hoof pierced through the chest of an Elysium Dimensional Ruler that stood in her way.","Her three eyes were filled with madness as the Rulers that stood beside her from Fantasia and Niflheim very carefully approached to lend their support, but a sense of oppressiveness and fear existed whenever they drew close to the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR on his throne!","And they could see him now as he rebuffed three Tribunal Rulers even while falling under the great suppression of the terrifying Primitivus Nullity Originator.","They hesitated as they were followers, but the one who led them had a lot at stake. Her dreams and aspirations.","What she set her heart to achieve after the end of the Last Age!","The appearance of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR threatened all of this as for Lilith, this was now life and death.","HUUUM!","Her hooved hands ripped apart the Elysium Dimensional Ruler whose eyes remained filled with the light of providence even as he perished, his body being burnt to Ashes as he was desegregated and destroyed!","Lilith moved forward once more as soon after, yet another Elysium Dimensional Ruler stood in her path as the gaze of this one was exactly the same as the one she had just killed.","The Seeker of Knowledge had a gaze that said whatever would happen at this juncture was only an inevitability.","Only one of the many probabilities in the Endless River of Providence.","<Move!>","And the Dimensional Deceiver only bellowed out with rage at the delay as she spread forth destruction!","In another direction, CHARLEMAGNE stood before Albus as the figure of this Prana Dimensional Ruler unfurled into a massive verdant tree, its branches shining with a metallic sheen and releasing innumerable authority while they counterattacked against the waves of NULLITY that CHARLEMAGNE released.","<Old friend...>","While ripping apart the very fabric of Reality and destroying the many branches that surged towards him, CHARLEMAGNE'S voice emanated out grandly.","<I do not fight for the destruction of the Anchors and Desolate Mausoleum because I want to. I did not suddenly undergo a change to become someone you do not know. I only looked at the Absolute facts and saw the path I must follow. Nothing can stand in the way of what is to come. Past True Emperors cannot, nor can this Age's True Emperor who has not even been decided. The Will of the Ancestors is undeniable...otherwise, how could they bind Reality itself so long ago?>","His words still carried domineering authority, but they also tried to convey understanding for the sake of the past relationship these beings had as Albus's archaic voice replied.","<Maybe so. But across the Ages, I have not seen an Emperor that has been capable of influencing the very Sources of Nature. With him, there lie many possibilities to follow apart from utmost destruction.>","WAA!","The most powerful Dimensional Ruler of the Prana Dimension saw Noah's power and thought of possibilities, but even then...CHARLEMAGNE still shook his head as three of his Parallel Selves appeared to reinforce him!","<Even then, it would not be enough. Something for you to ponder...why is it that Constantine is not in attendance in this Dimensional Conclave? Why is the Quantum Emperor absent in such a crucial meeting?>","...!","The Quantum Dimension held many mysteries and powerful existences as even CHARLEMAGNE did not take the seat as the strongest!","There was the Quantum Emperor that had been absent from the Dimensional Conclave as what was the reason for his absence?","The triangular pupils of CHARLEMAGNE shone with somber brilliance as he spoke out with majesty.","<He has been waiting at the Pylon of Ascension with the other two Mikados this whole time. The Pylon began to illuminate as it indicated a descent would soon be happening if it hasn't already. Authority exceeding anything in the Barren Lands might have already arrived. The rest of us...can only follow.>","HOONG!","Terrifying words emanated out as the verdant ancient tree that was Albus shook with never before seen anger!","Anger that things truly proceeded in this direction. Anger that it seemed the Ancestors were truly set on their aim if they worked this fast!","<I mean, what did you expect them to do when the Desolate Mausoleum began to lose its restrictions as one of the Anchors disappeared? Albus...join us. There is life to protect in these Barren Lands, yes...but there is life even more crucial to protect outside of it. And the Barren Lands stand in the way of that! You cannot win this...it would merely be suicide.>","BOOOM!","The fabric of Reality was torn as Albus stood his ground even against CHARLEMAGNE and multiple of his Parallel Selves.","The reason for this was nothing other than the fact that CHARLEMAGNE, Lilith, and many others had just lost access to 3 Sources of Nature and now came under the effect of the Primitivus Nullity Originator- while those who didn't target Noah did not face this heavy blow in their power!","Even though it was arduous, Albus held on as he hinged a possibility in the new being behind him that he did not fully know or understand.","He took a leap of faith in the existence that threatened the Hegemony of all other Emperors of this Age just by his sheer distinction alone.","If the True Emperor of the Last Age of the Olden Era was capable of doing what he did, would the True Emperor of the First Age of the Kainos Era be capable of something just as grand?","BZZZT!","Amidst these thoughts, the domain within the Quantum Rings became even more unstable as even these bright rings of light themselves became torn and broken.","NULLITY spread to the surroundings as the beautiful endless Seas of multicolored essence outside also began to get affected, the Primitivus Nullity Originator in The Empress's hands continuing to release its obscene authority!","Apart from the single opening created by the attacks of the Enders of Nature, countless rifts began to occur as some Rulers looked at this with their eyes released a light of brilliance- seeing another path opening up for them!"]},{"number":2129,"title":"Chapter 2129: Chapter 2128 The Pylon Of Ascension Illuminates! II","paragraphs":["In the midst of this all, multiple parties formed with their own ideals as all of them sought destiny and Providence to see what path they could forge in this chaos.","They went to Providence for answers as even while the three Tribunal Rulers clashed with the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR, their minds constantly exploded with possibilities as they relied on Providence to battle.","The Eminent Mastermind pulled his Spear from the clash as his hands turned into phantoms that threw out countless shadows of the NULLITY Spear, and yet his enemy seemed to only be getting more powerful as his stellar Xyston countered all the attacks while knocking away arrows from Althea and an innumerable number of NULLITY suns from the Flail of the Invigilator, Ezekiel!","It was a surreal scene as a single man sat on the Throne and weaved across the Fractured fabric of Reality to gloriously match three Tribunal Rulers, the Empowered NULLITY Beasts also joining the fray soon after as his Xyston covered by glorious blue flames began smashing into them and causing blooming singularities to occur that were snuffed out by the heavy waves of NULLITY soon after.","Seated on his Throne, his gaze was one of utmost power and glory as in this battlefield, nobody shone brighter than him!","<Your very eyes and soul are seeking the path forward.>","HUUM!","His voice began to emanate out in this gray Reality as everyone's guards rose up to elevated levels.","<Let me show you the only path waiting for you all.>","...!","His words brought great alarm to his enemies as before they even ended, they felt a warning from a concept for the last time.","It would be the last time as either they perished thereafter, or they survived as they had to release it!","It was an attack of dazzling blue flames that descended from the Line of Integration of Providence that was most closely bound to their souls.","<OOOOOOH!>","From afar, Lilith bellowed out with immense sorrow and rage as she was among the first to break off the Integration with Providence.","They had all felt the surging flames that singed their souls as the quickest had their lessons after Manadynamics, putting their feelings aside as they did what they had to do in order to escape death!","But it was still Providence.","A truly crucial and fundamental law that was like a Beacon of light to see overwhelming darkness!","It had still taken a fraction of a Nanosecond for some to completely be free of it as in multiple areas where enemy Rulers from Apollyon, Fantasia, Niflheim, Mirror...points of singularities bloomed.","Near Noah's own Throne, the Eminent Mastermind and the Invigilator spat out blue flames with solemn expressions as the visage of Althea...half of it was currently burning with blue flames as she had received a heavy injury!","An injury that was also a chance as the Dimensional Reality Xyston of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor weaved out like a snake towards her wrathful and solemn visage.","Whether the Xyston could actually reach her and cause the fall of another Tribunal Ruler...was unknown!","—","Providence!","As Noah cut off access to it from multiple Rulers, he himself was delving across its endless river that seemed to intricately wrap around the Parallel Paths, and he had learned to delve and gaze upon what he wanted with this unique boon of Providence as he gazed into multiple Parallel Paths.","He wanted to confirm the words of Reality as the more he looked, the graver his expression became!","When focusing on the major events of a Path, nothing about Noah Osmont came up.","Unless he focused on himself and gazed at a mere reflection, he truly did not play a role in the unfolding of Reality in Parallel Paths!","So...what about the Parallel Paths that sprouted from the Main Reality due to the Irreversible Nexus Events that he caused?","The moment he thought of such a question, his vision was drawn away from the current path he viewed as in an abstruse corner where a myriad of golden lines depicted Parallel Paths, he came to see Obsidian lines running alongside them.","And when his consciousness was pulled into them...he saw the Barren Lands.","He saw them in tatters as in this path, the Dream Dimension did not exist while the other 8 Dimensions and the Desolate Mausoleum were accelerating towards destruction.","He didn't stay on this path long as soon after, he was dragged away to observe another path as here, both the Avalon and Dream Dimensions were gone as the very fabric of Reality was constantly undergoing Cataclysm as countless Realities were dying along with the remaining Dimensions!","And one after another, Noah began to be drawn to countless paths that showed such scenes of destruction and despondency as their information soon rose in his mind.","<Apocalyptic Parallel Paths...>","WAA!","Since he did not exist across the myriad Paths, his actions had no way of being rectified by Reality from the Main Path.","The Irreversible Nexus Events that he caused allowed for the birth of Parallel Paths, but since there was no way for his influence or self to cause these events, they violated Reality itself as the actions could not be quantified.","The Parallel Paths that sprouted did not have a true basis in Reality.","So what was birthed instead were unquantifiable probabilities that bore nothing but destruction!","Apocalyptic Parallel Paths.","And it did not stop there.","Noah's consciousness was drawn out again as while he gazed at the massive golden line of the Main Path and the river of Providence coiling around everything, he saw tendrils of Manadynamics, Entropy, Relativity...and the tendrils of something he had not yet come across.","Something that enveloped all of the Fundamental Natural Laws that showed among the many smaller golden lines of Parallel Paths...some had begun to be tainted Obsidian due to the actions of a certain being!","The myriad of Parallel Paths, the myriad of probabilities of Reality...were going towards destruction and Apocalypse.","The Obsidian color was beginning to spread from the Apocalyptic Parallel Paths he sprouted and spread far as eventually, all lines would crumble!","All other probabilities would crumble to join the Main Path as the results of what this confluence would bring...were unimaginable!"]},{"number":2130,"title":"Chapter 2130: Chapter 2129 The Pylon Of Ascension Illuminates! III","paragraphs":["This was the scene that the River of Providence showed him.","Branching versions of Reality becoming apocalyptic ever so slowly as this time...it was actually through his hands.","Through his own actions!","SHIING!","He was drawn back into his body moments after this realization as his consciousness came back to full attention even though this whole time...he was still technically in a slumber as Infinite Dream remained active.","He was in a slumber, but his robust will could move and think freely as he felt the changes brought about by his constant advancements.","His body was wrapped around by countless tendrils of light as between his very fingers, pristine waves of the very fundamental laws of nature flowed.","Waves that his body had constantly been devouring this whole time as prompts also continued to flow!","<You have gained an initial Understanding of the Natural Law of Strong Nuclear Force.>","<You have gained an initial Understanding of the Natural Law of Weak Nuclear Force.>","<You have gained an initial Understanding of the Fundamental Natural Law of Relativity...>","Glorious prompts like these continued to come, but they seemed to be occurring in passing as the Will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor was gazing out into blankness while thinking of what he saw!","The pillars of Providence that had been the conduit to bring his consciousness to the unique concept of Parallel Paths began to fade as Eowyn came to once more, her figure stern as she looked around carefully before coming to float beside Noah's floating slumbering body.","Even though she didn't fully know what had just occurred, she wanted to be able to protect him in case something else happened.","So a man and a woman floated in the center of an expanding and elevating Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature as each had their own thoughts!","Noah's eyelids were closed in his slumber, but the Tri-Pupiled eyes beneath seemed to be staring out across the tendrils of Natural Laws and into the expanse of constantly assimilating Realities above his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, his gaze constantly reflecting the scene of Apocalyptic Parallel Paths and what his actions were causing until they finally came face to face with the visage of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix outside the boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","This Ender of Nature intricately linked to three Fundamental Natural Laws had its stared eyes gaze coldly at Noah as its voice rang out in his mind.","<<Did you see it? Has Providence shown you a semblance of truth regarding your actions? That as you hypocritically preach about preventing Cataclysm and Apocalypse, your actions directly bore fruit to Apocalyptic Parallel Paths that are spreading their destruction to the countless probable Realities out there?>>","...!","The voice was cold and filled with the same apathy as Noah's gaze was cold and simmering with brilliance when gazing at the Ender of Nature who continued!","<<Your standing as an anomaly nonexistent in Parallel Paths is causing this. If you hand control of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality to me and I am the one to continue causing Nexus Events capable of causing branching Paths, there would be no branching Apocalyptic Parallel Paths. Reality exists on the Main Path and Parallel Paths as even the absence of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality would be rectified. You can achieve what you preach as your goals right now and stop Apocalypse across the Myriad Parallel Paths...if you just grant me control of this Construct.>>","HUUUM!","The voice of Reality was cold and ruthless!","Noah's slumbering visage listened silently, but at the same time- his Will was bubbling with an unknown force of Tyranny.","The path he followed.","The goals he wanted to achieve!","Would he truly leave all of them behind because of the appearance of Apocalyptic Parallel Paths?!","His Will formed into waves of Haki as he bellowed out at this juncture, his Heart ever so clear as resplendent Absolute Authority coursed through his very vessels!<novelsnext></novelsnext>","<It is merely the birth of probable Realities that could have occurred through my own actions. But that is all they are- mere probabilities! As for their path towards apocalypse...I've come to learn that Apocalypse and assimilation are not too different. Let the Parallel Paths be no more. I shall return all possible versions of Realities onto a singular path...onto the Main Path!>","...!","His Will rose ever higher in stature.","Reality had to remain silent after his boisterous words as Noah had truly come to learn of the thin line between Apocalypse and Assimilation!","After all, hundreds of thousands of Realities were currently undergoing Apocalypse and being assimilated into his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality at this very moment.","So he would not be swayed.","This was his path.","And he would see it to the end!","WAA!","<There are greater things for me to worry about than this...>","Yes.","Among the many boons of Providence, there came individualized boosts like all Laws and Decreta.","In terms of Providence...","<The Protagonist Trait has experienced Quintessential Elevation.>","<The feature of [I Am the Main Character] has been infused with a large amount of Absolute Providence Authority.>","<The possibilities of your path become even so clear in your eyes.>","...!","Everyone relied on Providence to see possible paths that could play out and how to prepare for the future.","He was able to see many things after he bound the Source of Providence. The vision of the Parallel Paths was just one as now, he could also with even greater accuracy the most crucial Paths right before him...as well as any dangers that could stand in his way!","And even though his True Sanguine Clone was matching Tribunal Rulers at this moment and had reached a stellar level of power in the Barren Lands, it was not enough.","Because the Barren Lands would not remain with its current experts any longer.","CHARLEMAGNE had said it.","And now, Noah had seen it!","The most pertinent vision he was currently seeing after the Parallel Paths was of a massive configuration of light in the shape of an hourglass.","From it, it would illuminate as multiple points of darkness that swallowed everything in their path arose as these points of darkness...would make their way towards the location of the battle soon enough as...","<A True Sanguine Clone has stepped on the Point of Death and Rebirth.>","...!"]},{"number":2131,"title":"Chapter 2131: Chapter 2130 The Pylon Of Ascension Illuminates! IV","paragraphs":["<A True Sanguine Clone has stepped on the Point of Death and Rebirth.>","The Clone currently battling with Tribunal Rulers had such a prompt rise up.","Noah's slumbering eyes were extremely cold and calculating as when seeing this prompt again, he actually did not begin planning to prevent it in the same manner as he had all the others!","Yes.","He had seen with Providence.","The most opportune path in the very near future to come...was the death of one of his True Sanguine Clones.","He could prevent it by retreating in the seconds to come and disappearing before any new players entered the fold, but this would not lead to the most opportune path!","Sometimes, death was also a path forward as Noah prepared for it.","His work and elevation of power were still far from done as his gaze went to the Quintessential Treasure Cache around him, as well as the ever-increasing All Source Enhancers, NULLINIUM, and other loot from the NULLITY Beasts!","He waited to see what was in store as immense radiance shone, the resplendent light of loot beginning to overpower even the swirling essences of Natural Laws as Treasure Caches began to open one after another.","—","The Quantum Dimension.","A vast plane of existence that stretched out endlessly, its atmosphere being one where very unique species survived and thrived in!","It had no designated floor or ceiling as vibrant multicolored Seas of Quantum Essence covered vast regions, and naturally formed crystalline multicolored lands formed other regions.","Everything was akin to a stellar void of space surrounded by foreign and intricate structures as there were even areas of warped space and time...and even points of ever-present singularities!","Within the Quantum Dimension, near a vibrant Singularity the size of thousands of Realities.","At a distance above the Singularity- in the region of the Event Horizon, a radiant Empire stood strong for the past Ages as it had never been breached before- an Empire that was the center for many decisions across the 9 Dimensions over the eons.","This Empire was truly enacted atop a Singularity as just the logic of making it possible was warped, the existences within it that could withstand the force of a Singularity being even more unfathomable!","Countless multicolored towers rose with magnificence and grandeur as all their tips were pointed towards a central point within this Empire. It was closer towards this massive Singularity as suspended in a region with swirling waves of Quantum Essence, a construct that looked like massive coiling of energies to form an hourglass structure could be seen.","Its sheer size could not be fully made out as the constant warping of space fooled one's senses, with its size at times seeming as small as a grain of sand in one second, the size of a star in the next second, or the size of a Reality in another second!","Swirling seas of multicolored essence of lesser concentration wrapped around it and gave the image of a massive rising pillar of light- an image of a Pylon that was carved in space.","This...was the Pylon of Ascension.","It was utterly radiant and incandescent as it was anchored in space releasing a terrifying force that anyone below Nature Integration could not truly withstand, and yet there were three beings near this pristine location.","All three were in pristine humanoid forms, with two following behind one stellar existence who was adorned in simple white robes as above his head, a pure white crown rotated above him!<novelsnext></novelsnext>","The two behind him looked eerily similar in structure and stature as even their faces were alike, wings of multicolored light erupting behind their backs as above their heads, solidified multicolored crowns with unrecognizable ecritures rotated with grandiosity.","The two of them had been here many times and throughout their lives as everything here was familiar to them.","They were 2 of the Four Mikados that guarded the Pylon of Ascension.","The one ahead of them adorned in white robes that even these Nature Integration existences looked at with respective and somewhat fearful eyes was someone known simply as the Quantum Emperor.","A title a few others had held in the past as all of those that had held it over the Ages were no longer in the Barren Lands anymore.","And this man had attained this title in the Age of Destiny as he now led the strongest Anchor in the Barren Lands!","His figure was pristine and clear as strands of multicolored hair reached his broad shoulders, his skin actually crystalline in texture as it shone with stellar radiance and grandeur.","His eyes were uniquely shining with an austere blue as if one stared at an endless sea, his lips carving upwards at this moment in a calm smile as he gazed at the massive Pylon of Ascension below them that began to illuminate and hum with a magnificent light at this moment!","HOOONG!","At its Illumination, the identical Mikados trembled as they dropped to their knees, but the white-robed Quantum Emperor remained floating upright as the Pylon of Ascension only became brighter while its hourglass visage began to slowly spin!","The swirls of essence formed this Pylon began to light up as they lost their myriad of colors- the grandeur of white beginning to cover everything at this moment, it seemed like a white line had begun to shine across this space and spread out to the very center of the Singularity.","Light and everything else became distorted, but the white light remained shining with stellar glory as it released waves of incandescent brilliance and covered everything...before receding an instant later into the Pylon of Ascension.","But as it receded, a circular mass of light flashed out from the center of the spinning Pylon and smashed onto the nearby space- the fabric of Reality becoming torn in this region as the circular mass of light began to open up soon after!","And as soon as it did, the utterly horrific auras of multiple entities could be felt as along with this...","\"Ahhh...\"","A stretched-out yawn that contained no Authority and yet it caused the very fabric of Reality to tremble emanated out.","\"To think I would really be back here again...hmm, is that Little Constantine?!\"","From the fading light, multiple figures were beginning to be revealed as at the very forefront, eyes full of wildness and regality blazed.","A blinding light emanated from the adornments these beings had- armaments that shone with silver gray radiance and seemingly to be made out of bone covering them on all sides!","When gazing at them, one could only feel the feeling of ancientness and archaic grandeur.","A feeling of wildness and freedom not seen in any of the Emperors across the Barren Lands!","It was a feeling of grandiosity that emanated from those outside of it!"]},{"number":2132,"title":"Chapter 2132: Chapter 2131 An Emperor Of Age! I","paragraphs":["\"To think I would really be back here again...hmm, is that Little CONSTANTINE?!\"","The voice was authoritative and filled with grandeur as the circular fading light revealed those within more clearly as the air of ancientness screamed out.","12 distinguished auras blazed silently and with utmost contained power as their silver gray archaic bone Armaments caused the fabric of Reality to splinter and fracture!","Something unique about these figures was that around each of them, an intricate Obsidian crystalline ball floated around their bodies.","These Obsidian crystalline structures seemed capable of devouring all light as wondrously, the pressure they gave off was akin to terrifyingly stable singularities!","The words were spoken by a being at the very forefront that even the Quantum Emperor referred to as 'Little CONSTANTINE' showed surprise at her appearance, with his eyes regaining their regality soon after as he still did not bow even with the terrifying pressure these beings released.","Before he could even reply though, the light from the Pylon of Ascension entirely faded from the 12 figures as soon after, the space around them trembled. Massive waves of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws seethed as from the fabric of Reality, tendrils that looked like chains erupted out to wrap around these beings as if they had broken some inviolable laws!","The pace and speed they came down was utterly ferocious and yet...these beings merely gazed up and scoffed while doing nothing, a transparent barrier of light coming to life around them as gloriously, the tendrils and chains of Fundamental Natural Laws and Natural Laws were pulled towards the Obsidian crystalline balls rotating around their bodies- uniquely passing through these constructs before they came to descend on their bodies!","\"This...I truly did not miss.\"","The vocal existence at the very forefront spoke out once more while her tanned hands twirled with the Essences of Manadynamics, Providence, Relativity, Entropy...she twirled with the Essence of Natural Laws as they wrapped around her and all those that had just descended as if they were binding them!","At this scene, CONSTANTINE's blue eyes shone with brilliance as he spoke out in a calm tone that was befitting of an Emperor.","<I did not expect you to be among the first to descend, True Empress Katya. It seems you all are truly serious about this undertaking.>","...!","pǎпdǎ Й?νê1,сòМ True Empress.","A distinction worthy of a pause and honor!","It did not indicate someone that was the Emperor of a Dimension like CONSTANTINE...but a female that had truly and attained something only a single being in age could attain!","A True Emperor had shockingly descended!","\"Haha, well...it is a rather small matter that can turn into a serious matter depending on how things go. My Legion is among the few that could leave their post momentarily, with others to follow if need be.\"","A dazzling smile erupted from her face as she floated forward.","Radiant dark hair draped past her shoulders and into the archaic gaps of her silver gray bone Armament, her tanned face that of unrealistic beauty as her blessed proportions were hidden with the radiant bone Armament!","\"But for you to talk to me like this when I could remember you as just a little sprout from the Royal Quantum Singularity Lineage...how times have changed.\"","...!","Yes.","Even the Mikado at the Nature Integration Realm kneeled down towards these beings as CONSTANTINE...","He did not kneel.","After all, why would one True Emperor kneel to another?","As an unwritten Reality, it was already set in stone for him to be the True Emperor of this Age of Quintessence!","True Empress Katya smiled brilliantly as her figure gave off a unique authority that caused one's heart to ×waver- an authority that stood above many concepts as this was something that only True Emperors could attain.","Hers was veiled within her body as it pulsed with a verdant grandeur- it was the authority that defined the very Age that she had reigned over.","The True Authority of Karma!","From the Age of Karma, this existence had reigned Supreme before ascending as there was a reason for her to be the one leading the first set of forces here to ensure that the goals of the Ancestors were achieved.","<It is great to welcome you back to your first Home, True Empress. It seems I need to be filled in on the gravity of the situation if you are the first to come here.>","The current Quantum Emperor, CONSTANTINE, spoke out with regality as True Empress Katya appeared before him, the sheer might she released being extremely oppressive and breathtaking as the realm of power she was in was not in the stage of Nature Integration!","It was far different from these as existences like her that had exceeded the Barren Lands...their focus was not at all integrating with Nature.","After all, the Ancestors had sealed Nature eons ago, and they now wanted to let the natural process of destruction follow its course and end the very place that birthed them.","\"Mmm...they really chose you to bear the next Throne of Authority. Authority of Quintessence, is it? It seems to be a fairly powerful one amongst True Authorities as I can see why all of this would be occurring now. What information have you all attained on what is undoing what was done long ago? Would it have anything to do with the waves of battle all the way over there?\"","HUUM!","Her eyes were piercing as they shockingly unveiled anything standing in her way to be in tune with faint fluctuations of battle that nobody else here could feel due to the distance- her eyes landing on the rupturing Quantum Rings as well as the allure NULLITY from afar!","Here, she could feel many connections of Karma as this was the reason she was sent ahead of all others descending in the Barren Lands.","As the holder of the True Authority of Karma from this Age, very few others excelled when it came to tracking and seeking information!","She had just arrived within seconds as she knew which direction she had to go.","It was the dazzling grandiosity of a True Emperor, and even while facing the suppression of Natural Laws...she had yet to even show a fraction of her power!"]},{"number":2133,"title":"Chapter 2133: Chapter 2132 An Emperor Of An Age! II","paragraphs":["The two identical Mikados could barely lift their heads at the pressure that the 12 beings before them released as the most prominent one gazed at the Obsidian crystalline structure floating around her at this juncture, seemingly communicating with it while the Quantum Emperor replied.","<Yes. Under the guise of the Dimensional Conclave, CHARLEMAGNE found clues making Reality itself the Dimensional Inimicus- though it seems Reality is closely utilizing Enders of Nature and even Rulers of Anchors to achieve its aims.>","\"I see. I was sent here first because even though this issue has not become pervasive currently with a minority of Anchors removed, this will change if the majority of Anchors are not suppressing the Desolate Mausoleum. It's also unbearably difficult for those powerful old fogeys to come down themselves, but my aim here is the swift eradication of whatever is removing the Anchors and achieving the simultaneous destruction of both the Desolate Mausoleum and 9 Anchors. If I fail to do so in the coming days, more will come down thereafter. Either way, the goal remains eradication...\"","...!","The figures behind True Empress Katya released a pulse of profound power as the Obsidian crystalline structures floating around them released an oppressive radiance, their cold eyes not releasing any trace of information while adorned in their bone Armaments as they truly seemed to fall under the rule of the True Empress!","The True Empress that was adapting to the feelings of restrictions that had been wrapping around all of them this whole time as CONSTANTINE nodded.","<Yes. Although this time, the enemy is Reality itself, which can make things somewhat complicated.>","Reality.","The very space where they currently stood on was a part of it as Reality already knew of their arrival!","At his words, the True Empress Katya gazed at the fabric of Reality around them with a sneer as if she could feel its gaze, authoritative words emanating out that caused the surroundings to seethe.","\"Not to worry. We were True Emperors and Rulers before, but outside of these Barren Lands, we are Conquerors and Defenders. This time, we came to defend the interests of all our people as even Reality itself will not be capable of standing in our way. Let's go!\"","WAA!","pàпdá-ň?νêι.сóМ Entropy surged in waves before it was erased by the crackling waves of authority these 12 beings possessed, the whole party following the lead of a True Empress even though the level of power of the 11 other existences that gazed at everything with coldness...it wasn't too far off!","—","Destiny and Providence moved with purpose around Noah as they told him a crucial time was nearing.","And he affirmed multiple times the correct path to take as this time, it truly was different from before!","To allow a Clone to undergo the Point of Death and Rebirth.","What possible reason could there be to allow for the path of death of a True Sanguine Clone? His enemies had an inkling that it was one of his bodies as it wouldn't serve any deceptive purpose...and there were many other reasons alongside it but, Noah still trusted in Providence as he had yet to be led wrong!","Something else that calmed his tyrannical heart in all this was the fact that his clone would not face Death to any beings within these Barren Lands who were bidding for the Seat of the True Emperor- but those from outside of this Reality and Age of Quintessence as he found his Authority as an Emperor of this Age would not decrease!","But...he still would not make it easy for them.","He would still fight with everything he had and see exactly what forces the Ancestors could send down!","And the best way to do this on his side was to begin devouring the Loot he had just obtained from this fantastical battle.","As the three Quintessential Treasure Caches opened, Noah's slumbering eyes gazed at the overall gains from the thousands of NULLITY Beasts he had taken down so far, with their Legions still being abundant even now!","<220,000 Shards of Concept Modifiers have been obtained.>","<220,000 Shards of NULLITY have been obtained.>","<220,000 Ingots of NULLINIUM have been obtained.>","<22,000 All Source Enhancer has been attained.>","Pristine numbers were shown as a requirement was more than exceeded.","A requirement of grasping NULLITY!","Along with this, a large number of All Source Enhancers that granted Noah the resources for nearly 80% of the Seventh Dimensional Layer appeared- with the only thing left being Noah's choice on whether to utilize them all on this aspect...or use them to elevate the Infinite Forge ever higher.","Then, Noah stared at the dazzling metallic blocks of NULLINIUM that would be more than enough for two NULLITY Armaments as his Will also focused on the golden flaming Blacksmith's Forge from afar that showed a massive melting NULLITY greatsword that had its deconstructed materials flowing into RUINATION and the Primordial Disk, these two forged Relics resonating with each other as they bathed in pristine materials and power- their final form seeming to be interconnected and not separate!","Noah was waiting for it eagerly as part of the reason he hadn't begun devouring all the Loot he was getting was due to RUINATION. Its feature of multiplying loot was too crucial as with its recent elevation, even the multiplication of Noah's current high-tier loot should not be an impossibility.","But its elevation was taking its time.","And time was not currently present as Providence told him terrifying existences neared!","From the description of the Shards of NULLITY, 100,000 Shards were required to theoretically understand this construct and have it move through one's Origin without it negating and destroying everything.","Due to the limitations of time where Microseconds and even nanoseconds could mean the difference between life and death, Noah's will commanded the sufficiently required Shards of NULLITY to surge towards him!","Whenever RUINATION finished its elevation, the multiplicative effects would be utilized on what remained and what was to come as for now, Noah's slumbering body began to absorb the docile crystalline Shards of NULLITY.","The concept that stemmed outside of Reality!","The concept that OPPENHEIMER utilized to help him attain the Seat of the True Emperor!"]},{"number":2134,"title":"Chapter 2134: Chapter 2133 On The Cusp Of Glory! I","paragraphs":["Descent.","An action rarely done across the bounds of History, and something that was insurmountably difficult for existences to do!","And yet, it was done at this moment in time.","It was done as the repercussions were grand!","In the Quantum Rings surrounded by oppressive waves of NULLITY, The Empress rose her head towards a certain direction as her expression became stern, her figure currently weaving across space to appear in front of Althea as her fair palm snaked out to clash with a Xyston that wanted to reap her life.","BOOOM!","Her hand shockingly shone with a jade like crystalline luster as it smashed onto the Xyston like an unbreakable weapon, the Primitivus Nullity Originator in her hands exploding out with even more waves of NULLITY as Noah's visage upon the Throne was pushed back!","The Empress could feel his cold gaze even while his throne flew out further back as swathes of Abominations clawed towards it, her voice echoing out as she continued to look towards a certain direction.","<You have sown your own calamity.>","Her gaze was towards a far away area where a flash of white light had illuminated everything.","Her gaze was towards a direction where unimaginable existences were beginning to move!","On the same battlefield, CHARLEMAGNE also changed his gaze while sighing, and Lilith felt a shocking sense of foreboding as she bellowed out behind her.","<Lucius!>","She called towards her brother who had shiftily remained in the back as this being released all his reserved power at once in this juncture, forming a crimson gateway in the far back as their thoughts seemed to be linked.","It was a pathway to escape in case something drastic happened- and things seemed to be going towards this direction!","The Rulers from other Dimensions could also feel the tides of Reality changing in an unknown manner as even they knew something was coming- they just couldn't fully grasp what!","—","Across the fabric of Reality.","At the boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, the Draconian Qilin Phoenix Ender of Nature also gazed towards a certain direction as its eyes wondrously became bathed with anger, not even turning around as the archaic voice of Reality moved through waves unto Noah who was currently in the process of swallowing tens of thousands of Shards of NULLITY!","<The more time that passes that you do not release your control, the more unpredictable things become. Now, the Sealers from afar have come in as their power is something foreign. Something you cannot stand. Something outsides the bounds of Nature->","\"It matters not.\"","HUUM!","Noah's voice cut off the cold Will of Reality as his body began to be surrounded by an incandescent silver gray light!","\"Enemies will come as always, and they shall eventually fall under my feet to be turned into loot sooner or later. Whatever force has descended makes things harder...but not impossible. After all, my interests are not mine alone, are they? Reality itself does not wish to see the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality be destroyed, so it better make sure to mask it so that it can never be found...or be ready to defend it with everything it's got if it is ever found.\"","...!","The eyes of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix shone with cold brilliance as it saw the tyrannical will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor scheming- and yet it was a scheme that one could only follow as it truly was the case!","—","Further away across the fabric of Reality.","Hidden within the folds of the Boundary Between Realities, the existence whose figure constantly changed in size opened its eyes once more as this time, there was another emotion apart from ancientness and the hint of vicissitude.","The ancient eyes of this being curved up into a smile of enigmatic brutality as a single word left his mouth.","\"Finally.\"","...!","A single word...and yet he still remained in the folds of space!","Ingenuity shone resplendently within his unreadable eyes as his visage hid waves of incredible power...from even the very fabric of Reality around him.","From even Reality itself!","Going even further away from this location- in the Mirror Dimension.","Crystalline pikes and structures stretched out all around as both the clear transparent sky and earth were reflecting on each other, a mystic air flowing silently across the fabric of space.","A scene of carnage and battle could be seen in a domain of shattered mirrors as the body of the Mirror of Death, Calikan, could be seen rising from the gray Ashes of the Essence of Niflheim- Legions of calm and unperturbed Undead surrounding it entirely.","Yet the eyes of the Mirror of Death burned with blue flames currently as they were the eyes of a subjugated existence who had run away from the battle with Lilith in the Niflheim Dimension as ultimately...his demise had occurred in the Mirror Dimension!","When rising, the Will of the existence that dominated the Mirror of Death also felt inexplicable changes he couldn't fully explain as his eyes focused toward a crystalline mountain near this location and voiced out.","<Thanks for the aid, Osmont.>","Atop the mountain, the exceedingly beautiful figures of Katelyn and Noah could be seen as they had long since made their appearance in the upper echelons of power in the Mirror Dimension, with Katelyn not being capable of coming across her mother yet as she had joined the escort to the Dimensional Conclave!","After a less than pleasant introduction from the Mirare Lineage in this time of chaos, the verdict of incursion into the Mirror Dimension lay with the Dimensional Rulers currently fighting for their lives in the Conclave as Noah had taken Katelyn out at this time to stop the retreat of the Mirror of Death.","This massive dragon now lay under the Will of Eckert as Noah directly influenced the increase of power of another ally, his eyes releasing a knowing light as he nodded while also gazing towards a certain direction!","\"A mere Dimensional Hellion Ruler will not be enough to fight what has come. We shall all be fighting for our lives and homes to the point of suffocation as the power required...\"","Power.","The power required to stand tall above the coming enemies was insurmountable!","So Noah continued with his preparations.","He continued as the river of time continued to churn and in the far reaches of the Quantum Dimension- the heads of many Rulers turned as they now felt the foreign auras of utter oppressive and majesty near this location!"]},{"number":2135,"title":"Chapter 2135: Chapter 2134 On The Cusp Of Glory! II","paragraphs":["Noah's slumbering will was roused to its greatest possible state as he felt the changes in the Quantum Dimension.","Tendrils of Providence arched over his very skin as in the same mindset of preparations, the radiant treasure Caches fully opened to do their part as his Expansive Space began to light up with glorious lights while prompts cascaded within his mind.","Prompts that told of the results of Absolute Loot Authority that at its core- granted Noah the type of Loot that he needed the most!","Mind you, there were only the Loot from the Quintessential Treasure Caches and not the individual loot that Noah had yet to sort through from the Niflheim, Fantasia, Quantum...from all the Rulers he had burned with Quintessential Singularity Ignition in the Dimensional Conclave.","It was only the Treasure Caches currently!","Yes, the Caches were randomized, but they had given him the Lineage of the Nyavagoth True Emperor, he was shown the Failed Modus Operandi of Reality Integration that set him on the path of binding Reality instead of being bound by it, and even the Reality Altering Construct of the Golden Forge that he altered to make his Infinite Forge!","Constructs and Concepts that he needed the most- and all of this came from a single Cache.","This was back then, which wasn't even all that long ago, but Noah had advanced past this. So now, what would three Treasure Caches bring when they came from even more powerful existences and Noah's own authority had just continued to grow?!","The answer was a simple one.","<498,500 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas have been obtained.>","<The Reality Altering Construct of the Eyes of Clarity of the First True Emperor has been obtained.>","<500,000 Ingots of MANANIUM have been obtained.>","<5 Natural Decretum Complete Understanding Crystals have been obtained.>","<100,000 NULLITY Pearls have been obtained.>","<100,000 All Source Enhancer has been obtained.>","...!","The opening of all three Treasure Caches that stemmed from a Tribunal Ruler and two Mikados finished.","It was a shorter list of loot than even the opening of a single Quintessential Treasure Cache from the Heliotrope Lion Emperor!","So much shorter, but the sheer quantity and quality of Loot involved...it was utterly ridiculous!","Annihilating over 20,000 NULLITY Beasts had granted Noah a similar number of All Source Enhancers. Yet from the collective opening of three Treasure Caches, he had attained 100,000 of such loot.","5 Natural Decretum Complete Understanding Crystals!","A ridiculous number of Ingots of MANANIUM as well as something from The First Age- from the first existence to attain the Throne of the True Emperor!","Enough Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas for Noah to complete the Seventh Dimensional Layer and even start on the Eighth.","And a new loot termed NULLITY Pearls!","It was...truly what he needed.","No superfluous loot he may or may not use.","No unknown loot that would have one seek how to utilize it.","Just a simple and straightforward overabundance of everything he needed!","A burst of loot that could possibly change the result of the paths to play out in the future as in his slumber, Noah did not delay as his Will boomed out.","<Complete Entropy, Relativity, Gravity, Polarity...begin the Integration of each of them so long as your Source can handle it.>","BOOOM!","Glorious and immaculately pristine waves of colors erupted as his stellar visage somehow became even more radiant.","And he was not done!","<The Seventh Dimensional Layer...let it be Quantum.>","SHIING!","His Origin shone with splendor as after lying dormant within the last day, it began advancing forward yet again as a crucial milestone was crossed!","He chose it to be Quantum as from the unsorted individual loot of dead Dimensional Rulers, Quantum and Fantasia were among them as he had attained pristine Bloodlines from them and could generate their essences- so he could have chosen either one!","But extremely crucial events were currently happening in the Quantum Dimension. He didn't somehow sequence his Layers to build Quantum as the last and final one due to its position and power among the 9 Dimensions- his tyrannical gaze wishing to disrupt everything about it as much as he could at this juncture.","And something crucial to note in all this was that before Noah even began utilizing the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality to fully swallow the Sources of Dimensions and remove their functions as Anchors, he could affect them somewhat through his Origin alone that held Dimensional Layers!","Now that he was on his Seventh with all the resources needed to complete it as only 2 more layers were left...what change could he manifest on the Anchors when he had all 9 Layers built with Stanchions and Reality Passaged stably coursing through them?","It was a fantastical thought for the future as to see whether it would come to pass, he would have to overcome extreme enemies.","Enemies that were now arriving at the position of his True Sanguine Clone in the Quantum Dimension as Providence began to veer in an unknown direction!","In the vibrantly multicolored region filled with Seas of Quantum Essence.","Everything was still under the shocking effects of the Primitivus Nullity Originator as the Quantum Rings in the surroundings were torn and decayed of Vitality.","Yet at this moment, the raging battle seemingly entered a lull with the eyes of all powerful beings on high alert while they gazed towards a certain direction where the outlines of suffocating auras gradually became clear!","A white robe adorned the Quantum Emperor that all of them knew as CONSTANTINE- this being leading the way forward as beside him, an existence whose very appearance caused the fabric of Reality to vibrate took all of their eyes and attention.","It was because this existence seemed to have an inexplicable authority and presence that stood above all others- something they just couldn't quite put their finger on!","She and 11 others behind were adorned in fantastical silver gray bone Armaments, with dazzling Obsidian crystalline circular structures rotating around each of them uniquely.","This existence besides CONSTANTINE with her unreasonable sense of beauty and awe was the first to speak as an unknown force stepped into the broken Quantum Rings filled with dense waves of NULLITY.","\"Ah, now this is familiar...\"","HOONG!","True Empress Katya spoke as the essence of NULLITY surged around her, her blessed chest expanding as she took a deep breath in to breathe billowing waves of NULLITY with a content expression!"]},{"number":2136,"title":"Chapter 2136: Chapter 2135 On The Cusp Of Glory! III","paragraphs":["\"Ah, now this is familiar...\"","...!","While breathing in billowing waves of NULLITY with a calm expression, True Empress Katya spoke out freely as she continued!","\"It's familiar and somewhat weak in concentration, but it shouldn't be here...\"","And her words ended in a piercing tone as her gaze twinkled with a verdant authority, her eyes instantly honing in on The Empress who had rebuffed Noah at this time and had all the remaining Tribunal Rulers around her, NULLITY Beast Legions forming rows and rows around them as at this juncture- The Empress stopped gazing towards the direction of the new entrants and actually closed her eyes while focusing on the Primitivus Nullity Originator in her hands!","True Empress Katya adopted a cold gaze at this as she continued.","\"For you to have an EPOCH Relic here and mass produced replicas of Chaoticus Beasts...you are the vestige left behind by that man?\"","WAA!","A shockingly oppressive force came along with her words as the Empress did not reply nor focus on her, Tribunal Rulers appearing behind her as their bodies lit up with essence that surged into her- the light of power around them growing into an immense stage!","Against this, True Empress Katya and the cold gazed Quantum Emperor just arriving would have given The Empress their attention, but they found their eyes being drawn away.","And it was something natural that truly couldn't be helped as on this battlefield, there were some particularly astonishing things that instantly drew one's attention.","The Primitivus Nullity Originator is one thing, but there was another that was utterly breathtaking as one couldn't easily miss it!","It was the Emperor sitting on a floating throne while adorned with a floating solidified crown that vibrated with the ecritures of QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR.","The eyes of all new arrivals were drawn here as Princess Katya looked at this with squinted eyes, turning towards the figure of CONSTANTINE beside her in a questioning gaze.","\"I thought they had designated you to be the True Emperor after that whole debacle with OPPENHEIMER, so what is this? How did you all allow someone else to already attain a distinction of rulership of this Age?\"","WAA!","A shocking question arose as the Quantum Emperor gazed with utmost coldness towards Noah! He didn't reply to True Empress Katya as he instead addressed the existence wielding a Dimensional Reality Xyston while staring at them with utmost scrutiny.","<Are you the Emperor who recently tried to forge a Construct rivaling mine in this Age and failed? How bold of you to have attained the distinction of Quintessential when your actions are not!>","...!","His voice was booming as the Aura Potency hidden within it far exceeded even CHARLEMAGNE and Lilith.","His white robes seemed unblemished and full of grandeur as his blue eyes were as vast as the Endless Seas of Fantasia, his distinction special and above others innately as the only being he lost out to in terms of oppressiveness were the 12 beastial existences behind him!","This was the being who believed this Age was his.","After all, he had achieved feats of Quintessence in this Age.","He has built many things to great fruition as he was the Quantum Emperor- Constantine!","Being addressed by these terrifying beings in this gray space of NULLITY, Noah laid the Xyston in his hands on the armrests of his throne as he leaned back and spoke with majesty.","\"Sealers and Apostates...\"","HUUM!","His voice carried weight and grandiosity that spread far and wide, many eyes focusing on him!","\"...this is what Reality calls you all. But I believe the term cowards is more befitting.\"","...!","His eyes carried immense coldness and confidence as they focused on True Empress Katya and continued!","\"You think you can come here and admonish me for seeking the True Throne? Speak of this authority as if it can be designated and given away freely? How did they allow someone else to already attain a distinction of rulership of this Age you ask...do you truly think I needed permission from others to reign in this Age of Quintessence?!\"","WAA!","Regality.","Glory!","Fantastical waves of elegance radiated from him as he stared coldly at beings of utmost power that far exceeded many here!","Beings that were fearless as True Empress Katya had the verdant light of the True Authority of Karma blaze in her stern eyes as a trace of ridicule rose as her sonorous voice boomed out.","\"Yes...you actually do need to be designated and allowed to attain the Seat of the True Emperor. I would know this best as I stood at the top of an Age once to attain such a distinction! You have done exceptionally to parade yourself as a genuine candidate so far, but this is exactly as far as you go. Much greater things are at stake this time around as the authority of this Age will not be given out freely.\"","BOOM!","The atmosphere entirely changed the moment Katya affirmed everyone's fears.","The truly old existences that had lived through many Ages remembered her as Albus sighed while Lilith looked distorted and livid, all other Rulers present becoming despondent as truly, a True Emperor had descended to carry the Will of the Ancestors!","Her words denied any other possible opinions as in terms of authority of a True Emperor, who could speak about it with greater confidence than the one who had already attained such distinction?!","It caused all others to be speechless...all others but Noah!","He shook his head as his gaze moved between True Empress Katya and the Quantum Emperor whose cerulean eyes shone with utmost confidence.","\"The mere fact that you do not refute her words shows you shall never attain the True Authority of Quintessence.\"","...!","These utterly callous words were spoken while he gazed at the Quantum Emperor, and he then continued further as he came to refocus on True Empress Katya!","\"And if your words hold even a semblance of truth for the Ages that have come to pass, then it means there has not been a genuine True Emperor in all the past Ages.\"","WAA!","Tyranny and grandeur erupted around his Throne as his gaze was filled with utter majesty at this moment!","\"It means that only False Emperors have been proclaimed over the past Ages if they were truly handed this authority...and it means you all can rejoice. You can rejoice as in this great Age of Quintessence, you will finally be able to see a genuine True Emperor. You will finally be able to understand what it truly means to stand atop an Age!\"","...!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":2137,"title":"Chapter 2137: Chapter 2136 On The Cusp Of Glory! IV","paragraphs":["\"You can rejoice as in this great Age of Quintessence, you will finally be able to see a genuine True Emperor. You will finally be able to understand what it truly means to stand atop an Age!\"","...!","Resonant words!","Words so resonant and profound that they seemingly caused the very fabric of Reality to resonate, Quintessential Authority erupting out and surging around Noah and his Throne of Quintessential Tyranny as his image drew in all eyes.","<<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>>","<<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>>","And his resolve truly resonated with Quintessence as his authority increased purely from this.","Surging waves of authority wrapped around him gloriously as it seemed potent.","As his crown and backbone of a throne shone with blinding radiance!","As it seemed that the backbone of his throne was shockingly and precisely sculpted to the point that this being...","He was on the cusp of attaining something utterly grand!","On the cusp of glory that very few beings had attained across the Ages!","At such a scene, the gazes of the Quantum Emperor and True Empress Katya became cold as the latter rose her hand.","And then...Reality itself shattered!","—","The Seat of the True Emperor could only be attained if one was allowed to attain it.","This statement that True Empress Katya said held a form of Reality and falsehood at the same time as she knew it very well as a past Emperor!","She was one of the most proficient Seers in the Age of Karma as she was so proficient to the extent that she knew all those she was connected to and all those she would be connected to in the Barren Lands, to the extent that she could even form lines of Karma with those she had no relations to.","In her Age, it wasn't about strength, but simply about who was more proficient in Karma.","And she was not alone in this.","There was another being that had such monstrous skill in Karma that he put countless others in awe.","The Elysium Emperor during the Age of Karma!","He was the closest to winning the race to the authority of the True Emperor of Karma, but at a certain point...he just disappeared.","With no knowledge of the how or why, with the rest of the Quantum Dimensional Rulers left behind shocked and befuddled- this powerful being disappeared!","And as the years went by, Katya found nobody reaching the same stage as her as after attaining sufficient authority, she reached the True Throne of Karma.","The mystery of the Elysium Emperor of that Age was never solved as she only found out the truth when she had ascended.","She came to learn that the cycles of Ages that began so long ago and the True Emperors that rose and fell...only did so after being scrutinized by Ancestors!","If they were among those who would continue to follow their will.","The Elysium Emperor did not match the guidelines that the Ancestors set as this...was part of the reason why the Pylon of Ascension existed in the Quantum Dimension!","The Descent today was not something unheard of.","Silently and without others knowing, things were always kept in check over the Ages as if a leading Emperor was found to potentially not be agreeable to the Wills of the Ancestors, they would disappear!","There were even more terrifying Seers outside of these Barren Lands among the Ancestors that could gaze and find many things.","In some Ages, the Pylon of Ascension would illuminate. In other Ages, it remained dormant as no move had to be made.","This was done because the Barren Lands were crucial to all of them and the status quo had to be maintained.","This led back to secrets connected to exactly how the Ancestors had managed to seal the Desolate Mausoleum and escape the influence of Natural Laws long ago, and the power that a True Emperor achieved...and how they utilized it!","The only Age where someone slipped through the cracks was the Age of Destiny which had just come to pass.","An existence who was not a Chosen Emperor or a Destined Emperor, and yet he had attained the most authority in the Age of Destiny as due to this...the consequences included his shocking actions that ended an Era.","Now...another existence was slipping through the cracks it seemed!","The True Seers hadn't seen him.","This was an impossible task as especially so in the Barren Lands, hiding one's signature was hard- even if one was an Irregularity!","Their life signature would be seen even across the Parallel Paths of the Barren Lands. So how had this one slipped past the cracks?","Katya's eyes blazed with ingenuity as she focused on the existence upon the Throne, her True Authority illuminating many things as she began to give out commands.","\"Drakaris, take Aegis and Rose to the Desolate Mausoleum. Scour every Reality and Boundary Between Realities for this essence signature...find this being's Main Body and the signatures of the Dream and Avalon Dimensions...they should be in the same place. At the same time, increase the Desolate Mausoleum's rate of progression towards Cataclysm.\"","WAA!","A verdant light emanated from her and went in front of three being behind her who nodded silently, taking the light and disappearing soon after!","\"You six, delve into the Niflheim, Fantasia, Elysium, Mirror, Apollyon, and Prana Dimensions as you begin to spread NULLITY and increase its pace towards Cataclysm at the same rate. The rest of you...with me. Close off all surrounding regions of space and give us some alone time.\"","...!","The True Authority of Karma surged around her eyes as she accounted and saw countless verdant strings.","She saw how many things connected to each other as in the corner of her eyes, she also gazed at Lilith and the Enders of Nature.","CONSTANTINE began to emanate a dazzling radiance beside her as his eyes were locked onto a singular being!","True Empress Katya thought of many things as the tool rotating around her pulsed, feeling the tendrils of Natural Laws binding her again and a suppression she did not miss settling around her existence tightly.","She felt all of this as she moved!","She would do what others did when they were sent down.","She would stop a being like this who stood on the cusp of glory...all for the greater good.","For the survival of all beings!"]},{"number":2138,"title":"Chapter 2138: Chapter 2137 I Shall Burn It All For You! I","paragraphs":["The buzz and grandeur of Nullity emanated in her ears as she kept her eyes closed.","The Empress, they called her.","The one who stood by the Empyral Deceiver! The right hand of the True Emperor of the Age of Destiny.","These were all her accolades and titles and yet when she faced the grandiosity of another True Emperor, she couldn't help but become somber and enact a plan she did not wish to right away.","This plan was fair and simple-it was a retreat in the face of Absolute power.","And she was not the only person thinking this as on the other side, the figure of Lilith had already retreated towards the Supreme Pontiff as her gaze was entirely ashen and filled with rage.","The reason for her rage was a simple one- it was because people like her and The Empress were realizing that they were completing their methods of escape for no other reason than the fact that the newly entering Quantum Emperor and even the True Empress Katya...did not have their eyes on them.","As Reality shattered around them, these beings with terrifying stature and oppressive levels of power- the beings that were adorned in the Bone Armaments of unknown creatures...they all surrounded a single being and cut off all paths of escape for him as such a thing for Lilith and The Empress meant the complete and utter disregard for their position.","It was a great insult to their power, but at the same time, it greatly aided in what they wish to do here today!","HOONG!","While True Empress Katya descended onto the battlefield fully, Lilith's body became wrapped by the Crimson Gateway that was opened by her brother while The Empress clasped the Primitivus Nullity Originator and became wrapped in a wondrous surge of Nullity that extended onto the remaining Tribunal Rulers.","The legions of Abominations that were placed out began to turn into streaks of light that returned into their bodies, the powerful Epoch Relic in the hands of The Empress letting out an incandescent light as their figures quickly disappeared!","Retreat.","This was the path that all Emperors here saw because the other side...was death!","So those who could leave began leaving as among those staying behind, the visage of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR reigned supreme...his eyes not filled with an ounce of fear as his stellar Spear already roared with radiant blue flames!","—","Across the folds of Space-Time.","Crimson black waves of Apollyon Essence raged in the folds of space as the bodies of Lilith and a few others traversed great distances to instantly retreat into this Dimension.","The breathing of all the Dimensional Rulers that had joined in this escape was ragged-which was unique to see as it was brought about by no one other than the Aura Potency and feeling of Death from the oppressive power of those who had descended.","The body of Lilith was trembling with rage as her brother floated beside her with a look of contemplation that did not remain for too long as Lilith's angry bellows echoed out.","<Fuck...fuck!>","WAA!","<Disregard. They actually disregarded my entire existence as if in the grand scheme of things...I do not matter!>","Her words held rage, yes, but at the same time, one could feel immense pain and suffocation from them!","Because she had her goals and ideals.","She wanted to attain the seat of the True Emperor in order to rectify what was done in the Last Age.","What they did to her father. She wanted to pay back those that had gone against her and of course, save her home along the way!","But the level of disregard she had faced today caused her to want to destroy everything around her as the billowing waves of magma and flames in the skies of Apollyon that they had appeared in began to rise.","The Supreme Pontiff Lucius was about to console his sister when his gaze and the gazes of all Rulers here instantly changed.","Because from afar, they felt the aura of another existence near them. They knew this aura...as well as the voice that resonated soon after!","\"If you thought you were having a bad day, it's about to get even worse for you, my dear Dimensional Queen.>","The last set of words were said in an extremely mocking tone as the grand figure of the True Sanguine Clone of none other than Noah appeared before the retreating figures of Lilith, Lucius, and others.","Yes!","Noah's clone arrived exactly where Lilith and the others had retreated as the stage of the battle in the Dimensional Conclave was reaching unprecedented levels!","The enemies that were coming were two domineering as Noah had to be even more so. So he moved up his Paths of Conquest. Since he had attained sufficient power, he did not go through the path of overcoming Regional powerhouses as his clone came out right to face the Rulers of the Apollyon Dimension themselves!","Just because terrifying beings had appeared in the Quantum Dimension, it did not mean he had to stop his search for Loot and let all enemies go.","This was among the many things Providence was showing him.","As for how he had found them so fast...among the Apollyon, Fantasia, and Niflheim Dimensional Rulers with them, there were two that were still integrated to a source that Noah had bound since Noah did not attack them and force them to desegregate!","<You...!>","At the appearance of his Daemon True Sanguine Clone, the devilish body of Lilith simmered with contained power as her three eyes became tinged with ever greater levels of crimson.","She breathed out billowing flames from her mouth that scorched the near skies as she locked onto Noah while the Rulers around her blazed with power and got ready for a fight.","<Your singular appearance has somehow thrown out millions and billions of years worth of work and ideals...do you know that?>","She spoke as she felt the vestiges of understanding of Providence swirl within her. She had destroyed the Line of Integration for it, yes, but she still had its understanding.","It couldn't allow her to see things as clearly and with great accuracy as before, but it could still tell her that an important point in her life had come.","A point that if she overcame...there was a possibility of an illustrious path in the future. But if not...","<Do you understand how your existence has changed the fates of so many things? How your actions called down the existences that are here today?>","The removal of Anchors.","His distinction as the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR!","When looking at the causes and effects of many things...this existence was at the exact center.","And at her words...he merely nodded with an understanding expression as if he could empathize and truly grasp Lilith's perspective.","<I understand. You hold a lot of hatred and wrath in your heart...so let me help you silence it. Let me put to rest the great Dimensional Hellion Ruler Lilith.>","...!"]},{"number":2139,"title":"Chapter 2139: Chapter 2138 I Shall Burn It All For You! II","paragraphs":["Let me put to rest the great Dimensional Hellion Ruler!","These words resonated with the blazing skies of Apollyon as they caused Lilith's figure and those around her to become bathed in authority!","Her body was still in a devilish form that had absorbed three Undead Emperors, her hooved hands rising at this moment and burning with flames as she nodded lightly while voicing out.","<You heard the True Empress Katya when she said True Emperors are designated? In the Last Age, there were two beings that had the greatest chance and destiny to become True Emperors. One of those was my Father, and the other...was Feng.>","WAA!","<The Great Commander Feng...who ended up dying earlier than most Emperors in this Age- in the hands of a being who had an abysmal destiny. Some even say that Feng's Destiny was snatched on that day by OPPENHEIMER as he then went on to achieve what he did. But the crucial thing in all this...is that while my father's body disappeared, I was able to attain the body of Feng. I was able to raise it and keep its Aspects intact even though its soul was gone. I had grand plans for this as I believed it possible to even use the Destined Emperor of the past Age to attain rulership in this Age. I...had all these plans. But then you appeared.>","...!","Her crimson eyes turned clear as her rage and anger were entirely snuffed out.","A dangerous amount of clarity descended as in her devilish form, she stared towards Noah and continued.","<You appeared as all those plans I had for Feng and many others...I shall now throw them out the window. The crucial body of a Destined Emperor, I will now burn it and everything else I have just for you. I will burn it all to challenge that distinction you have and see that all I have done is not for naught. I shall put all of the Quintessential Authority that I have collected so far on the line for this...so let me see. Let me see this Quintessence that you have been boasting about since we were in the Quantum Dimension. Let me see why a being like you rose out of nowhere to even attain such a distinction while the rest of us who have been burning blood and soul are disregarded as if we are nothing!>","...!","A brooding symphony played.","It was a unique sight.","It was akin to the setting sun on a bright and radiant day as Lilith's body began to light up with tendrils of extremely crimson flames- flames that wrapped around her and ground her form down as she was becoming something else entirely!","She was staking all of her hard work that was already getting torn down to prove something.","That against this unreasonable being that quite literally rose from nowhere...she could overcome him. That the distinction of QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR could be taken down for her to prove her candidacy to the True Throne!","Lucius seemed shocked and unwilling to see such this unfolding result as his vibrant eyes locked onto the figure that was the cause of all this- the Dimensional Inimicus who was in multiple places at once.","There were no words that could be said to rectify any past actions or change what was about to unfold. The Rulers on their side got ready while tendrils of flames scorched Lilith as Ashes fell, and her figure shrank into a fantastical form of a demoness with curves of excellent proportions!","Apollyon Essence surged as the being that was closest to its Source burned all that she held dear, and this essence burned with this being as the very Dimension seemed to be supporting her.","Fair white jade-like skin wrapped on an Armament of crimson black flames, hair burning red and dripping past her shoulders while her opening eyes...","HOONG!","They seemed to contain the mysteries of the vast Dimensions and Reality as they seemed infinitely dense akin to a Singularity.","Gazing at them just once might be enough to swallow weak Nature Integration Realm existences, desegregate them, and shatter their souls all at once!","Yet against their target...they were only met with utmost majesty.","Noah gazed at the tendrils of demonic flames around a refined figure of Lilith as he thought of many things while shaking his head and voicing out.","<This was never meant to be a contest of strength or authority.>","WAA!","As he spoke, his surroundings fluctuated as two more True Sanguine Clones appeared to his left and right, their lips moving in conjunction with his as they laid down an affirmation!","<This was simply meant to be the end of your reign.>","...!","Three Noah's spoke as soon after, each of them began to blaze with the scorching cerulean light of Quintessential Singularity Ignition.","Along with this, a radiant silver gray light had begun to illuminate in his eyes as this...was the terrifying light of NULLITY that had been fluidly filling up the Origin of his main body- even this concept about to enter the fray as even with Providence, Noah did not know how drastically things would change!","So his three Clones moved out like the points of Singularities that they were, intent on closing off a chapter of a particularly powerful enemy while at the same time...he eyed to devour the Anchor that was the Apollyon Dimension!","—","When Lilith made her escape, she disappeared into the Apollyon Dimension with her forces...but what about The Empress?","Her return was uniquely not into the Main Reality- although it was still in the Desolate Mausoleum.","WAP!","Arcs of NULLITY and waves of spatial light twisted as an injured Althea, Ezekiel, and the Eminent Mastermind appeared alongside The Empress in a region located within the Boundary Between Realities.","It was a region of utter emptiness as there should be nothing here, but The Empress had a stern expression as she clasped the Primitivus Nullity Originator in her hands and communicated with it.","And moments later, she turned her gaze towards a certain direction as with clear eyes, she spoke out into nothingness.","<He said you would be here to lend aid in the case any of them descended.>","...!","She spoke out into nothingness with an astounding resolve, the very fabric of Reality vibrating at her words and focusing as even it didn't know what existence was being addressed by The Empress!"]},{"number":2140,"title":"Chapter 2140: Chapter 2139 A Flash Of NULLITY! I","paragraphs":["<He said you would be here to lend aid in the case any of them descended.>","While clasping the Primitivus Nullity Originator, The Empress spoke with confidence into nothingness as what followed her...was only silence!","Even Reality fluctuated and paid attention to this moment in time as The Empress was not rebuffed, continuing to speak with utmost certainty as if what OPPENHEIMER had told her could never be wrong.","<The survival of the Desolate Mausoleum. The promise from the Last Age still remains and waits to be completed now. All conditions have been met as the only thing left is for you to make a move.>","She spoke of daring secrets nobody knew as the folds of space remained empty, and she was about to speak again when...","RIIP!","The void of space cracked and split.","From it, a single eyeball could be seen as the splitting of the folds of Reality was akin to the brows of an eye rising- ots pupil locking onto The Empress as the Tribunal Rulers around her felt their blood run cold and nearly freeze while an archaic voice rang out!","\"I have waited for countless years to make a move, and I shall do so when I wish to. Return.\"","...!","A voice dripping with age.","A voice that felt like primordial eons talking to each other!","Althea felt her already injured body be strained even further just from listening to this voice as after hearing this reply, The Empress gave a light nod and clasped the Primitivus Nullity Originator once more, a unique light beginning to wrap around their figures to take them away from here.","The moment she affirmed what she came to affirm, she moved as there were too many things to account for!","Like the fact that she was returning to the Main Reality that had lost the Empyral Domain of Nature.","Like the fact that among the Rulers returning, they were 1 Tribunal Ruler off!","—","In the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","Waves of glorious radiance danced all around as below the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, Noah's Dream and Avalon Dimensional Chassis had returned with the Avalon and Dream Dimensional Rulers, the gazes of these beings ranging widely as they had many things to think about!","But before they could even resolve prior surprises, new ones came as in the halcyon skies of the Dream Dimension, a massive film of light showed the perspective of Noah's True Sanguine Clone in the Quantum Dimension as it showed all things happening here.","Another massive film of light played events in the Apollyon Dimension as Guinevere's will placed half of the attention towards this.","The other half was on the Quantum Dimension as the events playing out had too much at stake!","<We should be out there putting our lives on the line as well.>","The voice of the Dreamer of Providence echoed out as this aged being burned with the light of glory, seeing beings he knew perishing under Noah's hands or the hands of Lilith and CHARLEMAGNE as he wished to also be making a difference!","But at his words, Morgana sneered from the side while shaking her head with seriousness.","<If you want to die, you can go at it alone, old man. Do you think anything is going to survive against the Will of a True Empress? Hell, I truly have no idea what the rest of us are going to do when she reaches this place.>","Despondency.","This was what many beings currently felt as they didn't see a clear path forward!","A path to overcome the unreasonable enemies that had come as at this moment, they realized they had an unreasonable over reliance on the being who had hidden their Dimensions here.","So Guinevere turned towards Noah's clone as she asked with a gaze of radiance.","<What can we do?>","WAA!","How could they help in facing these unreasonable odds?","How could they overcome them and not wait for death?!","At this, Noah's Avalon Dimensional Chassis anchored the Sword of Avalon in space as his Will emanated out.","\"If you have connections to the other 7 Dimensions, reach out to them. Let those close to the Sources of those Dimensions know that salvation is here. That while even Ancestors wish to end everything, there is another choice they can make if they wish to save their homes.\"","...!","Guinevere asked, and she received an answer!","The others also had radiant eyes as Guinevere locked onto the verdant figure of Albus in the Quantum Dimension that gazed at everything with ancientness.","She still had her connections as a leading figure of a Dimension as she could still have an impact!","The tides of destiny wavered as Providence took reigns.","While they began to do this, a few were able to notice something unique within the eyes of the Avalon and Dream Dimensional Chassis.","They noticed a radiant light of gray and silver that they had abhorred and seen in their enemies beginning to shine in his eyes, the Origins also feeling a heavy weight as when they gazed above- they could see an incandescent gray light beginning to fill the horizon!","It was...the Light of NULLITY.","<What...>","...!","Before any questions could be asked about this unfathomable wonder, all Rulers in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality were nearly brought to their knees from a terrifying pressure release far above them in the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature they had yet to even see!","Here, Noah's slumbering Main Body shone with a vibrant radiance.","The color veered from gray to silver in radiance as it brought terror and death before, and yet now it seemed docile!","At this moment, his Origin was bathed with tendrils of this fantastical light of gray as unbelievably...all his Dimensional Layers shone ever brighter under the shade of this light!","The light that brought death and destruction...was actually causing his Origin to erupt with even more life and splendor as anyone would be confused.","But as Noah gained an understanding of what NULLITY truly was...everything was clear.","HUUM!","Radiance overflowed as it wasn't just him that was undergoing this change.","The moment he attained a semblance of understanding in NULLITY and had its essence vibrant in his Origin, the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature trembled as at its very center, the light of NULLITY began to bloom.","In the midst of Natural Laws and Decreta, NULLITY truly bloomed as a fantastical new stage was reached on this day!"]},{"number":2141,"title":"Chapter 2141: Chapter 2140 A Flash Of NULLITY! II","paragraphs":["NULLITY erupted at the center of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature as uniquely, it was docile under the control of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality after its master gained an understanding in it.","It didn't cause decay or death of everything similar to the mixing of the Essence of Laws and Decreta...it simply proliferated in the surroundings simply as no negative reactions bloomed!","Eowyn felt the expanding light of NULLITY with Noah at the center as when it reached her, she instinctively tried to retreat but when the waves washed over her...she didn't feel the coldness and death that she had felt so closely before!","It felt...warm and comfortable as even other essences around her body were revitalized and increased in activity.","Why was this?","It wasn't due to some unfathomable chain reaction or some unknown mysteries of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality...but simply due to this construct itself.","To the idea of NULLITY!","Amidst the surging waves of silver-gray light, Noah's mind was bathed densely with NULLITY as droves of information bloomed in his mind.","Information about NULLITY!","<NULLITY>:: A state of verisimilitude depicting nothingness and beginning. It is capable of reverting constructs and other states of verisimilitudes to nothingness when manipulating it at the lowest level, and it can take constructs and other states of verisimilitudes to their very beginning or initial states at the highest levels. The applications and scope of NULLITY are innumerable as one can only truly grasp all of its variations after achieving the highest possible stage. Understanding this state of existence is extremely hard as it is broken down into Primitivus, Proficere, and Terminus. Elevation into each level of Understanding grants unknown state-altering possibilities that require more data before they can be fully quantified. This state of existence is versatile in nature as it can be infused into various other constructs or used as a pure output to achieve intended results. The current state that the user has achieved is at the initial level of Primitivus, being capable of altering concepts and things towards nothingness at the extreme elementary level. The level of usage has currently been expanded to 100 Units of NULLITY with a rate of Regeneration of 1 Unit per Microsecond. Current understanding at the Primitivus Stage: .1%. Boosts granted: 1,000% Augmentation to All True Parameter Values...","A State of Verisimilitude.","A state of existence!","This was NULLITY!","And from the 100,000 Shards of NULLITY Noah had absorbed, he gained a .1% Understanding at the first stage of Primitivus that gave stupendous Augmentations comparative to Laws and Decreta- and the Augmentations of NULLITY were applicable to All True Parameter Values! This included True Damage Values, True Defense Values, True Vitality Values...and onward!","If the numbers were to be believed, it meant that at 10% Understanding, that was 100,000% Augmentation to All True Parameters! And this...was only at the Primitivus Stage.","There were also the Proficere and Terminus Stages!","...!","Noah's mind buzzed as he felt like he had stepped on a grand achievement.","And at the same time this occurred...","<Your understanding of the Fundamental Natural Law of Entropy has reached 100%.>","<Your understanding of the Fundamental Natural Law of Relativity has reached 100%.>","<Your understanding of the Natural Law of Gravitation has reached 100%.>","<Your understanding of the Natural Law of Polarity has reached 100%.>","<Your understanding of the Natural Law of Weak Nuclear Force has reached 100%.>","<Your understanding of the Natural Law of Strong Nuclear Force has reached 100%.>","...!","BOOM!","The Laws finished their elevation right after NULLITY.","The dense concentrations of Natural Law Essence in the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature turned utterly wild as Noah first utilized Pure Quintessential Natural Decretum Seeds before the utilization of the 6 Natural Decretum Complete Understanding Crystals to achieve complete understanding in 2 Fundamental Natural Laws and 4 Natural Laws!","It erased his reserves of Pure Quintissential Natural Decretum Seeds and left him with only 2 Natural Decretum Complete Understanding Crystals as there were still resources for him to do more.","The radiance of laws was dazzling around him as keeping to his commands, the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality began with the process of Integrating Entropy right away even as its unique understanding was still settling in Noah's mind.","This was about to occur when Noah's already alert mind felt the dense and unique aura of the Will of Reality yet again as his Will surged out sharply to see if Reality was truly trying something again. But all that came was a voice from the Draconian Qilin Phoenix as it was grave in nature!","<<An existence capable of hiding from even Reality itself has been hidden in the Boundary Between Realities for the past two Ages. Its power is unknown...and not from these lands.>>","WAA!","A voice of somberness.","It caused Noah who simply wanted to enjoy the feeling of power and elevation to nearly groan as his slumbering will probed for more information!","<<It seems opposed to the Sealers that have descended, and shares a connection with the Apostates and the Emperor of the Age of Destiny.>>","...!","Shocking information came out as Noah's mind buzzed with countless possibilities.","An unknown existence that could even hide from Reality itself while hiding in its boundaries for the past two Ages, with its origin not being from these Barren Lands!","Barring the connection this existence somehow shared with Primordials, it was opposed to True Empress Katya and other Ancestral Descendants that just came down as when all the dots connected...a terrifying conclusion arose.","A conclusion that caused Noahs to knit his brows even in his Infinite Dream.","\"Fucking hell...why can't things ever be simple?\"","Things were never so easy as they had been in motion for many Ages. There were too many beings involved and too many wonders to even imagine as somehow, Noah had to navigate them all and come out on top!","This new issue was brought forward to him as shockingly, even Reality itself felt it pertinent to let him know of information ahead of time out of its own volition. It meant that even Reality was cautious towards this unknown piece that had always been here...but was now appearing.","\"They'll just be added to the long, long list of enemies. I'll be clearing some of these enemies first and just proceed forward.\"","HUUM!","His vibrant tyranny rose gloriously as his will emanated out. He could only move forward steadily while planning ahead. He would scheme and plan as he would quickly raise his level of power to match all enemies, and he would then exceed himself even more until the point that when he faced his enemies- it wouldn't be a life and death battle, but a simple beat down instead!","And with the path he walked on of his Dimensional Realities and even his Gourmandizing Dimensional Realities...all of this was very, very possible!"]},{"number":2142,"title":"Chapter 2142: Chapter 2141 Mana And NULLITY! I","paragraphs":["The Light of NULLITY was an unfathomable one to grasp.","When it had initially appeared, all that Noah had known about it was destruction and death, with Mana being the only thing that could remotely match and oppose it.","But as he felt the light of NULLITY coursing through him, he understood that Mana was just denying the aspect of nothingness that the Primitivus Stage of NULLITY had.","Mana kept the order and balance as it cycled energies from one form to another, while the capabilities of NULLITY to reduce things to nothingness violated this- so the Absolute Mana Authority could reject NULLITY with more power than any other laws.","But now that he had both Mana and NULLITY swirling within him, he felt no semblance of a clash. No rejection between the two essences as their opposing relationship did not exist! This...was all due to how one utilized the two essences.","Noah felt like he had stepped on a grand path of truth as he tried to connect many dots, knowing that the path of NULLITY was a crucial one that granted obscene power.","OPPENHEIMER had utilized it to win the Seat of the True Emperor in the Last Age, and the Ancestral Descendants that had just come were utilizing it as one could see with clarity...most if not all of their power was drawn from it.","After all, a mere .1% in NULLITY granted one the equivalent boosts of fully understanding a Natural Law- and it was much more than that as the Augmentations was to All True Parameter Values.","So just like OPPENHEIMER and True Empress Katya who now emanated waves of NULLITY...Noah would also place his focus on it!","SHIING!","Eowyn's golden strands of hair fluttered as she was knocked back from the close proximity she was near his body as her fair hands reached out, feeling the waves of NULLITY around Noah getting ever stronger as his Dimensional Layers radiated grandiosity and light.","He was currently in a trance as after seeing the robust usages and immeasurable boosts of NULLITY, his Will sought much more of it as the first thing he did...","Was focus on its generation.","Especially so in his radiant Reality Passages as the moment particles of silver gray essence began to bloom, Noah's will commanded out.","<Focus all the generated understanding of the Reality Passages on NULLITY...>","...!","His multicolored mountainous Passages that looked like mountains rising from one Dimensional Layer and into another began to blaze with a silver gray light as for good or for worse, Noah placed a vast majority of his focus on the understanding and elevation of NULLITY right away!","Apart from this...the description of another Loot he had rose up before him as a mountain of silver gray Shards and Pearls that shone like cosmos in his Expansive Space was blanketed by his Will.","<Shard of NULLITY>:: Shards of the condensed essence of NULLITY. More details have risen after your understanding of NULLITY, showing that 100,000 of these Shards were enough to allow one to add this essence to your Source and grant you an initial Understanding of .1%. But further progression in the Primitivus Stage of NULLITY is quantifiably hard as a single Shard is capable of increasing your understanding by .0000001%. For the best progression in NULLITY, it is recommended for you to seek the plane of existence that it is most pervasive in...","The description of the Shards of NULLITY had changed as it showed that Noah would need 100,000 Shards of NULLITY to just progress .01%.","<...>","It was a ridiculously slow pace of progression, but it was understandable due to how ridiculous NULLITY was!","Then...there were the Pearls.","<NULLITY Pearls>:: Exceeding the ranking of Shards of NULLITY, NULLITY Pearls can be obtained from existences that have at least achieved the Primitivus Stage of NULLITY. A single Pearl is capable of increasing your understanding by .000003%.","A slightly better number came for the NULLITY Pearls as the 100,000 Pearls that Noah obtained from the Quintessential Treasure Caches...they would be able to increase his understanding in the Primitivus Stage fourfold and grant .3%!","That was equivalent to 3,000% Augmentations to All True Parameter Values.","Yet...Noah did not recklessly forge forward and begin to consume them.","His Will once more gazed at the far away RUINATION and the Primordial Disk bathing in multicolored flames- flames that now drew in tendrils of silver gray NULLITY as Noah ushered them to quickly complete their elevation and become usable to him.","He was waiting to multiply the number of Loot he had for even greater results as for now...he would continue exploring other avenues!","His Will once more returned to the profound changes in his body as his Reality Passages began to gush out silver gray grandeur while the Seed of the Quantum Dimensional Layer bloomed for his Seventh Dimension.","He wanted to closely and desperately study this essence that so many beings used as the core of their strength and then overcome them in their understanding, and whether it was hidden existences that even Reality couldn't see or True Empresses and Emperors descending down...they would all be forced to kneel at his grand majesty of Quintessence!","—","The river of time churns as Ages come and go.","True Emperors come and go.","Over time, grand epics and legends of renowned existences stay as memories in the hearts of those who lived in that Age.","They pass these stories down as these Legends are carried on across the Ages!","The Legends of many True Emperors were known and passed down through memory, but there were others who knew nothing of them.","There were those in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality who only knew of a single Legend.","A living legend that continued to enact his epic every single day, and they were always there to experience it.","This moment in time was just like all others when they once more felt and saw the results of the journey he continued to forge...but even they knew that this time was different!","They could feel it across the corners of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","Near an icy Cosmos close to the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature.","Many eyes and hearts rose as they saw rivers of a silver gray essence begin to permeate outwards and even surge towards them!"]},{"number":2143,"title":"Chapter 2143: Chapter 2142 Mana And NULLITY! II","paragraphs":["Strands of dark and blue hair streaked past her shoulders as she floated in the void of space.","A dark shawl covered her as she still wanted to retain her position even though she did not need to over the many months, but she still wanted to be known as the Shadow Guard of the Frozen Queen, Night.","She had changed over the past months as the diaries she wrote on had been found by Barbatos at some point, the devilish woman seeing the intricate details noted about Noah and his actions and relationships across the past months as Barbatos had mass copied them and began distributing them to as many beings as she could.","The diaries contained history dating back to the Beast World as they became extremely popular and important to the new allies that continued to appear, all of them having the chance to read the legends this being had enacted the past few months as Barbatos threatened Night to continue writing everything she saw- and to especially focus on how Noah interacted with those around him!","She was in charge of letting the character of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor known- she was now the Scribe of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","She wasn't alone as she stood in the void of space outside the icy Cosmos near the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, with Queen Adelaide she served floating not too far ahead with Halcyon, Athena, Barbatos, and many others.","They all gazed at the silver gray waves of essence that came to wash over their bodies in shock as they instinctively knew it was something far out of their reach- far too grand for them to even comprehend!","When it reached Night, she felt this essence wash over her skin as her calm energies began to bounce around with even more activity.","It was unlike anything she had come across before from the achievements of their living legend.","So a Relic in the form of a pen floated beside her as it began to write on clear white pages of a radiant gold-covered book.","As the Scribe, she would note down this event and the many events to come.","After this, she had plans to push the Frozen Queen to enact a banquet for the new entrants of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality- the existences from the Dream and Avalon Dimensions light years away from them currently.","This was because in the Lands they lived in, there were no threats or signs of dangers. They knew that the Master continued to fight for their safety and happiness outside of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as they trusted in his ability to do so. She wanted all the new beings coming to feel this level of safety and relaxation as well.","She wanted to continue noting down the many different beings that the Master had brought under his banner and how he treated them. She also wanted to see if the number of women around him had increased even more.","She would continue to write down his epic, but for now...she would enjoy this newly spreading silver gray essence that seemed to have profound and unfathomable effects that pointed to a new chapter rising for the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","The Shadow Guard had no knowledge of this, but what was occurring was the proliferation of an essence that was not pervasive in the Barren Lands.","It was an action with unfathomable and unknown consequences!","—","A sea of blue.","This was the only thing Lilith could use to describe the scene before her as crackling cerulean flames descended like an endless sea.","They originated from a single being, with another two of his Clones facing a transformed Supreme Pontiff Lucius and all of the Dimensional Rulers of various Dimensions she had brought under her that remained!","A single being...facing her power and multiple other Rulers at once as it would normally be an impossibility.","But this being seemed to thrive on impossibilities.","ROAR!","The blue flames were filled with Absolute Mana Authority that she couldn't tear apart even in her elevated form, where even as she felt the authority and destiny of a Destined True Emperor burn inside of her and provide her with obscene power, she could only keep the flames at bay!","When she measured the output that was actively being released every time they surged forward...","'Over 120 Quadrillion...'","...!","Even greater than moments ago in the Quantum Dimension.","What did it mean that he was dishing out a damage value that was half what he displayed now in the Quantum Dimension? Did it mean that he could always erupt with 120 Quadrillion Damage Values and just chose to release half just minutes ago, or did it mean he could only release 60 Quadrillion then as minutes later...he had grown capable of releasing more than 120 Quadrillion?","One of these theories seemed much more implausible, and yet the Hearts of Karma and Fortune that were also burning beside her Royal Daemon Heart told her the implausible theory was more correct.","That the amount of Damage this being could deal had more than doubled than just minutes ago.","<Just...what are you?>","WAA!","Amidst the raging blue flames, her extremely beautiful form released pillars of demonic light while the butterfly wings behind her released multiple Mirror images just like her that weaved in different directions, each of them releasing their own attacks that battled with the cerulean flames.","She had to ask what this being was as her three eyes carried great melancholy and hatred!","She had barely tipped past the point of 100 Quadrillion Defense and Damage Values herself after burning everything she had.","She thought in this form, she could match and overcome this being with the distinction of the Quintessential Dimensional Emperor as she could prove that she was worthy to seek her revenge!","That her hatred towards those that had allowed her father to perish and now wanted to end all things...that her hatred would at least have a chance of burning these beings.","But this being with much of his history and identity being unknown was stopping all of this!","She at least wanted to understand.","An answer came.","And her eyes trembled as it was not the one she sought.","She saw...silver gray flames of Singularity blooming from one half of his body as they surged out with terrifying speed to negate all the essences of Natural Laws and Decreta she was throwing out.","It was the Essence of NULLITY!","And unlike the domain that The Empress released which forcefully contained one's essences immediately to their bodies, the burning essence of NULLITY did this as on top of it- it still carried over 120 Quadrillion Damage Values that she could only defend against at this moment!","And alongside it, the flames carrying the Absolute Mana Authority surged as alongside NULLITY, they seemed even wilder.","<Ah...>","Great resentment and unwillingness rose in her heart as she understood the messages from the different Hearts inside of her clearly.","So while gritting her crystalline white teeth so much that crimson blood leaked from her mouth, she sought the reason and meaning behind this all.","<Are you like them...coming from outside of these Barren Lands?>","...!","With NULLITY being freely wielded by him and his non-affiliation with Primordials, Lilith wondered if this was it.","At least this could serve as an explanation as to why billions of years of hard work and planning fell apart!","But...","\"No such thing.\"","With half of her vision covered by silver gray flames of Singularity and the other half covered by a gorgeous blue, she traced these flames back to their origin as the handsome face of an Emperor became locked onto her gaze.","His skin glittered with multicolored radiance as the Tri-Pupiled eyes released astonishing brilliance, eyes that when she focused on them with all the authority she had left, she saw that in the very hidden depths, he seemed so...","<Young.>","She blinked as she felt like this was the only True thing she had ascertained for herself about this being since she met him.","And then...","CRACK!","Her Innate Dimensional Barrier shattered and was overwhelmed as soon after, her fair skin began to peel and splinter, her body and soul vibrating as she felt her vessels crying out madly as if molten acid was coursing through them!","It was the pain and terror of an Encroachment as Flames with a potent Pathogenic Will tore into the aspects of one of the most powerful Dimensional Rulers."]},{"number":2144,"title":"Chapter 2144: Chapter 2143 Mana And NULLITY! III","paragraphs":["A searing pain as if molten acid coursed through her vessels!","It was within the span of a nanosecond, and yet to her, it felt stretched out into countless years.","The burning pillars of molten flames shooting out of the cracking crimson earth of this Dimension seemed cooler in her eyes than what currently coursed through her body as in an instant, the flames reached her Origin and wrapped around it domineeringly!","YAAAH!","Her red lips couldn't help but tremble and release a cry that she believed to be her last, her True Vitality dwindling down towards nothingness as next- she expected the forcefully and instant desegregation of all laws and decreta that she knew before she faced Annihilation!","<Lilith!>","The Supreme Pontiff Lucius bellowed out from afar as even he didn't have any moment to spare, the clone that faced him also erupting with NULLITY as the dominance that the Quintessential Dimensional Emperor displayed on this battlefield was astonishing.","And right as Lilith expected desegregation and Annihilation...it didn't come.","<...>","The Encroachment of terrifying flames had wrapped all around her as they even reached out to burn the very vessels around her Hearts, but they didn't fully destroy as when her True Vitality Values shrank down to drastic levels...","SHIING!","She felt the Will carried by the flames clamp down on her in an unbreakable fashion as it pervaded in all aspects of existence- sinking into everything about her!","It was a Pathogenic Will.","It was a Neural Encroachment that seeped into her very soul and bound her!","...!","Her soul cried out with shocking rage as her Will bellowed out amidst all this.","<Do not taint me like this! At this stage, I at least deserve a worthy death and not a life of torment!>","Her cry should have been resonant and loud, but it barely rang out as her body was currently bathed in crackling flames.","The Dimensional Rulers and the Supreme Pontiff that backed her gazed at this scene with disbelief as a titan of a being like Lilith...seeing her defeated just seemed surreal!","But her defeat spelled doom for them as Damage Values they could not withstand had already sent a large portion of them into exploding singularities, and even more would soon follow as they came across a deadly enemy!","An enemy that had his flames wrapped around the Dimensional Queen as his clone floated towards her visage, his voice ringing out from the very depths of her soul.","\"You can die when I am done with you, O Dimensional Queen.\"","WAA!","The billowing will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor rose ever higher as the soul of a terrifying being was grasped, Lilith's vision blacking out and utterly changing at this moment as she found herself locked out of everything about her and brought into a unique space.","A manifestation of her soul awoke to find her lower body half submerged in a sea of flames, a cerulean throne floating not too far from her as a devilishly handsome young man sat atop it.","Her face was one full of the regality and rage of a Ruler as even in defeat, she stared hatefully towards this being whose voice emanated out as if it was the only thing that mattered.","\"The Dimensional Hellion Ruler that looked at me like an ant over just about a week ago... now stands before me with her soul shackled.\"","...!","The events in the Kun Peng's Cataclysm Nest played before Lilith's eyes as she grit her teeth with solemnity.","<Why do all this? Whatever your Origin is, whether it be outside of the Barren Lands or inside it- do you make a childish habit of torturing your enemies? What an Emperor! Truly worthy of this Age!>","Her words were drenched in wrath and sarcasm as the stellar visage of Noah upon the Throne smiled while shaking his head.","He rose from the manifested throne to stare deeply at Lilith as he reflected on how rapidly things could change!","\"You question my Origins as if you will die easier knowing I am some mysterious being from outside these Barren Lands who has plotted for eons...I'll shed some light to you now...\"","...!","\"I first touched upon Mana within the last 2 years, with a bit over 27 years to my name. In that period of time, I went from an existence that could not even grasp Mana to now freely wielding as much Absolute Mana Authority as I wish! And now...I have the renowned Dimensional Queen burning in my grandeur as the reason I have you here...is so that you can swiftly gift me the Source of the Dimension you are closest to.\"","WAA!","The eyes of this locked away portion of her soul were blank from this information as she couldn't even retort.","And she soon felt her locked away portion of soul returning to her body as all of her laws and decreta were intact, but her Aspects of Existence were wrapped tightly with a foreign will that submerged any thought of control!","The flames around her body stopped burning.","Her three eyes blinked as Lilith could see through them...but she didn't feel like it was her gazing through them!","As if she was locked in her own body.","And her soul...it now moved under the command of another as even without controlling it, she felt her very core reach out to the Source of Apollyon that she knew very well!","She reached out to this Source that she protected all these years as thereafter, she shared with it the knowledge of the coming destruction they had affirmed in the Quantum Dimension- and of the Ancestral Descendants that had already arrived to guarantee Cataclysm.","She then felt another bundle of information flowing through her from the soul that currently bound her- information about a way to escape this destruction as it was...the answer to what happened to the Dream and Avalon Dimensions!","<...!>","Lilith had no words.","She could only feel herself moving blankly under the control of another as she delivered the Apollyon Dimension into his hands.","\"Fret not, Dimensional Queen. You might just live long enough to see your wish of saving your Dimension achieved. If you prove to be useful enough, you may even get to release your Hatred on those you loathe so much.\"","His voice was resonant as it filled her mind.","As she watched everything with utter disbelief, a Pocket Dimensional Reality appeared in the skies of the Apollyon Dimension as the Source of this plane followed the only path of survival after seeing the coming destruction just like the Dream and Avalon Dimensions!","It was a shocking feat as Noah both defeated one of the more powerful Dimensional Hellion Rulers and also began the process of swiftly devouring the Apollyon Dimension!"]},{"number":2145,"title":"Chapter 2145: Chapter 2144 Mana And NULLITY! IV","paragraphs":["The dazzling allure of the Pocket Dimensional Reality shone incandescently as it released a horrific devouring force that made it seem like a massive Singularity.","The Crimson earth below scorching with heat and the pillars of magma rising to the skies all trembled and surged towards this Singularity as Lilith watched it all blankly.","Her devilish visage was wrapped with a crimson battledress as her butterfly-like wings retreat into her back, her third eye fading as her demonic horns glistened in the skies.","She watched the unfolding events with disbelief as in the corner of her eyes, she could see the other two Clones of the being that had bound her floating next to burning singularities!","These burning singularities were none other than the Rulers Lilith had come with as beside her, not a single one had been spared.","Even now, silver gray flames wrapped around the Supreme Pontiff Lucius as his body was scorched black, his gaze still blank as he also exploded into a Singularity as if he was some common Ruler.","\"Their deaths will serve a greater purpose.\"","The voice of the being responsible for all this echoed out as truly, their deaths would be put to great use.","This was because the light of the Quintessential Treasure Cache was activated for the Dimensional Hellion Ruler Lucius while the 14 Rulers from a myriad of other Dimensions that followed Lilith here...they were all turned into the pathway of Randomized Loot Crates!","For the sake of resources that he needed in overabundance, Noah would do all that he could.","<A madman...>","As she watched everything burn and become devoured into a Singularity, Lilith echoed out listlessly as she termed the being doing all this a monster. Her- a Dimensional Hellion Ruler that had plotted and done a great deal over the Ages...termed Noah a madman as she recalled the memories that had passed through her and into the Source of Apollyon!","Yet the Quintessential Kainos Emperor was not paying attention to her words.","His Tri-Pupiled eyes were gazing at the silver-gray flames that still burned in the Crimson skies along with the flames of Absolute Mana Authority.","Both were made up of Infinite amounts of Apocalyptic Blitzkriegs, with Noah finding out moments ago when he first utilized NULLITY...that Absolute Pure Mana Output did not thoroughly change NULLITY and retain its effects in the form of Mana!","The Essence of NULLITY was too pristine as theoretically and looking at all the data on hand, it seemed to be standing above Laws and Decreta.","A state of existence.","And it couldn't be thoroughly changed even through Mana Output!","Thoroughly.","This was a crucial part.","Noah was still able to affect it somewhat as even though the silver gray essence still remained as NULLITY, it seemed more...refined and malleable than the essence of NULLITY he saw the Tribunal Rulers or even CHARLEMAGNE use.","The Essence was too pristine and elevated to transform it into Pure Mana, but what if...","BZZZT!","The surging flames of Singularity around Noah pulsed and began vibrating intensely.","His bright eyes lost their luster briefly as in a shocking turn of events, Noah fell into an epiphany.","His Will focused on half of his body that released the refined silver-gray flames of NULLITY and the other half of his body that shone with the cerulean flames of Pure Mana. He saw the countless Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg Domains that formed both of these flames as his incandescent hands made a pulling motion!","He couldn't transform Nullity into Mana, but his Quintessential Will was asking...what if he still brought them together?","What if the Blitzkrieg Domains of Flames under his control still tried to forcefully combine into something else as he placed the qualities of both of these concepts together as they should have been if Absolute Pure Mana Output worked?","What if...","SHIING!","Nature vibrated and resonated with grandeur.","<<You are attempting an unprecedented action.>>","Prompts began to rise as he barely saw them in his mind.","<<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>>","<<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>>","<<You are reaching a profound precipice of Quintessential Authority.>>","...!","Under the pull of his radiant hands, silver-gray and blue flames slowly moved towards each other as Noah was proceeding by an unknown feeling alone, where even he wasn't sure exactly what he was reaching for!","And at such a juncture...","BOOOM!","He was forcefully repulsed out of his stupor.","He was shaken out of his epiphany as his Origin innately reacted and was wrapped up in a spatial light as the Laws of Gravitation and Relativity twisted space in such a way to instantly shift both he and Lilith to another location!","And in the position they were just at...","A massive gray fissure of NULLITY stretched out as it went towards the Crimson horizon- with this fissure being merely one of many as far away from here, an origination of it could be seen with multiple other fissures stretching out in all directions.","And at the center of it all...the glorious visage of an existence adorned in silver gray bone Armament and pulsing with heart rending power could be seen.","The Ancestral Descendant that arrived with the True Empress Katya made his arrival in the Apollyon Dimension as her commands dictated, the first thing he did being the acceleration of Cataclysm as he heavily attacked the Dimension and its Source with NULLITY!","His hair was stained ashen gray as his eyes were utterly wild, eyes that stretched across space to instantly hone in around the figures of Noah and Lilith- as well as the point of Singularity that was swallowing the Apollyon Dimension!","Noah's eyes constricted as all three of his Clones appeared side by side.","Lilith stood in front of them as her butterfly-like wings erupted again, Noah's Pathogenic Will allowing her more control of herself as he danced with destiny and Providence.","As he looked at a terrifying being drenched in NULLITY and wondered...just what stage had he achieved?","Was he still in the Primitivus Stage where even the hallway point at 50% granted one 500,000% Augmentations to All True Parameter Values?","Was it a being he could currently face with his constantly elevating strength?!","The answers to all these questions were unknown, but he did affirm one thing.","The feeling he felt with Mana and NULLITY...it was worth pursuing as from afar, the ecstatic visage of a bone-armored existence began to surge towards their direction, and the flames of Quintessential Singularity Ignition blazed ever higher as Noah's Clones once more made a pulling motion towards the crackling silver-gray and blue flames- directing all of it towards an insurmountable coming enemy as the Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor wanted to see a scene of utmost glory!"]},{"number":2146,"title":"Chapter 2146: Chapter 2145 Dominant! I","paragraphs":["Spectacular.","This was all that could be said about the events unfolding in the Apollyon Dimension!","Back in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, Guinevere was focused on the illusory screen showing these events as her eyes were placidly focused on the visage of Lilith standing before Noah and erupting with waves of essence, where one could visibly see her strength elevating even more as she was actively re-integrating with the Natural Laws she had just broken the Lines of Integration of in the Quantum Dimension!","It meant that she was truly brought under the control of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor as Guinevere thought back to the promise that this being had made not too long ago.","A promise that was further brought up as Morgana's will sent forth a mental communication only to her!","'He said she wouldn't be an ally, and yet this-'","'Shut up.'","..!","Guinevere's reply was sharp as her exceedingly beautiful face shone with a light of power and age. A purple white battle dress adorned her as among all female Rulers here, she held a grandeur very few could even come close to.","She turned to Morgana who shrank back in frustration as the voice of this Connate Sacred Beast emanated in her mind.","'Enough trying to sow any conflict between us and him. We are inextricably linked in an unfathomable way. I remember the promise, but I can also see what is necessary to be done. Through his actions, he is now saving a third Anchor while fighting with his authority on the line. Yet...what are we doing? Hiding and coddling here as we only watch!'","WAA!","Regal work filled with wisdom emanated from her as a trace of anger could be seen in her eyes when she looked at Morgana who entirely shrunk back while biting her lips!","Not too far away, the Will of Noah's Avalon Dimensional Chassis came down as it discerned the exchange that just occurred and only focused on Guinevere with a hint of understanding, choosing not to say anything as the main focus remained getting back to the state of epiphany on the subject of NULLITY and Mana...and also seeing how his three Clones could survive until all of Apollyon was devoured.","This...would be something utterly critical in the next few seconds.","An existence he had very little information about aimed for him just like his compatriots in the Quantum Dimension, and in his search to better understand and pierce across the veils of secrecy...","<The Reality Altering Construct of the Eyes of Clarity of the First True Emperor are resonating with the Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor.>","...!","His sharp eyes that were calculating and unveiling everything to their absolute limit actually resonated with the pristine loot he had obtained from the recent opening of the Quintessential Treasure Caches.","A construct!","It unveiled itself at this moment as intricate Runic Epitaphs descended onto Noah's eyes- beginning to carve themselves until his very pupils as his vision began to change, but the coming attack and battle waited for nobody as his Clones had to first survive this!","The coming enemy was a ferocious one as wrapped in the silver-gray bone Armament, his visage was surrounded by a swirling Obsidian crystalline ball that released a fearful aura of authority as every part of his pores swelled with NULLITY. His face was exceptionally valiant and filled with majesty as his booming voice reached before his figure could.","\"You seem to love flames...so let me teach you a little about them.\"","...!","His voice was magnetic.","His eyes were filled with ingenuity as they focused on Noah's and Lilith's figure and the Pocket Dimensional Reality that Noah had moved behind them protectively.","He seemed to know he had found something crucial among what they were looking for, and Noah could already see the level of danger as even while devouring the Apollyon Dimension- he would still eliminate the connection as soon as he gauged just how terrifying and unstoppable this being would be!","And this existence seemed determined as his voice was followed by action.","Before the flaming Seas of NULLITY and Mana could even meet, the visage of this being illuminated like a burning sun as...a concept that immolated reality itself bloomed out!","And it was utterly ridiculous to see as from the body of the Ancestral Descendant and then stretching out behind and up endlessly in the Crimson skies of Apollyon...a single white flame came to fruition.","A white flame that shockingly seemed so massive and titanic that it occupied half the visible skies of the entire Dimension one could see in this location!","SAAA!","It scorched even the Reality it didn't occupy directly as behind Noah- even the skies were melting!","And his defensive barriers all lit up as before the flame even descended, he could already feel tens of Quadrillions of Damage Values just from its waves of heat alone.","\"...\"","It was a suffocating attack as apart from this, this single flame released a Gravitational force that pulled others towards it in a cataclysmic manner as it was meant to burn everything!","Uniquely, one couldn't feel the aura of Natural Laws on this massive single flame.","More accurately- its composition wasn't that of Natural Laws even though around it, tendrils of Manadynamics and other laws were wrapping around it almost in a suppressive format as if it was exceeding what they allowed!","The Ancestral Descendant had a cold gaze as he beckoned down after he called out such a flame.","\"Unbound by Natural Laws, there are countless things one can achieve as they are not confined to the boundary of any concept.\"","...!","Why had the Ancestors sealed the Desolate Mausoleum all those years ago?","This being before Noah's eyes partly showed one of the answers as his single attack covered half the visible skies in this region.","\"Manadynamics does not dictate my reserves or usage of Mana, nor does Entropy limit the level of destruction I can achieve.\"","Like a mountain smashing down and scorching everything, the single white flame barreled down at insane speeds as the stellar eyes of this being glinted with grandiosity!","\"The only boundaries...are those that I- Carciel, have made.\"","...!","BOOOM!"]},{"number":2147,"title":"Chapter 2147: Chapter 2146 Dominant! II","paragraphs":["\"The only boundaries...are those that I- Carciel, have made.\"","...!","Unbound by Natural Laws!","So when they descended and became tainted with these laws again...they faced a suppression to the True power they could display.","There were many larger and more intricate mysteries lying behind this all as for now, this was all that was revealed.","The Ancestral Descendant had beckoned as the massive flame rushed down...and Noah's robes began to flutter as all three of his Clones came extremely close to each other while his eyes released astonishing brilliance.","Lilith's butterfly-like wings fluttered as emotionlessly, her figure also appeared in the close circle within Noah's Clones as defensive and offensive skills bloomed out from her- the color of crimson black barely shining amidst the surging white flame descending.","In the past, Noah had used multiple Clones to attack all at once in order to dish out tremendous damage onto his enemies, and now...he wanted to try something similar with his defenses.","He wanted...to overlap his many barriers in order to survive against an unbeatable enemy.","Lilith's was another piece that just added to this.","He had the Lich's Armament of Devotion, the Beacon of Thorny Consecration, and an Innate Dimensional Barrier...on each clone.","Collectively, they allowed his Defense Value to far exceed his Damage Value that was on the upper boundary of 125 Quadrillion- with all three defensive concepts stacking each Clone with approximately 380+ Quadrillion Defense Values.","Each!","And towards the massive single flame descending, Noah would have the flames of his Quintessential Singularity Ignition rush out along with keeping all of his Clones extremely close- even making 2 smaller in size to make sure the defensive barriers around his bodies would overlap after he extended them as much as possible- and then all of this defense would be put to the test!","Well, this was only the theory.","In Reality...","BZZZZT!","The single white flame arrived too quickly as it carried a malevolent essence unbound by any Laws, negating Reality wherever it crossed as uniquely, traces of NULLITY were the only things Noah could recognize with it!","It reached him in a fraction of a nanosecond.","The palms of all of his Clones reached out along with the body of Lilith as in synchrony, all hands and the barriers that protected them overlapped to withstand the hundreds of Quadrillions of Damage Value coming down.","Values that far exceeded even 1,000 Quadrillion!","With such damage, any of Noah's Clones would be wiped out with all their defenses and True Vitality before he could even heal himself.","But at this juncture, they weren't alone.","9 different defensive layers from three Clones glimmered with gorgeous incandescence as one by one...","CRACK! CRACK!","They began to fall under the pressure of the unreasonable flame as everything a barrier broke, Noah allowed a Gravitational force to build up around him!","CRACK!","A dense Gravitational force that when barely two barriers were left as Lilith's hands were also scorched black, Noah allowed the pressure and might of the single titanic white flame to descend as when the last Innate Dimensional Barrier cracked- all of their figures used the accumulated Gravitational force as they were smashed backwards.","...!","Smashed with the force of what seemed like a single blazing sun, and yet it would encompass even Quadrillions of suns!","SAAA!","It smashed their figures back with such force and ferocity as they tore across the skies of the Apollyon Dimension as they were thrown from the position they were at until...the unstable boundary of this expanding Dimension could be seen!","The Pocket Dimensional Reality moved with Noah as fantastically, his Clones and Lilith were hit with such a massive force that they came to smash onto the ends of the Dimension in the span of a mere nanosecond.","\"....!\"","Stellar blood erupted and overflowed as from an extremely far distance, Carciel's voice still resounded out all around.","\"For an existence still in the Barren Lands to withstand something exceeding 1 Aeon Value...you're truly worthy of the mess you've caused in this Age!\"","...!","1 Aeon Value!","A new term that when Noah took everything into account and the benchmark of 1,000 Quadrillion Damage Values he had achieved, it seemed that this being equated all of this...to a single Value termed Aeon that was utilized as a measurement outside the Barren Lands!","Aeon!","Aeon was a term that meant an extremely long period of time or an even closer definition- a lifetime.","A lifetime!","A single Damage Value...was enough to wipe away a lifetime.","A single Aeon Value equated to 1,000 Quadrillion True Damage Values!","This new information swirled in Noah's mind as while this drastic situation bloomed, something profound was also achieved by Noah's Main Body as it would propel his strength further to stand against these unreasonable enemies!","Within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","Seas of essence raged as his body was at the exact center- bathing in it all with utmost glory.","Within his Origin, the formation of the Quantum Dimensional Layer...finally crossed a threshold and rapidly surged towards completion.","It placed a multicolored light of majesty as Noah's Seventh Layer, dazzling cylindrical Stanchions already rising from the Dimensional Layer below as mountains of Reality Passages gushed out to form!","HUUM!","Incandescent waves of multicolored light proliferated from him seamlessly as prompts rained down.","<You have successfully completed the Seventh Dimensional Reality.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","<A version of Pure Undefined Authority has been isolated for your future use above the Quantum Dimensional Reality.>","<Through your reign over the Quantum Dimensional Reality, a level of influence can be exerted in the Quantum Dimension.>","<...>","A level of influence could be exerted towards the Quantum Dimension.","This was a prompt Noah was looking for as something crucial in this Dimension...was the Pylon of Ascension.","The pathway for existences to descend onto the Barren Lands.","He had no idea if other pathways existed, but if he broke the one they utilized now...","His thoughts were vibrant as the boons of the Seventh Dimensional Layer continued!"]},{"number":2148,"title":"Chapter 2148: Chapter 2147 Sacrifice And Survival! I","paragraphs":["A scorched fabric of Reality.","This was the only sentence that could accurately describe the skies of the Apollyon Dimension!","And at its far reaches where its boundary was, Noah's three Clones rose amidst the restructuring Reality with Lilith's figure that breathed haggardly, her fair fingers healing as her eyes shone with her old hatred.","From the bodies of the True Sanguine Clones, stellar skin closed up and healed as incandescent blood returned into their bodies, their True Vitality Values taking a hit even amidst all of this as the enemy truly was too unreasonable!","An enemy that accurately judged the scene from afar as he stared at the Pocket Dimensional Reality that moved with Noah's body- a point of devouring light that in his eyes was a massive Singularity that continued to rapidly and with great progress swallow the Apollyon Dimension.","It was to the extent that the boundaries that Noah's Clones had arrived in could visibly be seen shrinking as the surface area of the Dimension being absorbed per nanosecond was vast!","This was because apart from the absorptive force of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality itself, the Source of the Apollyon Dimension was also moving in earnest and urgency to rush as much of the Dimension into this Singularity as fast as possible.","Carciel gazed at this while his eyes turned to the crystalline circle structure rotating around him, his Will flowing into it as he sent forth a message even though he held tremendous advantage.","\"I've located multiple more Clones of the Quintessential Dimensional Emperor. He seems to be actively devouring the Anchor of Apollyon and displacing its position. I'm informing and requesting back up in the case of any unforeseen circumstances, or if his current actions are how the Anchors have been getting removed.\"","...!","His body was filled with hybrid, power, and confidence. And yet...he did not delay to look at things from all perspectives as he reported everything right away and even requested backup due to the nature of this event and its many unknowns!","After all, who could have expected an existence in the Barren Lands to be capable of withstanding 1 Aeon Value?","Carciel did not want new surprises to come while he watched all of the Apollyon Dimension be swallowed up!","And even while he took such an action, his body was already barreling across space towards the ends of the Apollyon Dimension as he ushered his hands in the air as he did so.","And then...","SHIIING!","One...two...four...","The massive Flame that he released once before...multiple of them began to bloom as they blotted out the skies of the whole dimension.","No mercy.","No delay.","This being moved with expert precision as he truly deserved his position!","And Noah...had to somehow face all of this alone.","Alone!","But...was he truly alone?","HOOONG!","Multicolored radiance shone.","Waves of Relativity and Gravitation erupted as multiple rifts bloomed around Noah's Clones at this moment.","From them, the visage of a Draconian Qilin Phoenix stepped with tens of Enders of Nature, the potency of Natural Laws elevating in this area as in the blotted skies of the Apollyon Dimension- seas of Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws waved down like tendrils of chains that went on towards Carciel!","His body rebuffed them momentarily as they passed through the Obsidian crystalline structure floating around him, but they descended unto him nonetheless as his gaze changed.","The Natural Laws imposed more of their effects as at this moment, Reality itself acted in its best interests.","The freeing of another Anchor was a great boon for it as sitting back and seeing it fail was not an option!","So Dozens of Enders of Nature came to stand before Noah akin to an impenetrable wall as behind all this, his Clones glimmered with unbound radiance and glory as he looked like a Chosen Emperor that exceeded any other Emperors across the Ages.","Even Lilith's gaze of hatred couldn't help but turn utterly ashen and defeated at this as with such a development, Carciel became even more determined as his body began to vibrate- a fearsome bellow booming from him!","OOOOOOH!","—","In the midst of all this, Noah's main body continued to observe the wonders of the Quantum Dimensional Layer that he had just achieved.","<The Undefined Authority under you has increased.>","<Your Understanding of the Decretum of Quantum has been forcefully raised to 50%.>","<Your Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been elevated to the Maximum of 32 Billion.>","<Your Maximum True Vitality Values have risen to 64 Trillion.>","<Your rate of Progression in the Decretum of Quantum has increased by 1,000,000%>","<The saturated Paramount Kainos Quantum Dimensional Reality grants a base addition of 7,400,000 Dimensional Quantum Damage and Defense Values, bringing your Overall Origin Base Value to 13,480,000.>","<16x Pure Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds has been obtained.>","WAA!","His base values more than doubled.","His Resources and Vitality more than doubled!","His power rose in such a profound fashion as he felt the tendrils of Providence that told him many things, and he found himself questioning...with his means and constantly rising strength, would he truly not be able to survive the Tyranny of the Ancestral Descendants with any of his Clones?!","There was the battle in the Quantum Dimension to consider as it involved a True Empress.","Then there was the fight in the Apollyon Dimension as swatches of Enders appeared to fight alongside him in this unique instance!","If he took all of this into account along with optimizing his own strength...new pathways may just be possible.","He had to see.","So his Will moved to continue his ceaseless elevation of power.","His Slumbering will watched the continued assimilation of new Realities onto his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality while it moved with robust purpose- one of the first ones being the utilization of the 16 newly gained Pure Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds to max out the understanding of all of his currently understood Decreta among many other passive actions underway!"]},{"number":2149,"title":"Chapter 2149: Chapter 2148 Survival And Sacrifice! II","paragraphs":["His Will gazed at the still descending prompts while the Decretum of Quantum began to edge past 50% the moment that a Pure Quintessential Natural Decretum Seed began to burn.","<Your Affinity to the Natural Laws of Reality has risen greatly!>","<Your Affinity to the Decreta of all Dimensions has risen greatly!>","<Your Maximum Number of Ascendancy Stanchions is now 2,000.>","<Your Maximum Number of Infinite Reality Passages is now 3,780.>","<The Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique is Devouring the Quantum Essence and Refining its authority.>","<Your Dimensional Body and Soul continue to experience a profound strengthening and elevation.>","<The Insurmountable Milestone of the Seventh Dimensional Layer has been conquered as your Realm reaches an unfathomably profound level.>","...!","Even greater levels of grandiosity unfolded as apart from his Decreta surging upwards in understanding, Noah's now ridiculous reserves of the Essence of Reality began to burn with utilization as tens of stellar mountainous Reality Passages erupted in his Origin- mesmerizing Stanchions also shooting up like Celestial pillars from the Niflheim Dimensional Layer and onto the Quantum Dimensional Layer!","His foundation was becoming ever so pristine as in this Age and in the Ages past...who could match such a Realm of progression?","The Ancestors did not have this. The past True Emperors did not have this!","Out of the multitude of Parallel Paths and possibilities, only he had attained the path of forging 9 Dimensions for his Origin!","And even during this moment of grandiosity, even more wonders were blooming around him as the moment the Quantum Dimensional Reality was completed, he wanted to pull upon its essence and authority to see just how greatly he could affect the genuine Quantum Dimension and the Pylon of Ascension within it.","He wanted to...but everything around him came to a halt a moment later.","Even the blazing radiance illuminating everything in the surroundings was stopped as at this moment, Noah's pupils began spinning as the Runic ecritures fusing with them began to burn.","The Construct of the Eyes of Clarity began to burn and overcome all other sources of light as even time and space were ground to a halt, the burning in Noah's eyes becoming truly immense and encompassing until...","SHAA!","Everything turned white.","<....>","Noah's consciousness momentarily blacked out as he didn't know how much time had passed before his Will was roused and he began to see light form a wondrous scene.","A scene that showed the broad back of a single man gazing at everything before him, his gaze pointed towards a lush verdant earth that sprouted countless massive multicolored pillars of light that stretched out endlessly to the skies and space.","These radiant pillars were condensed essences of Fundamental Natural Laws as surrounding them were seas of Laws that shone with beauty, such a scene repeating itself for countless light years as it showed a mere portion of Reality!","A Reality...that was far back in time.","\"When we did all this, I wondered if it was a great mistake.\"","WAA!","From the man with his back turned to Noah, a glorious voice of hearts having majesty emanated as Noah instinctively knew it was directed towards him!","Just like how he instinctively knew exactly what he was staring at right now in the glorious expanse before him.","Reality before it was split up.","Reality many, many Ages ago as from how this all began with the reaction from the Reality Altering Construct of the Eyes of Clarity- Noah was actually viewing a scene of the fight Age.","Of a portion of the Desolate Mausoleum after it had been suppressed!","Majesty emanated all around as Noah's face was stern, his Will coagulating into the form of a devilish regal being that walked forward in the dazzling skies to stand beside the man with his back turned, his own voice echoing out as he lamented at being pulled into something so intricate and unique while so many other things were going on around him.","\"So why did you all do it?\"","Noah spoke bluntly to this being's words who was speaking with melancholy on whether what they did was a mistake!","This being that the Eyes of Clarity belonged to.","The True Emperor of the First Age, the Age of Genesis!","His visage cleared up as Noah saw the black and white robe draping over this being's wide back, his dark hair flowing gently in the wind as his fair face held a hint of a mocking smile while his eyes...they were mere points of golden light that shone like blazing singularities.","\"Out of weakness. We stepped outside these Barren Lands and found unfathomable things. We found unbeatable enemies exploring Lands filled with boundless treasure. We saw methods of power and authority that we could not even imagine. And so for the sake of survival, we sacrificed something deeply connected to us. But even as I sit atop this newly enacted construct, even while reigning as the True Emperor of this Age, I can't help but ponder...whether there was another way.\"","Fantastical words left this being's mouth as he wasn't just the Emperor of the Age of Genesis- he was also an Ancestor!","These...were the words of an Ancestor!","Yet what Noah was talking to now...was merely a vestige lost in the river of space and time.","Yet...he still replied sharply as he wondered about the meaning of all this.","\"Maybe. But you all did what you did. You locked down and suppressed the Desolate Mausoleum for countless Ages. So what is all this now? Why did you pull me in here?\"","A straight question.","And an even straighter answer came back in turn!","\"Even back then, I understood that everything had a cycle. What we began would eventually run its course and come to an end...and so I left the signature of my eye in the expanse of space and time to find anyone who would be seeking for a different path. To be able to shed the light on whatever they seek as they can at least accomplish what I failed to do here. To find another path that is far different from what we chose.\"","...!"]},{"number":2150,"title":"Chapter 2150: Chapter 2149 Survival And Sacrifice! III","paragraphs":["\"Even back then, I understood that everything had a cycle. What we began would eventually run its course and come to an end...and so I left the signature of my eye in the expanse of space and time to find anyone who would be seeking for a different path. To be able to shed the light on whatever they seek as they can at least accomplish what I failed to do here. To find another path that is far different from what we chose.\"","...!","The First True Emperor of the Age of Genesis had an ethereal expression when he spoke of this, his eyes that were as bright and as forceful as a Singularity continuing to gaze out at the stellar plans before them!","Yet towards his question...Noah floated right in front of this being and stared at him straight on, his gaze feeling like he was staring at an unfathomable black hole as he replied grandly.","\"How cowardly.\"","WAA!","\"You aid in the suppression of the Desolate Mausoleum in a path you do not agree with, and you preside over the True Throne of the First Age without undertaking any changes...only to leave behind your signature so that someone else down the line would fix your mistakes for you? Whatever the construct I am talking to now...what about its main body? Where are you now in the midst of all this?\"","Noah's grandiosity didn't hold back even while standing before the construct of a True Emperor- an existence with such majesty and pressure that the souls of lesser Nature Integration existences would have shattered from just gazing at his eyes!","At Noah's words, the gaze of this being stopped staring and the expanse and focused on Noah's figure.","BZZZT!","The weight of the world seemed to fall on his shoulders as his Will trembled, but he gazed on at the Ancestor that had presided over the True Throne of the First Age as this being's will emanated out again!","\"I am but a mere construct from the Eyes of Clarity that eventually showed me the wrongness of the path we took, and I do not share a current connection with the Main Body. I know not whether he is alive or dead in all this, but if things have evolved to the state I have seen while fusing with your eyes and I have yet to appear...then I do hope it is because I am dead. Because if I do not act when the path we chose moved from suppression to destruction, I truly do not deserve to live.\"","...!","The Will of the Ancestors!","Were there truly none who wanted to preserve the Desolate Mausoleum and the 9 Dimensions? Were all of them so cohesive in their decision to allow the destruction of everything in order to escape the binding of Natural Laws?","As he spoke, the visage of the First True Emperor waved its hands beside it as in the incandescent skies above, a blinding point of light that formed into the structure of a massive throne of light.","It blazed with authority and grandiosity that it felt blinding to even look at from afar!","\"As for fixing these mistakes...I was among the few that came up with a chance to do that during the suppression of the Desolate. As what we did entirely went against Nature, accomplishing it was a nearly impossible task as after sacrificing a great deal of things...the last piece of the puzzle was the True Throne...and its cycling of Authority across the Ages.\"","The different Eras.","The cycles of Ages that went by!","\"The True Throne of an Age...was a way to rectify nature and leave a sense of balance- giving Reality a way to overcome its suppression as if the True Emperors of at least 9 Ages utilized their authority for a single purpose, the suppression of the Desolate Mausoleum would be lifted. The choosing of a True Emperor would be overseen passively by Reality itself as when a certain existence exemplified the Extreme of an Age and accumulated sufficient authority in the bounds of Reality, they would attain the True Throne. It was an idea, and it was also a chance for salvation for the Desolate Mausoleum. As the First True Emperor, I was too bound and weak by newly rising ideals as I did not take any action to undo what was just done, convincing myself of leaving it for the Emperors of future Ages. But it seems...every future Emperor took the same path I did as countless Ages came, and countless Ages passed.\"","The tone was somber.","Ancientness could be felt from this being as the blinding throne of light floating afar seemed to be coming ever closer!","\"Every Emperor took the same path that is...until the Last Age. Until the Age focusing on the Extreme of Destiny, a True Emperor rose who conducted an action even my old self couldn't have imagined with his accumulated authority.\"","HUUM!","The blinding white throne suddenly changed and became painted grandiose gold.","From the pure white Throne of Genesis, the Throne of Destiny released blinding luster as even Noah's eyes reflected its rays of light while digesting all of this information!","OPPENHEIMER!","This was actually the first True Emperor to go against the cycle of the countless Ages past- a being who actually split apart the Desolate Mausoleum into countless Shards as he brought about great instability.","But through this instability...","\"A new path arose with his actions as after such a core part of the Desolate Mausoleum was changed due to his actions, the Anchors began to unwind. Reality gained more control as it would have eventually escaped its shackles and possibly regain enough of its power to overcome any possibility of destruction. But...even this path did not pan out as thought as now, a new Age comes. An Age that will be the decider on how things unfold came- the Age of Quintessence...I actually quite like that name. It seems fitting for the countless possibilities to come.\"","Towards the end of his words, the First True Emperor turned towards Noah again.","\"It seems fitting for someone like you to make a choice...just like many of the True Emperors past.\"","...!"]},{"number":2151,"title":"Chapter 2151: Chapter 2150 Survival And Sacrifice! IV","paragraphs":["\"It seems fitting for someone like you to make a choice...just like many of the True Emperors past.\"","The First True Emperor spike towards Noah as if he was already gazing at the being to take on the True Authority in this Age!","Noah turned his head at this as he replied calmly.","\"I have yet to attain the Throne of Quintessence.\"","\"Yet. But you are the only one fighting for Reality at this moment as it should be an inevitability. But even with that...I will still tell you that it will not be enough.\"","...!","The pupils that were quite literally singularities on this being shone as he became stern.","\"Just like how we sacrificed everything for the sake of survival all those years ago, we will do whatever it takes to maintain the status quo. In your quest to liberate Reality, you will come face to face with a power that is impossible to overcome- a power that has been festering for generations. You have found the construct of my Eye, so use it to see through Nature and aid you in surviving what is to come. It may not be enough and only supplement you a little, but I can also offer you something else. A warning.\"","WAA!","The First True Emperor paused as everything in the surroundings faded, blank whiteness covering everything as Noah could barely discern the glimpse of Genesis.","\"The True Emperor of the Age of Destiny attained great power, yes...but I see now that he had aid in doing so. His choice to do what he did may have been his own, or it may have been influenced by another source. You have come to learn about his utilization of NULLITY that no others in the Barren Lands should have, and you have also come to learn about a hidden existence in the Desolate Mausoleum that does not originate from the Barren Lands. More likely than not, this was the influence that granted the Last True Emperor the power he had as if his actions were also a plot concocted by this unknown existence...then things are dire than you can ever imagine.\"","WAA!","\"Even though those actions aided in freeing Reality somewhat, even though this being may seem like an ally if they ever decide to make a move against Ancestral Descendants...they are not your ally. They will never be your ally. They are part of the existences that drove us to the path of sacrifice in order to survive all those years ago, and they are our undeniable enemies. If one of them has made it into the Barren Lands and much of what is occurring now is due to their machinations...things are truly, truly dire. It means that somehow, they have managed to enter the one place we never thought they would locate as all this...would be a scheme to greatly hurt those you consider Ancestors. A grand scheme Ages in the making.\"","...!","The white space trembled as the visage of the First True Emperor began to fracture!","His words carried shocking intent and purpose as Noah became stern while listening to them, watching the solemnity in this being's face as everything about him cracked and fractured away until...only his eyes were left.","Two points of Singularities.","Singularities that emanated out this will once more.","\"Believe me when I tell you this, they are your most inherent enemies. Use my eyes. Gain clarity. See if you can forge a different path than the one we found. And if you ever see me in the future...try and remind me of where I came from.\"","SHIING!","With that, the pupils of Singularities exploded into points of light that surged into Noah's own eyes, everything breaking down as time began to move again!","Noah found his Will returning to the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as everything began to flow once more, a part of his body undergoing a metamorphosis as his Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor released tendrils of light across the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature!","<The Construct of the Eyes of Clarity is fusing with the Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor with profound Resonance.>","Magnificence overflowed as Noah felt like his eyes carried infinite density, as if they could devour everything and scrutinize it all under his grandeur! He felt...as if his very eyes were becoming points of Singularities.","WAA!","A symphony played out with grandiosity as...","<Epochal Clarity has been fused into the Eyes of the Tri-Pupiled Kainos Emperor>","...!","<The Epochal Tri-Pupiled Eyes of Clarity have been born.>","<The feature of Interminable Clarity has been obtained.>","<The feature of Absolute Epochal Fulmination has been obtained.>","<The feature of Epochal Radiation Emission has been obtained.>","<Unquantifiable features of the Epochal Tri-Pupiled Eyes of Clarity are in the process of forming.>","Stupendous waves of information cascaded down as Noah delved into some to fully understand and left some behind.","There were truly too many things he was concurrently doing and dipping his hands on that it seemed like an overload of information was coming at him constantly, but at this moment- he hoped this newest addition would add some clarity.","The tendrils of light his eyes released changed color as they turned into terrifying beams of destructive light that tore apart the fabric of Reality itself, gazing far into the folds of space as his vision very quickly reflected the events unfolding in the Quantum Dimension!","There were also drastic events unfolding in the Apollyon Dimension with Carciel, but Noah's current focus was on the Quantum Dimension after completing its Dimensional Layer as his True Sanguine Clone here...was currently within reach of the True Empress Katya!","Her purpose at this moment did not seem to be destruction, instead being a goal of capturing as her fair hands reached out with an unknown exuberant authority.","Well, it wasn't unknown any longer as Noah's eyes shone with brilliance.","He gazed at the authority as he saw words appear in front of it, other words appearing above Katya and many more things!","But he didn't have the time to gaze upon them and learn as the Clone was nearly placed under their control had to first be extricated.","And in rejection to possibilities shown by Providence...","<Absolute Epochal Fulmination.>","...!","Noah's will bellowed out with majesty and determination as he utilized the power assimilated from the First True Emperor to release an ability that far exceeded anything in the Barren Lands!","BOOOOM!","With him at the center, an undeniable force emanated from his eyes as a white blast of light bloomed with Noah at the center.","A light that pushed away the nearing True Empress and the Quantum Emperor among others in a shocking turn of events!"]},{"number":2152,"title":"Chapter 2152: Chapter 2151 An Undeniable Death! I","paragraphs":["<Absolute Epochal Fulmination>:: An authority within its own boundaries that arose from the ingenuity of the First True Emperor of the Age of Genesis. In exchange for a third of one's Aeonic Soul Value, it allows you to release an Epochal Authority that absolutely delegates its authority in the surrounding Reality. Absolute Epochal Fulmination allows one to release an epochal repulsive force or an attractive force towards the intended targets, with its effects Absolutely applied to all as targets can only possibly resist it by utilizing their own means with Aeonic Soul Value. The cost of this ability will vary in the future depending on the strength of your Soul...","A boon from the Reality Altering Construct of the Eyes of Clarity!","They included the <Absolute Epochal Fulmination>, <Interminable Clarity>, and <Epochal Radiation Emission> among those quantified.","Uniquely, the cost of this ability and the other abilities of the Epochal Tri-Pupiled Eyes of Clarity was not the essence of Reality or Mana- but one's own Soul!","One's soul as its power was quantified by Aeonic Soul Value.","It was a glimpse into the means of those who exceeded the boundary of the Barren Lands.","In the bid to change the fate of a Clone, Noah utilized Absolute Epochal Fulmination as to all those near his position...he applied a shocking repulsive force that actually applied to even the True Empress Katya!","His pupils shone and spun like singularities as they exploded with regality.","An undeniable white light.","Noah could almost see a sense of the Age of Genesis within this pristine white light as when Katya saw this and felt her figure sway back ever so slightly, her eyes shone with utmost brightness.","This was because at the same time, the messages from the Apollyon Dimension stemming from Carciel had reached her as she realized the target truly had reached the heights of irregulars!","It meant to contain such a being, she had to release all her power even while being suppressed by Natural Laws.","...!","Against the raging Epochal Authority that had even pushed back the Quantum Emperor, Katya's figure came to a halt as she began to bubble with tremendous power.","But the being she was about to direct this power towards...","SHIING!","Like a burning star, his figure had already turned into another direction as he shot away from the destroyed Quantum Rings of light!","The True Sanguine Clone flitted across the veils of space as he surged towards the direction of a single thing.","It was the Pylon of Ascension!","His body burned with authority as his Origin exerted its minimal control over this Dimension to do something entirely different from before.","In the past, he was able to lift the Anchor of Dream and loosen the suppression on the Desolate Mausoleum with an Undefined Authority.","This authority was all coalesced at the top of newly forged Dimensional Realities as at this juncture, Noah willed for this authority to be utilized to twist the very fabric of space of the Quantum Dimension, rapidly taking him from one location to another!","This was why True Empress Katya turned cold as she saw Noah's figure disappear towards a direction at speeds impossible for any existences in the Barren Lands.","And an instant after, her True Authority of Karma shone in her eyes as she turned entirely somber with a hint of surprise, being warned of an unbelievable possibility as her eyes reflected the image of the Pylon of Ascension.","This being...actually targeted the Pylon of Ascension!<novelsnext></novelsnext>","HUUM!","At this moment, the full power of a True Empress became unleashed as the humanoid form of True Empress Katya changed.","Her visage then released blinding waves of authority as she instantly disappeared, and when she appeared again...she had unbelievably crossed tremendous distances in a blink as she appeared in front of the dazzling Pylon of Ascension.","Her form had changed from human as currently...a massive and magisterial form of an existence stared towards Noah's figure that was just now arriving at the Pylon of Ascension as it was a creature that would take one's breath away!","A species lost on the river of time within the Barren Lands as it was extremely hard for them to reproduce.","With dazzling verdant gold scales and 10 limbs that shone line pillars of Reality, the glorious form of none other than an Imperial Karmic Scarab appeared.","A Scarab!","Pristine in grandeur, it was Princess Katya who had seen the True extent of a threat that Noah posed as when she saw him twist his hands towards the Pylon of Ascension, she couldn't help but give a nod of acknowledgment.","\"You're truly a wonderful anomaly to have been born in the Barren Lands, and if things were different...you would have even joined us against the True Enemy.\"","WAA!","\"I'm sure you have your own goals and ideals in all this, but my goals, no, my purpose here that concerns the very survival of all beings...it is much greater than you.\"","...!","Destiny flourished.","Providence seethed.","Karma overflowed!","A True Empress revealed her true power at this moment as she no longer went for the goal of capture...it was now to kill!","Aeonic Soul Power began to burn and leak out senselessly.","From the antennas of the verdant gold Scarab, a dazzling glow of NULLITY was actually intermixed with a verdant light of the True Authority of Karma as Noah's will trembled when he saw this, thinking of the epiphany of Mana and NULLITY he was still trying to get back to.","But this was all he had.","A time to think.","Thereafter, everything became bathed with destructive and heavy bursts of NULLITY as from Katya's position and in a fan-shaped formation, a blast that wiped out everything in its path emanated outwards.","Noah became covered in its path instantly, along with countless light years all around this area as half of the Empire that was the center of the Quantum Dimension was also in the path of this blast!","And its fan-shaped destruction only continued to extend outwards across the entire Quantum Dimension as an unknown number of Aeon Damage Values eradicated everything!"]},{"number":2153,"title":"Chapter 2153: Chapter 2152 An Undeniable Death! II","paragraphs":["Bathed in the destructive light of Karma and NULLITY, Noah felt his greatly elevated Innate Dimensional Barrier, Celestial Lich's Armament of Devotion, and the Beacon of Thorny Consecration all burst in an instant.","<Hmm...>","His thoughts were pristine as the attack had arrived too fast and too powerful to the extent that even Providence had no chance to tell him anything!","It meant that for this moment in time, he could not change fate.","He could not change the path of this True Sanguine Clone.","HOOONG!","Before he could deploy any means against the Pylon of Ascension, a True Empress had crossed vast distances even faster than him and released an attack within a fraction of a nanosecond as the true might of an Ancestral Descendant was displayed.","His true vitality values were instantly drained as well even as bursts of life force and power erupted from him towards the end, but any rapid regeneration was instantly overcome as the flow of space and time began to lull to an extremely slow pace at this juncture.","The True Sanguine Clone's life force was entirely drained as only traces of his source and will remained, Noah calmly accepting this undeniable outcome as he now wanted to see why Providence had shown that a death for this clone would be beneficial. In the frozen moment in time, he saw the massive visage of the Imperial Karmic Scarab move out its Will with precision as what remained of the body of the True Sanguine Clone...became drawn towards her.","More accurately, all that remained of Noah was drawn towards the obsidian crystalline structure that all those that came from the Pylon of Ascension had!","Traces of his source and origin were taken into it as at this moment while the connection was still retained with the main body, a passive ability continued to show its wonders.","It was <Interminable Crality> from Noah's newly elevated eyes that could see through many things.","His sight changed as everything that remained of the True Sanguine Clone was entirely devoured by the crystalline circular structure!","—","<....>","Calmness and coldness.","This was what Katya saw as the expansive beam of NULLITY she released faded.","What was left behind...was utmost destruction as no trace of Reality could be seen.","The very fabric of the Quantum Dimension was erased, half of the Quantum Empire erased along with it as when gazing at this all...Katya didn't feel anything.","All Dimensions and the Desolate Mausoleum had to be accelerated towards Cataclysm anyways, with the existences below Nature Integration having no chance of climbing the Pylon of Ascension to leave these Lands!","Now, the Quantum Dimension became the anchor that had the most destruction as the attack of the True Empress covered not just this region, but a third of the whole Dimension.","Massive rifts of Nullity were the only thing left behind as Entropy surged chaotically and with great fervor, a sense of sadness coming down on Katya as she looked at all this, a sigh escaping her lips.","She wasn't a madman. Of course, she felt great pain at the fact that countless lives would be lost across the Barren Lands when they achieved what they sought to achieve!","She had ruled over an entire Age and saw the myriad of races and species across these lands.","This was also her home.<novelsnext></novelsnext>","Yet she knew what she had to do.","But it did not mean she took any pleasure in it.","It was only necessary for the sake of all others. Because as many beings as there were in these Barren Lands...the number was incomparable to those outside of it!","The river of time worked differently as even though billions of years had passed over the many cycles and Ages, many more billions of years had passed outside the Barren Lands.","Survival was grueling and hard, but in the many Sanctuaries they had occupied life flourished at a shocking speed.","The number of beings she had to think about were hundreds of times greater in number than those in the Barren Lands!","\"The needs of the many...outweigh the few.\"","She spoke serenely as she stared at the destruction she had caused, sighing in her heart as she looked at the round tool floating around her that had swallowed the remains of the QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR.","She wanted to learn about him from these remains, but seeing the urgency in the message of Carciel and just how unreasonable the power that this anomaly displayed, she wanted utmost confidence in achieving their aims as she could not be responsible if things went south- not with something this important!","So her will sank into the tool beside her as her Soul illuminated.","Strength achieved over eons rose in waves as it transmitted a fantastical message from the Barren Lands towards a place much, much further.","\"Risk assessment has been completed and is deemed Extreme. More Brigades are recommended to descend as soon as possible to cover all of spacetime continuum of the Barren Lands to quickly contain the enemy. Reevaluation of the level of danger is required as there are too many unknowns, with Reality itself exerting a great level of control.\"","WAA!","A True Empress spoke in such a cold tone as even after seamlessly eradicating Noah's clone, she didn't like how little information she could grasp with Karma as she relayed all of this and put her word and position at risk by stating that the risk was Extreme!","This would mean many more of their forces would have to be pulled out from the battlefront to descend as they would be tainted and weakened by the time they returned, but the consequences of the whole Desolate Mausoleum being unveiled would mean the tainting of all those originating from it as their Sources...all stemmed from this location!","No matter how hard they tried, they could not shatter this link- so they could only suppress it over the eons.","All that they had attained...could not be jeopardized at this moment as it made Katya relay this risk assessment.","She wanted many more bodies covering the Dimensions and Desolate Mausoleum as it seemed the enemy they faced was moving very quickly without giving anyone time.","When Katya came to this thought, her will flowed deeper into her Obsidian crystalline tool to see the remainings of the Quintessential Dimensional Emperor and what they could tell her...when she suddenly saw these remains were still vibrantly active with a consciousness that emanated a profound light of EPOCH!","\"You..!\"","BOOM!","Her will instantly crushed this light as her expression turned ugly.","An active consciousness had actually remained and gazed at her tool as what exactly did this being learn?!"]},{"number":2154,"title":"Chapter 2154: Chapter 2153 The Spread Of Cataclysm! I","paragraphs":["Verdant gold scales of an Imperial Karmic Scarab shone before the grand Pylon of Ascension as the antennas of this being could be seen vibrating with solemnity.","The existence she had killed actually had traces of his will still retaining itself when absorbed by her tool, and she didn't know how many things he had unveiled during that time!","Her expression was one of somberness and contemplation as her verdant gold antennas vibrated at the appearance of more auras in this location.","The Quantum Emperor appeared with a cold gaze as his white robe fluttered in space, CHARLEMAGNE and the remaining Mikado with him as the Emperor of the Quantum Realm was observing the contrast of the multicolored grandeur of half of the Quantum Empire starting at the Pylon of Ascension and the other half where fissures of NULLITY and nothingness permeated!","He gazed at the Lands he ruled that were halt destroyed as thereafter, he only turned towards True Empress Katya and spoke out.","<What now?>","HUUM!","The massive visage of the Imperial Karmic Scarab shone as the humanoid form of Katya returned.","<The remains to locate the displaced Dimension and this QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR. I've sent in a request for more bodies to cover all of spacetime as the most immediate thing right now is to support Carciel in the Apollyon Dimension. But Karma tells me I cannot leave the Pylon of Ascension currently, or we shall lose the most stable gateway to the Barren Lands. I've already informed the others- make way as quickly as you can.>","...!","Waves of Karma surged around Katya as she gazed at the hourglass structure of the Pylon of Ascension and its fantastical force.","Those around her nodded as a spatial light began to cover them, and they disappeared!","—","Crimson waves of heat and flames scorched the skies as on this day, bundles of massive white flames also appeared.","From the hands of Carciel, Aeonic Soul Power burned as he coldly faced ever increasing droves of Enders of Nature that appeared before the Quintessential Dimensional Emperor, the Singularity behind them expanding and swallowing with even more force as Carciel could already calculate that over half of the Apollyon Dimension was already devoured!","And the pace of devouring was only becoming faster as more and more regions were becoming blank voids of nothingness.","What was occurring now was extremely crucial for all as Reality itself held nothing back, the Draconian Qilin Phoenix backed by dozens of Enders of Nature as the Will of Reality knew...the pull of the Apollyon Dimension would mean even greater power and freedom for it.","So it had to succeed.","No matter what sacrifices had to be made.","SHIING!","The Enders of Nature surged towards the descending white flames as their bodies burned with Natural Laws, their power not being directed to stop the ridiculous flames that held enough Damage Values to wipe out Lifetimes- but instead using the opposition of laws to the concepts within the burning flames to restrict their power and the power that Carciel could display!","So it seemed like waves of multicolored essences of Natural Laws were emanating from the dozens of Enders that had surpassed a hundred at this point, their Sources burning to achieve what they wanted as behind them, Noah's Clones and Lilith did not tarry!","Noah's eyes had a bright expression as if he was lost in thought, his Main Body currently sorting through grand information that was obtained from the death of a True Sanguine Clone as his eyes gradually became more and more luminous.</novelsnext>","He then stared at the visage of Carciel and the round tool floating around him as a moment later...a spatial light surged around this being.","And his expression actually eased from the urgency he felt as beside him, three more existences clad in bone armaments appeared.","Their bodies billowed with power as the instant they arrived, Reality began to change as the situation turned extremely perilous!","The eyes filled with the secrecy of nature of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix became grave as the burning bodies of Enders of Polarity at the very forefront began to turn to ash, Enders of Gravitation taking their place as the immediate future looked grim!","Seconds.","This was all they needed before the Apollyon Dimension could be fully devoured with the mutual cooperation of the Source of this Dimension and the Pocket Dimensional Reality.","As the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality continued to elevate the strength of its Source with the constantly assimilated Realities, its features continued to elevate as every passing nanosecond- the pace of absorption became more and more domineering!","But with beings that could attack within nanoseconds, much less microseconds...seconds felt like days.","So the current mindset was grim for many...but not for one being.","Not for Noah!","His clones actually smiled brilliantly as they rose from the ends of the boundary of this Dimension, the eyes of the central clone having their pupils shine with vibrant luminosity as a voice of authority emanated from it!","<Epochal Radiation Emission>","...!","Another ability that rose from the Epochal Tri-Pupiled Eyes of Clarity.","And it was a grand one that caused Noah to smile so brilliantly at this moment!","<Epochal Radiation Emission>:: The Epochal Tri-Pupiled Eyes of Clarity can peer across veils of falseness, but this is not the extent of their power. In exchange for a third of your Aeonic Soul Value, it allows you to release an Epochal Authority that absolutely achieves its effects on the selected targets. This ability allows your eyes to release double the full extent of your strongest achievable Damage Value in the form of multi-target rays of Epochal Radiation. Everything falling under your gaze can be designated as the target, with the ability going even further to allow the achievable Absolute results of Epochal Radiation Emission to be designated to [Damage] or [Displacement]. Under the [Displacement] designation, no damage is dealt towards the chosen targets as instead, they are forcefully displaced from their current location to another location chosen by you. The cost of this ability will vary in the future depending on the strength of your Soul...","Yes.","In exchange for a third of his soul power, Noah could target all those falling under his gaze to release a multitarget attack that was twice the maximum damage he could currently achieve!","But...he didn't care about this Damage currently.","After all, it would not be enough to decimate the enemies before him.","What he wanted...was the feature of Displacement from Epochal Radiation Emission!","What would buy him a precious few seconds in order to fully devour the Apollyon Dimension!"]},{"number":2155,"title":"Chapter 2155: Chapter 2154 The Spread Of Cataclysm! II","paragraphs":["The pupils within his eyes shone with epochal brilliance.","A brilliance flashed within them at this moment that was equivalent to the brilliance of a lifetime for others!","Lilith gazed at such brilliance as she was absent minded.","This was the enemy that had torn down all that she held dear. All her goals over the past millions of years and the very empire she had built were seemingly destroyed within a matter of days, where even the very Apollyon Dimension was being unrooted at this very moment!","She had so much hatred towards those who did nothing in the last Age and the Ancestors who chose to abandon everything in this Age that she sought the seat of the True Emperor to gain a power to deny them.","Yet this being before her...why was he emanating such a level of power that could actually stand against the forces of Ancestors even before attaining the True Throne?","Why did he have everything that she wanted?","This was a passing thought in Lilith's mind as she expected everything to now come to an end even with all the power this being displayed, but he smiled in the face of impossible odds even as two more Ancestral Descendants appeared. He smiled as Lilith saw a scene that would be burned into her mind for however long her life remained.","She saw the stellar hair of this being dance wildly as his fair face glistened. His eyes...their pupils began to spin as if they were EPOCH Relics as they released a heart-shaking light that made Lilith's very source tremble, once more feeling that the damage output this being could release had doubled or tripled since just a few seconds ago.","It affirmed the thought she denied of this being somehow elevating in strength rapidly and within the span of seconds and hours ceaselessly!","And at this moment, his spinning eyes released a heavy and oppressive multicolored light that ripped apart reality itself, this ray of light multiplying into multiple rays an instant after as they nearly arrived before Carciel and the newly arriving Ancestral Descendants in the span of a fraction of a nanosecond.","\"Hmph.\"","And their disdain came as they saw it was a mighty and truly commendable attack that had somehow exceeded 1 Aeonic Damage Value.","But this was something they could handle.","BZZZT!","Their bodies shone with brilliance as their bone armaments alone released splendor at this moment, beginning to change as they turned malleable and covered even their faces with a fantastical glow of NULLITY.","The crimson skies of Apollyon cried out as the multicolored rays of light reached their targets an instant later, but something shocking occurred that left Lilith and the Enders of Nature sacrificing themselves baffled.","It even caused the Ancestral Descendants themselves to gaze with perplexity as the damaging rays of light that should have exploded into the bodies of their targets...they instead expanded into a multicolored circular glimmer of light that wrapped around them as an instant later...","WAP!","They disappeared.","...!","They had enacted barriers to defend themselves, but the damage never appeared!","Carciel's gaze had changed in the last moment as he discerned the true purpose of this radiated multicolored light, but it was too late as the region of space he was in and his whole body became carved out and displaced elsewhere!</novelsnext>","And it wasn't just the Ancestral Descendants as the multicolored rays of light also went towards the blazing white flames that were descending towards them, the light expanding to cover them as even they were displaced.","\"...\"","The situation changed drastically in a nanosecond as all enemies and even their attacks disappeared, the only thing left behind being the grandiosity of a single being that at this moment...acted like he had done nothing much while turning his attention to the Singularity that was devouring the Apollyon Dimension as from his three bodies, the dense golden Absolute Dream Authority began to torrentially erupt around him.","The authority to make dreams into reality.","It senselessly leaked from him in unbelievable amounts as the pace of the devouring of the Apollyon Dimension more than doubled through whatever effects this being's Will imposed, Lilith looking at all this with a blank gaze as she could still feel the same tyrannical Will still wrapping around her soul.","She had lost to this being.","She had lost as an Emperor before, but now she even lost in her Will as the past Dimensional Hellion Ruler felt inexplicable emotions amidst her rage and hatred this whole time!","She wanted to find a chance where her origin gained even slight freedom to end everything after losing so much, but her burning Hatred now told her...what if she stayed just long enough to see if this being could actually wipe out those that she hated so much. Even though she couldn't achieve it and was unreconciled even now, this unreasonable being might just be able to do it!","SHIING!","The glow of gold overflowed in torrential waves as Absolute Dream Authority went towards making a dream into reality, the Apollyon Dimension being swallowed with its last remaining dredges with the few seconds obtained as it was bound to be fully devoured by the surging singularity in the next 3 seconds.","As for the Ancestral Descendants?","They had been displaced to an unexpected location that would cause problems for many beings!","—","BOOM!","In the Northern Empyral Domain of Nature.","\"Fuck!\"","Carciel cursed as he felt the dense concentration of Natural Laws barreling down unto him, the circular tool beside him pulsing with grandiosity as it filtered most of the essence raging around them- the taint of Natural Laws ever so closely wrapping around his Source and restricting the strength he had built up over many years to the designated boundary of these laws!","The other Ancestral Descendants around him were in the same situation as even amidst all this, there were also Carciel's scorching flames that appeared behind them and raged down without an ounce of control","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor had achieved a myriad of results with a single move.","He sent the Ancestral Descendants to the Northern Empyral Domain of Nature where the concentration of Natural Laws was the highest apart from his own Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature!","Their power faced even greater limitations as Primordials now had a new issue to deal with!","At the same time, a precious few seconds were gained as it was enough for...the removal of a third Anchor!"]},{"number":2156,"title":"Chapter 2156: Chapter 2155 The Spread Of Cataclysm! III","paragraphs":["Spatial Instability and chaotic waves of the very fabric of Reality were torn.","Yet in the midst of all this, the aura of a being pierced its way through as his white robe fluttered with majesty.","His eyes were as vast as the blue seas as he tore apart the seams of space to tunnel across the spacetime continuum and appear in the Apollyon Dimension.","True Empress Katya had sent out the commands to reinforce the Apollyon Dimension as the Ancestral Descendants had arrived first, with others beginning to arrive now as at this juncture, the Quantum Emperor was the first to arrive!","But when his Will spread out to cover the vast expanse of space around him, he saw blankness and waves of NULLITY as very far from where he was...he glanced at a multicolored Singularity finishing devouring the last vestiges of space.","He saw the figures of Enders of Nature fading away as beside the pulsing Singularity that had devoured nearly all of the Apollyon Dimension...his eyes met with the existence that also turned towards his direction at this moment.","<...>","A clash of authority erupted from their gazes alone as CONSTANTINE fully analyzed this being before him after seeing that things were much too late.","A being that was stacking up achievements of Quintessence and even exceeding him in some areas to the extent that even with the help of Ancestors, the Quantum Emperor didn't have a title as distinguished as him. And with the appearance of Katya and other Ancestral Descendants that exceeded all common sense, he didn't even have the spotlight to show his own grandiosity as the genuine Emperor of this Age, this spot light being taken by this being instead.","Lesser beings would feel threatened.","But CONSTANTINE retained his confidence as his figure turned into a streak of pure light to close the distance between them, his grandeur emanating out as his voice blanketed everything.","<You do not understand the sheer consequences of your actions. You do not look at the larger picture at hand as how can you believe you are deserving of the True Throne?>","WAA!","His body released a unique power that was shockingly connected to an abstruse natural law very few beings grasped.","Even those at the stage of Lilith knew it and grasped it somewhat, but it was not to the extent of utilization!","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor smiled at his words as he affirmed the last vestiges of Apollyon had all but disappeared, his other Clones and Lilith already gone as he now watched the Pocket Dimensional Reality close, his voice ringing out grandly.","\"The only picture that matters is the one I am painting. The words of a being playing the role of Emperor after getting help from outside sources...they aren't ones I put much weight on!\"","Waves of Quintessence burned in the word of both beings as from CONSTANTINE, his blue eyes began to burn as a sea materialized behind him- a sea filled with an overabundance of natural laws as it threatened to crush everything before it!","And at this same period of time, in an extremely far away location- within the Blacksmith's Forge of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, a change bloomed.","The eyes of the clone facing the oncoming CONSTANTINE lit up brightly as they reflected a scene gazed upon by his Will in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, a scene that showed a particular Forge releasing glorious lights of incandescence.","Lights of completion!","Lights of a much awaited Relic.","Lights...of something with the grandeur of EPOCH!","The Clone saw this scene as his hands stretched out.","\"You came at the perfect time. I'll also give you the chance to experience True Quintessence and let you know just how far the gap between us is!\"","...!</novelsnext>","His hands beckoned.","And a dazzling stellar multicolored light bloomed as the grandeur of blue, crimson and silver were the most pervasive.","Over the eons, there were countless relics that were born and faded over the cruel passage of time.","Countless relics forged by renowned Blacksmiths over many Ages.","But never had there been a Relic that was born under such intricate and perfect conditions like this!","A Relic that was bathed with NULLITY and Mana. And then infused accidentally with the Descent of an Empyral Domain of Nature...it was something born out of pure dreams.","SHING!","Its details were already beginning to bloom in Noah's mind as before the dazzling light could even fade from his hands, it shot out towards the Quantum Emperor.","Obscenely fast.","This was the only thought that would occur when one saw this light that looked like a line cutting through space!","The line of light that had shot out...was a sword.","But it wasn't just any sword, with there being a chain at the end of the multicolored stellar hilt of this sword that was connected to another piece that also left Noah's hands at this moment!","It was ecstatic to see as fantastically, it was in the form of a crescent disk and giving off a holy glare of deadly light.","This crescent disk also left his hand...as he grasped onto the stellar chain that connected the two pieces.","He then began tugging on the chain as the path of the weapons connected to them began to speed up and flutter across the void of space faster than the attacks of anything achievable by the power of even peak Nature Integration existences!","It was so fast...that CONSTANTINE seemingly did not even react to it and in the next instant, the dazzling disk he couldn't even see passed through the midpoint of his body and crossed the dense blue sea behind him.","...!","It was a shocking and unexpected scene as it didn't even seem like an Innate Dimensional Barrier was enacted and broken when this shocking attack passed, with an even more unreasonable action occurring thereafter as the oppressive blue sea behind CONSTANTINE instantly faded as if it never existed!","But the Relic called out didn't stop here as with a being tugging upon their chain, both a stellar sword and a crescent disk seemed like countless sharp lines that tore apart even the void of space as they passed through CONSTANTINE's body countless times.","And each time they passed, they wondrously desegregated a law or decreta as by all means, it was a surreal reality for the Quantum Emperor!","But this being...continued gazing at everything coldly even as thin crimson gold lines began to appear all over his body, portions of his limbs and torso began to separate as he was truly cut into multiple pieces!","WAA!","A dark symphony played as the Eyes of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor turned solemn.","The eyes of the Quantum Emperor retained their grandiose confidence as a foreboding glimmer of light descended!"]},{"number":2157,"title":"Chapter 2157: Chapter 2156 The Spread Of Cataclysm! IV","paragraphs":["Noah's Will sent out a command as the lengthening chain that continued to expand and connect two weapons instantly retracted.","A fantastical Relic that had one side show the grandeur of a pristine sword easily surpassing the Sword of Avalon and another end that shine with a crescent disk that could instantly desegregate Nature Integration existences!","It had shown its shocking power today as by all means, the enemy before its master should have perished.","But Quintessential Treasure Cache never triggered.","Even while desegregated with one Vitality near the lowest, no prompt of loot came.","Only the cold gaze of the Quantum Emperor permeated as he only began to show a glimpse of his might!","A terrifying scene occurred in the next moment.","His cut apart limbs began to reconnect.","The allure of Natural Laws and Decreta he was desegregated from reformed as if it was only natural!","His different body pieces reconnected as if the very fabric of Reality was reversed, a unique essence permeating the surroundings as it held traces of an unknown and pristine Fundamental Natural Law!","\"Interesting.\"","Noah's eyes twinkled with light at this as his gaze turned towards a far away direction where a spatial light flashed, the figures of Carciel and other Ancestral Descendants being seen once again.","\"Is this your construct that exceeds others in the aspect of Quintessence?\"","Noah spoke nonchalantly as his body already began to fade, his Will and voice being the only thing remaining as he formed a devilish smile while he disappeared.","\"It shall not remain Quintessential too much longer.\"","WAP!","Leaving behind these words, he disappeared.","And right after Carciel and other Ancestral Descendants appeared in the surroundings with gazes of anger as they gazed at the blank void of nothingness!","The reformed CONSTANTINE retained his cold look as he spoke out even while in the midst of such beings.","<The location of the displaced Dimension is one full of potent concentration of Natural Laws. We need every single available force scouring the Desolate Mausoleum->","\"No.\"","...!","A golden-haired woman adorned in bone armaments beside Carciel spoke with a rough expression.","\"The main goal is to not let a repeat of this Dimension occur. No more Anchors can be pulled as we have to designate forces in the remaining 6 Anchors. True Empress Katya has requested for more forces that will be more than enough to cover the Desolate Mausoleum. We...cannot face a humiliation like this again!\"","Words filled with power emanated out as one by one, the Ancestral Descendants began to disappear, leaving behind just the Quantum Emperor as not too long after, the visage of CHARLEMAGNE, Mikados, and a few others began to appear here.","\"Sire.\"</novelsnext>","These powerful Rulers gave looks of respect towards CONSTANTINE while gazing with grimness at their surroundings, the beings they were eating homage to nodding as his voice echoed out mesmerizingly.","<User our forces to scour the Desolate Mausoleum. If we can find him, all this comes to a stop. Focus wherever there is a large cluster of natural laws or Enders of Nature...>","Commands began to be given as waves of Destiny and Providence swirled with maddening fervor.","The cerulean eyes of the Quantum Emperor turned and gazed into the unknown, his pupils reflecting countless golden lines at this moment as he continued!","<As for me, I will look for traces across the Myriad Parallel Paths...>","A sense of awe and grandeur rose from him as for the sake of all beings and a brighter future, he moved to apprehend a being that he believed did not fully fathom the consequences of his actions!","—","The Desolate Mausoleum trembled as one could almost hear a roar of freedom echoing out across its depths.","Natural Laws intensified in concentration and power as Reality became ever so stronger, but this wasn't the only thing that had happened in this period of time as even in the Desolate Mausoleum itself...there were regions where deathly gray fissures of NULLITY stretched out for light years as thousands of Reality fell!","Entropy surged with glory as one could sense the path towards Cataclysm...was only accelerating.","But it wasn't just limited to the Desolate Mausoleum.","Across all 6 remaining Dimensions that Ancestral Descendants had been deployed, fissures of NULLITY carrying the quality of nothingness spread out as the truly powerful beings came to see the auras of Ancestral Descendants carrying out...controlled destruction and Apocalypse.","Paced and controlled Cataclysm as they had a terrifying end goal in mind!","In the bounds of the Prana Dimension.","Beautiful verdant lights covered everything as vegetation and trees that had lived for eons...were wilting in some areas.","All this and more was captured in the eyes of an aged man that floated across the verdant plains of life, watching the gray fissures spreading from afar as this was the most powerful existence in the Prana Dimension- Albus!","After the dissolution of the Dimensional Conclave, he and many others used the chance to retreat amidst the chaos of unreasonable power as they now returned to their homes to see the controlled destruction occurring!","The eyes of Albus were filled with an exuberant life force as he opened his palm at this moment, a flower blooming on it that showed an illusory scene at its very center.","It was the image of the Connate Avalonian Sacred Beast, Guinevere that had sent him a message not too long ago.","A message of possible salvation for not just his Dimension, but all others.","What one needed to do was to just take a leap of faith!","<What do you think, old friend?>","His body sank onto the gorgeous lush Lands below him as his Will connected with the Dimension.","With the Source of Prana!","There were many unknowns in the future to come, but at this moment as the Dimensions entered an accelerated path towards Cataclysm, a silent helping hand was reaching out in an unprecedented move as even with the unreasonable power displayed by beings exceeding all boundaries of power...the result was still unpredictable!"]},{"number":2158,"title":"Chapter 2158: Chapter 2157 You All Are Weak! I","paragraphs":["Many things could be changed with the hands of men, but time was not one of them.","No matter what one did, time would eventually continue to flow!","Even though a level of controlled and accelerated destruction began across the Barren Lands, time flowed on.","Even though a third Anchor that suppressed the Desolate Mausoleum was removed...time flowed on!","But over the passage of time, many changes could occur as hours after the cataclysmic Dimensional Conclave ended, a level of calm seemed to have settled in on the face of the ongoing Apocalypse.","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality was the place of most calm across all other locations at this moment, with a shocking number of experts within it settling and planning as right now, yet another Conclave was in the process to begin.","The Lands of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality were unique as when one looked at it as a distant observer, they would see the golden layer of the Dream Dimension with its gorgeous waves of sandy light serving as a vast plane at the very bottom, with the royal purple light of Avalon being right above it as countless idyllic floating land masses and purple Cosmos with waterfalls dripping down stretched out across the stellar Lands.","At the top of the Avalon Dimension, a massive purple sword floated with grandiosity as it drenched the Lands below with dense particles of profound light.","And above this, the Crimson light of the newly pulled and reconstructed Apollyon Dimension could be seen as pillars of magma-filled light and crimson cosmos calmly gravitated with grandeur- dense Seas of multicolored essence permeating throughout this Dimension and the one below it!","And then above these three reestablished Dimensions...were an ever increasing cluster of Cosmos that had far surpassed hundreds of millions.","A terrifying feat as Noah had remained in the Infinite Dream pulling more and more Realities to assimilate into the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality for so long- not allowing the Dream to end until he actually felt a strain on his soul!","Only then did he stop it as he had to be in the best possible state if any emergencies arose- with the future seeming like it was heavily leaning towards the direction of the strength of one's soul when the concept of Aeonic Soul Value rose.","And after Noah had gazed upon the unique tool that True Empress Katya and all Ancestral Descendants had- a tool that was actually designed by the Ancestors who had first stepped foot outside the Barren Lands in order to allow them to filter out and refine all types of authorities among other uses...he grasped an idea on exactly what type and methodology of power these beings used that was centered around one's Soul...around their Aeonic Soul Value!","His own Soul continued to strengthen to ever greater levels as all the countless existences in the hundreds of millions of Cosmos that had recently joined paid homage to him and gave up portions of their souls.","He also continued to undergo constant refinements from the Natural Laws and Decreta he had, as well as the established Dimensional Realities in his Origin that continued to shine with utmost splendor!","Many things were occurring as in this period of calm where everyone was unsure about the future, only Noah was seeing multiple steps and Paths that could be taken, with many things being completed.ραпdα `n?ν?| сom</novelsnext>","Because of the uncertainty of the future and many other things, a Conclave was beginning in the very center of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality- in the Lands that used to be Noah's old home to be exact!","The stretched-out landmass that used to be the blue planet had changed so drastically that the very earth and skies of these lands pulsed with the Essence of Natural Laws, serene seas of condensed essences swirling across the beautiful skies filled with all sorts of unique Spiritual Beasts.","Towards the center of these lands, three radiant white gold pedestal banquet tables could be seen floating in the skies as two ran in parallel, with the third one standing perpendicular to them as this grand banquet table had the vibrant Throne of Quintessential Tyranny at its very center!","These tables weren't lined with mere seats as radiant thrones could be seen alongside the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny and on the two long banquet tables running alongside each other on the other side.","Tables that had the astounding auras of multiple Dimensional Rulers talking amongst each other while staring at the golden inlaid plates and chalices filled to the brim with stellar drinks pulsing with the Essence of Providence!","This, alongside multicolored fruits releasing waves of the Essence of many Natural Laws caused for a fantastical and never before scene of grandiosity to play out.","Guinevere sat on the seat closest to the perpendicular table where Noah's empty throne could be seen, the Avalonian Dimensional Rulers extending to their own thrones to her left while the Dream Dimensional Rulers were on the other parallel banquet table sitting with regality.","Many of their eyes would at times move away from the incandescent banquet tables and gaze at a point in the skies where a single figure floated like a guard who was protecting this banquet, this guard being none other than The Dimensional Hellion Ruler, Lilith!","Alongside her, radiantly gold Dream Automatons stood in rows as they seemed to serve much more of a decoration than anything else.","Lilith's gaze showed no emotions as one could still see vibrant rage and hatred hidden in her eyes, her presence being something very few could fathom as the Old Dreamer shook his head while watching this scene and spoke out to The Longest Dream.","<If you told me a few days ago that I would be sitting alongside all Dream Dimensional Rulers and Avalon Dimensional Rulers side by side while the Dimensional Deceiver stood watch as a guard...I would've recommended you dream more realistic things.>","WAA!","Yes!","Surreal things were occurring at this moment as apart from the Dream Dimensional Rulers, the perpendicular banquet table that faced all of them had began to fill up its thrones as the exceedingly beautiful figures of Adelaide, Eowyn, Barbatos, Athena, and many others appeared!","They talked amongst each other while gazing at the Rulers with curiosity, but not an ounce of fear or apprehension could be seen as they were also studied by the powerful Nature Integration Realm existences!"]},{"number":2159,"title":"Chapter 2159: Chapter 2158 You All Are Weak! II","paragraphs":["Eowyn took the Throne to the right of the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny as she sat down and sighed while looking at her father from afar and the rest of the Dimensional Rulers, where even though she was among those who saw exactly how all of this happened, even she couldn't believe it.","pαndα`noν?1~сoМ To the left of the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny, the regal visage of Queen Adelaide could be seen as she retained a glorious bearing amidst all of this, where even the Rulers noticed the preferential treatment she was receiving as all others were extremely polite in talking to her or meeting her gaze with nods of respect!","This was, after all, the only woman to bear the progeny of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor at this moment.","Her status was special as The Longest Dream raised his brows at seeing his daughter sit in a similar seat as this being.","Everyone was adorned in intricate dresses and glimmering robes, others adorned in sleek suits as beings like Ezekiel, Kazuhiko, and the Oathkeeper were on the far ends of the thrones adorned in such a manner.","Little Henry was floating on the Throne beside his mother as he was adorned in simple sleek white pants and a loose shirt, his visage looking regal and wild as he truly seemed like a Child of Destiny- his face carrying ridiculous handsomeness!","There were many other beings who all sat and talked amongst each other as they waited for a single being.","For the one man who made all of this possible!","HOONG!","A tantalizing symphony began to play at this juncture as if it was announcing the arrival of someone utterly high in status.","Booming horns blew and drums of power and victory played as above the skies of this ethereal place filled with Seas of multicolored essence, one being appeared as he wasn't alone.","Behind him, 8 other existences releasing even more majestic waves of power appeared as they gave off an inexplicable feel!","8 Clones that looked just like him in grandeur and glory appeared as seven of them were adorned in stellar robes burning with their own unique colors.","They each gave off an aura of a different Dimension as they displayed one of the Dimensional Layers Noah had forged apart from Fantasia and Elysium!","7 of the Dimensional Chassis and 1 True Sanguine Clone came with Noah as he floated towards his throne with grandiosity, 2 other Clones not here as they were still playing their roles as Alexander King with the Primordials and the clone in the Mirror Dimension.","Noah himself was adorned in black and white Emperor's robes as his solidified crown and throne of authority shone radiantly above him, and behind his body...there was something that caused the hearts of the Rulers here to feel a tremendous sense of suffocation!","It floated immediately behind Noah as it was an incandescent blade whose hilt constantly changed colors, its actual blade shining with sharpness as auras of silver-gray and blue radiated around it.","Below the hilt of this blaze, a massive crescent disk leaking out pure white and blue grandeur could be seen as this weapon gave off an aura of ancientness and age!","An aura of EPOCH that nobody here had yet to truly experience!","Such a Relic floated behind Noah along with his Clones as his main body magisterially sat upon the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny, the Relic and Clones floating behind him with utmost glory as everyone in the surrounding quieted.","The serene waves of essence were the only thing making sounds as all eyes were focused on him and him alone, his face shining with majesty as he laid back on his throne while staring at some of the most powerful beings in these lands.","Thereafter, his voice began to resonate as the symphony of horns and drums faded into the background.ραпdα `n?ν?| сom</novelsnext>","\"Some of you here know me by one name or another, and some may not know me at all.\"","WAA!","As he spoke, he didn't just gaze at the thrones holding Avalon and Dream Dimensional Rulers, he gazed at other thrones that had illusory images of existences not in this place!","On one throne on the banquet table of the Avalon Dimensional Rulers, the illusory image of Albus from the Prana Dimension could be seen.","In another, the Seeker of Knowledge from the Elysium Dimension could be seen as these were the only two- with no representatives for Fantasia, Quantum, Niflheim, and Mirror present!","Albus and the Seeker of Knowledge had a limited view of the things they heard and saw as Noah took any and all extra precautions just in case, his eyes sharp as he continued.","\"I am Noah Osmont, the Quintessential Kainos Emperor...the one that will stand above other Emperors in this Age of Quintessence.\"","HUUM!","Majesty pulsed and emanated all around as his domineering voice continued!","\"But who I am does not matter. What does matter is what I can do in the face of destruction and Apocalypse...and what the rest of you can do as everything is steered towards Cataclysm.\"","...!","\"Unreasonably powerful enemies have come and will continue to come, and all Sources of strength are required to stand against them.\"","His voice carried a commanding tone and grandeur even as he talked to beings that had lived for billions of years, Barbatos being among others who raised their heads high with smiles on their faces at this scene!","\"I was able to save the Dream and Avalon Dimensions with the help of those who listened, and I took Apollyon by force before destruction could overwhelm it. Now, other Dimensions are on the path of an accelerated destruction as the same beings who caused this...will be present to oversee this destruction and prevent any chance of salvaging them. This...is where the strength and power to stand against unreasonable beings is required. But you all...do not have that strength.\"","...!","The atmosphere changed.","Albus's old eyes shone with solemnity as the Seeker of Knowledge released a radiant light of providence!","\"You all are weak...only watching as these unreasonable and unbeatable enemies raze your homes to the ground.\"","Straightforward words of truth emanated out, with the pupils of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor shining with glory as finished with utmost regality!","\"You are weak, yes, but I...can offer you a path to overcome this weakness and at least give you a fighting chance to defend your homes and everything from destruction.\"","The Essence of Tyranny and Conquest surged with torrential waves that were directed at none other than the Dimensional Rulers!"]},{"number":2160,"title":"Chapter 2160: Chapter 2159 EPOCH! I","paragraphs":["You are all weak!","Such a statement was uttered out as immense silence descended, not a single Dimensional Ruler being able to say anything as this was truly the case.","Morgana was among the few who clenched her fists in silence while not being able to say anything, the current reality being so different compared to just days ago when they reigned as the peak of power.","But the rankings of power underwent a great change the moment that Ancestral Descendants began coming down!","Average Nature Integration Realm existences couldn't even grasp their feet.","Dimensional Hellion Rulers and the strongest Dimensional Rulers could only possibly withstand them for mere seconds!","So the words of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor reigned true as thereafter, he told them he could grant them a path to overcome their weaknesses and actually contribute to this unwinnable fight.","His pupils shone with a glint of Tyranny as he continued.","\"There is no need for flowery words or going about it in a roundabout way...the path to strength for you all is Fealty.\"","WAA!","The Throne and crown far above him released rays of authority.","Conquest and Tyranny reigned as while he sat on the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny, he tapped his hands while emanating his Will.","\"I can continue to fight this war alone with you all watching from the sidelines, or you can join in by pledging fealty and achieving sufficient strength to actually fight back against your enemies.\"","...!","He pointed to the Clones behind him as he continued.","\"You can learn my techniques for making many disposable bodies and Clones so you can participate without fear, and each one of you...can be fitted with weapons that can withstand NULLITY, or even relics exceeding the Barren Lands similar to what The Empress pulled out- the allure of EPOCH! All of this and more, the choice is yours.\"","The Essence of Tyranny mixed in with Quintessential Authority as it bloomed around the Dimensional Rulers here.","Before their eyes, a prompt rose as even these pristine and powerful beings that had lived for billions of years were asked in simple terms...","<Will you pledge Fealty to the Quintessential Kainos Emperor?>","A point of no return.</novelsnext>","A line that one had to decide whether to cross or not as they left behind their distinguished titles as Emperors to become vassals of another!","All for the promise of power and weapons that could actually be utilized to stand against the powerful enemies.","Weapons born from MANANIUM and NULLINIUM!","Noah could say this with confidence due to nothing else but the wonders of a new EPOCH Relic he had gained.","An EPOCH Relic...and its capability to multiply Loot.","While the Dimensional Rulers before him were given the chance to make a life defining choice, Noah's eyes reviewed the details of the highest tier Relic he had forged yet!","EPOCH II <Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence>:: A Relic born from sequences of advancements until it reached a pinnacle. Its formation was influenced by materials outside the boundary of the fabric of Reality as well as Quintessential materials at the very pinnacle of the fabric of Reality, giving way to a hybrid that both supersedes Reality and is still supported by it. It still retains its roots and abilities from its prior state, alongside additional features making it worthy of its standing as a Second Rank Epochal Relic that could dictate the direction of an EPOCH. Two parts were assimilated into one to bring the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence into fruition, where the one binding this Relic is granted +50,000% Augmentation to All True Parameter Values passively in its current stage of EPOCH II. The features of <Epochal Decuplicate>, <Emperor's Epochal Armament Replication>, <Quintessential Erasure>, and <Empyral Domain of Disorder> are currently unlocked and usable. The assimilation of more materials and relics into the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence shows a possibility of elevating the rank of this EPOCH Relic past the second boundary....","Decuplicate.","Armament Replication.","These were just some of the new and ridiculous features of what RUINATION used to be as now...it was something utterly impossible to understand.","Impossible to understand as its features were just that overbearing!","<Epochal Decuplicate>:: Amongst the auxiliary features of the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence, Decuplicate stands at the very top as it grants the capability to multiply some conceptual ideas, understanding of concepts, and items. The cost to Decuplicate depends on the selected targets as after an initial cost to activate of 200 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality, it may require an additional thousandth of your Aeonic Soul Value or 100% of all of your Aeonic Soul Value. Across the epochs, many concepts and items are capable of undergoing the process of Epochal Decuplicate, while some concepts and items cannot undergo this process no matter what. It is up to the Quintessential Kainos Emperor to grasp the mysteries himself...","<Emperor's Epochal Armament Replication>:: Apart from achieving the capability to Decuplicate certain concepts and items, the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence establishes its authority as a True EPOCH II Relic with the capability of Decuplicating itself and its authority, giving birth to 10 EPOCH I [False Epochal Blades of Quintessence] that can be utilized to those bound to the Quintessential Kainos Emperor. A False Epochal Blade of Quintessence grants half the capabilities of a Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence. This ability costs 200 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality and a Hundredth of your Aeonic Soul Value to cast and keep Active for a minute...","...!","Yes!","It was these abilities among others that made Noah confident in greatly elevating the power of the Rulers before him to at least the level of Lilith if not exceeding this!","Epochal Decuplicate promised grand possibilities as all his Loot could be multiplied by 10, and this wasn't all as he could now even do this for the Understanding of Concepts or even Concepts themselves!","He didn't grasp how the Decuplication of concepts fully worked as this would be a surprise for the future to come, but even Epochal Decuplicate was only a single ability to be born out of all this.","The <Emperor's Epochal Armament Replication>...was even more balance-breaking!"]},{"number":2161,"title":"Chapter 2161: Chapter 2160 EPOCH! II","paragraphs":["He could adorn 10 Existences with EPOCH Relics as the extent of power they could release would at least be able to defend against the Tyranny of the Ancestral Descendants.","This power was just one among the many things that Noah had that made him confident in saying the things he did.","In making these extremely powerful beings pledge fealty as they left their roles as Emperors to become Vassals!","The serene and beautiful atmosphere was silent as waves of radiant seas of essence were the only things that could be heard.","Destiny and Providence swirled with magnificence as it didn't take too long after the prompt rose before the eyes of the Dimensional Rulers for some to already make the choice.","And uniquely, the first one to do so was actually none other than Guinevere as she understood Noah the most out of all other Rulers here!","A glimmer of light shone from her as a thin line shot out from her to Noah, her eyes being covered by a royal purple light as she nodded towards him calmly while her voice emanated out.","<You kept your end of the bargain and saved Avalon, and you are the only one with the capability of saving other Anchors while standing against the Ancestors that have abandoned us. I have a great deal of pride, yes, but I know what to do when an obvious path of destruction or salvation lies before me.>","WAA!","Her voice was mesmerizing to hear as it wasn't just meant for Noah.","It reverberated in the minds of all Rulers here as this exceedingly beautiful being that stood over the top of Avalon gave a nod of recognition while allowing the Essence of the Quintessential Tyranny to enter her very source!","<I commend you for being the Emperor that rose above others to have reached this point in this Age...and I hope this is not the highest you can reach. Not just for your sake, but for the sake of us all...>","Incandescence bloomed from her as she became the first to pledge fealty, her eyes still showing the same regality and coldness as she seemed to be thinking a million thoughts when she finished her words- her eyes bright as she sat back down on her throne!","Noah gave back this nod of respect as he then turned to stare coldly at all the rest, his eyes particularly resting on Morgana as if he wanted to watch every passing nanosecond that she fought with her heart before she made the inevitable choice.","The words of Guinevere still resounded in their minds as after her choice was made...","<I'm truly getting too old for this...>","The Dreamer of Providence sighed as he accepted the light of Tyranny to wrap around his body as well!","The Longest Dream stared towards Eowyn and etched the dazzling golden hair of his daughter into his eyes, seeing her expression towards him as while staring deep into her eyes, this being also accepted the light of Tyranny!","One by one, brilliant radiance shone on all the Dream Dimensional Rulers as thereafter, the figures of the Avalon Dimensional Rulers began to illuminate.","Arthus gave a glance to his son from afar as his body glowed with the light of Tyranny, with Noah's eyes still focused on Morgana coldly as with her lips trembling at this inevitable choice...even this utter beauty had to pledge fealty as the tyrannical light sank into her as well!","A smile rose from Noah's lips at this as even while pledging fealty, Morgana still gazed towards him with a light of defiance in her eyes as with her...all the Rulers present truly took the unheard of stop to pledge fealty to a single being of Age.","The illusory screens that showed Albus from the Prana Dimension and the Seeker of Knowledge from Elysium glimmered as the latter had tendrils of Providence swirling around her, her voice strong as it emanated out across spacetime.","<I trust in Providence...and anyone that has bound its Source is one who is worthy to lead us. All of the Elysium will heed your call.></novelsnext>","WAA!","Waves of utmost glory whipped as it lastly came to one of the oldest beings here- Albus gazing at the scenes he could from a distinct location in the Prana Dimension as his aged eyes seemed tired.","Tired, and yet full of light as he turned to stare at the expanse of verdant greenery around him and the far away rifts of NULLITY spreading out.","<Emperors rise and fall...I have seen this many times over the Ages.>","His voice was filled with life as he spoke, all Wills gathering to listen as it seemed tendrils of wisdom were flowing out!","<I have seen it many times, but I have yet to see an Emperor denying the Will of the Ancestors. I am curious to see whether you will be successful when even Reality itself could not deny their Will.>","...!","HOONG!","His words were boisterous as even the fabric of Reality itself seethed at their provocation!","But the choice in his words was clear as across the folds of space, Noah's will shot out as his eyes focused on this being- his essence of Tyranny landing on Albus as this being also accepted it!","An existence so old and with power that even matched CHARLEMAGNE was also bound to become his Vassal as he took many Emperors under his banner today!","And it was a worthy feat.","It was a notable one.","Back in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, his Main Body sitting on the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny experienced a shocking rise in aura potency and authority as the very Essence of Quintessence began to spin with torrential wildness around him.","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","<A significant percentage of the most powerful existences within the Age of Quintessence has been achieved!>","<The backbone of your Throne is going towards completion!>","<The True Throne of Quintessence is beginning to call out to you!>","...!"]},{"number":2162,"title":"Chapter 2162: Chapter 2161 EPOCH! III","paragraphs":["<The True Throne of Quintessence is beginning to call out to you!>","...!","Such a prompt rose as in this Age...Noah had truly done a great deal of Quintessential feats.","And he had done all of them in a ridiculously short period of time!","In other Ages, it took a range of millions to billions of years for a True Emperor to be decided after one had accumulated enough authority. But in the Age of Quintessence, the True Throne of Quintessence was already calling out to Noah after not even 2 weeks had passed since the Age officially began.","<...>","Truly Quintessential!","Truly standing out as exemplary among others!","The multicolored waves of essence serenely flowed in the skies as above Noah, his body was getting washed over by incandescent radiance while even more changes continued to his power.","In the last few hours that had passed since he fully assimilated the Apollyon Dimension and his first encounter with the Ancestral Descendants ended, many things were accomplished up until now as Noah continued his elevation in a ceaseless fashion.","Since RUINATION still had retained all her prior abilities in addition to the newly unlocked abilities after it became the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence, the first thing Noah had done was to Decuplicate all of his Loot!","It took a great deal of his Resources, but his Reserves of the Essence of Reality alone were inflated to ridiculous levels as 200 Billion Units was not an issue, with the Aeonic Soul Value being paid by him as his soul recovered from the strain of Infinite Dream.","In this sense- he had to first quantify his Aeonic Soul Value and how quickly it regenerated to keep track of just how things were changing when he cast abilities that utilized a thousandth or a tenth of his Aeonic Soul Value.","As for the Units of the Essence of Reality...Noah's Heart of Mana came into the picture.","It had detailed before that it would rise in capability along with Noah's own power, and the number of Units it provided for him to cast his abilities without paying a single thing...it had risen more than a hundred fold.","More than a hundred fold as Manadynamics became stronger after a third Anchor was pulled, and Noah had also managed to seamlessly bind the Sources of Entropy and Relativity in addition to Manadynamics and Providence in terms of Natural Laws!","His power had truly risen greatly as many changes unfolded, one of the many being his Heart of Mana now being able to fully cover the cost of any ability that required Units of the Essence of Reality exceeding 500 Billion!","So he freely utilized Epochal Decuplicate.","122,000 All Source Enhancers became 1,220,000!","500,000 Ingots of MANANIUM became 5,000,000","100,000 NULLITY Pearls became 1,000,000!","His Pure Quintessential Natural Decretum Seeds which had been reduced to 12 before he attained the upgraded RUINATION were multiplied to 120!","This and more under the process of Epochal Decuplicate as Noah began building his reserves to explode with even greater power for the coming enemies.","And all this was just a glimpse as it was before Noah opened the Quintessential Treasure Cache stemming from the Supreme Pontiff along with the Randomized Loot Crates he had obtained from the other Dimensional Rulers!","These were just some of his achievements in the last few hours.</novelsnext>","All the Decreta that correlated to his 7 established Dimensional Layers were brought from 50% to 100% if they didn't already have a full understanding.","Integrated Laws included Manadynamics, Providence, Entropy, and Relativity so far as Noah was cautious of binding more Sources.","And in the midst of all this, a significant number of Emperors of this Age pledged their Fealty to Noah.","So now while the dense aura of Quintessence swirled around him, he vibrant eyes wanted to exceed in all aspects of Quintessence as he thought about the one area he was deficient in.","The Infinite Forge that was ranked second best in terms of a Construct in this Age.","Noah's Will gazed at this as he sent out a command.","\"Utilize 500,000 All Source Enhancers on the Infinite Forge.\"","...!","HOONG!","A mountain of radiant loot in his Expansive Space began to disappear and sink into the Epitaph at the depths of his soul.","He could have jumped to utilizing all 1.22 Million All Source Enhancers, but he felt like even just half of these would grant him unrivaled Quintessence of constructs in this Age!","And even this number was overdoing it!","This process began with vibrant eruptions of grandiosity as while it continued, Noah focused on the prompt of the True Throne of Quintessence calling out to him.","His vibrant eyes closed as he sought the source of the pull, everything around him slowing down as even the consciousnesses of the Rulers gazing towards him seemed to have stopped.","The spacetime continuum froze as the Quintessential Kainos Emperor sought the calling of Quintessence!","In this frozen time, tendrils of multicolored essence bloomed and stretched out beautifully from no other area but...above and behind Noah.","From the backbone of the Throne that had his solidified crown above it.","SHIIING!","It released an utterly glorious cry as this backbone of a throne...was what had begun to call out to him.","It was the Throne of Authority that he had been building this whole time.","Others were enacting their own thrones with their Authority as Emperors of this Age, but none had gotten to the point of the True Throne of Quintessence calling out to them!","Noah focused on this calling and wanted to pull the authority of this throne closer, but just like the statement stated...it had just begun to call towards him.","There was still a portion of authority yet to be achieved as for this, Noah waited for the elevation of the Construct of the Infinite Dream to finish and attain Quintessence in this aspect as well.","At that point, no being would be able to say they stood above him or excelled in anything more than him in this Age!"]},{"number":2163,"title":"Chapter 2163: Chapter 2162 EPOCH! IV","paragraphs":["Time began to flow once more.","Noah's soul felt robust as it pulled upon the strength of existences that had lived for billions of years, the blinding light of Conquest building up to even greater levels as his eyes opened.","HUUM!","The fabric of Reality resonated with him as a significant portion of its Fundamental Natural Laws were bound to him, his very gaze carrying immense pressure and power as he stared at all those that could now be considered his vassals!","Then, the glorious relic floating behind him shone while rising to the highest point of the multicolored skies, his voice echoing out grandly.","<Emperor's Epochal Armament Replication>","...!","Droves of the Essence of Reality were pumped from his Heart as the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence released a piercing cry.","Then, a portion of Noah's very soul shone and released its power as a Hundredth of his Aeonic Soul Value was utilized to cast and keep this ability active for the next minute!","But...even though he hasn't fully quantified his Aeonic Soul Value, his rate of Regeneration far exceeded a Hundredth of his soul within a single minute as this balance breaking ability to produce 10 EPOCH I Relics from the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence could passively be kept active for as long as Noah wished.","HOOONG!","The allure of white and crimson was blinding as even the Rulers squinted their eyes, gazing up to see glorious multicolored Blades connected to a crescent disk below their hilts appearing en masse.","They bloomed with wonder as in a mere instant, 10 False Epochal Blades of Quintessence began to weave across space and surge towards specific Dimensional Rulers!","The first one appeared before Guinevere as to her and all the other Rulers, it felt like a terrifying being appeared before them and not even a Relic.","Yet the False Epochal Blade of Quintessence washed an austere light of grandeur towards her as she reached out and grasped its hilt- tendrils of light wrapping around her fingers and traveling up her fair skin as they sank into her body with radiance.","She felt her power rising in a shocking manner as her red lips trembled, releasing an unexpected bellow as beams of purple light illuminated from her eyes!","<YAA!>","Power.","This was what she felt as unlike Noah who received +50,000% Augmentations to All True Parameter Values, she received +25,000% as even this was equivalent to the understanding and integration of multiple laws or decreta!","She wasn't the only one to receive this honor as False Epochal Blades of Quintessence appeared before Eowyn, the Dreamer of Providence, and Longest Dream from the side of the Dream Dimension- each of them grasping the blades and feeling the tremendous rise of power as well as the features they could utilize, their hearts shaking with amazement and incredulity at the possibilities of an EPOCH Relic.","Another two False Epochal Blades of Quintessence flowed towards Arthus and Morgana, with another floating towards a position not even close to the magisterial banquet tables and thrones as it floated towards the lone figure of the Dimensional Deceiver who was at a distance!","Her identity and power as a Dimensional Hellion Ruler were unique as she could reach over 100 Quadrillion Damage Values in her peak state, and with an EPOCH I Relic that further boosted her power...she was bound to be one of the more powerful combatants aside from one other being.","A being that from the verdant fields he was just in, a spatial light wrapped around him as with his connection to the Quintessential Kainos Emperor, he could seamlessly be transported from the Prana Dimension and into the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality without fear.","It was Albus who began to materialize in the location of this grand meeting, his visage appearing first as the same thing occurred to the Seeker of Knowledge who appeared right after!","Their gazes were those of somberness and a contained surprise as they gazed at everything around them, seeing the EPOCH I Relics floating towards them as they accepted them with grace.</novelsnext>","The Seeker of Knowledge in particular had a holy white gold light surrounding her as it seemed like she was accepting a holy Relic, the light of Elysium shining gloriously around her!","With this, 9 EPOCH I Relics were given out as a single one remained.","A single one...that flashed with a spatial light and disappeared, its path going towards the Mirror Dimension.","In that location, there was another Dimensional Hellion Ruler whose body was taken over by the Will of a Usurper- a fantastical weapon being chosen to head his way as all beings had a part to play!","\"Resonate with your Relics and understand its features. Visit the Soul Library to attain the recommended skill trees and delve into the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature. If you are close to completing your understanding of any law or decreta, let me know and I will aid in your completion.\"","WAA!","Noah's voice emanated out amidst all this as his main body and a few Clones began to disappear, tasks being given out to some as his Will continued.","\"The others can follow a Clone into the Blacksmith's Forge to voice out what design you want for weapons and armaments born from MANANIUM and NULLINIUM...\"","Noah addressed those who hadn't received EPOCH Relics as it was many of the Avalon Dimensional Rulers, the surroundings getting busy as his Will left behind his last set of words.","\"Prepare for a war that is nearly impossible for us to win, but it is one that we must win regardless. Destiny is murky as even Providence shows what lies ahead is abysmal. Even if you do not believe in yourself, believe in the power I show as I...do not plan to lose!\"","HUUUM!","His Haki resonated out for light years as what needed to be delegated was delegated, his Throne of Quintessential Tyranny lying empty as his main body and a few Clones entirely disappeared from this banquet.","They had another task to complete!","Waves of spatial light emanated out as his main body and 3 Clones were carried across the folds of space and into the center of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, dense waves of Natural Laws that were even greater in concentration than before surging around him as his Main Body and Clones floated with silent grandiosity as they gazed forward.","They floated in this radiant region of space silently as they waited!","This was because among the methods of elevating one's power that Noah had just shared with his vassals, he provided an extra option to a few specific beings that wished for an even larger boost.","It was something unique as Noah couldn't freely make it available to everyone- it was the pathway of Dual Cultivation with Quintessential techniques that he had perfected! Techniques that would boost one's realm and understanding of concepts at the very least, and especially so when done on the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature!","Noah had given this as an option to others as those who chose to take it would be appearing before him soon after.","WAP!","And in a flash of light, the first being to appear was Eowyn who already knew of the benefits after regaining all her power and escaping her shackles.","Her golden hair danced with the surging essence in the surroundings as her fair hands twirled with the dense essences of Natural Laws, a smile of exasperation on her face at seeing Noah's bodies as in the surroundings- a few more flashes of light bloomed!","The astounding visage of the Connate Avalonian Sacred Beast- Guinevere, appeared with glory as soon after, Morgana and the Seeker of Knowledge made their appearance as well!","More flashes of light continued to bloom soon after as the Quintessential Kainos Emperor had his hands behind his back as he stared at all this with a profound light of Tyranny!"]},{"number":2164,"title":"Chapter 2164: Chapter 2163 Legions Of Ancestral Descendants! I","paragraphs":["His visage was magnificent as he floated amidst raging swirls of the Essence of Natural Laws, watching the most powerful women in the Barren Lands teleport in this domain for no other purpose than to elevate their strength even further through the means of Dual Cultivation.","They were existences that had lived for an extremely long time as the physical relations between a man and a woman were not things they focused on- the greatest aim in their lives being authority and preserving what they cared for!","So in their mindset, the act of Dual Cultivation was just another method of Cultivation to raise their power.","And in these times, any astounding improvements in their power was much sought after!","Of course, it was still something intimate to do as saying no emotions would be involved in it would be a lie!","Guinevere's face was as pristine as always as her purple white adornments reflected the myriad of colors in the surroundings, her beauty exceeding nearly all others here as this was a being that stood at the peak of the Avalon Dimension!","Not too far from her, Morgana's expression was inexplicable to look at as her eyes seemed to hold a lot of frustration due to her initial interactions with this being, but she was here regardless because she also sought what all others did.","The Seeker of Knowledge had a serene expression as if everything was natural, Providence swirling around her as she focused on the dense concentration of laws that were sinking into her very skin.","They weren't the only ones as more flashes of light occurred with other figures pouring in, a resonant and powerful voice echoing out with confidence soon after as a petite figure adorned in an Obsidian dress appeared.","\"Little Fish, is your hunger this inexhaustible?\"","WAA!","Barbatos appeared with a devilish grin as Adelaide, Athena, Halcyon, and many others teleported in with her.","Their auras were robust as all of them were in the Grotto Haven Realm, their realm progression having matched Hecate and Katelyn as those Noah Dual Cultivated with were those who would exceed all others in power when gazing at the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as a whole!","Apart from the increase in realm progression, the Resonance of Nature during the Cultivation session would allow their Understanding of Natural Laws to progress at a shocking pace- the means and Vitality of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor being robust!","At the words of Barbatos, Adelaide shook her head with a light smile as the visage of Noah's main body emanated power, a gravitational force erupting from him and wrapping around Barbatos as pulling her forward- the Quintessential Kainos Emperor beginning this Dual Cultivation with her as his Clones also made their moves!","This serene area in the depths of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature became covered with a layer of light as all events were hidden from prying eyes, a unique method of power progression occurring while Nexus Events continued to unfold in the Barren Lands...","—","In the Mirror Dimension.","A woman clad in a silver dress stepped out of a multicolored rift in the clear mirror-like skies above a massive Empire that was filled with rising silver glass castles and skyscrapers, serene waves of clear silver stretching throughout this location as it seemed one of grandiosity and peace.","This was one of the centers of power of the Mirror Dimension- the Imperial Mirare Empire where a significant portion of the Mirror Dimensional Rulers lived in!","Yet, it seemed darker than it normally was as on this day, multiple Mirror Life Medallions had shattered to show that many of the Mirror Dimensional Rulers who had gone to the Dimensional Conclave had actually perished.","Perished!","Existences at the peak of power...actually perished as it caused many Grotto Haven Commanders to feel like the end was nearing.</novelsnext>","And this was further cemented when not too long after, a terrifying will descended onto a region of this Dimension and released deathly silver-gray waves of power, countless regions shattering akin to fallen mirrors and turning into Lands of nothingness.","And now a few hours later...a few Mirror Dimensional Rulers were actually returning as beside the silver adorned woman, another two Mirror Dimensional Rulers stepped out behind her along with a Ruler releasing bright waves of Quantum Essence.","The Quantum Dimensional Ruler accompanying them was one of the Mikado that normally guarded the Pylon of Ascension, but he was escorting 3 Dimensional Rulers currently as the Pylon that he normally protected...was currently the most fortified location in all of the Barren Lands.","The most powerful Mirror Dimensional Ruler at the very forefront spoke out coldly as her aura was close to that of CHARLEMAGNE and Lilith.","<Get your affairs in order and choose those who will be ascending with you. We have days to finish everything and be ready.>","...!","Her voice was filled with coldness and pain, where one could feel the sense of helplessness within as this being was known as the Mirare Queen.","The most powerful existence in the Mirror Dimension.","And yet now...she didn't even want to receive the feedback of the Mirror Essence that had tried to surge towards her as from it, she could feel the Source of this Dimension crying out in pain!","But she didn't listen.","She couldn't listen!","WAA!","Essence vibrated powerfully as the two Rulers behind her nodded, both turning into streaks of light that went to different locations.","One streak of light was an exceedingly beautiful middle-aged woman with an even more difficult expression than the Mirare Queen, with her eyes filled with shame and pain as she went towards a stellar region of this vast Empire that when she neared her home...","<What?!>","Her heart skipped a beat as her very Bloodline pulsed.","Her Lineage was reacting as a blood connection she had not felt for a long time was burning, her heart in disbelief and in even more pain as she sped up to go towards a certain castle!","She was in pain because at the current state of affairs, she had to choose a few existences in the Grotto Haven Realm who could bear the pressure of the Pylon of Ascension with the help of Ancestral Descendants, and the aura she felt was that of her kin that she had not seen for a long time! And knowing the power of the existence whose blood called out to her now...she would probably be left behind to be destroyed like the countless other existences in the Barren Lands!","<Why...why did you come find me at this time...my daughter?>","Her voice was robust as it reached the existence whose blood resonated with her as her figure materialized in front of a silver balcony of a massive and grand castle-like skyscraper.","On this balcony, a young woman accompanied by a devilishly handsome man turned around as it was...none other than Katelyn and Noah's True Sanguine Clone!"]},{"number":2165,"title":"Chapter 2165: Chapter 2164 Legions Of Ancestral Descendants! II","paragraphs":["Two gazes met as they felt vastly different emotions.","Two gazes from beings that looked extremely alike, one simply being older than the other as Mother and Daughter had the same dazzling silver hair and glazed eyes that illuminated countless mirrors!","\"Mother.\"","Katelyn called out calmly as the Dimensional Ruler before her had initially lost her regality and composure to show a tinge of guilt, but even this guilt was buried away soon after as the majestic image of a Ruler returned.","From the guilt hidden in her eyes, surprise actually came in as this Ruler realized the waves of power that her daughter gave off.","<Haven? How did you achieve this when you were just at...>","A happy surprise rose in her eyes as this Ruler who was known as Luna landed on the balcony to grasp Katelyn's face in her own hands.","She then nodded as the grandeur of a Ruler fully erupted from her.","<Good, you've done well.>","While gazing into Katelyn's eyes, the Dimensional Ruler Luna implied many hidden things with her gaze alone as she continued.","<I may not have done much for you in the past, but I can do one thing today. Things are rapidly changing as the Mirror Dimension will be no more...along with everything else in these Barren Lands. You will join me among the privileged few that can escape from here before that happens. Away from these Barren Lands and onto regions we cannot even fathom.>","WAA!","Her words were straight and without any leeway as Katelyn took her mother's hands off her face and bottled up many emotions while voicing out calmly.","\"That's what you say to me? After all these years?\"","<There is time for other things later. We have to move quickly and prepare.>","\"...\"","Yet the reply to her words was a cold one as Dimensional Ruler Luna seemed to have too many thoughts surging in her mind, the weight of the whole dimension seemingly on her shoulders!","Katelyn sighed lightly while keeping everything in, wiping away a barely formed tear in her eyes as she spoke while turning to gaze towards Noah's visage that was watching all of this with a smile!","\"Fine, but wherever I go, he goes. You left your partner after you regained your memories all those years ago...I will not be leaving mine.\"","...!","Her words were staunch and also without leeway as Dimensional Ruler Luna finally turned to focus on Noah.","Her sharp silver eyes were extremely cold as tendrils of desegregated destiny and Providence swirled, Luna not knowing this being was the one who was killing Rulers left and right in the Dimensional Conclave!","Her Aura Potency descended on him as she harrumphed, turning to see her daughter's unlovable face as she replied coldly.","<Fine. Be ready to move when I call on you.>","A blazing silver light erupted around her after she finished these words as she disappeared.","Disappeared while not knowing she had just agreed to the invitation of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor to be among those who would Ascend the Pylon of Ascension before Cataclysm descended!","—","In the Quantum Dimension.","Vast regions of this stellar plane still had cataclysmic ruptures of NULLITY burning throughout- the deathly gray area contracting and expanding at a low pace as those truly close to nature could even hear a constant low howl of pain that was emanating from the very source of the Quantum Dimension.</novelsnext>","It was the Source of a Dimension crying on as it headed towards Cataclysm, with its own inhabitants and strongest beings aiding in this as it could do nothing.","It was a suffocating atmosphere to feel, but one area remained vibrant and full of grandeur.","It was the radiant hourglass shaped Pylon of Ascension that currently had multiple Ancestral Descendants guarding it!","True Empress Katya was in her Imperial Karmic Scarab form as she floated before the Pylon with grandiosity, her gaze bright as she was watching this unique structure begin to illuminate.","Just like it had illuminated when she had come down!","She had sent word back.","And her assessment was answered.","The Ancestors placed a great deal of attention on the subject of the Barren Lands as if things didn't go the way they expected, they would be dealt a terrifying blow that would greatly weaken their power.","So for such an important matter, they had to make sure their Will was carried out successfully as after sending Katya, the next set of beings they sent would be the determinant to how everything would unfold.","Those coming down right now would be the force that the Ancestors managed to spare after draining all other sources of avenues and pulling their Legions back into defensive positions for the next few weeks or months while the situation with the Barren Lands was resolved!","Those coming down would be the force to make sure that the Will of the Ancestors was carried out with 100% Chance of success.","HUUUM!","Droning sounds of singularities echoed as the light from the Pylon of Ascension turned blinding, figures beginning to materialize from it at their appearance caused the fabric of Reality to churn and turn wild.","The radiant visage of 24 beings bloomed first.","Adorned in even more pristine and refined NULLITY Bone Armaments than Katya and her squadron, Ancestral Descendants wielding smooth and nearly identical blades on their waists appeared with glory.","Circular structures rotated around them as well, Katya's eyes shining brightly as she had heard of the man who was leading these 24 beings before her- a man who wasn't a True Emperor, and yet when he put himself against multiple True Emperors of past Ages who had ascended- he could not be knocked down!","It was an existence known by a single name.","<Theseus...>","Katya unconsciously called out in shock as she didn't think this would be among the beings sent down.","But this wasn't all!","After these 24 figures appeared...","SHIIING!","The Pylon of Ascension shone even brighter as 48 more glows of incandescent light materialized.","SHIIING!","Another flash of light as 96 new glows of light materialized into more Ancestral Descendants soon after!","It was a shocking display of power to see as Katya's eyes could not hide their immense surprise, her Heart trembling as she was reminded of the power that had made her docile even after she had attained the True Throne of Karma.","It was the power of the Ancestors.","It displayed itself fully right now as a force that was enough to even cause her to be somber came down!"]},{"number":2166,"title":"Chapter 2166: Chapter 2165 Legions Of Ancestral Descendants! III","paragraphs":["24, 48, 96.","These were the number of beings that came down in sequence as each group...was led by a terrifying figure.","Normally, the larger the group that one led, the more powerful they were.","But Katya knew that this wasn't the case the moment that she saw Theseus leading his force of 24.","Each of them was adorned with sharp silver gray NULLITY Bone Swords as among those who had exceeded the Barren Lands...they focused on constantly exceeding a single concept.","They weren't bound by Natural Laws as they forged their own boundaries!","Theseus and those he led in particular...focused on expanding the Boundary of the Sword to unbelievable levels while following the lead of certain Ancestors.","To the extent that the level of power, augmentations, and Authority that this concept released exceeded anything that Entropy, Manadynamics...or what any other Natural Law could offer.","A single swing of their swords could alter the very fabric of Reality in fantastical ways!","Paired up with the immense boosts of NULLITY...the power of existences following this Modus Operandi was deadly.","Others focused on expanding a myriad of Modus Operandi, while some focused on a single one and brought it towards Extremity.","Theseus was among the latter as his power was not to be trifled with!","The Legion of 48 that came after him was led by an existence that Katya recognized as the True Emperor of Fate- Hideyoshi!","Tendrils of gold wrapped around his body that was extremely robust- his musculature vibrant as his very skin and the skin of all those behind him shone with a golden hue.","They seemed like impenetrable statues as these existences focused on a boundary of the Extremity of Physique!","The number of Aeonic Damage Values required to even bypass the Innate Barriers of these beings was unfathomable.","And lastly, there was the one leading the Legion of 96 Ancestral Descendants that was none other than Yvonne.","Yvonne the Conqueror!","She was an Ancestral Descendant, and yet she had joined the list of respected existences with the accolade of Conqueror.","Her hair shone with streaks of black and gray as she was adorned with an Obsidian skull that covered her head, her pupils also in the form of a skull as the small Legion she led behind her also carried similar deathly energy!","Existences that focused on the Modus Operandi of Death and followed it towards an Extremity.","Yvonne, Hideyoshi, and Theseus.","Three Commanders that even Katya had to be careful and wary of!","They came with their Generals on this venture as outside the Barren Lands, they led Legions of Billions of Soldiers. Billions who were left behind to maintain defensive lines.","Legions that would be appropriated under different Commanders while their Commanders ensured that the Will of the Ancestors was followed in the Barren Lands.</novelsnext>","They now arrived and gazed towards her radiant verdant gold Imperial Karmic Scarab form as Theseus was the first to speak out with a calm smile.","\"Show me what you've seen of the enemy so far.\"","His dark hair weaved with radiance as his hand was kept on the hilt of his sword, the circular structure floating around him taking in the waves of the Essence of Natural Laws that came down to bind him and everyone else that had descended just like Katya and the others.","His circular tool floated away from him and towards Katya's as without saying anything, the Obsidian structures came in contact and flashed with light as all the information that Katya had was shared!","And this same scene repeated as the tools of Yvonne and Hideyoshi came forward, these Commanders seeing exactly what was in store within these Barren Lands.","\"Quintessential Dimensional Emperor...\"","Yvonne said the three words with a hint of power and brutality as the bone skull over her head shone, its empty sockets lighting up into black flames that illuminated the surroundings.","\"I will wade through Niflheim, Prana, and Mirror to seek him and any of his forces. Those that have fallen under his hands in death will tell me exactly where he is...\"","...!","As she spoke, the Legion behind her burned with a dark spatial light- Yvonne the Conqueror moving with purpose the moment that she arrived as she moved her terrifying forces to fortify three Dimensions!","Then came Hideyoshi.","His body was like a titanic golden statue of glory as a devilishly holy smile erupted on his face while he clasped his hands before his chest.","\"I shall oversee Elysium, Fantasia, and reinforce this Dimension as well...\"","Every time his mouth opened, golden seas of power flowed out as his Physique put even the bodies of Royal Humans to shame!","\"...Commander Theseus, you can handle the vast Desolate Mausoleum?\"","Even though his voice was robust and filled with regality, he still added the accolade of Commander when addressing Theseus as the power of this being was truly terrifying!","Theseus who at this juncture nodded while his head turned up to stare at the vastness around them, his magnetic voice echoing out.","\"Remember that we cannot fail in this. The Ancestors are bound down in their positions to not lose any Sanctuaries, and their power will face great limitations if the limitations of Natural Laws reach out to them again. Our success here determines whether we keep the progress we've made in the last Billions of years or...\"","HOONG!","Space trembled as his pupils unconsciously released waves of swords, massive rifts opening up above as if Reality itself was cut apart as this being didn't finish his words.","Katya became even more somber as she nodded at this, her will covering the Pylon of Ascension with even greater concentration as all the beings who had just come through this channel began to disappear into their designated positions.","Were anything to happen, they would quickly contact each other as at this moment, the concept of failure was not even a possibility they could afford!","For them, too many things lay on their shoulders as a single upcoming True Emperor of this Age...what could he do against all of them when he couldn't even stand against Katya alone?"]},{"number":2167,"title":"Chapter 2167: Chapter 2166 Legions Of Ancestral Descendants! IV","paragraphs":["Providence surged in a myriad of chaotic directions.","Neither it nor destiny could show what was coming next as too many confounding variables were involved.","At this moment, yet another variable prepared to enter the fray.","In the foldings of space within the Boundary Between Realities.","An existence that had been lying dormant for an unknown number of Ages opened his eyes yet again as he stared out at the expanse of emptiness.","His form seemed to constantly change in size from something titanic to something the size of an atom as his power was unpredictable!","His gaze was profound as he sensed many things, his voice emanating out at this moment.","\"This is the strongest force you can muster to descend without beginning to lose your foothold?\"","BZZT!","The layers of space he was embroiled in began to fracture as if a statue made out of a stone mountain was carving itself out.","From his hidden position, he stepped into the Boundary Between Realities as the fabric of Reality trembled at his presence!","\"Ages have come and gone as now...it is time to finish all this.\"","...!","His body emanated brutal and unknown power as his voice echoed out like ancient bells and melodies only heard across eons.","But just as this began...","WAP!","The fabric of Reality near this being began to open up as the Draconian Qilin Phoenix appeared, accompanied by dozens of Enders of Nature that emanated the power of three Natural Laws while this Draconian Qilin Phoenix...now emanated four!","Entropy, Manadynamics, Providence, and Relativity surged like arcs of lightning around its body as it displayed the power that Reality had achieved after a third Anchor was pulled from it!","Variations of Enders of Nature that released waves of three different natural laws from their Sources appeared alongside it, the Will of Reality paying close attention to the unknown that was this being after The Empress had appeared before it.","And against Legions of the forces of Reality itself, this being bursting with power turned towards the Enders of Nature with his lips curving into a smile of confidence and brutality, its eyes swirling akin to singularities as it spoke out calmly!","\"Rejoice, Little Will...for I am here to aid in your liberation. I have no qualms with you.\"","...!","In a tone as if a grown man was talking to a child!","In a tone of utter disregard for the grandeur that Reality held!","The eyes of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix flashed with immensity as the Will of Reality focused on this being whose body continued to emulate greater levels of power- a power that was so foreign and different from any authorities.","The Will of Reality saw all this...but it did not make a move.","It was hesitant.","It had seen the conversation between this being and The Empress as it knew it was the enemy of the Ancestors. And just now, its gaze had seen the terrifying Ancestral Descendants that came down as their power was something that even the Master of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality would be hard pressed to stand against!","So what if another variable joined the fray?","For its freedom, Reality deliberated.","And these few seconds of deliberation...one truly could not say what result they brought to the future as the existence that had been veiled this entire time continued to pulse with its foreign power.","This power bubbled out from his body as his hand...unfolded while pointing at the space above the Boundary Between Realities.</novelsnext>","His hands were ancient and seemingly forged from stone, their bronze hue reflecting in the starless space as this being uttered out while immense darkness began to gather in his hands.","\"VOID.\"","HOOOONG!","An extremely terrifying dark radiance emanated.","A dark radiance that even blinded the Will of Reality for a brief instant!","This darkness...was unfathomably black and oppressive as from this point in the Boundary Between Realities, it began to spread and proliferate far faster than even the speed of light as everywhere it passed...Everything turned dark.","The vibrant multicolored rivers of Reality lost their luster and grandeur of colors.","The vast cosmos and stellar bodies within seemingly lost their brightness!","Terrifying and pervasive darkness spread all around as it stretched out across the Desolate Mausoleum...and then seeped into the foldings of space to stretch its claws onto All Dimensions!","While all this occurred, the booming voice of the unveiled existence echoed out.","\"No communication with each other. No communication with your dear Ancestors. No open pathways in or out of these Desolate Lands. No teleportation. No vision....let us enter a complete state of VOID, why don't we?\"","WAA!","Across Realities.","Across Dimensions.","A blanket of Darkness descended in a terrifying show of skill and power that actually affected such a vast space.","Something unique was that as it jumped across different points of the fabric of Reality, occasional Obsidian flashes of light would bloom as hidden ecritures flashed briefly before this darkness spread even further.","And these hidden areas of flashing dark light were hidden across the fabric of Reality!","It gave one a glimpse of how something at this scale could even be achieved.","It seemed...that there were many preparations done to make it achievable.","Across the Ages...this being had planned and enacted unknown things across the fabric of Reality, and it was all deployed at this moment to achieve a shocking feat of utter darkness that blanketed everything!","In the Prana Dimension, the vibrant verdant light lost its luster.","In the Mirror Dimension, the silver grandeur of reflections lost their luster!","In the Quantum Dimension...","The multicolored Seas lost their regality.","The Pylon of Ascension lost its luster!","The Pylon of Ascension truly lost its luster as Katya looked towards it in shock, her gaze somber as she felt the unreasonable authority and power settling in!","A power that reminded her of the great enemies they faced as since it was displayed here...","Ah!","Her heart skipped a beat as she realized things were much direr than they seemed.","One of THEM had actually located the Barren Lands!","One of THEM was actually here!"]},{"number":2168,"title":"Chapter 2168: Chapter 2167 VOID! I","paragraphs":["The descending darkness that covered everything and caused the Pylon of Ascension to turn dim was something that Katya had experienced on the battlefield a few times!","An ability that stemmed from a unique Bloodline Boundary of their True Enemies- something only known as VOID!","It could be manipulated in many different ways as it made battlefields extremely tricky, causing a veil of darkness to descend as one couldn't communicate with others unless they had their own unique means through a Modus Operandi that was just as powerful.","This darkness was terrifying as it restricted one's vision, hearing, the extent of the spread of their Will...and so much more!","When the Ancestors first faced the VOID, a terrifying massacre occurred as Providence and Destiny did nothing for them. The surrounding Reality couldn't be felt or even sensed no matter how they tried with their Natural Laws.","After a heavy loss among many other losses over the years, the Ancestors had retreated and re-evaluated the concepts they relied on as it eventually led to the sealing of the Desolate Mausoleum- their hearts reaching to set their own Boundaries that could withstand the Extremity of VOID that their True Enemies freely controlled!","And now, while once more bound by Natural Laws...Katya felt this VOID.","It caused her soul to shudder as even the Descendants that she commanded could not be felt or heard from, her body surging with power as she enacted her own Boundary of Karma and became able to see the extent of the space around her.","\"Cover all directions of the Pylon of Ascension, attack on site on anyone nearing who doesn't identify themselves!\"","WAA!","Her words were commanding and showed no ounce of fear...even though the fear ingrained in her bones of their True Enemies was creeping up.","They were too fearsome as Chaoticus Beasts alone were their mounts and pets.","Their methods were terrifying as...","'How many of them were here?'","'How did they find the Barren Lands?'","'How long have they been here?!'","Many questions buzzed in her mind as she reigned in her hidden thoughts and only showed majesty outwardly, her Will calming down and gazing at things objectively as a light of confidence shone within her eyes.","She wasn't alone.","Even though they couldn't communicate with each other, they knew the protocol and exactly how to move in this case as those overseeing specific dimensions...they would make sure these Anchors didn't face anything to the same result as Dream, Avalon, and Apollyon!","'Right. There's Theseus, Yvonne, and Hideyoshi...things should still not be a problem!'","Care and caution were prevalent in her eyes as her authority continued to blaze, barely capable of keeping the VOID away from the nearby structures.","The VOID that now stretched out across Dimensions and Reality as the being who had initiated it all...had his eyes closed at this moment in the Boundary Between Realities as his voice boomed out towards the surroundings.","\"VOID...interesting, isn't it? Everything is ushered into darkness as to prepare this, I silently spent multiple Ages leaving markings all across the fabric of Reality. All of it was done to wait for the time when the Emperor who would begin to pull on the keys to your freedom appeared. All for the time when these so called Ancestors send their strongest manageable force down here...and I cut off the connection between the Barren Lands and anything outside of it for 7 days.\"","BOOOM!</novelsnext>","A shocking burst of information echoed out as the ancient voice of this being continued!","\"7 days...where even if an Anchor is pulled, the effects will be delayed from reaching out of the Barren Lands. They would never be alerted to just how dire things have become for them. So I can enjoy the snacks they have sent down while destroying the remaining Anchors...without them knowing their bindings are about to erupt and confine them the moment that this VOID disappears and the Desolate Mausoleum is freed once more.\"","...!","A simplified pathway that took ages to plan was explained so simply as even the Draconian Qilin Phoenix did not have any words!","And this terrifying existence moved at his own pace as his titanic hands came down to smile eerily towards the fabric of Reality, his voice emanating out one last time as a dark light began to wrap around him.","\"Well then, I'm off to hunt and destroy.\"","WAP!","The dark light wrapped around this being and teleported him away in a ridiculous turn of events as whatever limitations imposed on others due to the VOID...were never limitations for the ones who sought the Extremity of the VOID.","In fact, they became even stronger in a place filled with the VOID!","The Fabric of Reality gazed at this scene silently as the Source of Providence it partially controlled told it many things, but when it came to the current situation and the things involved...the information was murky.","What just occurred now definitely placed the Ancestors at a disadvantage as even if the Anchors were destroyed, they wouldn't know until it was too late!","There was a 7 day period for the VOID.","7 days were what the preparations of an existence that had lived for Billions of years here had amounted to.","These 7 days would be critical!","The eyes of the Draconian Qilin Phoenix flashed as the Will residing within it calculated how things would change, its gaze turning towards the direction of a certain being and his Relic.","Towards the direction of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","HOOONG!","The VOID had blanketed everything, and it also came to cover the hidden folds of space where the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality was located!","But...","A blinding multicolored radiance shone over the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","Incredulously, the VOID only smashed on its boundaries as it did not seep through!","—","<Author's Note>:: Outside of the Barren Lands, truly powerful existences set their own Boundaries of Power depending on the strength of their soul. One can focus on a certain Modus Operandi/Path/Boundary and expand the extent of its power towards Extremity- towards something that nobody knows the ends of or just how far it can reach."]},{"number":2169,"title":"Chapter 2169: Chapter 2168 VOID! II","paragraphs":["The moment that this change had occurred, Noah's will was roused as a Clone of his instantly appeared near the boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","He and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality sensed the coming wave of darkness as innately, the <Defensive Maneuvers> feature had activated innately to defend against any attacks thrown towards this incandescent spiritual plane!","BOOOM!","The Boundary reflected multicolored splendor as the voice of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality emanated out.","<<A Foreign Authority is trying to impose itself. Currently mobilizing the Sources of All Dimensions and Reality under our control to reject the Foreign Authority.>>","...!","Resistance!","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality actually resisted the taint of this Foreign Authority as its Will continued to resound!","<20% Operational Source Authority utilized.>","<30% Operational Source Authority utilized.>","<50% Operational Source Authority utilized. Seeking clearance to designate Manadynamics as the main resisting authority and a constant usage of Master's Mana.>","WAA!","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality moved fast as the darkness was akin to a billowing beast that was clashing on its boundary, the authority being knocked back in a unique fashion as 50% of the daily 'operational' authority for all Sources was focused on resisting it!","Noah gave his permission as his body gushed out waves of incandescent blue in a constant flow that resonated with the Source of Manadynamics, the boundary of his home turning even more radiant before stabilizing as this shockingly powerful Foreign Authority...could not make its way in.","<A constant usage of 50% Operational Source Authority is required to maintain the rejection of the Foreign Authority. Assimilating additional Sources will increase the reserves of Operational Source Authority and reduce the currently utilized percentage.>","The monotone voice emanated in Noah's mind as it expressed just how all of this was made possible.","It was an action that even Noah did not know the full significance of at this time!","The authority that made Ancestors despair and leave the Natural Laws of Reality...Noah was actually able to reject it with the aid of his terrifying Construct that had Bound the Sources of Nature they left behind!","Because he had taken another path.","They integrated themselves into Nature as their control was minimal.","Noah integrated Nature unto himself and bound it as with his control and the control of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality on the Sources of Nature, the Boundary of the VOID was actually rebuffed!","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality wasn't present across the Ages to be inscribed and altered in whatever ways the unveiled existence utilized to mark the fabric of reality over the past billions of years.","It came to be over the last 2 years.","And...it had capabilities, autonomy, and freedom that exceeded any other Entities or Wills- this was how any of this became possible!</novelsnext>","HOONG!","Radiance shone at such a juncture as near Noah, the figures of Eowyn, Guinevere, The Longest Dream...nearly all of the Dimensional Rulers within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality appeared near Noah's position as they stared at the encompassing darkness outside.","The bodies of Guinevere and other female Rulers were particularly bursting with waves of power after the beginning of the Dual Cultivation session in the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature under dilated time, with their eyes luminous as they raised brows from their male counterparts before they focused on the unfolding situation outside!","No sooner had they arrived, an aura neared this position of the Boundary as it was an Ender of Providence that was among the many standing guard outside the Boundary of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, its form being that of a Celestial Qilin as golden scales and fur radiated light that barely lit up the dark surroundings.","It stared into the still vibrant Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality that the Will of Reality was also a part of, many calculations being made at this moment as soon after, the Ender of Providence waved its hand to cause the appearance of an illusory film of light that showed a scene of a shockingly powerful titanic existence covered by darkness.","\"No communication with each other. No communication with your dear Ancestors. No open pathways in or out of these Desolate Lands. No teleportation. No vision....let us enter a complete state of VOID, why don't we?\"","The words this being uttered caused shock and incredulity to rise in the eyes of all Rulers, Noah's own eyes turning extremely sharp and luminous as the scene continued!","\"7 days...where even if an Anchor is pulled, the effects will be delayed from reaching out of the Barren Lands...\"","...!","The monolog of this being was utterly shocking as a crucial piece of information arrived before Noah's feet, many of his plans having to shift and change as his aura rose terrifically in the next instant!","\"Alright, we have 7 days.\"","WAA!","\"7 days to face Ancestral Descendants bound by Natural Laws and this VOID- 7 days to save the remaining Dimensions before they are destroyed by this being. 7 days...to decide the fate of the Barren Lands!\"","His grandiosity rose in shocking waves as he spoke out.","\"Finish your preparations and form your clones. We move out within a matter of hours.\"","He let his will be known as he chose to move within the next few hours.","It was enough for his preparations to be finished as one reason was the 24 hour cycle of the Infinite Forge coming up soon, its elevation with 500,000 All Source Enhancers nearing completion right now as the Lemniscate Epitaph at the depths of Noah's soul with shining with a light of Quintessence!","He would collect the Loot to come and open the remainder of the Loot Crates and Caches, multiply them with RUINATION, and begin forging the Eighth Dimensional Layer for even greater power as he was reaching the precipice of the end of his Foundation!","He would also bring together the knowledge of the systems of power that Ancestral Descendants and their enemies utilized- the idea of expanding chosen conceptual Boundaries or Paths into Authorities that could far exceed even Natural Laws.","And all of this...was also something that he could theoretically do with a loot that he had already attained.","The Shards of Concept Modifiers!","Their modification of concepts...could Noah not utilize them to modify Natural Laws and Decreta, expanding their Boundaries and achieving what the Ancestors wanted without leaving behind any of these concepts?!"]},{"number":2170,"title":"Chapter 2170: Chapter 2169 Boundaries! I","paragraphs":["The expansion of a concept's Boundary to Extremity.","It was something that required great understanding just to think about, and it was something that had stumped the Ancestors many years ago before they shifted towards this same system of power.","Everything had its preset Boundaries, with the Natural Laws and Decreta of Dimensions having their limits to the Augmentations and boosts they provided- their own boundaries!","The Boundaries of Reality were set, but they were also malleable at the same time as when the Ancestors sealed the Desolate Mausoleum, they suppressed its boundary to grant 1,000% Augmentation with its Natural Laws.","But every time that Noah removed an Anchor, the suppressed Boundary was elevated by another 1,000% for each natural law as in this manner...it could be considered an expansion of the boundary of Natural Laws!","Those outside the Barren Lands sought their own conceptual Boundaries, with Noah's mind being illuminated on these concepts somewhat due to the death of his True Sanguine Clone in the Quantum Dimension- where his residual consciousness had gotten a chance to delve into the circular structure that floated around every Ancestral Descendant.","A structure that through Interminable Clarity, he was able to know it was termed the <Automaton Boundary Modulator>!","A Modulator!","A tool that was actually designed to make it easier for the Ancestors to seek new concepts or more easily expand the Boundaries of current concepts, along with a myriad of other uses that Noah didn't know if they were the full extent of this tool's capabilities.","It was a tool that aided in the expansion of the Boundary of a Concept, but how does one exactly begin to expand the power of a concept? To push it past its limitations?","The most basic way was just like how one had to comprehend and understand the nature of Reality for Millions and Billions of years, with one's Soul being extremely critical!","The power of one's Soul- an existence's Aeonic Soul Value...it was utterly critical to how quickly and efficiently they could expand a Boundary towards its Extremity, and just how powerful a concept could become.","If one's soul was weak and they were struggling to expand their Boundaries, other advanced ways were capable only outside the Barren Lands.","Unfathomable treasures existed that could allow one to forcefully expand the Boundary of a Concept towards Extremity!","There were even unique Lineages that were born with terrifying Innate Boundaries...and this was the extent of the information Noah was able to discern from the <Automaton Boundary Modulator> before True Empress Katya entirely extinguished the Clone's Will!","<Automaton Boundary Modulator>:: Born from the genius of Ancestor Archimedes during a time of constant losses, this tool came to be from the assimilation of metalloids enriched in NULLINIUM and three other unknown Sources. These Four different Sources were all brought together with the Boundary of Orgamech Magitech to form a tool allowing one to more easily observe the Boundary of a Concept. Once observed, one can infuse their Aeonic Soul Power through the Modulator for a 1,000% increased rate of expansion towards Extremity. This Boundary Modulator can also resist the Boundaries of other concepts being imposed upon its user, with a special care given to the resistance of the Boundaries of the Natural Laws of Reality that plagued the inventor of the Automaton Boundary Modulator. This tool has been expanded to contain many more features over the years, with it being the best tool for long distance communication across spacetime continuum, and the best tool to quantify one's power and Concepts to give a better grasp of their progression. Other uses for the Automaton Boundary Modulator have yet to be uncovered, with the will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor requiring at least 1 minute within a Boundary Modulator to fully understand its usage...","Ancestor Archimedes.","This was the being who actually designed and mass produced the Automaton Boundary Modulator that aided in the survival of Ancestors- and this genius did so through the Boundary of Orgamech Magitech!","A concept dealing with the allure of Reality Altering possibilities and technology!</novelsnext>","This was a tool that all Ancestral Descendants had currently as Noah had to make up the gap by any means possible.","He had his Realm of Power being much different from theirs as it followed the path of Nine Dimensional Layers, and he had Bound the Sources they left behind for even greater power.","He had NULLITY, but they had this as well- and more than likely attained even more ridiculous boosts from it after all these years!","But from eliminating NULLITY Beasts and his own means of Absolute Loot Authority, he now gained access to All Source Enhancers and the Shards of Concept Modifiers.","With them, he might just be able to close the gap and enhance Reality Altering Constructs to ridiculous levels while modifying their limitations!","Even though All Source Enhancers and The Shards of Concept Modifiers were two different Loots, Noah considered their usage the same- and it was as tools to expand the Boundaries of his Concepts.","At this very moment, the half a million All Source Enhancers Noah had designated to the elevation of the Infinite Forge were used up.","Something like this...Noah also considered a form of expanding a certain boundary as whatever output of loot that the Infinite Forge could put out before was about to undergo ridiculous revision.","Inside Noah's soul, the Lemniscate Epitaph was shining with rays of utmost incandescence.","He barely utilized a few hundred All Source Enhancers last time as it had increased the chance percentages of rare loot appearing by a factor of 5 or more.","The Infinite Forge was also still ranked only second to the Construct of the Quantum Emperor!","Buy after the ridiculous infusion of 500,000 All Source Enhancers...","<The Infinite Forge's capabilities have been enhanced to a Quintessential level.>","<The percentage chance to Generate certain Loot is increasing.>","<New Loot has been added to the Infinite Forge.>","<The Infinite Forge has become Quintessential in the Age of Quintessence.>","...!"]},{"number":2171,"title":"Chapter 2171: Chapter 2170 Boundaries! II","paragraphs":["Across the spacetime continuum.","Within the Boundary Between Realities.","The visage of a single man adorned in a white robe could be seen surrounded by the VOID, his blue eyes being the only thing releasing a point of light in the surroundings as he came to a stop!","This was because his eyes were reflecting a burst of information that came from the very fabric of Reality.","<Another Reality Altering Construct has exceeded limitation and become Quintessential.>","<Your Reality Altering Construct is no longer Quintessential.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age has quintessentially decreased.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age has quintessentially decreased.>","...!","Droves of information that caused his cerulean eyes to release shocking rays of light!","The same being he was seeking in the Desolate Mausoleum...had somehow gone to exceed the construct he created with the aid of Ancestral Descendants. With the aid of an existence with a unique Boundary of Constructs!","An existence that even after he used all of his authority to seek in the Myriad Parallel Paths...he could not find him.","He only saw the scene of darkness spreading as Apocalyptic Parallel Paths were increasing in number.","And yet the existence he sought was nowhere to be found across these paths.","<...>","CONSTANTINE gazed at the disappearing flows of information silently as his head raised up.","He gazed at the Interminable darkness all around him as he wondered.","Would Quintessence truly slip past his grasp in an Age that was his to reign in?","WAA!","It was a question that did not have an answer, with the future remaining unknown as his visage released even more authoritative light while he continued his search!","--","<The Infinite Forge has become Quintessential in the Age of Quintessence.>","...!","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","The backbone of the Throne absorbed incandescent rays of light as at this moment, it truly couldn't be called a backbone anymore.","It was seemingly beginning to materialize into something else as the True Authority of Quintessence could be felt bubbling with surging waves and building up to a crescendo!</novelsnext>","Noah was achieving Quintessence in all fields as one of the few things remaining was his Physique being Quintessential as well, something that would be easily achieved after the formation of another Dimensional Layer!","So in the midst of all this, he gazed at the Reality Altering Construct that he had achieved Quintessence in.","<Infinite Forge>::...Every 24 Hours, the following Loot will be passively generated in the Infinite Forge that the user can enter to remove or allow to passively accumulate over time: <25,000 Transcendent True Vitality Flasks>(100% Chance to Generate), <125,000 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas>(100% Chance to Generate), <1,250,000 Golden Dimensional Reality Panaceas>(100% Chance to Generate), <25,000,000x Ingots of MANANIUM>(100% Chance to Generate), <25,000,000x Ingots of NULLINIUM>(100% Chance to Generate),<2,500x Random Transcendent DHARMA Relic>(100% Chance to Generate), <2,500x Random Absolute Dimensional Relic>(100% Chance to Generate), <50x Random Connate Dimensional Relic>(100% Chance to Generate), <50x Random Transcendent Skill Tree of a True Emperor>(100% Chance to Generate), <50x Modus Operandi of Previous Ages>(100% Chance to Generate), <10x Random ZENITH Dimensional Lineage>(100% Chance to Generate),<10x Random ZENITH Reality Lineage>(100% Chance to Generate), <500,000 All Source Enhancers>(100% Chance to Generate), <500,000 Shards of Concept Modifiers>(100% Chance to Generate)<10x Natural Decretum Complete Understanding Crystal>(50% Chance to Generate), <1x Absolute Connate Reality Relic>(50% Chance to Generate), <1x Absolute Connate Dimensional Relic>(50% Chance to Generate), <2,500x Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas>(25% Chance to Generate), <100x Aeonic Soul Pills>(25% Chance to Generate)<1x Blueprint of the Automaton Boundary Modulator>(25% Chance to Generate), <1x Random Lineage Boundary of Extremity(1% Chance to Generate)...","\"...\"","Utter Quintessence presented itself before his eyes.","He had spent 500,000 All Source Enhancers for its elevation, and yet every day, it would spit back the same number of Loot to him...along with a ridiculous number of many others!","An addition of a myriad of more Loot.","From 250 Obsidian Panaceas, the number became 125,000 every 24 hours.","From a .05% Chance to Generate 50 Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas, it was now a 25% Chance to get 2,500 of them!","A 25% Chance to Generate a Blueprint of the Automaton Boundary Modulator! Aeonic Soul Pills! And even a minuscule 1% Chance to attain a random Lineage Boundary of Extremity!","All of this...every 24 hours.","A constant cycle.","\"Worthy to be a Quintessential Construct of this Age.\"","Noah's Will emanated out grandly as he spoke to himself with a nod of acknowledgment, his eyes looking at the few minutes remaining before the Cycle of the Infinite Forge reset and he was granted the boundless types of loot within it.","He looked at the resource to come his way as well as the ones he had currently as his Will gave another command.","\"Begin the formation of the Eighth Dimensional Layer. Designate it to be Fantasia.\"","WAA!","He began with the formation of another layer that would cement his foundation even further.","A layer that for him to form, he required over 3.5 Million All Source Enhancers...or close to 18 Million Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas as forming this Layer required 128 times more resources than the 7th Dimensional Layer!","This would have been a daunting number a day ago with many questions as to how he could possibly come up with such a number.","But that was a day ago.","Now, he would soon be getting 500,000 All Source Enhancers from the Infinite Forge that he...had not placed through a round of Epochal Decuplicate.","So truly...he was about to achieve 5,000,000 All Source Enhancers within the next few minutes!","It was frankly ridiculous and utterly balance breaking for what was about to happen to even be possible.","But for the sake of overcoming Unreasonably powerful enemies...Noah had to be even more unreasonable and balance breaking!"]},{"number":2172,"title":"Chapter 2172: Chapter 2171 Boundaries! III","paragraphs":["In the Niflheim Dimension.","The skies and earth that were normally cold and dreary were even more deathly to be in, with the vast majority of the Undead roaming around silently at this moment.","After Lilith's war and subsequent loss of control and death of so many Rulers, the chain of Command was nonexistent and even further abolished when the rifts of NULLITY began to spread and destroy the Dimension under the hands of Ancestral Descendants.","This was a Dimension that was currently being overseen by the forces of Yvonne, her Legion of 96 spread between Niflheim, Mirror, and the Prana Dimension!","And Yvonne herself with all her grandiosity was at the center of Niflheim with 32 Ancestral Descendants from her legion stretched out around her.","Yvonne the Conqueror!","This was her title that showed her power as she expanded the Boundary of Death towards Extremity while achieving shocking results, but even she was gazing around coldly and carefully at this moment after the blanketing of the VOID that covered everything!","Her dazzling black and gray hair illuminated and came to life as she was adorned with an Obsidian skull that covered her head, her pupils in the form of skulls radiating a deathly light as her Automaton Boundary Modulator rotated dimly around her.","She couldn't communicate with anyone, nor could she leave her post.","All of the Ancestral Descendants knew this as the protocol as this wasn't the first time they came across the VOID!","They had to face what was coming and follow the same plan of overseeing the destruction of the Dimensions and Reality without any more Anchors being removed.","So Yvonne spread out her Soul as much as she could with the Boundary of Death, those around her doing the same as they prepared for anything.","And no sooner than a few minutes passed after the VOID blanketed everything...","HOOONG!","Space split and fractured as a billowing aura of a lone being stepped out not too far from their forces.","\"Attention!\"","...!","Yvonne bellowed out coldly as all her forces surged to surround the opening rift in an instant, their bodies blazing with maddening reality cracking power as they gazed forth coldly and with ferocity!","And when the rift closed with the identity of the existence revealing itself...","BOOOM!","The auras around Yvonne and all her forces blared as behind them dark skulls appeared that released layers of dark defensive light to wrap around each of them.","This...was an instinctive move as they instantly deployed one of their more powerful defensive measures- their bodies becoming wrapped with the protective aura of death as massive illusory skulls floated above their heads!","This was an instinctive reaction because the moment the being out of the rift became clear, their strong souls could sense and smell a certain scent they were very familiar with.","A being that smelled of the Lineage of their True Enemies!","And an affirmation of the spread of the VOID that just occurred.","Their Lineage was a unique one.","Generally, the more powerful a race was, the harder it was for them to reproduce.","This was not the case for them!</novelsnext>","They propagated at speeds far faster than some of the weakest races while their Bloodline was so powerful and potent that it stood above many others!","It was why outside the Barren Lands, they were the ones in control of the farthest reaches of lands and resources.","They were known as....","\"NOBLESSE...\"","Yvonne uttered out with utmost distaste as the magisterial humanoid visage of the unveiled existence floated while surrounded by her forces with his hands behind his back, his titanic eyes gazing around him with a carefree expression.","NOBLESSE!","This was the Lineage that the Ancestors came across outside the Barren Lands that caused them to despair!","A Lineage whose name alone exemplified superiority, ennoblement, and a profound sense of elevation above other Lineages!","Yvonne could feel her body pulsing with alarms as she spoke while the skull above her head spat out luminous flames!","\"I've never seen a NOBLESSE actually hiding their true form that gives them so much pride. Are you a runt that managed to bypass the folds of Reality? How many more of you are here?\"","She spoke to destabilize the mind of this being while also trying to figure out how the NOBLESSE Has discovered the Barren Lands- and how many were actually here.","All of these were crucial questions as towards such a provocation, the titanic form of the unveiled existence actually let out a burst of booming laughter.","WAA","A burst of laughter that caused the fabric of Reality to tremble and shatter, with this being answering not with words, but with his actions as his massive visage began to release rays of black light.","A black light that caused Yvonne's eyes to sink!","His form began to change.","Its massive humanoid stature shrunk down and became more refined, an explosive musculature still being seen as radiant Obsidian robes draped over his wide back.","On his wrists, a dazzling Obsidian Halo could be seen spinning vibrantly on each hand as the same colored Halos could be seen around his ankles!","And when one gazed above the broad muscular chest covered by the incandescent obsidian robe, they would see the most exquisitely handsome existence in the Barren Lands.","His face was overflowing with regality and grandeur as he would out those calling themselves Emperors to shame- his nose sharp and his eyes piercing as his whole face was illuminated with a stellar black hue!","The reason for this was the appearance of four radiant obsidian Halos around his head- one in the back, one on top, and two on the right and left sides of his head!","These Halos released a light of majesty and power as they seemed to constantly be funneling waves of essence over this being.","Yvonne gazed at this as her heart turned somber, her voice emanating out grandly.","\"An 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE...\"","WAA!","4 Obsidian Halos around his head. One on each of his hands and legs.","An 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE!"]},{"number":2173,"title":"Chapter 2173: Chapter 2172 Boundaries! IV","paragraphs":["An 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE!","Just one Echelon off of becoming one of the most powerful NOBLESSE in the Obsidian Stage! Such was the being Yvonne had to face as normally, this was the type of existence that Yvonne and multiple other Commanders had to face on the battlefield to guarantee victory.","It was an utterly terrifying being to come across alone.","But...the situation was slightly different due to where they were as in the Barren Lands, things might just play out differently than expected!","The Natural Laws here bound everyone equa-","\"You think a chance of survival is possible due to the bindings of Natural Laws.\"","...!","Her eyes constricted as her thoughts were stopped by his cold and resonant words!","The 4 Halos around his head illuminated as they showed his smile of majesty and brutality, his eyes being shown as they...held no pupils.","Pure blackness was all that could be seen in this being's eyes as they seemed like focal points of piercing singularities!","\"I will tell you to throw those thoughts out of the window if you wish to survive the next few seconds, Little Rabbit.\"","BOOOM!","The eyes of this being burst with light as Yvonne made a move right after, her body releasing a deathly smoke of light as around her- terrifying clusters of Undead began to appear!","\"Release all your Legions and maintain your distance! The aim is defense and containment!\"","Yvonne bellowed out her command as the Automaton Boundary Modulators were not working anymore.","The bindings of Natural Laws were pressing down even more tightly around her along with the oppression of the VOID, but she knew what she had to do as around her- Variations of many Races of Undead appeared and formed an ever expanding Legion!","She said the goals were Defense and Containment.","She didn't even place the possibility of them actually defeating an 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE on the table until reinforcements came, and she knew that the VOID had to have a time limit.","Once it was lifted and this being's power was a bit more used up...they would be able to move freely and even stand a possibility to erase a commanding NOBLESSE here!","And someone like her and her Legion who could summon droves of Aeon Undead...were the best at containment and stalling for a long period of time!","HOOONG!","Boundless shadows bloomed around her and her party of 32 as the encirclement of the 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE seemed like a constantly expanding deathly mass stretching out for light years- millions of Aeon Undead and Apparitions appearing as the Boundary of Death was put on full display.","The capability to summon truly powerful Undead who could release Aeonic Damage Values with deathly precision.","The capability to delay one's demise and use the Boundary of Death in unfathomable ways!","And yet the being who faced all this...smiled ever brighter as he breathed in the smell of death, his magnetic voice echoing out.","\"The Boundary of Death...one I am familiar with. Let us see how far you are towards Extremity.\"","...!","An Obsidian light flashed from his body.","SHIING!</novelsnext>","And around him, deathly waves of energy erupted as different Tiers of Aeon Undead began to rise freely!","Waves of Entropy whipped around madly in this region of fracturing Reality as a shocking battle bloomed, the fate of the Barren Lands hinging on the many Nexus Events about to unfold!","—","In the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature.","The eyes of Noah's main body rose up amidst his Dual Cultivation and attaining of unique Lineages from the Dimensional Rulers before him.","He was doing many things at once, with his main body well in the process of forging the Eighth Dimensional Layer by first utilizing Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas.","Yet at this moment, a portion of his consciousness disappeared at this juncture as a prompt had risen before him!","<24 Hours have passed since the last Generation of The Infinite Forge, would you like to receive the generated loot?>","A prompt that he immediately agreed with.","And one that only took a portion of his soul this time into the Lemniscate Epitaph releasing rays of radiant light!","When his soul came to be again, he found himself back in the radiant domain filled with golden luminescence and grandeur.","His will could feel a floor of crystalline golden stellar liquid that had mountains of Loot rising throughout it, with this light stretching out endlessly and converging around a massive spinning golden Lemniscate Epitaph.","A spinning golden infinity symbol that released vibrant waves of loot light, the two circles within it covered by a luminescent golden film of light that began to shine at this moment while the symbol spun!","<The Loot of a 24 Hour Cycle shall be Generated>","Similar to before, Noah's will began to see shining bundles of loot light fly out from the spinning Infinity Symbol and cascade over the liquid gold floor that already had mountains of loot- the prompts beginning to rain down as Providence shone.","<25,000 Transcendent True Vitality Flasks have been generated.>","<125,000 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas have been generated.>","<1,250,000 Golden Dimensional Reality Panaceas have been generated.>","<25,000,000x Ingots of MANANIUM have been generated>","...!","How could it even be described?","A breathtaking scene was taking place as breaking all possibilities of balance, droves of loot rained down from the golden Lemniscate in the halcyon skies in obscene numbers.","Before the incandescent allure of Flasks and the raining Panaceas even ended, the skies became painted blue by the grandeur of 25 Million metalloid and radiant cerulean Ingots of MANANIUM raining down!","And this...was only the beginning of the Infinite Forge's production today.","It was a rain of loot and grandiosity that caused the hearts of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor to fill with boundless joy and contentment!","—","<Author's Note>","<Empyral Domain of Disorder>:: A skill born due to the confluence of the laws on nature during the elevation of RUINATION. It allows the holder of the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence to release a domain that destabilizes all conceptual forms of Reality, and on some viable concepts, grants the opposite result. The casting of all abilities are interrupted in this domain as only those who are highly proficient in essence utilization are able to cast abilities through unique Boundaries or Paths. The cast Empyral Domain of Disorder can cover a region as small as a few meters to the size of Planes depending on the cost paid. This ability costs 300 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality and a Hundredth of your Aeonic Soul Value to cast..."]},{"number":2174,"title":"Chapter 2174: Chapter 2173 The Ambrosia Of Loot! I","paragraphs":["The halcyon skies within the space of the Infinite Forge became painted a gorgeous blue briefly as millions of Ingots of MANANIUM rained down to form stellar cerulean mountains.","And not long after that...","<25,000,000x Ingots of NULLINIUM have been generated>","Vibrant silver gray lights rained down soon after as obscene amounts of NULLITY also cascaded down into their own mountains!","All of these were ecstatic to see as with them, Noah could form a great number of powerful Relics...or he could funnel a majority of these materials into the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence to continue elevating RUINATION!","The answer for this was clear as many of the ridiculous things that were about to happen would only be made viable due to RUINATION.","So even as the obscene allure of loot rained down, Noah had already designated its usage long ago!","And just as the Ingots of NULLINIUM finished raining down, an even more unforgettable scene bloomed.","From the buzzing golden Lemniscate in the halcyon skies, Transcendent DHARMA Relics began to rain down.","They released glorious radiance as stellar painted swords, bows, hammers, armor, helms...a variety of armaments rained down with a fantastical light of loot!","<2,500x Random Transcendent DHARMA Relics have been generated.>","And even before they finished cascading down...","<The Connate Dimensional Relic Life Splitter has been generated.>","<The Connate Dimensional Relic Elysium Breastplate has been generated.>","<The Connate Dimensional Relic Quantum Needle has been generated.>","<The Connate Dimensional Relic....>","Even more glorious items that were higher in ranking came down by the tens, the prompts washing over Noah's eyes as he truly felt...like he had arrived at his happiest place.","At a place of constant loot raining down as the Will of this Quintessential Kainos Emperor became humbled at the ambrosia of Loot light raining down!","He reflected where he had come from all those months ago when he was entering mere dungeons termed [Ape's Paradise] and [Goblin King's Abode] looking for items and skill books, and now...","He had the most premium items raining down from a reality Altering Construct that he had built himself!","And loot such as this would continue to rain down every 24 hours for as long as he lived, but he didn't think he would ever get tired from looking at the grandeur of loot light coming down for the days to come.","50x Random Connate Dimensional Relics came down as even before they finished landing on the piles of mountainous loot...","<The Transcendent Skill Tree of the True Emperor of the Age of Fate has been generated.>","<The Transcendent Skill Tree of the True Emperor of the Age of Chaos has been generated.>","<The Transcendent Skill Tree of the True Emperor of the Age of Light has been generated...>","Amalgamations of concepts in the form of titanic ancient tomes of light appeared, numbering at 50 in total as these...Noah planned to learn and see if he could draw any inspiration from.","But they would be going to the Soul Library as he would have Guinevere, Eowyn, The Longest Dream...all Rulers under him- he would have them grasp techniques of past True Emperors along with his own self designed skill trees!</novelsnext>","This was the thought at hand as multicolored tomes rained down with glory.","Thereafter, tens of unique Modus Operandi stretched out across the Ages also came down in the form of ancient tomes, and then the points of loot light that shone like bright stars began to cascade down.","<The ZENITH Apollyon Dimensional Lineage of the Imperial Orc Daemon Emperor has been generated.>","<The ZENITH Fantasia Dimensional Lineage of the Celestial Whale Zaxa has been generated.>","<The ZENITH Dream Dimensional Lineage of the Nightmare Ender has been generated.>","...!","Lineages that Noah would absorb into his own began to bloom as with these...the number was 10 for ZENITH Dimensional and 10 for ZENITH Reality Lineages!","Among the few things Noah could truly get a chance to Decuplicate, these unique Lineages were not one of them as the bundle of light holding the blood of the Celestial Whale Zaxa for example...multiplying this by 10 would just increase the amount of Blood Noah could absorb to attain the Lineage and not result in anything else drastic.","But it was still 20 Unique ZENITH Lineages falling onto his lap as for these...he would see if he would be able to touch the boundary above ZENITH for his own Bloodline.","And the moment the blobs of starlight ended falling from the skies, they were replaced with the fantastical allure of none other than the multicolored stellar glows of Enhancers and Shards of Concept Modifiers raining down onto the already rising loot mountains.","<500,000x All Source Enhancers have been generated.>","<500,000x Shards of Concept Modifiers have been generated.>","Glorious multicolored grandeur came down as after this, the Loot that had a 50% Chance or lower to Generate every 24 hours appeared!","<Providence has shone upon you.>","And surges of Providence cascaded down as a blinding point of a Singularity bloomed from the golden spinning Lemniscate.","<10x Natural Decretum Complete Understanding Crystals have been generated.>","Understanding Crystals that Noah could multiply to gain 100 rained from the skies as they were followed by...","<The Absolute Connate Reality Relic Empyral Shield of the Entropy has been generated.>","<The Absolute Connate Dimensional Relic Helm of Fantasia has been generated.>","Two relics akin to the Sword of Avalon came down in a serene show of wonder, but they weren't what caught Noah's eyes the most.","It was the fact that the golden skies of this space began to turn a shade of crimson.","A shade that caused his Heart to palpate as hundreds of crimson singularities formed from halcyon lemniscate as each was the size of one of the mountains of loot already forming below!","It was the appearance of Loot that caused Noah's multiple Hearts to cry out and for his Origin to tremble!","<2,500x Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas have been generated.>","...!","The allure of stellar crimson gold loot light came to wash over everything!"]},{"number":2175,"title":"Chapter 2175: Chapter 2174 The Ambrosia Of Loot! II","paragraphs":["<2,500x Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas have been generated.>","The Crimson color they held superseded any version of red Noah had seen before.","They seemed like millions of thin rivers of crimson Realities coalescing together to form a massive circular Panacea- a panacea that made itself look like the very fruit of Reality!","The aura it gave off caused his forming 8th Dimensional Layer to tremble and seek this Panacea fervently, but he held it back as a resource like this was reserved for the last and final Dimensional Layer which would be Elysium!","But these wonders came down with fantastical glory as more prompts unfurled.","<The most Quintessential Loot obtainable by the current state of Absolute Loot Authority has been generated.>","WAA!","The most Quintessential Loot.","Forget about anything else that had the chance to come after the Crimson Dimension Reality Panacea- it was granted the accolade of the Most Quintessential Loot attainable to him under his current Absolute Loot Authority.","And this...was a prompt that caused Noah's soul to release a pulse of spatial light as everything around him slowed and came to a halt.","He steeled his heart while gazing at the golden skies that dripped with the ambrosia of Loot light- at the Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas that were calling out to him!","And he wondered.","He had been debating how to proceed forward in the expansion of his power- and exactly which area he wanted to expand his authority as he reached the same stage of power of Boundary Expansion that Ancestral Descendants had attained.","Yes.","Boundary Expansion!","This was the alternate Realm that the Ancestors termed when they left behind Nature Integration- and it was for beings who did not integrate with Nature as instead, they expanded the Boundary of concepts and authorities!","They did all this with a singular aim to achieve a stage that their True Enemies had achieved- a stage coming after Boundary Expansion as it was known as EXTREMITY.","When an existence reached the absolute Extremity of a Boundary as it could not even be expanded any further.","Boundary Expansion, and then EXTREMITY!","All of the Ancestral Descendants that came into the Barren Lands were at the stage of Boundary Expansion, including the unveiled existence that had deployed the VOID.","If any of them were at the stage of EXTREMITY, Noah and everyone else would have just had to pack their bags and wait for slaughter.","But the stage of Boundary Expansion was attainable as Noah just had to choose a concept and expand it!","The question came to him on exactly what he should expand the limits of.","He could utilize the Shards of Concept Modifiers to increase the Augmentations of Natural Laws and Decreta, or expand the Boundary of his Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Techniques, or even the True Authority of Quintessence that was calling out to him and coiling around his Throne!","But now as he gazed at the ambrosia of Loot cascading down...","He questioned how he got where he was.","And the answer was Loot.","His ability to get Loot that could then be multiplied in Quality and Quantity multiple times over.</novelsnext>","The Absolute Loot Authority...that granted him what he needed the most.","Of course, he had to have had the offensive and defensive power to kill- but there were many more powerful beings who had nowhere near his speed of progression!","The critical factor remained Loot!","And in a construct like the Infinite Forge, he didn't even need to fight anyone to gain the most fundamental forms of loot.","This was because before his very eyes, he was attaining Panaceas that no enemy had dropped yet.","Of course, he still understood that power was at the basis of everything as the advent of the All Source Enhancers and RUINATION who could Decuplicate Loot and make everything that was happening right now a possibility did stem from the Loot of the enemies that Noah killed in the past!","So there would have to be a balance in the distribution, but at this moment...Noah's Heart was leaning towards Expanding the Path of Loot. The Boundary of Loot!","He wanted to elevate Absolute Loot Authority to unimaginable levels.","He wanted to attain Loot multiple times above the killed enemy in quality and quantity!","He wanted his very cells to drink the ambrosia of Loot every waking moment!","He wanted even more of this type of Loot where even by doing nothing...it simply came to him.","HOOONG!","His thoughts were wild and vibrant as Providence surged with maddening fervor- seemingly edging him on as he smiled.","His soul had formed a corporeal form that reached out towards the descending Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas as one of them landed on his hands, his eyes vibrant as they saw through this fantastical treasure.","<Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea>:: A Quintessential Loot brought to fruition by the authority of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor in his bid to enact a grand foundation. This Loot serves as the final piece required to complete the last stage of progression for a type of Quintessential Foundation in the shortest period of time. Its stage nears the treasures that the Quintessential Kainos Emperor has just begun to glimpse from the information of things outside the Barren Lands, with a single Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas being equivalent to 100,000 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas. It is what is required for the completion of a grand foundation. It is what is needed. And so here it is!","WAA!","A glorious and precise description!","And one that caused Noah to smile brilliantly when reading it.","This was because the formation of the final Dimensional Layer would have required Obsidian Dimensional Panaceas in the Billions.","The resources became greater and greater the higher up one went, and after the required resources were multiplied by 128 for the Eighth Dimensional Layer, the resources for the Ninth Dimensional Reality were 256x those required for the Layer behind it!","But with the advent of the Crimson Dimensional Panaceas and the fact that Noah could multiply them tenfold...","\"2 days.\"","...!","His Will was luminous and shining with incandescence as he said these words.","2 days!","He would only need 2 days as the next collection of the Infinite Forge after another 24 hours passed...would grant him everything he needed to fully complete his Ninth Dimensional Reality!","All without touching or fighting to the death against a single enemy!"]},{"number":2176,"title":"Chapter 2176: Chapter 2175 The Ambrosia Of Loot! III","paragraphs":["The path towards the completion of his Foundation became clear.","Within a period of fewer than 2 days, he could complete all Dimensional Layers and achieve something that would have otherwise been impossible!","As he grasped the Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea, this was his only present thought.","But this didn't stay for too long as his consciousness was pulled and tugged upon by something else from the golden Lemniscate in the halcyon skies.","<Providence has shone upon you!>","<100x Aeonic Soul Pills have been generated.>","...!","<The Generation of Loot has ended for the previous 24 Hour Cycle.>","Pure transparent circular crystals that looked like stellar transparent cosmos rained down as they reflected the image of the surrounding skies.","Pure. Transparent.","These were the words one would feel when gazing at these fantastical treasures as they were means to strengthen one's soul!","A type of rate Treasure that would be much sought after even outside the Barren Lands.","And yet Noah was getting his hands on it as when his piercing eyes tried to gain some clarity on these new items...","<Aeonic Soul Pill>:: The Soul is the crux of power. It can dictate how strong the Origin and Body of an existence are as it is the Soul that can comprehend the limitation and understanding of Boundaries, which in turn affect the extent of power one can display. Raising the strength of one's Aeonic Soul is extremely arduous, and Loot that can directly refine one's soul for an elevation in power is even rarer. The Aeonic Soul Pill is capable of elevating the Aeonic Soul Value by .25, making it one of the rare treasures that even beings outside the Barren Lands cannot look down on. A Preliminary understanding shows that this loot can only be affected by an EPOCH IV Relic, so the means of quantity alterations of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor are bound to be meaningless at his current stage...","An addition that caused Noah's eyes to squint as he came to grasp the pill that looked like a transparent Cosmos, its grandeur fantastical as it was akin to looking at an object that released waves of Haki constantly.","An object that increased one's Aeonic Soul Value by .25!","To understand just what this would signify, one had to know their own Aeonic Soul Value.","And in Noah's case, his own Soul had tabulated what he believed to be his comprehensive Quantification of this Value as when he stared at his expanded Status Panel that could spread for a few pages, a multicolored number showed itself that when one focused on it...a small description bloomed!","<Aeonic Soul Value>:: A Quantification of the dynamic relationship of one's soul and the extent it can affect their own Reality and the surrounding Reality. The greater the Soul Value, the greater the control and capability of altering one's own Reality and their surroundings. A high Aeonic Soul Value can dictate the rate that one comprehends abstruse Concepts, the expansion of the boundary of Concepts, the extent of Reality Alteration, and the usage of the Soul to directly alter Reality. When one utilizes their Soul in the alteration of Reality, their Value will momentarily reduce and regenerate over time- something that is also affected by how high the Aeonic Soul Value is. An inquisition into the Soul is required to better grasp the full understanding of one's Aeonic Soul Value. Current Aeonic Soul Value: 78/80. 5% of one's Aeonic Soul Value will regenerate every hour, with this rate being affected by external forces...</novelsnext>","The relationship of one's soul and the extent it can affect their own Reality and the surrounding Reality!","Its uses were profound and unfathomable as while forming his Eighth Dimensional Layer, Noah's aspect of the soul was quantified to be 80!","This was the number that came up after looking at him comprehensively...and it was somewhat correlated with his own Realm as since he had 7 out of the 9 Dimensional Realities forged and he was beginning on his Eighth, his Value came out to be approximately 80.","When completed all of his Dimensional Layers and continued receiving the profound elevation of his Aspects of Existence, this Value should reach 100!","But when Noah came across the new skills that would display their Reality Altering effects by stating they would utilize a tenth or a Hundredth of his Aeonic Soul Value, this was the number they were drawing from.","And there was still much to learn about it as Noah needed to quantify the rate of Regeneration of this value fully, because the end of the description stated that it could be affected by external factors as this was the case for him- where there were multiple factors around him that were contributing to his Aeonic Soul Value regenerating rapidly!","This was because after he nearly drained himself through the usage of Infinite Dream, he felt that his soul had nearly returned back to full power after the passage of just a few hours.","So this didn't match the 5% Regeneration expressed in the description of the Aeonic Soul Value.","The factors that could have affected this included the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, Dual Cultivation, absorption of Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas and All Source Enhancers while elevating his Realm...and even his connection to the bound Sources of Nature and the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","All of these were things he had to fully quantify and grasp to better understand his power before he faced the unreasonable Ancestral Descendants, so his gaze returned to the Aeonic Soul Pills that increased one's Value by .25.","They couldn't be Decuplicated by RUINATION at her current stage, but these fantastical treasures could directly take Noah's Aeonic Soul Value to exceed what stage he would be after the completion of his Dimensional Layers!","It was a fantastical Reality to come as Noah wondered...how would this affect the Body and Origin?","From the description of the Aeonic Soul Value, it showed that the stronger it was, the greater one could augment the power of their body and Origin as would Noah be capable of forming his Kainos Royal Cosmos even faster? Require even fewer resources while forming his Dimensional Layers?!","When one Aspect of his became overly strong, other aspects would be pulled up even faster!","There were many more possibilities to think about as the only way to find out...was to elevate the power of his Soul and see for himself.","HOONG!","So he beckoned towards the 100 Aeonic Soul Pills while the mountains of Loot within the Infinite Forge all began to disappear and began their transfer into his Expansive Space!"]},{"number":2177,"title":"Chapter 2177: Chapter 2176 Unprecedented! I","paragraphs":["Noah beckoned towards the Aeonic Soul Pills so he could begin to utilize them, while all other Loot that was capable of being multiplied in quantity by RUINATION went to the Expansion Space to undergo this process!","Meanwhile, Noah's Soul began to devour the Aeonic Soul Pills as the portion of his soul remaining in the Infinite Forge grasped one of these stellar transparent crystalline masses on each hand, their size beginning to reduce as he devoured them while his manifested soul released multicolored rays of radiance!","When the transparent waves of essence surged into him, utmost euphoria was experienced as Noah felt a profound strengthening that would normally take the stupendous elevation of one's Realm to occur.","A strengthening that would normally take millions of years for others!","HOONG!","Austere waves of power emanated out grandly as the myriad of Aeonic Soul Pills were pulled towards his soul, everything being sucked up cleanly as a major part of him took great strides in power.","At the same time this occurred, the majesty of the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence was blooming in his Expansive Space where mountains of loot were transferred over- with this Blade focused on multiplying the Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas and All Source Enhancers as the moment they were finished, they were funneled towards Noah's Origin as his Eighth Dimensional Layer fully began to be established with speed!","In this manner, Noah could also observe any changes in Realm Progression while his Aeonic Soul Value was also increasing.","The Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas would be devoured first as thereafter, the All Source Enhancers would follow.","It was the devouring of loot from many sources as within his Origin, a Seed had already bloomed as essence gushed down from all around to help its formation.","A gorgeous Blue color could be seen pervading across this Dimensional Layer that stood above the multicolored Quantum Dimensional Reality.","It was Fantasia!","Its floor was a vast and incandescent sea with such a dense blue hue that one would be blinded by it if they stared for too long.","Above this cerulean sea, a brief sky could be seen as even this...held traces of smaller blue seas floating mystically!","They all shone with cerulean color that was so bright and dense as it continued to flash constantly due to the formation of Kainos Royal Fantasia Cosmos that bloomed within the very seas and liquid skies- beautiful stellar blue cosmic light flashing constantly as Billions of Cosmos formed rapidly.","Noah gazed at every minuscule thing happening as with his Aeonic Soul Value also elevating in power, he could distinctly feel the speed that his Eighth Dimensional Layer devoured the Essences of the Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas was becoming ever faster, to the extent that the All Source Enhancers had to be brought forward very quickly to provide as much essence as possible!","And when they came into the picture...","BZZZT!","In the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, Noah's main body had to momentarily stop his Dual Cultivation with the Seeker of Knowledge as his main body released a heavy burst of power and majesty.","He was devouring the Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas and All Source Enhancers directly from his Expansive Space as it seemed like essence was just pouring into him, but due to his Aeonic Soul Value continued to rise due to the Aeonic Soul Pills- a billowing authority covered everything about him and caused his Origin to feel like a dry desert!","Like a sponge that was desperately taking in all Sources of water around it- and so the Essence of all Decuplicated Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas was instantly devoured as the nearby All Source Enhancers were instantly broken down.","50 Trillion Kainos Royal Fantasia Cosmos.","80 Trillion.</novelsnext>","120 Trillion!","Noah's 8th Dimensional Layer which should have undoubtedly taken him much longer to form due to its greater resource requirements...it was being formed at an unprecedented rate as in a matter of seconds, it jumped from barely 5% formed to 60%!","And for the seconds that followed, the grandeur of blue dominated as after 5 seconds...","SHIING!","A cerulean ring of light spread with Noah at the center as a completed Dimensional Layer buzzed with grandiosity.","Within seconds, Fantasia was completed!","<You have successfully completed the Eighth Dimensional Reality.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","<A version of Pure Undefined Authority has been isolated for your future use above the Fantasia Dimensional Reality.>","<Through your reign over the Fantasia Dimensional Reality, a level of influence can be exerted in the Fantasia Dimension.>","Prompts began to cascade down as Noah's Aeonic Soul Value experienced successive jumps, becoming 90 even without accounting for the additions due to the Aeonic Soul Pills!","And this number was exceeded as Noah finished devouring the Aeonic Soul Pills that with their .25 addition each, 25 Aeonic Soul Values were added to his majesty!","It caused profound waves of power and incandescence to bloom out as in this state, Noah did not want to waste this profound feeling of Resonance at all.","So he ignored the rising prompts of completing the Eighth Dimensional Reality, his Will coming to latch onto the vibrant Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas that had already begun to be multiplied next by RUINATION.","A bit over 2 Million All Source Enhancers were utilized on the formation of the Eighth Dimensional Layer after an initial 4.8 Million Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas were devoured, so there were still well around 3 million All Source Enhancers that he saved for the purposes of elevating constructs or concepts like the Infinite Forge as he now turned his attention on the Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas!","He did this as before the boons of the recently built layer could even be shown...","\"Begin the formation of the Ninth Dimensional Reality.\"","WAA!","The allure of gold exploded.","The allure of Elysium was called upon to be the base for the final Dimensional Reality.","The Will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor exploded with waves of unbound Tyranny as he wasted no time to see the end of his Foundation, his power scaling upwards steadily in order to stomp the coming enemies!"]},{"number":2178,"title":"Chapter 2178: Chapter 2177 Unprecedented! II","paragraphs":["The winds of change.","The coming of something utterly fantastical and inevitable that when it neared...some beings could instinctively feel it!","As a tyrannical existence took great strides forward with unbelievable speed, the ushering of something new could be felt within the minds of all those powerful enough.","Within the vast stretches of the Boundary Between Realities.","A man floated in this void of Reality as he grasped the hilt of a sword in front, the sharp sword point pointing down as it caused a line of a rupture across the fabric of Reality extending downwards for many light-years!","It was the grand visage of Theseus who caused the other Ancestral Descendants to gaze at him with respect and even a hint of veneration!","It was the renowned existence with great accomplishments in the Boundary of the Sword!","Behind him, a small Legion holding swords similar to his floated in a profound formation as they waded across the Desolate Mausoleum.","At this moment, the pupils of Theseus illuminated with a golden sword light that caused his eyes to squint while gazing at the far reaches of space- seeking something he didn't know of!","But the sword light shining gold in his eyes showed him something akin to what Providence or Destiny would show an existence who was extremely proficient in such concepts.","This was because when one reached a sufficient stage in Boundary Expansion, a concept would not be limited to a category of merely offensive or defensive!","Unimaginable things became possible as geniuses like Theseus who could attain such a stage with the few billion years he had lived...was rare.","So this existence felt the winds of change. But he wasn't the only one.","Far from his location in the Desolate Mausoleum, the visage of The Quantum Emperor floated alone as his gaze seemed to contain countless hidden truths, a pondering expression on his face as he continued searching!","Within folds of the Elysium Dimension.","Hideyoshi thought he felt a pulse echo out across the Dimension in addition to the feeling of great change occurring, his True Authority of Fate burning with golden grandeur as he tried to see the innumerable paths that would unfold!","In the Niflheim Dimension, a shocking battle was blooming as its participants also felt a similar sensation.","All of them felt that something significant was occurring as they had to move even faster since they didn't know exactly what!","—","In the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","This very construct of clusters of Realities and Dimensions was currently pulsing with grandiosity as they resonated with their Master- the Realm he was on the cusp of attaining being something closely linked to it as well!","9 Dimensional Realities within his Origin, and there were 9 Dimensions that the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality sought to devour and layer them on its current fabric of Reality.","The two were not at all separate as even the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality itself expectantly waited to see what authority was in store when the Origin of its Master had all of the Dimensional Realities forged!</novelsnext>","Its will focused on the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature where the visage of Noah's body could be seen.","All activity was paused during this juncture as not just Noah's main body, but even his Clones momentarily stopped their activities as Eowyn, Barbatos, the Seeker of Knowledge, Guinevere, and all others in the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature looked towards Noah and the oppressive pressure he released with a hint of awe.","His body glimmered with 9 stellar bands of light, the Eighth cerulean band that was recently finished shining with utmost incandescence as a golden band was currently in the midst of forming!","The 9 Dimensions were in his Origin, but it seemed like his very body had the foundations of 9 stacked Dimensional Layers that had golden pillars of Ascendancy Stanchions and mountains of Reality Passages supporting everything.","It was utterly glorious to observe as from his Expansive Space, Noah absorbed the Decuplicated Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas while still observing the terrifying effect of an overly strong Aeonic Soul!","He affirmed that even though the Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas should have been granting the same effect as 100,000 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas each, this number was being curved upwards as he...may not truly need to wait until the next cycle of the Infinite Forge to achieve completion of this stage of his Realm.","A stage that after he achieved it would come the question of...exactly where he took it from here.","He was walking on a path he forged himself as he could rely on the methodology that others had designed, but his path was a unique one as there were infinite possibilities as to what he could do with it!","These thoughts, possibilities, and more surged within Noah's mind as while the Elysium Dimensional Layer began its formation, he allowed the prompts of the accomplishment of the Eighth Dimensional Layer to descend over his eyes.","<The Undefined Authority under you has quintessentially increased.>","<The concentration of Undefined Authority has reached a critical level as its identity begins to unfold before you.>","...!","<Your Understanding of the Decretum of Fantasia has been forcefully raised to 50%.>","<Your Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been elevated to the Maximum of 64 Billion.>","<Your Maximum True Vitality Values have risen to 128 Trillion.>","<Your rate of Progression in the Decretum of Fantasia has increased by 1,000,000%>","<The saturated Paramount Kainos Fantasia Dimensional Reality grants a base addition of 14,800,000 Dimensional Fantasia Damage and Defense Values, bringing your Overall Origin Base Value to 28,280,000.>","<20x Pure Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds has been obtained.>","His might continued to scale upwards as his base stats experienced Quintessential increases, his life force becoming even more abundant as if someone sought to destroy his main body...the forged Dimension themselves would act as an anchor to prevent dreadful results!","One of the more critical things was that the Undefined Authority that Noah was collecting this whole time while he was forging Dimensional Realities...it had begun to be quantified to his eyes as he truly reached a precipice!","This Undefined Authority was one that allowed him to already pull upon the Anchors that chained the Desolate Mausoleum as it was closely interconnected with the workings of the Barren Lands!","Just...what would Noah be able to do with it at the completion of the Dimensional Realities?"]},{"number":2179,"title":"Chapter 2179: Chapter 2178 Unprecedented! III","paragraphs":["Undefined Authority!","This essence surged with blinding brilliance and unveiled its pure white grandeur, shining above the Dimensional Realities and being pulled up towards the highest Layer where Elysium was forming.","It was as if a brilliant white star was rising across stellar layers of planes as when it reached the top...","SHIING!","Incandescent white light illuminated Noah's upper body.","He felt an immense weight of this light as information gradually began to flow into his mind- only now realizing just what importance this Undefined Authority held!","But the grandeur of this essence was too robust as quantifying it took its time, with a missing piece being this same essence produced from the Final Dimensional Layer that was still in its beginning stages right now.","As soon as this was in place, Noah would be able to put together all the pieces and be granted the right to use this Undefined Authority!","And since this was the case, he focused on the completion of this final Dimensional Layer as Decuplicated Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas liquefied to grant their essence unto him, the seed of the Elysium Dimensional Reality already bloomed while fantastical halcyon cosmos formed.","This Layer had the same color as the Dream Dimension, and yet its halcyon grandeur didn't have the sandy feel of the Dream Dimension- instead being very free flowing as if the color itself was simply pure light!","A light that would nourish one's aspects of existence and lead them onto the path that best suited them.","An essence that had a unique relationship with Providence as the two resonated greatly with each other!","The planar floor of this Dimensional Layer was a vastly stretching aurora of light, this aurora extending upwards as one couldn't differentiate a sky.","Amidst this surging halcyon aurora, golden Kainos Royal Elysium Cosmos formed en masse as their number already exceeded a few Trillion and continued scaling upwards.","While intently watching the formation of this Layer, Noah continued to monitor the changes of the previous Layer and make sure he wasn't missing any steps- his Will urging Ascendancy Stanchions and Dimensional Reality Passages to rise up between the Quantum and Fantasia Dimensional Layers as their upper tier was expanded yet again!","<Your Affinity to the Decreta of all Dimensions has risen greatly!>","<Your Maximum Number of Ascendancy Stanchions is now 3,000.>","<Your Maximum Number of Infinite Reality Passages is now 4,680.>","<The Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique is Devouring the Fantasia Dimensional Essence and Refining its authority.>","<Your Dimensional Body and Soul continue to experience a profound strengthening and elevation.>","<You have arrived at the point of no return with the completion of the Eighth Dimensional Layer.>","<Proceeding forward and completing the Ninth Dimensional Reality is considered a Quintessential Irreversible Nexus Event as even the reversal of time cannot reverse or alter your Realm after this.>","...!","260 Cycles of the Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique were completed as the number of Quintessential Dimensional Infinite Reality Passages reached a ridiculous number of 4,680 due to each cycle increasing the capacity by 18 Passages.","His Ascendancy Stanchions rose from a maximum of 2,000 to become 3,000 as his Value Multiplier increased even more!","But forgetting all of these numerical details and what they signified for now...it was the last two prompts that caused Noah's gaze to become cold.","In Reality, there were Irreversible Nexus Events that occurred and affected the Main Path and even extended to the countless Parallel Paths.","The Ancestors shackling Reality, OPPENHEIMER splitting apart Reality, and Noah removing the Anchors from the Desolate Mausoleum were perfect examples of events that simply could not be reversed after they had occurred!</novelsnext>","Now, Noah was crossing the threshold as with the formation of the final Dimensional Layer, it was considered a Quintessential Irreversible Nexus Event for him!","If he took and finished this step, he could not go back.","If this path was grand in the beginning but not viable towards the end, he couldn't just return across the spacetime continuum or do anything that could reverse what he was about to establish.","Irreversible.","Quintessentially Irreversible!","This was a prompt that might have carried a tremendous weight for genius existences that had lived for millions or billions of years, making them take a pause to just fully grasp the brevity of their choices and actions and how they would affect them in the future.","Whether establishing a new path to follow was worth it when there were so many unknowns!","It was a prompt that could have created doubt in others and whether what they were doing was truly the path to follow!","Yet when the Quintessential Kainos Emperor saw it...","\"HMPH!\"","WAA!","His Will was roused instead.","His Tyranny surged from the depths of his heart as fantastically, his very Soul cried out in grandiosity as the burning torrents of the Essence of thousands of Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas that were already multiplied by 10 through RUINATION...all of this essence was tyrannically and unbelievably devoured into his Ninth Dimensional Reality instantly.","Every single Decuplicated Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea disappeared!","After the consumption of the Aeonic Soul Pills, Noah saw that the effect of these Panaceas were greatly expanded from the initial equivalency of being worth 100,000 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas- Noah being able to establish his Kainos Royal Elysium Cosmos with a reduced requirement as if he could approximate and quantify it, a single Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea was granting him the equivalency of a range of 150,000-160,000 Obsidian Dimensional Reality Panaceas.","It was a massive and ridiculous increase in efficiency.","It was a change that would be enough to not make him wait a whole day until another cycle of the Infinite Forge came!","But due to the range of equivalency ranging, all of the Crimson Dimensional Reality Panaceas would get Noah close to completing everything...but not all the way there!","So from his remaining few millions of All Source Enhancers...a vast majority also disappeared instantly from the command of a budding will of Tyranny reacting to the prompt of Quintessential Irreversible Nexus Events.","Until...","Everything stopped.","No more essence was taken into Noah's Origin.","There was nowhere for it to go before everything underwent reconstruction and rebirth!","This was because in a span of not microseconds or nanoseconds, but an instant- Noah had reacted tyrannically toward a prompt that questioned his resolve to continue on this path as he absorbed everything needed for the Ninth Dimensional Reality right then and there.","And in that instant...all 200 Trillion Kainos Royal Elysium Cosmos flourished.","\"...\"","The hardest, most resource-requiring, most arduous layer to form, the last and final Dimensional Layer....it was formed and finished at an even shorter time than the Layer that came before it as it took but an instant!"]},{"number":2180,"title":"Chapter 2180: Chapter 2179 My Path! I","paragraphs":["The tyrannical will of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor felt like it was besmirched!","Like the prompt that had risen before it had intended to make him pause just for a second to think about his completion of the 9 Dimensional Realities!","So his soul roared out with dominance and grandiosity as he let it be known that he fully trusted himself in the path he followed- and he would never regret it.","To him, there was no worry of the future and whether this path he followed would make way for grander pastures or possibly fail.","He simply...held such immense levels of confidence in himself that he knew no matter the outcome, he would overcome it and come out on the other side with even more majesty.","It did not matter that he could not reverse it once he proceeded forward!","And to show this conviction, he completed one of the more profoundly Quintessential acts in his life by completing the hardest Dimensional Layer to forge...faster than even the easiest and First Dimensional Reality that he forged.","An instant.","This was his answer.","And it was a mighty response!","HOOONG!","A blaring sound akin to a horn blowing away the farthest ends of Reality bellowed out as it stretched out across the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","It then extended much further outwards as without revealing its Source, this bellowing horn responded out across the far reaches of the Boundary Between Realities!","It cascaded into the folds of space to even echo out across the remaining Anchors, this bellowing horn causing many heads to turn!","It was the coming of something utterly glorious that let itself be known.","At the very source of this booming bellow, Noah's visage could be seen.","It was spotlessly pure at this juncture as his whole body had seemingly turned transparent.","His stellar vessels, bones, organs, and musculature could be seen as overlapping all of these were 9 layers of pure incandescent light.","They began with gold at the very bottom and finished with gold at the very top.","Dream, Avalon, Prana, Apollyon, Mirror, Niflheim, Quantum, Fantasia, and Elysium.","9 Layers of Dimensions overlapped on his body as at this moment, they pulsed with magisterial Resonance to release a pillar of pure white light- light that coveted Noah entirely as it exploded into tendrils that began to spin around him like a web!","Like a cocoon!","And it had to be so as his body and Origin were undergoing a profound transformation, his soul also following as before he became fully wrapped in the white cocoon, those near this region of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature could already see his stellar skin beginning to peel off of his body as if he were a canvas.","This was what they saw.","But for Noah...it was very, very different!","For him, many things happened in the span of an instant as it seemed like countless Prompts rained down, but he could only focus on a single one that pervaded into his mind.","<The Undefined Authority has been quantified as the Authority of this Era.>","...!","The Authority of an Era!","An Era!","It was something that constituted of an unknown number of Ages as after the Olden Era, there came the Kainos Era!","This Era had only just begun with the Age of Quintessence, and at this juncture, it was shown that Noah had been collecting the authority of this entire Era through his actions when he began to build Dimensional Realities that correlated to the actual 9 Dimensions.","It was Kainos Authority!","<Attaining the Authority of an entire Era is an impossibility that only became a possibility after the actions of the Ancestors that enacted cycles of Ages. Your path and actions have made it possible for you to accumulate this profound Authority due to their direct effects on the fabric of Reality.>","WAA!","Even more information surged into Noah's mind, but it wasn't just this as this terrifying torrent of Kainos Authority was currently pushing inside his body as if it could explode out at any second!","<Your Aspects of Existence are currently undergoing a Quintessential Transformation.>","<The forged 9 Dimensional Realities are resonating with the 9 Dimensions of the Barren Lands and portions of its fabric of Reality.>","...!","At this juncture, the Dream, Avalon, and Apollyon Dimensions in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality began to pulse with Resonance.","A low thrumming pulse as waves of transparent light echoed out towards Noah's figure and bounced off of him joyfully!","A unique phenomenon bloomed as it didn't just affect the 3 Dimensions Noah had bound to his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, but the remaining 6 Dimensional Planes stretched out across the folds of the Barren Lands.","The very Sources of these Dimensions began to resonate.","It was the build-up of something unprecedented and incalculable for others as Quintessential changes took place!","And while this effect occurred outside Noah's body...","<The Authority of the Age of Quintessence is being mobilized to reforge your Aspects of Existence.>","RUMBLE!","Utmost glory and brilliance emanated from him as the backbone of a throne above and behind Noah released blinding light, a surge of multicolored stellar essence gushing from it and sinking into the white cocoon in a show of grandiosity!","But this wasn't all!","<The Authority of the Era of Kainos is being mobilized to reforge your Aspects of Existence.>","...!","<Your current Tier of Existence cannot withstand too much Kainos Authority.>","<You have gained the unique privilege to direct and focus the usage of the Authority of this Era towards a specific area of yourself.>","The Authority of an Era that could not be freely controlled!","It was a culmination of a prize for a lot of hard work, and it granted Noah the right to focus a portion of it on a specific area that he wanted.","His choice would be crucial as this was one of the critical boons for completing all 9 Dimensional Realities!","Would he focus it further on his Aspects of Existence that were already being reforged with this Authority? Would he focus it on his Systems? RUINATION? The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality?","No.","His Will was luminous and unfathomable as it gazed at an extremely far away place.","And then...he spoke with surety!"]},{"number":2181,"title":"Chapter 2181: Chapter 2180 My Path! II","paragraphs":["<You have gained the unique privilege to direct and focus the usage of the Authority of this Era towards a specific area of yourself.>","Towards such a prompt asking Noah for an area of focus, it could only be met with his Will tyrannically voicing out what he sought the most.","\"Loot.\"","WAA!","\"The Authority of Loot, nay...the Boundary of Loot- expand it as much as possible.\"","...!","There were a great deal of Boundaries that existences chased towards Extremity.","Noah had gained an idea of their many examples when briefly residing in the Automaton Boundary Modulator of True Empress Katya, but he didn't seek any of them at this juncture!","Not the Boundary of Karma, Sword, Light, VOID, or anything similar.","LOOT!","This was the path that Noah chose as from his own experience, he wanted to see it to the very end.","Towards EXTREMITY!","<The Authority of an Era is gazing at the Modus Operandi of Loot.>","<The Authority of an Era has begun expanding the Boundary of the concept of Loot under the Quintessential Kainos Emperor.>","WAA!","Subtly, Noah felt something tucked away in a corner of his Soul rouse and begin to pulse.","It was a profound and foreign sensation that had only just begun, its results entirely unknown!","And at the same time this began, the resonating and completed Dimensions released their prompts unto his mind!","<You have successfully completed the Ninth Dimensional Reality.>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","<Your Authority as an Emperor of this Age quintessentially increases!>","<A version of Pure Kainos Authority courses through you!>","...!","<Your Understanding of the Decretum of Elysium has been forcefully raised to 50%.>","<Your Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been elevated to the Maximum of 264 Billion.>","<Your Maximum True Vitality Values have risen to 512 Trillion.>","<Your rate of Progression in the Decretum of Elysium has increased by 1,000,000%>","<The saturated Paramount Kainos Elysium Dimensional Reality grants a base addition of 59,200,000 Dimensional Elysium Damage and Defense Values, bringing your Overall Origin Base Value to 87,480,000.>","<40x Pure Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds has been obtained.>","Ah!","The last layer truly was a special one as his Maximum True Vitality Values and Essence of Reality were quadrupled!","His base defenses and Damage Values were even more robust as even with these listed Values...one must be mindful that his reformation was still not complete!","All of this came on top of 40 Pure Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds that when multiplied in quantity...ensured that Noah would be mastering any remaining Natural Law he didn't grasp his hands on.","At this moment, he already had all the Decreta that correlated to his forged Dimensions at 100% Understanding, and as soon as he completed the 9th Dimensional Layer- the Decretum of Elysium was also forcefully taken towards 100% in this frozen moment of time.","In this instant of time, it signified Noah completely understanding all 9 Decreta of Dimensions and even binding the Sources of three of them!","And the prompts continued to roll in at such a time.","<Your Affinity to the Decreta of all Dimensions has reached the Maximum Value>","<Your Maximum Number of Ascendancy Stanchions is now 6,000.>","<Your Maximum Number of Infinite Reality Passages is now 6,480.>","<The Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique is Devouring the Elysium Dimensional Essence and Refining its authority.>","<Your Dimensional Body and Soul are currently undergoing a Rebirth.>","<You have crossed the threshold of no return with the completion of the Ninth Dimensional Layer.>","<The only path for your Realm is the path forward.>","<Through your reign over the 9 Dimensional Realities, a level of influence can be exerted in the Barren Lands.>","...!","The Barren Lands!","He had gained the authority to influence not just the 9 Dimensions- but the Desolate Mausoleum was also included to make it all of the Barren Lands!","And at this extremely critical juncture...","HOOONG!","The surrounding fabric of Reality trembled with torrential waves of a rousing will- a will that was newly Empowered with the removal of Apollyon.","It was the Will of Reality.","It had blatantly promised Noah that when it was given the chance in the future, it would do whatever it could to take such a chance to gain control!","Now that he had completed his 9 Dimensional Realities and was resonating with the very fabric of Reality...","This terrifying will rose.","Would it truly keep to its promise and attack Noah at such a juncture even after everything that had happened?","<The Source of Reality is gazing at you.>","\"...\"","Within the incandescent white cocoon, time continued to remain stagnant as Noah's Will was about to surge out with all of its power.","And yet...","<The Source of Reality is enumerating countless possibilities.>","...!","<The Fabric of Reality within the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality has been freed of Reality's control.>","<The Fabric of Reality outside of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality calls out to the Source of your Construct.>","<The Effect of Infinite Dream has been increased by one thousand times.>","HOOONG!","A terrifying progression.","The Source of Reality...chose not to fight Noah.","In the wake of all new entrants and powerhouses and existences with their own aims...the Will of Reality went against its own words and did not choose the path of conflict!","And this particular decision and event occurring at the same time as Noah completing his Dimensional Realities and undergoing great change...went on to add to this already ridiculously Reality breaking process.","Noah's body.","The Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","The 9 Dimensions.","And the vast stretches of Realities in the Desolate Mausoleum!","Just once...all of these constructs pulsed with a wave of Resonance.","....!!!","A wave that in Noah's eyes was quantified in the most beautiful way possible.","<With the usage of Kainos Authority, Quintessential Authority, and the support of the Source of Reality, the Quintessential Kainos Emperor can directly affect, displace, and remove the Anchors pressing down on Reality.>","WAA!"]},{"number":2182,"title":"Chapter 2182: Chapter 2181 The True Throne Of Quintessence! I","paragraphs":["<With the usage of Kainos Authority, Quintessential Authority, and the support of the Source of Reality, the Quintessential Kainos Emperor can directly affect, displace, and remove the Anchors pressing down on Reality.>","\"...\"","An austere prompt presented itself amidst the profundity as even Noah's Will stared at this blankly for a moment.","Up until more information on it was revealed as when Noah wondered exactly what extent or limitations the words affect, displace, and remove had...the very fabric of Reality around him buzzed as it was Reality itself that began to converse with him.","<<Your current accumulation of Authority along with the Authority of Reality can work in conjunction to allow the removal of the function of at least 3 Anchors. Displacement is possible for the same number of Anchors to grant the same function of the removal the suppression. This is the path I saw after countless calculations.>>","...!","Noah listened calmly while his Aspects of Existence underwent reformation, his thoughts on the logistics of it all as he asked lightly.","\"What about the existences currently within selected dimensions that undergo Displacement?\"","Yes.","If Noah used the limited authority he had and displaced a Dimension that held terrifying Ancestral Descendants into his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality, this was a recipe for disaster as he had yet to scale his current strength against theirs!","<<For even greater levels of control of the fabric of Reality to be capable of even rejecting existences within it, you will need to place under your control the key to the Source of Reality and the remaining Fundamental Treasures of Nature.>>","...!","The Key to the Source of Reality!","Naturally, it was the Heart of Reality!","Noah already had the Heart of Destiny in his hands as he could rip the Heart of Karma and the Heart of Fortune from Lilith whenever he wished.","Now, he had to collect the rest of these treasures as there was the location of the Heart of Fate to find out about!","But since Reality itself had finally taken a step towards Noah after gazing at countless possibilities, it could definitely take a few more.","The white cocoon that covered Noah had multicolored waves of light bounce off of it as the voice of Reality resounded in his mind.","<<The Heart of Reality is within the grasp of the Tribunal in the Main Reality. The Heart of Fate is in the hands of the Quantum Emperor. I can lead you to them.>","WAA!","A terrifying development for Noah's enemies.","An utterly balance breaking development as the very Will of Reality was now an active guiding factor that was aiding Noah!","Under the effects of the VOID, it was very hard to navigate and peruse through the Barren Lands at this moment.","But the very Fabric of Reality that was pervasive throughout? It could sense which existences were crossing through it and where!","It was a despairing Reality for those that stood against him!","\"I see...then we should get started!\"","...!","The white cocoon he was in pulsed as he urged its completion.","His Body, Origin, and Soul cried out as they were reformed into something even more pristine!","HOONG!","From the white cocoon, a fair white hand glimmering with a stellar radiance flashed out as the layers of white began to crumble.","And even more prompts cascaded out.","<Your Aspects of Existence have undergone a Quintessential Kainos Baptism.>","<Both the Essence of this Age and the Essence of this Era have reconfigured your Existence.>","<You have achieved a Quintessential Soul.>","<You have achieved a Quintessential Body.>","<You have achieved a Quintessential Origin.>","<You have achieved the Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation with your Quintessential Aspects of Existence that exceed all other Foundations established across the Ages and Eras!>","BOOM!","More and more cracks spread across the white cocoon as a being bathed in blinding stellar radiance stepped out, his body pristine and unblemished and without anything covering its glory!","Those in the surroundings couldn't help but squint their eyes and gasp as they barely saw the visage of this being, and this was because apart from his body releasing ridiculous waves of radiance- there was something just as fantastical blooming behind him.","Eowyn, Guinevere, and some of the truly older existences that had lived across the Ages felt their hearts tremble at what appeared behind Noah.","There was a throne that was turning extremely solid.","A throne that wasn't the Throne of Quintessential Tyranny.","It was the True Throne of Quintessence!","Those who had lived across the Ages had felt a type of Authority similar to what was currently emanating from this throne- an Authority that different Emperors had used for many different actions!","Others had used this authority to reign with Tyranny before they left, and the more recent example was the Emperor of the Last Age that put everything on the path of destruction.","Now, they felt this same authority on a Throne that shone with much more incandescence than any of the ones they had seen before.","It was solidifying behind him as after calling out to Noah, it now floated behind him as it released waves of light that were seemingly calling for an enthronement!","He...didn't seek the True Throne at this juncture.","It had called out to him, and it was now manifesting and coming to him after he exceeded all others in this Age. As he achieved Quintessence in all aspects!","He had even achieved a Foundation that took into account everything about him- his Aspects of Existence, Concepts, Constructs, and even something as unique as the Heart of Mana.","And when all of it came together- especially the boons of the Heart of Mana contained in this Aeonic Foundation...","<Your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation allows you to cast all abilities requiring less than 1,000 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality at no cost.>","<Your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation allows you to cast all abilities requiring less than 10 Aeonic Soul Values at no cost or strain to your soul.>","...!"]},{"number":2183,"title":"Chapter 2183: Chapter 2182 The True Throne Of Quintessence! II","paragraphs":["<Your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation allows you to cast all abilities requiring less than 10 Aeonic Soul Values at no cost or strain to your soul.>","...!","These were the shocking prompts emanating out as Noah broke out of the pure white cocoon and stepped onto the outside space!","Those gazing at him only saw the grandeur of stellar blinding radiance as he unfurled his hands and scrutinized his body.","Yet the moment that his hands moved across space...","BOOM...CRACK!","Space trembled and shattered.","\"....\"","The mere wave of his hand shattered the nearby fabric of Reality as it held unbelievable explosive power that was not contained by Noah!","He had to first actively understand this level of strength and then control his body to express it whenever he wished, the prompts to explain this phenomenon cascading down right then and there.","<Due to the strengthening of your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation, your Body has gained equivalent defenses to an EPOCH III Relic, being capable of withstanding 100 Aeonic Damage Values. You can also release a force of 100 Aeonic Damage Values from any part of your body at will without the cast of any ability- just purely from the stage of your body alone. This level of body strengthening will only increase in the future as you illuminate your path forward and establish your Realm with your robust Foundation.>","WAA!","Yes!","This was the true boon of the Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation!","A foundation forged atop 9 Dimensional Realities, concepts, and constructs that shockingly made Noah's body equivalent to an EPOCH III Relic in toughness!","Even putting aside the passive defenses Celestial Lich's Armament, Beacon of Thorny Consecration, and his Innate Dimensional Barrier- just his body alone could now defend against 100 Aeonic Damage Values while being able to release this exact same number with any part of him.","A punch with his fist.","A flick of his finger.","The movement of his hair!","Every single part of him could explode with shocking power as all this...was only a part of what was to come as this type of body- Noah could continue to elevate its ranking and grandeur over time.","It was a phenomenal boon.","And the foreign sense of torrential damage that Noah released just from the swing of his hand had to be contained as just when he came out of the cocoon, he stopped and closed his eyes while his Will washed over every part of his body.","He felt every crevice as his Will even delved into his very cells, the ferocious power he released being understood and reeled in as his eyes flashed open with ferocity soon after!","SHAA!","A blinding white light flashed out as Noah breathed in slowly, moving his body again as even while his limbs moved across the fabric of Reality...it wasn't fractured and destroyed.","But there was still more that he found out for himself while another prompt rolled down!","<Due to the strengthening of your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation, your Aeonic Soul Value has risen to 225. Your Soul can now freely control the release of your Will in the form of Haki to release a targeted or a burst of 25 Aeonic Soul Damage Values. Your capability to expand Boundaries has also been greatly enhanced as you can more easily induce epiphanies of the soul. This level of soul strengthening will only increase in the future as you illuminate your path forward...>","<Due to the strengthening of your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation, your Origin has become a type of Epochal Engine that can progress through future Realms at a 1,000,000% increased rate of Progression. In the future, it will follow the most natural path of progression and Quintessentially reduce the chances of taking the wrong path. This level of Origin strengthening...>","His Aeonic Soul Value which was supposed to have reached 100 at completion was more than doubled! In addition to the 25 added by 100 Aeonic Soul Pills, Noah's Aeonic Soul Value reached a terrifying 225!","This number may seem foreign as one may not be able to fully wrap their mind around its significance due to not having comparators to compare to, but it was a stupendous achievement regardless.","His Origin also experienced its own boons along with the body and Soul as the Foundation that Noah had set up for himself...it had truly set him up for success as it would be doing its best to follow the most natural path.","This may be a positive and a negative at the same time as what if what Noah wanted to do was not in any way natural? There were many things to think about with this advancement as Noah finished observing his Aspects of Existence thoroughly.","With all these changes, the way he fought would change.","Not in any major ways as he would still be spamming- especially since he did not have to pay the cost of abilities costing anything less than 1,000 Billion Units of the Essence of Reality or less than 10 Aeonic Soul Values.","But now...he could suffocate his enemies with 25 Aeonic Soul Damage Values by releasing a burst of his Haki.","Soul Damage was always extremely hard to defend against compared to other Damages, and in these stages of power where Soul reigned supreme...having one's Damage specifically geared towards the Soul would make you an existence others feared!","The existences who expanded their Boundaries to a high enough level reached this stage where everything they released could affect the soul!","Yet Noah had it simply due to his Quintessential Soul.","\"Hoo...\"","Noah breathed out as torrential waves of essences surged out with his breath alone, the control over his newfound power being established as now...he turned his gaze behind him.","Shining splendorously with multiple colors, a solidified throne floated grandly as a solid Quintessential solidified crown floated atop it!","It was a throne that would grant one tremendous control and power over the True Authority of an Age.","Over the True Authority of Quintessence!"]},{"number":2184,"title":"Chapter 2184: Chapter 2183 The True Throne Of Quintessence! III","paragraphs":["True Emperors chose to use their True Authority of an Age carefully during their reign before another Age began.","After attaining it through years of battle and proving themselves, this was a reward that they utilized to the fullest!","And it was a reward that came with immense power.","\"...\"","Noah stared at the glimmering multicolored throne that seemed to be carved out of the fabric of Reality itself, its stellar makeup inducing just as much awe as the solidified crown floating above it.","He had continued to exceed all others and prove himself Quintessential in this Age to the point that this throne called out to him and even now appeared before him! It was done in such a unique way as the enthronement of any True Emperor varied, but none was as peaceful as this!","Noah reflected back to where he came from and where he now was even as other prompts were slowly passing in the back of his mind.","<The structural make up of the Ascendancy Stanchions has been bathed with Quintessence as they begin to evolve...>","<The Quintessential Natural Born Infinite Mana Physique has been bathed with Quintessence as it begins to evolve...>","Even as prompts like this and more continued to come down, Noah reflected on his past self as right after such brief contemplation...his stunning visage began to ascend towards the dazzling multicolored throne.","An Imperial Emperor's robe that was one of the Connate Relics to come out of the Infinite Forge draped over his fair stellar body, his Ascension in the space of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature causing the hearts of all those in the surroundings to beat even faster!","Guinevere stared at the dazzling throne with mixed emotions as the being she followed her intuition to follow had truly arrived here.","It meant she had taken the proper path for her and her people as she waited to see the results!","There was Morgana beside her who didn't have the eyes of defiance anymore when she gazed at Noah- all of such defiance being wiped away by the Tyranny of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor during the Dual Cultivation session under dilated time.","Then there was Eowyn.","She had a much stronger connection as she was with Noah for much longer, and she had watched him spout his ideals and what he wanted to achieve as many times...she had acted as the voice of common sense to tell him that it may not be possible!","But now, she was glad to have been wrong this whole time.","THRUM!","A booming low thrumming hum began to emanate with Noah's Ascension towards the True Throne, the Will of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality moving as this scene became reflected across the folds of space of these vast lands.","Before the eyes of his mother and Little Henry.","Before the eyes of the Longest Dream and Albus.","Before the eyes of the Emperor Penguin, the Kraken, and Kazuhiko.","Before the masses within these lands as they all gazed you to see an Emperor be enthroned and crowned!","The stellar robe he wore only magnified his majesty and beauty as after his baptism with the Authority of this Age and Era, he had become even more exceedingly handsome as his hair had reverted back to its original dark color, with a few streaks of gold, purple, blue, black...all the colors of the Dimensional Realities adding to the radiant darkness of his head.","He arrived before the True Throne with an expression of utmost majesty and power his hand reaching out to stroke its armrest as prompt began to rise.","<You have accumulated the most Authority in this Age and exceeded all others in terms of Quintessence.>","<You have earned the right to sit upon the True Throne of this Age.>","There was nobody to fight him for it right here and now.","So he gazed at its wonders as his body turned around, overlooking the torrential waves of the Essence of Natural Laws in this Domain of Nature and the faces of the women gazing up towards him- some with looks of reverence!","Then...","His visage fell back as if the True Throne was magnetic, a pulling force calling out to him as his figure instantly came to be enthroned atop it!","....!","Radiance erupted out.","Shocking waves of incandescence exploded as with the True Throne as the center, a blinding pillar of multicolored light shot out from above and below and stretched out endlessly across space!","A blinding pillar of multicolored light that seemed to reflect countless illusory images of a man sitting upon a throne- his visage too crowded by countless waves of essences to be seen by others.","These reflections of countless illusory images... were not just that.","They traversed far and wide.","These reflections traversed across the space affected by the VOID as before ever Emperor who had attained a solidified crown...","The image of the enthroned True Emperor of Quintessence appeared!","One of the first was the figure of Lilith who saw everything with clarity. Her demonic eyes weren't as dim as before as she still gazed at what was happening with too many mixed emotions.","Her mind could almost see her figure as the one sitting up on the dazzling throne, but even as that image began...","BZZZT!","It was ground out of her mind to be replaced by the glorious visage of the being that was currently sitting upon this throne!","Others would not even be able to fantasize before the authority of this Throne as it made its master known across the folds of Dimensions and Reality!","The image of a True Emperor covered by waves of essence appeared before all Emperors who entered the race in this Age, but it also seemed to taunt the invaders that had intruded upon this Age not too long ago- the visage of the True Emperor blooming before the Ancestral Descendants who gazed at it with utmost coldness.","The scene they observed showed the figure of a man sitting on the Throne as parts of his radiant face could barely be seen- with a dazzling solidified crown shining with the Ecritures of QUINTESSENTIAL DIMENSIONAL EMPEROR beginning to descend from its high position to crown itself on his head!","But at this juncture, the right hand of the magisterial being sitting on the True Throne of Quintessence rose as the descending solidified crown came to a halt.","His gaze then turned towards a certain direction as he beckoned for someone to come.","He would not merely have the crown descend to his head to signify the completion of the enthronement. He would grant this honor to a being that had started this path with him at an early age, believing in him against all odds after her eyes had discovered his blinding golden grandeur in the Frozen Kingdom of the Beast World!","He beckoned towards the Frozen Queen as she floated to instantly appear before the True Throne of Quintessence!"]},{"number":2185,"title":"Chapter 2185: Chapter 2184 The True Throne Of Quintessence! IV","paragraphs":["The Frozen Queen appeared before the True Throne of Quintessence!","Not Eowyn. Not Barbatos. Not Guinevere. Nobody else but Adelaide!","Noah gazed at the Mother of his child as he nodded towards her, her exceedingly beautiful face, blue eyes, and dazzling cerulean hair bringing a burst of colors as the solidified crown above Noah floated before her.","Her fair hands trembled slightly as she came to hold this crown, the man before her nodding once more as he tipped his head down ever so briefly.","HOONG!","The torrential waves around him surged along with his movements as a burst of royalty erupted from Adelaide, her eyes filling with courage and power as she recalled the first moments of this being who had suddenly appeared in the Snowy Peak of the Frozen Kingdom.","The place where her [Golden Rule] had told her this was the being to put her life on!","The world where he had attained the Spiritual Land that was elevated to become the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality today.","All of these images crossed her mind as she was granted the authority to actually hold the True Crown of Quintessence, her fair hands bringing it forward on the man waiting for her as she came to crown him with a surge of grandiosity.","HOOOONG!","The moment the crown sat on his stellar head, even more blinding surges of light exploded out as the very fabric of Reality began to resonate out a message that traverses across the farthest reaches of Reality!","<The existence who expressed Quintessence in all Aspects has taken reigns of the Authority of this Age.>","...!","Even though wars and chaos were blooming all around.","Even though a blanket of the VOID covered everything as others feared the end!","Before their eyes at this moment, bountiful information was relayed to them.","In the shortest possible time since the start of the Age of Genesis, a True Emperor was crowned.","And this was shown and told with glory across the far reaches of the Desolate Mausoleum as a shockingly fantastical message traversed outwards at this moment!","<True Emperor Osmont has taken the True Throne of Quintessence.>","A message that shone with grandiosity!","There were many different contenders for Quintessence, but one being had achieved it in the shortest period of time across the Ages as his name...was Osmont!","...!","In the myriad of Primordial Temples across Realities.","The Seers scrambled to their positions as they looked at a name etched in their Primordial Blacklist!","Across the folds of space, in the Quantum Dimension.","True Empress Katya stared at the image of the man seated upon the True Throne of Quintessence as she overlapped this image with the same being who she had killed the clone of not too long ago!","Her expression was grave as she knew what came with attaining the True Authority of an Age.","It granted one the power to do a great deal of things, with some Emperors capable of utilizing a much greater concentration that far outstripped others- a more recent example being OPPENHEIMER and his usage of the True Authority of Destiny on an action that had nothing to do with him.","He didn't utilize the True Authority of an entire Age to propel his power or Aspects of Existence and grant himself the uniqueness that True Emperors had outside the Barren Lands- he instead used it all to split apart the Main Reality!","And yet when he was forced out of the Barren Lands, he was still illustrious even now as his Existence was truly a mystery.","Now, another anomalous Emperor had risen after him.","Someone that the Ancestral Seers had seen nothing about.","What exactly would he use his authority for?","This thought was not just shared by Katya alone as far from her location, in the Niflheim Dimension...","BOOOM!","An 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE surrounded by countless titanic Aeonic Undead Chaoticus Beasts gazed towards the image of the True Emperor of the Age of Quintessence as Yvonne and Her Legions were moving about busily to contend with the Boundary of Death that he released!","There were fewer Ancestral Descendants in the field compared to when this battle began as in this battle for attrition...it was clear who was winning.","Yvonne ignored the illustrious image of an Emperor atop a throne as she had to have all her focus in this battle, but the 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE stared at Noah's visage freely as his eyes held countless thoughts.","\"The Variable of the Key to this Age is moving much faster than anticipated...I'll have to take things seriously and put in some more effort, Little Rabbit.\"","...!","Like an apex predator eying its prey.","\"The Boundary of Death is an interesting one to play with, but have you had the pleasure of facing the full Boundary of the VOID?\"","WAA!","Horrific words that caused Yvonne's eyes to turn somber echoed out, the darkness in the surroundings becoming extremely dense as waves of Obsidian light began to surge out of the 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE- the VOID erupting with a light of regality and ennoblement as it threatened to suppress everything!","—","\"...\"","A buzz of power.","A light of brilliance!","This was the only thing Noah felt as his head rose after allowing Adelaide to place the crown on his head, his eyes opening to see her legs trembling as she was unconsciously kneeling due to the sheer pressure he released after the crowning!","His aura erupted to cover her as she breathed easier, also extending to cover all those in this region of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature as shockingly- the burst of the True Authority of Quintessence had inherently caused all those nearby to fall to their knees!","Even after Noah reigned on this aura, some still couldn't find the strength to rise as his piercing gaze was still focused on rows of prompts cascading down before him.","<You have gained the title of the True Emperor of an Age.>","<You have gained the title of the True Emperor of Quintessence.>","<You have gained access to the accumulated True Authority of Quintessence across all of Reality. This Essence can be accessed and utilized through the True Throne of Quintessence.>","<Like all the Emperors in the Ages Past, the Source of Reality beckons you to release it from its shackles.>","...!"]},{"number":2186,"title":"Chapter 2186: Chapter 2185 True Emperor Osmont! I","paragraphs":["<Like all the Emperors in the Ages Past, the Source of Reality beckons you to release it from its shackles.>","WAA!","This message appeared before Noah amidst the acceptance of a profound authority.","Through the multicolored True Throne of Quintessence he sat on, it felt like he had gained access to a key that could open a massive gateway.","A gateway that held within it boundless accumulated authority- the True Authority of Quintessence!","In the past Age, the True Emperor of Destiny, OPPENHEIMER, had utilized his throne as a key to unleash the True Authority of Destiny to split apart Reality. But just like Noah, he had received the prompt from Reality that asked him to release it from its shackles.","His answer was not to use the authority for himself as it made one wonder.","Since Reality had to have multiple True Emperors make the choice to remove the Anchors suppressing it, were OPPENHEIMER's actions actually selfless to begin loosening the restrictions of the Desolate Mausoleum, or was there something larger at play?!","One could not be sure of this.","But what Noah could be sure of were his own actions.","So while he sat on the True Throne of Quintessence with surging waves of authority, he spoke out in a frequency only a single entity could understand.","\"Is that truly your wish or just a basic message all True Emperors receive?\"","WAA!","Yes.","Did Reality truly want him to use the True Authority of Quintessence on the removal of its shackles, or was this just something all Emperors saw?!","<<What would have required other True Emperors to use their True Authority of Age to do, you can accomplish due to your 9 Dimensional Realities and Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality. There should be more than enough Authority of Kainos to achieve the removal of the Anchors. Your True Authority of Quintessence is something you can utilize towards whatever will benefit you the most, or whatever will help achieve your goal of binding the rest of the Anchors to your Gourmandizing.>>","The Source of Reality spoke to the recently crowned Emperor as this being currently burned with multicolored authority.","He was already able to do what were considered Irreversible Nexus Events even before he attained the Throne.","He was removing Anchors that the Ancestors placed without utilizing the True Authority of an Era or the True Authority of an Age!","Now that he had these, what he could do was only expanded to alarming degrees.","His majesty and regality at this moment were at the very peak as his image was shown to those prevalent in this Age, those in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality being most affected as they were connected to this existence before he took on such a distinction!","They gazed at his illusory image as at the forefront, the black and gold flippers of the Emperor Penguin rose up as if they were reaching out to the image of the personage on the Throne.","The Emperor Penguin remembered when he first met this being and actually challenged him with the other Spiritual Beasts when he wanted to take control of the Spiritual Land.","He remembered how this being had taken them all on a path of power they could have never imagined!","He remembered all this as golden tears of pride and joy dripped from his stellar eyes, the raised flipper clenching tightly as the Emperor Penguin bellowed out.","<Long Live the True Emperor!>","WAA!","A symphony was playing with incandescent glory.","Drums of victory and glory emerged across the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as they were even carried by the waves of Quintessence to resound across the fabric of Reality!","<Long Live the True Emperor!>","Booming reverberations echoed out across the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as the Vassals of the True Emperor called out to celebrate this achievement.","It was a day for great happiness and celebration to have their Master attain the highest position in their current Age, but it was also a sad day for some!","This was because some beings that were familiar with the True Emperor and had met him very early on found a unique change when they called out his name.","Kazuhiko was gazing at the visage of the man on the True Throne as he wanted to call out his name.","But when he began, he felt his Origin become riled up as his Mana and Essence of Reality began to burn- all of it going towards his mouth as just to utter the name of the being he considered a friend...he had to pay a price in Essence!","<Long Live True Emperor OSMONT!>","HOONG!","His name had gained distinction.","His name had gained reverence!","To utter it, one had to pay a price!","For his vassals, the minimum it was reduced to was 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality and 1 Million Units of Mana just to utter his name.","And for them, this was a privilege as those who weren't his vassals, the price was more than 10 times just to utter out such a distinguished name!","<True Emperor OSMONT!>","Kazuhiko called out again as his eyes carried a trace of sadness amidst his happiness, seeing that the one he considered a friend was so far away and so distinguished that he may not be able to smile freely and joke around him as before.","And if his name and identity carried such distinction to his vassals...","CRACK!","It was even more so for his enemies as at this moment, on the walls holding the Primordial Blacklists within Primordial Temples.","CRACK!","The walls were cracking as if the Essence that maintained them was not enough to hold the name written there, Seers scrambling away as their eyes burned when they had tried to peer across the veils to understand the absurdity that was occurring!","The Absurdity of the True Emperor of the current Age being listed as their enemy on the blacklist!","BOOM...CRACK!","The walls of the Blacklists shattered as it seemed like Reality itself was admonishing them for having such a distinction on such a list, the structures of the myriad of Primordial Temples across Realities trembling and beginning to crack- their very foundation falling to the ground!"]},{"number":2187,"title":"Chapter 2187: Chapter 2186 True Emperor Osmont! II","paragraphs":["In the Mirror Dimension.","Surrounded by the VOID, a massive Nature Integration Realm Dragon with dazzling blue eyes lay at the center of a stretch of countless Legions, a visage of the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence floating above him as it was a False Epochal Blade of Quintessence granted to this existence by the very True Emperor he saw the image of in the VOID!","It was the visage of Eckert.","His deep blue eyes held countless emotions as a rueful smile appeared on his lips, his grand voice echoing out.","<It seems nobody else can be the main character in this Era apart from him...>","He had grand dreams.","He had aspirations as well!","He had risen up at a fast speed that exceeded others who took billions of years!","But at this moment, he accepted that he had lost in the brilliance that this being showed.","The being he had appeared in front of as the Great Usurper was now so far and above that it seemed Eckert could only gaze at his shadow!","Whatever fortune and destiny lay remaining in these lands, it seemed that it would only go towards a single person.","Yet Eckert's confidence and resolve didn't waver.","The cerulean eyes of the Dimensional Ruler he dominated released tendrils of blue light as in the face of a dominating destiny and grandiosity, he didn't waver!","<When all this is over, shall I see what lies outside the Barren Lands?>","WAA!","He spoke grandly as he didn't develop any feelings of inferiority from this, focusing on himself and his own path as he thought of the girl embroiled with the Primordials and his Sister that he had safely hidden away in the folds of his System.","He thought of many things as his bright eyes only gazed towards the future!","—","His enthronement was a grand one as his Vassals paid their respect.","But in the midst of this all, he still had to make moves as his enemies were not waiting for him!","And for what he had to do first, he could start without finishing all preparations!","So while seated upon the True Throne of Quintessence that constantly urged Noah to access its vast reserves of authority, his voice echoed out as it was directed towards Reality itself.","\"Then...let us move.\"","HUUM!","The True Throne of Quintessence vibrated and released waves of austere authority as Noah wanted to make a few moves after attaining the apex authority of this Age!","The first move ushered wisps of the True Authority of Quintessence that Noah could now freely control as his deep voice filled with majesty and regality boomed out to all Lands outside of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality.","At the same time his voice bloomed, his eyes also half closed as he activated the <Infinite Dream>, billions of wisps of his Will being carried into the words of Quintessence!","<True Emperor Osmont commands Fealty to those who seek salvation!>","...!","Across Realities and Dimensions.","A message spread as the first edict of the True Emperor of Quintessence was to command Fealty to those across the Barren Lands that wished to be saved!","It was a dark time.","The VOID covered everything as weaker existences who didn't have any control of the Natural Laws could barely even see their surroundings!","To the vast masses, a terrifying Apocalypse had descended that began by taking away their sight, and they had no idea what would happen next.","But now, the illusory scene of a True Emperor being enthroned bloomed as soon after, they saw his austere authority descend to them! For them to be saved out of their current predicaments!","This message appeared not just before the vast existences, but also before the Infinite Realities as Noah had separated billions of wisps of his Will with the activation of the Infinite Dream.","His first action was to bind the countless Realities and all the existences within them unto him, and it didn't even require a thousandth of the vast reserves of the True Authority of Quintessence!","Across the vast folds of space filled with the VOID, countless Wills rose to answer the vibrant essence of Quintessence.","The Wills of Realities began to glimmer as they accepted a Will to wrap around them and begin traversing them across the folds of space and towards a single location!","This was just the first action.","As its effects bloomed, the True Emperor of Quintessence gazed towards a direction of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality and tapped his finger, space folding and twisting as the figure of Lilith appeared emotionlessly, her bountiful chest splitting open to release two glimmering hearts that flew towards him!","The Heart of Karma and the Heart of Fortune.","Verdant and gold lights mixed in as these Hearts came before Noah and sank onto his own chest, his visage becoming ever brighter as he gazed at the figure of Lilith with her chest closing back up, a voice that only she could hear emanating in her mind.","\"The only thing wrong you did was seek the same authority as me. Now, you can only follow my will and maybe gain a semblance of contentment from the deaths of those you burn with hatred for.\"","WAA!","The Dimensional Hellion Ruler Lilith received consolation as her bleeding chest closed, her gaze filled with rage and possibilities as reached out towards the multicolored True Throne of Quintessence as if it was right before her grasp...only for it to disappear soon after.","The True Throne of Quintessence and the Emperor that sat atop it disappeared as they delved even deeper into the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, seeking isolation to absorb everything that had occurred while at the same time- his other bodies began to move.","SHIING!","The Quantum Dimensional Chassis that experienced a Rebirth along with Noah's Main body disappeared as it followed the lead of the very fabric of Reality towards the direction of the Heart of Fate held by the Quantum Emperor!","The Apollyon Dimensional Chassis also disappeared as it followed the lead of Reality towards the Main Reality where the Heart of Reality stood waiting under the hands of the Tribunal!"]},{"number":2188,"title":"Chapter 2188: Chapter 2187 Do You Know Who You Are? I","paragraphs":["Two Dimensional Clones disappeared from the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as they went to seek the remaining two Fundamental Treasures of Nature!","When Noah's main body had undergone baptism, so did his Clones as the link between the Chassis and the 9 established Dimensional Layers was especially strong.","To the extent that these 9 Clones correlating to the 9 Dimensional Layers had their own boons that had yet to be quantified- with their changes still in progress!","Two of them had set off as even if Noah wasn't fully done with all the preparations, he still had to begin making moves.","His enemies had made many moves, and it was now time for Noah to make his as while his main body took time to understand all the changes from attaining the True Throne, the expansion of all his concepts as he had to open up Caches and Loot Boxes, utilize the Shards and Pearls of NULLITY to further this concept further, watch the blooming of the Boundary of Loot that was being expanded by the very Authority of this Era, and many more things...his Clones made moves outside of the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as the reign of the True Emperor of Quintessence truly began!","—","His blue eyes always saw the farthest reaches of space and time as his vision was far above what lay in the Barren Lands.","He utilized his calculation eyes and the second Heart inside of him that shone with white gold grandeur- the Heart of Fate that showed him innumerable paths and allowed him to be greatly proficient in viewing the Parallel Paths.","At this moment, his Heart of Fate gradually began to lose its white gold luster.","It was not a good sign.","It meant that among the many possible Paths that could unfold in the near future, the number was shrinking as the possible Paths became very few.","As for what the cause of it could be...CONSTANTINE gazed at the illusory image of the Emperor situated upon a throne that had yet to fade as he could make some guesses.","He was a being that came from the Quantum Singularity Lineage that traced back all the way to the Ancestors!","He had many in his Lineage utilize the Pylon of Ascension to leave the Barren Lands and attain great power outside, with him even receiving a unique authority in this Age that would have been more than sufficient to place him on top and attain the True Throne.","But it was attained by another as even in such a defeat, the Quantum Emperor did not waver.","He had that much confidence in himself and his Lineage, as well as everything that lay outside the Barren Lands.","Unimaginable power lay out there as he had only just tasted a semblance of it!","Just because he could not attain the True Throne of Quintessence, it did not mean it was the end of his path. Having the distinction of a True Emperor gave one an edge, but it wasn't everything outside the Barren Lands.","There were many True Emperors to come out across the many Ages past who had left the Barren Lands, but not all of them were still alive today!","Becoming a True Emperor was not everything. Outside of these lands, one had to have support to truly thrive and not be decimated by the tides of power and war.","And he...had all the support he could ask for while beings like OPPENHEIMER and this OSMONT? They would be branded as those that had gone against the Will of the Ancestor as how far could they thrive in Lands where Chaoticus Beasts alone ravaged everything? Lands where terrifying and noble beings like the NOBLESSE reigned supreme?!","The Will of the Quantum Emperor remained solid as he thought of the current development and stopped spreading his aura out, coming to a decision and choosing to retreat while relying on the power of Ancestral Descendants to take care of this existence that had risen to the heights of this Age.","He looked at the illusory image of True Emperor Osmont upon the Throne as he tugged upon his connection with the Quantum Dimension, feeling its pull and about to leave when suddenly...the image he was looking at seemingly became very real.","From the illusory image, a corporeal face stepped out of the void to fill the image of the True Emperor of Quintessence as the eyes of the Quantum Emperor shone sharply- his senses telling him they were one and the same!","The being who had become the True Emperor of this Age actually appeared before him just as he gave up his search, the Heart of the Quantum Emperor calm as even in this situation- he did not become worried!","<You ran away the last time we were on the same battlefield, are you only confident to appear before me now after attaining the True Throne?>","WAA!","His regality and prestige were still maintained as he spoke, but it still lost out to the grace and royalty that the True Emperor of Quintessence currently gave off as waves of Quintessence surrounded him!","A sneer rose on his face as the pressure of his body alone was maddening.","\"Is that truly something that an old man who's been plotting for billions of years and even received outside help only to still lose to someone that hasn't even lived to a century...are such words really something you can say confidently?\"","BZZT!","Words that caused the eyes of the Quantum Emperor to turn extremely cold emanated out as he stabilized himself in space. He stared closely at the visage of the recently enthroned True Emperor as he felt the Heart of Fate increasingly lose its luster.","The number of paths continued to reduce, but it did not mean destruction. After all, in these Barren Lands...nothing existed that could cause his destruction!","<The experience I have and the aid from outside you scoff at is precisely the reason why I am not worried even at your appearance here. You may have come here thinking that with the Authority you now control, you can do something against me. I will tell you now that the result...will be the same as before.>","The construct that was at the peak of this Age before it was surpassed in the past day!","Something that made death...an extremely far fetched reality for the Quantum Emperor!"]},{"number":2189,"title":"Chapter 2189: Chapter 2188 Do You Know Who You Are? II","paragraphs":["<I will tell you now that the result...will be the same as before.>","...!","Confidence.","This was the feeling emanating from The Quantum Emperor as he stared at the visage of the True Emperor of Quintessence that gave off waves of Quantum Essence!","It was a Confidence that was backed by a strength only he fully understood, and it was why a personage like him could keep his cool even at such a juncture.","Withstanding the grandeur of the True Emperor before him who had begun to smile devilishly, CONSTANTINE continued while nodding.","<I'll give credit where it's due. You're a genius to have achieved Quintessential feats amidst all this and even exceed what I have, but that's it. Even with all that you have achieved, it will not be enough. You may have the True Authority of Quintessence, but so what? You saw True Empress Katya who has the True Authority of Karma. Or True Emperor Hideyoshi with the True Authority of Fate. But...they are just that.>","<Your path is illustrious now and in these Barren Lands, but outside of it...you will not be able to survive, O True Emperor of Quintessence.>","BOOM!","As if he was giving a verdict.","As if his words were the very Natural Laws!","A unique authority raged around him in the form of the construct that granted him the confidence he had!","But even in the face of this, the devilish smile on the True Emperor of Quintessence became ever deeper as he placed his hands behind his back while floating closer towards the Quantum Emperor.","\"Do you know who you are, Constantine?\"","He asked this question nonchalantly as he appeared right in front of the Quantum Emperor in an instant.","The two were inches apart as the authorities around them surged, the body of the Quantum Dimensional Chassis Alone beginning to release shocking waves of pressure as they showed the Foundation that could defend against and receive 100 Aeonic Damage Values with ease!","A level of damage that this being before him could not even come close to withstanding!","So the devilish smile on Noah widened as he continued.","\"What you are is a blip on a glorious path. An extra that isn't even all that well developed. You'll appear and make some inconsequential waves, and then you'll disappear just as quickly. Only to be forgotten a few pages later.\"","WAA!","His words were damning as a terrifying authority bloomed.","It wasn't something profound or abstruse, and it was even attached to the last word that the True Emperor of Quintessence said next!","\"You are [nothing].\"","BOOM!","The word [Nothing] was coated with a wave of Haki.","A flash of the Soul of the True Emperor of this Age that could release 25 Aeonic Soul Damage Values in an instant!","And something that utterly eviscerated everything before Noah's eyes as the light within the Quantum Emperor dimmed first, and then his body exploded into countless dredges of dust while a white gold heart became the only thing that remained!","<...>","It was an unbelievable and shocking show of dominance as in a matter of days, Noah had risen from moving in the dark and being wary of the most powerful beings in the Desolate Mausoleum...only to now be capable of killing one of them with a mere shout.","This was Quintessence.","This was why he became the True Emperor of this Age!","SHAA!","His hand reached out to forcefully grasp the white gold Heart of Fortune into his hands, and he had to do this forcefully because its current owner...was shockingly still not considered dead.","As Noah forcefully pulled the Heart of Fate from the position it floated in, the dredges of dust that were the Quantum Emperor began to collect and reform the body right where it stood before seamlessly returning him to exactly how he was before Noah's Haki ravaged everything!","...!","The reason for his confidence.","The power behind his construct!","<While I may not be fully sure how your Construct became considered Quintessential, the construct I have that you scoff at is something that exceeds these Desolate Lands. I have no qualms enlightening you on it as it is something that at its core...holds wisps of one of the Boundaries that allowed the Ancestors to stand against the NOBLESSE outside these lands.>","WAA!","Yes!","CONSTANTINE's Construct did not have a Natural Law or Decreta behind it as it had a Boundary- and a particularly ridiculous one at that at its foundation as this was what he had received from his Lineage on top of the treasures required to forge it!","<It is the Boundary of IMMORTALITY. A Boundary that stood against the Tyranny of NOBLESSE...and one that I mixed with a Fundamental Natural Law that very few existences Across the Ages have grasped in the Barren Lands.>","As he stood inches away from the True Emperor of Quintessence with his reformed body, he stared at the Heart of Fate struggling in the hands of this being as he thought of his own achievements.","How he had studied the Parallel Paths so much that he was able to catch a glimpse of and attain...the Fundamental Natural Law of Continuity.","What kept the cycles of Ages going and what even placed itself as the regulator of the myriad of Parallel Paths and branching Realities.","Continuity!","He paired this achievement of his with a construct born from the inscription of the Boundary of IMMORTALITY that someone from his Lineage sent down, and the result was the Construct of Immutability.","Where he gained a state that was incapable of being changed by others!","His life and death...could not be dictated by them as even if they released enough damage to desegregate and erase everything about him, he would return back to the state he was in and remain unchanged.","This was something that could not be altered or bypassed unless someone had utilized a Boundary nearing IMMORTALITY in power!","CONSTANTINE may have been worried if it was the existence who had released the VOID around them as there were too many unknowns with such a being, but a True Emperor who was still so closely interlinked with Natural Laws?","The Quantum Emperor shook his head while returning a dominant smile of an Emperor of his own right towards the True Emperor before him.","<If you had sided with the Ancestors and attained a wisp of a Boundary, maybe you would have had the chance to oppose me. But as you are now...nothing you have will be able to even erase me.>","Inches from each other, two Emperors floated.","The regality and grandeur around them was baffling as the one who emanated the most glory as the True Emperor had the ends of his lips curving up in an even more devilish fashion, his voice callous as his body began to ebb and flow with a blinding gold light!","\"As I said, you are merely an extra that has already taken up too many pages.\"","WAA!","An authority began to blare forth gloriously from Noah.","It was something far and above anything he had utilized before.","It wasn't an Edict, Decreta, or a Natural Law.","It was....a Boundary."]},{"number":2190,"title":"Chapter 2190: Chapter 2189 A Ridiculous Boundary! I","paragraphs":["A glorious symphony was playing the moment Noah finished his words.","\"...you are merely an extra that has already taken up too many pages.\"","BZZT!","Their figures were still close to each other as the Quantum Emperor felt the blooming wave of authority very closely.","It truly didn't align with neither Law nor Decreta as it was something he had once felt when his Construct was in the process of being born!","It was the aura of something utterly pristine as it had its own set of rules while seeking EXTREMITY.","It was a Boundary.","It was something that finally caused the eyes of the Quantum Emperor to flatter as his unbreakable walls of confidence thinned just a little as he wondered...","It shouldn't be possible, right?","The being before him couldn't have somehow attained a Boundary and already begun expanding it towards EXTREMITY, right?!","Alarm bells finally began to ring in the mind of the Quantum Emperor as he retreated from Noah and widened the distance between them.","He was confident in the Construct of Immutability, but he still would not be careless in the face of unknowns!","But just as the blinding golden light of authority had erupted around the True Emperor of Quintessence and covered his body with an utterly ecstatic light...this being floated utterly still without doing anything.","His smile only became deeper.","He didn't make a move, and yet it seemed like he was enjoying this current situation!","'Just what...'","Seeing the pulsing Heart of Fate still connected to him in this being's hands, the Quantum Emperor wondered just what this existence was up to!","And if one were to change their point of view to the True Emperor of Quintessence himself, they would notice a fantastical oddity that even the Quantum Emperor could not see.","An oddity that actually originated from the body of the Quantum Emperor himself as one could see it was surrounded by a radiant cluster of golden light, and incandescent golden cylindrical pathways of light emanated from the cluster of his golden light and connect to the body of the True Emperor of Quintessence, these pathways carrying unique things only visible to the eyes of the one who had erupted with the Boundary of Loot!","On these golden cylindrical pathways, one could see points of starry light leaving the field of gold of the Quantum Emperor and disappearing into Noah's body, these points of light having names and quantities under the eyes of Noah!","<+10,000x All Source Enhancers>","<+1 Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea>","<+1 Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea>","<+1 Pearl of Continuity.>","<+.01 Shard of the Boundary of IMMORTALITY.>","<+.01 Shard of the Boundary of IMMORTALITY.>","<+1 Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea>","...!","A shocking phenomenon where from the body of the Quantum Emperor, Loot followed cylindrical pathways to flow into Noah's Expansive Space as even though he seemingly didn't make any move after he activated the Boundary of Loot, he had done something utterly incredulous!","And all this...could be attributed to the prompts that had risen in his mind not too long ago that told of the successful expansion of LOOT towards Extremity.","<The Boundary of LOOT has been expanded by the Authority of an Era.>","<2 Boundary Layers were exceeded on the path of LOOT.>","When one expanded the Boundary of a path, it was akin to a small ring being expanded.","Every so often, a threshold of this ring would be exceeded as an actualized result would bloom- and Noah had managed to already exceed 2 layers on the Boundary of LOOT.","What Layers others had reached or what was considered normal...Noah did not know.","He only knew what boosts exceeding 2 Layers in the Boundary of LOOT granted!","<The First Boundary Layer of LOOT >(Passive):: All those targeted by the Boundary of Loot shall provide Loot equivalent to a Quintessential Treasure Cache.","\"...\"","Yes.","He always had a limitation to how many times he could utilize the number of Caches until his concepts reached the next level.","Yet now...every single existence that happened to be his enemy and perished under his might would be turned to Loot equivalent to Quintessential Treasure Caches!","This was only the first Boundary exceeded.","There was the second Boundary.","There was the reason why Loot seemed to be leaking from The Quantum Emperor's visage!","<The Second Boundary Layer of LOOT >(Active):: Why should a target have to die to grant Loot? With the activation of the Second Boundary Layer of Loot, Active Loot Absorption is achieved as you can select a target to drain their Concepts, Life Force, Aspects of Existence...everything about them and transform it into Loot that benefits you the most. Weak targets who cannot defend against the power of your Boundary that currently releases 100% of your maximum Aeonic Output will eventually find their Existence fading quickly and becoming Loot when it is too late, while stronger targets will be drained of their Existence at a slower rate until a critical point is reached and they are alerted of your presence. Even the strongest targets can only oppose the Boundary of Loot if they have a Boundary exceeding Loot in its expansion towards EXTREMITY. Similarly tiered Boundaries are not able to stop Active Loot Absorption as on the path seeking the EXTREMITY of Loot, this is but a minor step. Activation of this Layer requires 1 Trillion Units of the Essence of Reality and 25 Aeonic Soul Value as a base, with the cost of activation changing when targeting stronger enemies...","This ridiculousness was why streams of golden light were leaving the Quantum Emperor.","Streams that contained fantastical Loot while on the other hand, the surging cluster of golden light around the Quantum Emperor...it was disappearing ever so quickly and only becoming faster!","And the faster this light disappeared was fantastically correlated with how many points of starry Loot light were crossing the golden cylindrical paths and arriving on Noah's body.","<+1 Crimson Dimensional Reality Panacea>","<+1 Pearl of Continuity.>","<+.01 Shard of the Boundary of IMMORTALITY.>","<+10,000 Shards of Concept Modifiers.>","<+1,000 Pearls of NULLITY...>","Streams of loot continued to surge towards the True Emperor of Quintessence as he seemingly did nothing, his smile not being able to help but break into a light laugh as he looked at this because...this was truly a joyous occasion!","He always wanted to see the levels of wonder out there.","He always wanted to see what ridiculous things could be made possible with his own hands.","What he was doing now....it was up there!"]},{"number":2191,"title":"Chapter 2191: Chapter 2190 A Ridiculous Boundary! II","paragraphs":["Streams of Loot light surged towards Noah as since the Quantum Emperor was considered a weaker target who could not withstand Noah's Maximum Aeonic Output, he was being drained of everything about him even without his knowledge by the Boundary of LOOT!","Would his construct that was backed by the Fundamental Natural Law of Continuity and foundations of wisps of the Boundary of IMMORTALITY be able to bring him back when everything about him was gone?","The Quantum Emperor was gazing at Noah quizzically with caution as he spoke.","<You continue to surprise by even pulling out the authority of a Boundary, but it seems to be something defective as- BLERGH>","...!","The Quantum Emperor had to stop his words as he found golden blood uncontrollably flowing out of his mouth.","He gazed down to see his chest and visage sunset in, his skin rapidly losing its luster as when he focused on his Aspects of Existence, he incredulously found his Body in a state of near death, while his Origin felt as dry as a desert while his soul that could pervade his Aspects of Existence to provide relief...it seemed unbelievably thin and weak!","To the extent that even the Construct hidden deep in the pockets of his Soul seemed to have fragments remaining that were being sucked away somewhere!","CONSTANTINE's Will gazed with shock and horror at such a situation as he raised his head up again, with him actually finding this motion difficult as he gazed into the eyes of the far away True Emperor of Quintessence.","He couldn't believe this being was actually doing such an unimaginable thing as he wondered...was it truly someone of this Age? Someone that had risen from the Barren Lands?!","But more than these thoughts, this Quantum Emperor actually felt fear begin to grip him.","He never thought it was even possible for him to die.","But as he saw even his construct had withered away, he wondered...would he still return reformed next time?","In the rising emotion of fear he never thought he would have, he wanted to at least understand.","\"Who...are you?!\"","There was no authority backed by Natural Laws in his voice.","This wasn't by choice like Noah and the Ancestral Descendants chose to do, but by force as this being didn't even have control of his faculties right now.","\"Who am I?\"","The True Emperor of Quintessence smiled devilishly as he watched Streams of loot surging towards him while only activating the Second Boundary Layer of LOOT.","\"If you are the Extra that's currently dying, then naturally...I am the Main Character.\"","WAA!","His eyes shone with a light of Loot as he said this, the happiness within them not being easily contained as the Tyranny of the True Emperor of Quintessence was blooming in unpredictable ways!","Unseen golden flows of loot leaked from the Quantum Emperor as his Aspects of Existence became thinner and thinner, his Will shaking as when his hands rose...he saw them begin to turn into dust.","And even though an inexplicable emotion he never thought someone like him would feel was currently blaring, he still held a sense of hope for his construct.","Even as he turned to Dust, he would still be able to return like always, right?","He had the abstruse Fundamental Natural Law of Continuity that very few grasped. He had the Construct that had at its foundation the Boundary of IMMORTALITY!","Surely this wou-","<...>","The thoughts of the Quantum Emperor came to a stop.","The vast and expansive vision of his eyes and Will that could cover light years of Reality dimmed as immense blackness rolled in.","An existence of a special Lineage. The one propped up to be the next Emperor by the Ancestors!","He turned into glimmers of gray dust that were devoid of light as everything about it had been sucked away by a terrifying Boundary!","And seconds passed.","No reformation occurred.","No Rebirth bloomed.","There was only the sight of the True Emperor of Quintessence surrounded by a shocking light of Loot as he brought the Heart of Fate that had lost its owner near his chest and absorbed it!","Now...all that remained was the final Fundamental Treasure of Nature.","The Heart of Reality that another Dimensional Chassis had set off to attain at the same time as the Quantum Dimensional Chassis- the destination being the Main Reality where the Primordials reigned!","--","In the Main Reality.","A blanket of the VOID covered everything across these vast lands as well, and yet at an isolated space where 12 blazing thrones floated grandly, there was a hint of vibrant stellar light from a Heart that was atop a glorious pedestal!","A heart that at this moment, the fair hands of an exceedingly beautiful woman reached out to.","It was the Empress- the right hand woman of the True Emperor of Destiny!","Surrounding her were all Tribunal Rulers apart from a single one that had shockingly fallen, their eyes cold at this moment as The Empress voiced out while grasping the Heart of Reality.","\"Before the Desolate Mausoleum is freed, we have to make sure that its Source is in the state that OPPENHEIMER seeks...for that, let us go to the Source of Reality.\"","WAA!","The very Source of Reality!","A location that no beings could readily access, and something that was only accessible if one had the Heart of Reality as a prerequisite!","And even then, it was hard to find and enter the Source of Reality as one would need the other Fundamental Treasures of Nature to fully gain access.","Yet The Empress sought to enter the Source of Reality as it seemed in all this...the machinations of OPPENHEIMER were still in play.","Just what did this being seek by splitting apart Reality in the last Age as he now ushered his forces to free Reality?","The Empress seemed to be the only one who fully knew as just when they were about to set off...","CRACK!","The folds of space behind one of the blazing thrones fractured as a terrifying aura surged out.","An aura that blared out with majesty only to be met with the sharp gazes and authorities of 11 Tribunal Rulers!"]},{"number":2192,"title":"Chapter 2192: Chapter 2191 I’m An Impartial Looter! I","paragraphs":["Grabbing the Heart of Reality in her hands, The Empress gazed forward with intense scrutiny at the being stepping into their most sacred and hidden location.","A place that for one- nobody would have even dared to find nor barge in just days ago!","But...too many things had changed in just a matter of days.","From a delicate balance of power between them and Dimensional Rulers, there was now a tremendous imbalance with Ancestral Descendants more powerful than them running around freely.","There were unknown existences rising and exceeding all others in power!","There was the True Emperor of Quintessence that had just risen to power...and this being was the one that had split apart space to appear before them now.","His solidified crown shining with grandeur and Imperial ecritures could be seen as it seemed to be a variation of his bodies, this one shining with a crimson stellar grandeur and giving off waves of Apollyon!","The recent changes these past few days and beings like this made The Empress and other Tribunal Rulers realize that things had rapidly changed out of their favor, and they had to move quickly to finish the plans in the works for too many years.","So when an existence that could cause all of these to crumble appeared...","HUUM!","The Authorities of Althea, Ezekiel, Noah, Gregory, Lombard...all 10 Tribunal Rulers beside her blared their authorities while coming to float in front of The Empress!","Althea grit her teeth as she glared at the existence that had killed Aegon and nearly killed her as she spoke softly to The Empress.","<Not all of us need to go to the Source of Reality to achieve our aims. Go, Empress. Providence has not closed off all paths for us yet.>","Althea spoke with grandiosity and valor as she saw the lips of the being that had walked into this isolated space curve upwards, his visage floating in serenely as it felt time was moving at a horrifically slow pace!","Althea could not speak for others, but as she was almost killed by this being not too long ago and he had gone to take the True Throne of Quintessence now- his power was no doubt greater as her fate and destiny...it was not the brightest at this moment.","She instinctively felt that she may not survive this!","And the other Tribunal Rulers that had stepped forth with her should also have felt the same!","She wanted to say many more things to The Empress.","She wanted to say that maybe they would all still be there to watch their aims come to fruition, that they would all follow the golden path of Providence onto grander lands.","That they would be in the company of the Great Commander once more and laugh while understanding the intricacies of Nature.","But for now, she could only show her thoughts and dedication by defending her from the being that wanted to destroy everything!","WAA!","Her body and the body of all other Tribunal Rulers illuminated and surged with a unique power as the Pure-Blooded Lineages deep within them were activated, their bodies exploding with Runic Ecritures and waves of NULLITY as they pulled out NULLITY Armaments and caused the surroundings to explode with swathes of Legions of Abominations!","Their numbers exceeded the hundreds of thousands and went to millions as they were meant to stand between the enemy before them and the one they protected!","<Empress.>","And all the Tribunal Rulers could still feel the aura of The Empress behind them as even she found it difficult to leave those she knew the most to an unknown fate, the voice of the Eminent Mastermind ringing out at this juncture.","<The Great Commander would not forgive me if I let the one he cares for the most fall under the hands of someone we should have caught on early. Go. Do what needs to be done...and we shall see each other if fate Wills it.>","...!","Their Wills burned bright as they knew what had to be done!","And the eyes of The Empress flashed with veiled emotions as she waved her hands behind her, a rift opening as she was about to leave when...","\"How touching.\"","BOOOM!","A cerulean light exploded and covered everything in a circular motion in an instant.","A tinge of gold covered the blazing blue light as they shockingly formed a circular domain, a single Magistracy of the Apocalyptic Blitzkrieg being cast as this Domain...held a foreign authority they had not come across before.","It was the coverage of the Essence of the Boundary of LOOT!","It made the domain of the Blitzkrieg wondrously seem like it cut off the very fabric of Reality itself, this domain being far vaster than any other one's cast before it as it contained all the Legions of Abominations and the Tribunal Rulers that called them out with a singular purpose.","\"It is touching that you all would sacrifice yourselves for others, but...nobody may leave here today.\"","WAA!","The damming words of the True Emperor of Quintessence reverberated out as the rift that The Empress had called our fissured and faded away.","The eyes of all Tribunal Rulers became somber as they blazed with even more authority, an Ancient Tribunal Ruler under the name of Zimmer and holding the visage of an old man speaking out with power at this juncture!","<He could stand against you 4 last time and he's only just attained the True Throne. With all of us here...we may still be able to forge a path forward and even take this being down.>","A deeply forged pride of the Tribunals burned in the heart of this being as he spoke.","Althea and the others gripped their NULLITY Armaments tighter as truly...there was no other choice!","SHIING!","At this same time, the Empress brought out a heart shaking silver gray flower.","It was the Primitivus Nullity Originator that released the same blinding light of NULLITY that covered everything just like in the Quantum Dimension!","The Empress brought out an EPOCH Relic as she was backed by 10 Tribunal Rulers and Legions of Abominations- all of their eyes on a single being that continued to float towards them freely!","He was curious of the change in power.","He was curious to see how even as a prominent figure of these Barren Lands pulled out an EPOCH Relic to stand against him with all of the forces of Primordials...how would they react when his body alone had the hardness of an EPOCH III Relic and would not even be touched by their attacks?!"]},{"number":2193,"title":"Chapter 2193: Chapter 2192 I’m An Impartial Looter! II","paragraphs":["Was the power of the newly risen True Emperor of Quintessence really at the level where they couldn't stand against him?","This was a question Althea felt more than others as she still remembered the chilling blue flames that nearly burned her to Oblivion.","So while grasping her bow tightly, she first urged the millions of Abominations nearby as the other Tribunal Rulers did the same.","ROAAR!","These Beasts born of NULLITY roared out as they surged towards the smiling True Emperor of Quintessence like a tide.","A tide of Cataclysm that threatened to drown out everything!","And yet when these ferocious Beasts of different variations reached the visage of the True Emperor...","PAH!","Their claws pulsing with NULLITY never reached him as when they merely neared inches from his grandeur, they were repulsed as if he was a being they couldn't touch!","A mere damage of a few Quadrillion Values...it couldn't even come close to scraping the regality of the True Emperor!","Noah looked at this scene with marvel as he sensed the profundity his body carried.","The hardness of an EPOCH III Relic!","These beings before him couldn't even reach inches of him when they could pose danger to Dimensional Rulers days ago.","When he thought of his rapid advancements, he shook his head while releasing a burst of Haki around him in a circular motion.","Haki that carried 25 Aeonic Soul Damage Values emanated out to cover the nearest Abominations around him as the moment this blast coveted them...","SHAA!","Their composition changed from their magnificent and terrifying forms as they became nothing but dust!","<+137,698x Golden Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","A single move of just spreading out his Haki had eliminated over a hundred thousand NULLITY Beasts as he attained Golden Quintessential Treasure Caches!","His Will wrapping around the Boundary of LOOT told him that depending on the enemies he killed, different variations of Quintessential Treasure Caches would come out since he achieved the First Boundary Layer of LOOT that made all killed enemies into Quintessential Treasure Caches.","For more powerful enemies who could aid him on his path, their Caches would be labeled Obsidian and then Crimson!","But the mere spread of his aura brought in such a haul as the Boundary of LOOT was bound to provide Noah with all the resources he would ever need in the future.","His actions of destroying the NULLITY Beasts with such each caused the Wills of the Tribunal Rulers to become even more somber, but they were Tribunal Rulers for a reason!","SHAA!","To the sides of Noah's head, a spiked Flail and a Spear of silver light surged forward for no other purpose other than decimation.","It was the visage of the Eminent Mastermind, Noah and Ezekiel.","These men's bodies exploded with power and authority as their NULLITY Armaments stuck out, yet to their dismay, the True Emperor didn't even make a move to defend!","BZZT!","Arcs of repulsive light buzzed inches away from the radiant stellar skin of their target as their weapons bathed in NULLITY never reached.","Instead, this being raised his hands towards them as they pulsed with the Essence of Relativity.","The spacetime continuum instantly became warped and twisted as a terrifying gravitational wave pulled their bodies in, Ezekiel and Noah finding their bodies within the grasp of this being right after!","They! With their identity as Tribunal Rulers!","They fell into the palms of the True Emperor of Quintessence as their necks were grasped in a shocking fashion.","Named Ones.","Beings at the hierarchy of power for Primordials as they had been actively moving for the past billions of years!","Beings that generations named their children after.","Waves of austere multicolored essence coursed over Noah's skin as he grasped the necks of such beings.","He gazed at them to see their emotions of shock and incredulity at the sheer power and oppressiveness he showed against them as they exploded out with waves of essence and authority to break away from his hands- each explosion seeming like Realities shattering and exploding as none of it had any effect on Noah!","<OOOH!>","They bellowed out with grandiosity while countless NULLITY arrows rained down as Althea and the other Tribunal Rulers reinforced them at this shocking juncture, yet none of it did anything as True Emperor Osmont shook his head with a hint of pity!","\"Merely Named Ones!\"","BOOM!","His hands crushed down with 100 Aeonic Damage Values while also releasing waves of 25 Aeonic Soul Damage Values, the bodies of Named Ones becoming utter dust in his hands as Noah sighed.","<2x Obsidian Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","Two Tribunal Rulers died, but Noah sighed!","This was because he was reminded what stage of power these beings were at and how just days ago, they believed themselves to be untouchable!","He used this chance to remind himself to never fall into such a mindset.","That even though he exhibited a great level of power right now that made others seem like ants, anything could change in the grand scheme of things as he never wanted to be in the same position as these beings where he would die without even understanding how it was possible!","This was why he sighed.","Yet when the remaining Tribunal Rulers saw this scene, their Origins shuddered as they saw this devilish existence erase the life force of two of their strongest combatants with his bare hands- and he then sighed as if to say they were so weak!","They felt the waves of Destiny and fate turn dark as they could not believe this development.","This was because right after this, the True Emperor of Quintessence turned his gaze towards where the remaining Tribunal Rulers were clustered as his voice emanated out.","\"I should remember not to play with my food either. After all, anything can change at any moment...\"","Lessons he had learned from the many forgotten extras in the past were dredged up as he seemed ready to end all those contained in his established domain!","It was a move that caused Althea's heart to lurch and flutter as she realized at this moment that the darkened fate and destiny truly meant what they implied!","And yet she still spoke out with strength as she floated in front of the Empress with her silver Bow.","<The rest of us you may be capable of killing with no repercussions. But...touching The Empress will mean a Fate worse than death for you!>","WAA!","<Putting your hands on the Lover of the Great Commander will mean that whenever you leave these Barren Lands...death will just be around the corner for you.>","Her fate and the fate of other Tribunal Rulers may not be too bright.","But the Empress activating the Primitivus Nullity Originator while gazing coldly at Noah...she could not fall.","The plans of the Great Commander lay with her. The Heart of Reality lay with her!","Yet towards her words...the True Emperor of Quintessence shook his head as the waves of Apollyon emanating destruction surged around him.","His expression was one of righteousness and mercy as he shook his head while replying to her.","\"Do not worry. I am not someone that considers one being more important than another. I shall treat you all equally as I am an impartial looter!\"","WAA!","Whether it was a regular Tribunal Ruler or The Empress, why did it matter? Did Noah fear the oh-so-grand OPPENHEIMER? Did he fear the wrath of the Ancestors to go against their will?","The answer was no.","So to the dismay of Althea and all other Tribunal Rulers...","\"Quintessential Singularity Ignition.\"","HOOONG!","Sparkling blue flames were ignited.","They bloomed all around as their aim...was to burn everything enclosed in this space!"]},{"number":2194,"title":"Chapter 2194: Chapter 2193 The Source Of Reality! I","paragraphs":["2193 The Source of Reality! I","The falls of Empires were always unique to observe.","No strong power truly believed that at the height of their power and majesty, they could somehow be toppled","over!","Especially so in such a short period of time, and by another power that wasn't even a contender against them for the past years.","When the fall did happen, it was only noticed at the last possible moment.","At this juncture, the pupils of powerful Emperors that reigned over Reality after the True Emperor of Destiny was gone shone with a blue light as they realized this.","The Tribunal Rulers that controlled vast stretches of Reality saw the surging Ignition of Flames of a Singularity that latched onto Abominations and decimated them as if they were stalks of wheat on a dry field- and they saw these flames coming towards them with even greater ferocity as they knew!","Their fate and destiny instantly turned dark as even their wisps of understanding of Providence told them this","was it!","It was a terrifying thought in one's mind to know they were about to die, and people accepted this thought differently as some accepted it, while some struggled.","Althea looked at the coming flames that threatened their extinction as feeling the breath of The Empress behind her, she cried out mournfully at what was to come and the madman who didn't even consider the status of this personage behind her.","\"00000H!\"","She cried out mournfully as her soul burned and she released the strongest attack she could have mustered throughout her whole life!","She cried out mournfully and with valor as she wasn't able to see the Great Commander again after all this!","She cried-","BOOOM!","Her blinding surge of silver light that was bursting out was instantly devoured by cerulean flames as it didn't","matter if it was her strongest or weakest attack, it was instantly devoured by the Quintessential flames as her figure was turned to cinders right after.","<...>","The Damage Output of the True Emperor of Quintessence was too massive at this moment.","He had yet to pair himself against the Ancestral Descendants and see exactly how they would fare with the Boundaries they controlled, but the Rulers of the Barren Lands would not be an issue for him!","After all, he had decimated the strongest Quantum Emperor before coming here!","<8x Obsidian Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained.>","Everything burned under the cerulean domain as the 8 remaining Tribunal Rulers apart from the Eminent Mastermind Noah and Ezekiel joined them in death, the tongues of the flames surging towards the visage of the woman cradling an EPOCH Relic at this moment.","Her eyes held a hint of frustration and anger as she was close to achieving something only to have it taken away, but the one thing she didn't have...was fear.","In the face of death, why wouldn't one have fear?","BZZT!","The flames carried tens of Aeonic Damage Values surged around her body as just like the others, the","defenses of The Empress were utterly shredded in an instant!","And yet just as the flames were about to erase all her Vitality Values...","BOOM!","Her soul illuminated as a verdant barrier of terrifying life force erupted to cover her!","And yet...","CRACK!","This barrier was latched onto by the flames and also devoured right after as they sought to decimate her Aspects of Existence next!","It seemed she had multiple life saving measures that initiated the moment that her life was in danger, but even these weren't enough as after the verdant barrier was shattered, her body was instantly aflame as it began to burn along with her Origin.","These 2 aspects of existence were instantly decimated as when the tongues of blue flames reached out to burn her Soul...","DING!","A ringing sound emanated out that stopped everything.","Her body and Origin were destroyed as right when the third aspect of existence was about to undergo the same process, a blinding white gold light emanated from it as from afar, Noah instantly recognized it as the light of a Boundary.","A Boundary!","It wasn't IMMORTALITY or NULLITY, but something just as pristine as the moment it bloomed out, Noah already silently activated Active Loot Absorption and designated this light covering the soul of The Empress!","A light that kept the cerulean flames at bay as from it, Noah could almost feel a raging and rising will that could oppress an entire Age.","\"It seems that the True Emperor of Destiny truly loved you.\"","Noah uttered silently amidst the raging flames as his figure came closer, his eyes on the golden cylindrical paths of light that showed fantastical prompts.","<+.01 Shard of the Boundary of DESTINY.>","<+.01 Shard of the Boundary of DESTINY.>","The True Emperor of Destiny had taken his prime concept and expanded its Boundary towards EXTREMITY.","And it now wrapped around the soul of his beloved as just when it seemed a Will was about to rouse from the white gold light covering the Empress, it instantly fluctuated and roared out with anger as it flashed with majesty- turning into a point of light that shot towards the cerulean Boundary Noah had enacted and passed through it after slight resistance!","It noticed the constant leaking of its Source towards a terrifying enemy as the authority of the Boundary of DESTINY wrapping around the soul of The Empress instantly chose to leave, bypassing the Boundary of LOOT covering Noah's Domain and only leaving behind crackling flames!","\"Hmm...\"","Noah looked at this scene sharply as the soul of the Empress was whisked away too quickly, his authority bypassed as it seemed the Boundary of DESTINY had to have been expanded by multiple Boundary Layers to be capable of bypassing his at this juncture.","It showed the True Emperor of Destiny truly lived up to his name.","It showed that OPPENHEIMER was still someone to be gazed at carefully and understood!","The cerulean flames in the surroundings began dying down as twinkling silver lights of NULLITY Armaments were all that remained, 12 thrones fractured and utterly burnt as one of the more dazzling points of lights..was an EPOCH Relic in the form of a flower and a shining multicolored Heart of Reality."]},{"number":2195,"title":"Chapter 2195: Chapter 2194 The Source Of Reality! II","paragraphs":["2194 The Source of Reality! ll","Noah gazed at the torn fabric of Reality as his hurting flames of Singularity receded, waving his hands to collect the NULLITY Armaments and the Primitivus Nullity Originator that he only gave a glance to before his focus came to the Fundamental Treasure of Nature before him.","The Heart of Reality!","Inside of his body at this moment, he had collected the Hearts of Destiny, Fortune, Karma, and Fate as now..he got his hands on the Heart of Reality!","All of the Fundamental Treasures of Nature were within his grasp as with them, even greater control of Reality was granted.","\"Come.\"","WAA!","Noah beckoned to the Heart of Reality as it sunk into his chest- being transferred into the Main Body at the depths of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature and coming to position itself stably beside his Heart of Mana as the other four Fundamental Treasures of Nature circled them with majesty.","Waves of a profound authority emanated around him as prompts descended.","<You have brought all the Fundamental Treasures of Nature under your banner.>","<Your Providence exceeds all others in this Age and Ages past as you gain an unprecedented level of control over the Fabric of Reality!>","<When gaining access to the Source of Reality with the Heart of Reality and the guidance of the other Fundamental Treasures of Nature, the possibility to completely affect Dimensions opens.>","Noah had enough Authority of this Age and Era to easily Displace 3 Dimensions- and this wasn't counting the unknown reserves of the True Authority of Quintessence that were waiting for him through his True Throne!","He had asked Reality itself whether it expected him to use this Authority to free it, and the answer was that he didn't necessarily need to.","3 Dimensions could be displaced with the help of Reality, and if he got his hands on the Fundamental Treasures of Nature- he could even displace the existences within it!","He could remove the Ancestral Descendants stretched throughout the Dimensions and safely assimilate these planes onto his Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality as thereafter..he could judge how to maneuver with the remaining Dimensions.","Even in the Main Reality he was in and the Desolate Mausoleum, Ancestral Descendants waded through calmly while surrounded by the VOID as since Noah did not want to clash with them yet, he wouldn't hastily try devouring the fabric of the Main Reality.","There was no harm in continuing to amass power as Noah had two options from here on out.","Meet and fight the Ancestral Descendants as he had tough battles where a winner or loser would be hard to decide, or fight them at his absolute peak of power when he could trash them!","He knew himself and which path he would choose.","Besides, he didn't have to devour the fabric of Reality where Ancestral Descendants roamed when he had a much better option.","When he had a place that nobody but him could even access!","\"Lead me..\"","The voice of his Main Body in the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality emanated out grandly as his Will descended on the Fundamental Treasures of Nature he had collected from all Clones.","\"Lead me to the Source of Reality!\"","HOOONG!","His gaze was far reaching.","He didn't have to devour the fabric of Reality as..what if he simply swallowed up the very Source of Reality itself?","This would have been the final step after Noah swallowed up all Dimensions and Realities, but if he could truly access it now..why couldn't he see if it was feasible for him to Bind or Devour it like the Sources of Nature?!","The Sources of Manadynamics, Relativity, Providence...all of the Sources of Nature that Noah had half bound to himself were what comprised the Source of Reality.","After all, Reality was made up of the Natural Laws that maintained it.","In the Source of Reality, all of the Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws would be contained.","Anything Noah knew or didn't know would be there.","There were many possibilities to what could come of this as in the far reaches of the Dimensional Empyral Domain of Nature, a multicolored stellar spatial tunnel of a singularity formed that led into the folds of the very fabric of Reality.","The Heart of Reality within Noah pulsed while releasing rays of multicolored light that seemingly enacted the spatial bridge leading into the folds of space, his Main Body stepping into it as for the first time in quite a long","period of time for him...he left the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality!","The True Emperor of Quintessence himself entered a unique pathway into the folds of Reality as one had to","wonder..just where would the very Source of Reality be located?","Was it not at the very center of the Main Reality where one had Empyral Domains on Nature swirling with a myriad of natural laws?","The most obvious place actually was not it as Reality was pervasive across the Desolate Mausoleum and Dimensions.","Its Source was hidden within its very folds in a spatial plane that no being should truly step in.","Because within the Source of Reality, one wrong move could spell catastrophe for everything.","And yet the Will of Reality had guided Noah to the other Fundamental Treasures of Nature required to access this location.","The same location that The Empress wished to go to in order to complete the plans of OPPENHEIMER!","SHIING!","Noah's will was vibrant as he crossed a tunnel that was built with Fundamental Natural Law, his feet cascading across a multicolored bridge made of Manadynamics, Entropy, Providence, Relativity..and as he went further in, he began to see tendrils of Natural Laws he did not yet have understanding in build the very spacetime bridge he walked on.","He very quickly recognized the blinding light of Continuity and a few other points of light shining with grandiosity- everything around him buzzing with grandeur and authority as he knew he was moving countless Light years with every step he took.","He could have been moving from one end of Reality to another, or traversing across different planes of Dimensions with every step in this unique tunnel he was in!","It felt like traversing across a massive Singularity of Infinite mass and density as in an indeterminate period of time...","WAA!!","Noah felt like he had reached the end of the line.","His 9 Dimensional Realities pulsed as his Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation caused his body to Illuminate like a natural treasure, his Will billowing out maddeningly towards a blinding source of light- towards the very Source of Reality!","<Quintessential Aeonic Ascendancy Stanchions>:: Your Ascendancy Stanchions have further evolved due to your Aeonic Quintessential Kainos Empyral Foundation. They are now capable of passively elevating all Flames of Edicts within it to the highest possible level, with all current edicts being infused with Natural Laws or Decreta to reach the stage of DHARMA or HERESY. When all concepts within a Stanchion are elevated to their highest level, they will resonate with each other to passively produce Boundary Pearls within your Origin- a type of treasure that can take you just a little bit further towards EXTREMITY, and is utilizable by all Boundaries..."]},{"number":2196,"title":"Chapter 2196: Chapter 2195 The Source Of Reality! III","paragraphs":["2195 The Source of Reality! Ili","His eyes were blinded by brilliance as by the time he could see again, he found himself in a space of pure fantasy.","His Origin was actually the first to 'feel' as it cried out with fervor, the completed Dimensional Realities echoing out joy at the overabundance of extremely pure essence in the surroundings!","And it was pristinely pure as Noah felt like he was swimming in waves of plasma of the Natural Laws, austere and pristinely beautiful multicolored tendrils of light surging all around him as they screamed purity.","This whole space was covered by these plasmic multicolored waves of pure authority!","Unimaginable purity as just the tendrils of Manadynamics here were a color of blue that would blind normal existences!","And these tendrils of blue swam in a circular motion across this space as they came from a single source.","A source of the brightest light around this space as when Noah gazed at it, he could only describe it as a massive spinning multicolored Singularity.","It weaved in the tendrils of the Fundamental Natural Laws of Manadynamics, Relativity, Providence, Entropy, Continuity..and one more abstruse Fundamental Natural Law!","Noah's will gazed upon it and focused on this pristine","white essence that he instantly got the name of as...","\"Isochronism...\"","WAA!","The Fundamental Natural Law of Isochronism!","This Natural Law and Continuity were the two hardest and most abstruse laws to grasp as Isochronism dealt with cycles.","The cycles of life and death. The cycles of creation and destruction. The cycles of Ages that come and go.","It was something so pristine and at the center of the Barren Lands as aside from these massive plasmic tendrils of Fundamental Natural Laws, Noah also saw 9 tendrils of thinner laws of nature that swirled around the spinning multicolored Singularity.","He focused on those he knew and those he didn't as their information rose before him!","It was the Natural Laws of Polarity, Gravitation, Weak Nuclear Force, Strong Nuclear Force, Electromagnetism, Oscillation, Elasticity, Uncertainty, and Isotropy.","9 Natural Laws that matched the 9 Decreta, and 6 Fundamental Natural Laws that stood above them!","Pristine waves of these different concepts flowed as in the midst of all this, Noah also saw plasmic waves of the 9 Dimensions- these also being a part of Reality.","The waves of Dream, Avalon, and Apollyon were surging with peace and serenity while the tendrils of the","remaining 6 Dimensions..they coagulated to form into grandiose multi-colored nail-like stakes that pierced into the spinning Singularity that was the Source of Reality!","These pikes were extremely similar to the scene Noah saw when he finished forming Dimensional Layers, but now..he would have the authority to pull out 3 seamlessly.","The Fundamental Treasures of Nature inside him pulsed as he floated closer and closer to the gloriously spinning","Singularity, his body releasing an absorptive force to take in the Essence of all the Natural Laws he had yet to","fully grasp as he spoke while focusing on the verdant, golden, and multicolored pikes of the Prana, Elysium and Quantum Dimensions!","\"Designate the Prana, Elysium, and the Quantum Dimensions as the first ones to undergo Displacement.”","His Origin vibrated ever so slightly.","He knew that what he was about to do was something utterly unfathomable as he grasped the sheer grandiosity of it, and the results would only further cement his supremacy as he could not wait to do it!","And yet...","<<The Displacement of the Quantum Dimension will shatter the Pylon of Ascension and instantly alert those on the other side of it. Even if the VOID prevents the changes of the removal of the Anchors from being felt, the Displacement of the Quantum Dimension will alert them and cause the factor of uncertainty to rise that much more. It is the easiest pathway to utilize in descending and Ascending, but it is not the only one. As soon as they confirm the destruction of the Pylon of Ascension while not being able to communicate with all of their forces, an even stronger force will undoubtedly descend.>>","The booming Will of Reality emanated out as Noah's eyes flashed sharply.","Countless ideas flowed in his mind as the Will of Reality continued.","<<Analyzing your current level of power, there is a high probability of matching against normal Ancestral Descendants with the level of Boundaries they have achieved and the current restriction of Natural Laws. But there are the Ancestral Descendant Commanders known as Yvonne, Hideyoshi, and Theseus on top of True Empress Katya. These beings should have achieved a Third or Fourth Boundary Layer towards EXTREMITY in an unknown number of Boundaries. Unless you elevate your own, you are still off from overcoming them completely.>>","The Will emanating out was emotionless as it actually gave Noah a glimpse between his abilities and his enemies!","<<This isn't to mention the Eight Tier Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE that is currently dominating Yvonne in the Niflheim Dimension. | cannot analyze the discrepancy between you and him.>>","The existence that had been scheming since before even OPPENHEIMER rose!","There were many parties to account for as the waters couldn't be muddied anymore with terrifying Legions that the Ancestors could send.","There was no harm in playing events covertly while making great progress- Noah not allowing his great elevation in power to blind him from being careful!","After all, it was when one was at the peak of their pride and arrogance that they fell.","He had seen this too many times.","So he turned from the Quantum Dimension as he gazed at other candidates, the Will of Reality continuing to emanate out.","<<Resonate your Dimensional Realities with the Fundamental Treasures of Nature as well as my Source.","You can connect your Dimensional Realities to the Dimensions with the Authority of this Era as with all prerequisites met, you can both displace the existences within Dimensions and the Dimensions themselves.>>","WAA!","Resonance.","Displacement of both Dimensions and the Existences within it!","\"Hooo..\"","He breathed out while feeling his vibrant Dimensional Layers.","His Will then covered the Fundamental Treasures of Nature as he then gazed at the Source of Reality.","He had to take all of these constructs and pair them with the Authority of this Era that his Origin had been accumulating and resonate everything..and only when he entered a fantastical state of Resonance could he undertake the act of Displacement of Dimensions!","HOONG!","An austere symphony began to play as the True Emperor of Quintessence absorbed the essence of Natural Laws while beginning to resonate with the very Source of Reality.","The result of his actions was bound to be astonishing as he began on a great undertaking!","Occasionally missing content, please report errors in time."]},{"number":2197,"title":"Chapter 2197: Chapter 2196 The True Emperor Of Destiny! I","paragraphs":["2196 The True Emperor of Destiny! |","While Noah's main body began a great undertaking, his clones had their own designated tasks as one clone in particular was worthy of mentioning.","With hair shining radiantly with a halcyon gleam, it was the Elysium Dimensional Chassis that was surrounded by intense waves of Providence.","He was currently at the deepest area of the Soul Library which only he had access to so far, his figure floating","atop a stellar multicolored crystalline floor as his surroundings were akin to a star-filled space, and one could see dazzling ancient books and grimoires floating around serenely in this space!","Some of these grimoires were labeled [Quintessential Emperor's Annihilation Technique- Fourth Form], [Exerpts From the Age of Genesis], [Analysis of Mana and NULLITY]...there were a myriad of titles for these grimoires as they contained information Noah considered important, and he was taking it upon himself to record it down as something akin to a hobby!","Currently, the Elysium Dimensional Chassis was adorned in loose fitting golden pants and a tight fitting shirt that showed the astounding foundation of a body that Noah had sculpted, the rims of a relic in the form of glasses sitting on the bridge of his nose as it shimmered with waves of NULLINIUM and MANANIUM!","It was actually one of the relics that another one of Noah's clones who was working on the Blacksmith's Forge had produced- one that reached EPOCH | after Noah began utilizing the materials he gained to make different Relics! These glasses were identified as","<Aeonic Emperor's Spectacles> as they furthered Noah's inquisitive eyes and their capabilities of seeing through nature among other things!","With such fantastical adornments, Noah floated atop the stellar multicolored crystalline floor as a thick golden book lay before his eyes.","It was a book labeled [The Age of Destiny] as it gave off austere waves of ancientness, Noah's Will serenely surging into this book as it was inscribing all of the details from the memories Noah had attained over the past days from his enemies!","From the Dimensional Rulers he killed in the Dimensional Conclave to the Tribunal Rulers he killed just recently, his","Will inscribed it in words that when one placed their essence into, they could experience the very memories that Tribunal Rulers and Dimensional Rulers of the different dimensions had across the past Age.","Concurrently, Noah was perusing through Billions of years worth of memories between Althea, Ezekiel..all of the named ones and how the events of the past Age truly unfolded!","He was also able to learn about the being that was at the center of controversy.","OPPENHEIMER!","Shockingly, the memories of Althea and the others about him were veiled as even while going through mere memories, Noah was only able to unlock the memories about OPPENHEIMER by utilizing the Authority of the Boundary of LOOT!","And from that, he had seen this True Emperor.","He was learning about this being's beginnings as well as the path he took as while Noah inscribed all of it down, he couldn't help but mutter with raised eyes.","\"Were you actually the main character?\"","The journey this being took was a unique one as rising from absolutely nothing, he had come to reign over the Pure-Blooded Primordial Lineages and even triumph over Chosen Emperor and Destined Emperors to become the True Emperor of the Age of Destiny.","From the memories of the Tribunal Rulers, Noah could feel immense reverence and respect.","And as he perused through things he already theorized or knew, he came across some memories that finally bore fruit in his search for Knowledge.","It was a memory Althea had as she was more trusted by The Empress, and she had followed her on a day that OPPENHEIMER had called for her.","The memories flowed into words and mixed with each other as a fantastical scene bloomed.","At the depths of Reality itself.","Multicolored streams of natural laws weaved together into a massive Empyral Domain of Nature tens of times in size compared to the ones seen in the Age of Quintessence.","These tendrils of essence were dense in concentration as in such a place one could easily grasp the laws of nature at a fast pace!","In such a location, a golden throne floated silently and gazed out into the incandescent waves of light as behind this throne, the figure of The Empress appeared, Althea floating behind her as if she was a maidservant while she gazed towards the man on the True Throne of Destiny with reverence!","<I plan to go through with it.>","WAA!","His voice was deep and magnetic.","Even though he sat on the golden throne, one could see his vibrant dark hair cascading close to his shoulders as Althea's eyes could barely catch a glimpse of his sharp nose!","<Desiderius will eventually destroy everything if things do not go his way, so | will act like | am following his will and destabilize everything. | cannot undo what the Ancestors did a long time ago, but | can do something different with my current Authority.>","His words were shocking for The Empress to hear as she came closer to the True Throne, Althea not being able to bring herself to go as she waited behind.","She could only see the caution and care in the eyes of the Empress as she went on to grasp the hand of the True Emperor.","<It never felt right dealing with this NOBLESSE. Is he not the enemy of our people? Isn't he doing all this to hurt our ancestors?>","Care and yearning could be felt in her eyes as The Empress actually tried to sway the True Emperor, with this being sighing at such a juncture as he stared at the expanse of colors around him!","<I understand this more than you can even imagine..but it is what must be done. The Boundary of DESTINY tells me so. And when it comes to them being enemies to our people..our people are only those who care for us. Not some abstruse past Lineages that no longer care for these lands. We will protect our people. We will do everything we can to protect those we care for. And for anyone standing in the way of this- whether it be the Ancestors or the NOBLESSE...they will all be crushed under the weight of DESTINY.>","BOOOM!","A heavy and shocking will erupted and blared out domineeringly as it was too potent for the still weak Althea, her mind blanking out at such a juncture and only waking up later to the sight of the Empress gazing at a man on a throne that was shining with utmost radiance.","He was shining with a shocking amount of golden radiance as the Authority of this entire Age accessible","through the True Throne..he had begun directing it for only a single purpose.","Others say the Primordials did it because they were greedy for even more resources and even more Realities. To stretch their hands even across the Parallel Paths and Dimensions!","The Primordials believed in a higher purpose as among all the differing opinions..who knew where the truth lay!","<Author's Note>:: Revision of the 9 Natural Laws of Nature! From the Natural Laws of Polarity, Gravitation,","Weak Nuclear Force, Strong Nuclear Force, Electromagnetism, Vacillation, Steady State, Uncertainty, and Isotropy to >> Natural Laws of Polarity, Gravitation, Weak Nuclear Force, Strong Nuclear Force, Electromagnetism, Oscillation, Elasticity, Uncertainty, and Isotropy","<<Prompt of the Loot from NULLITY Beast Legions summoned by Tribunal Rulers.>>:: +7,468,553x Golden Quintessential Treasure Caches have been obtained."]},{"number":2198,"title":"Chapter 2198: Chapter 2197 The True Emperor Of Destiny! II","paragraphs":["2197 The True Emperor of Destiny! II","A change in the very winds of Destiny.","A change brought about when the True Emperor of Destiny illustriously sat on his Throne and accessed the key that led to the True Authority of Destiny of the whole Age!","When Noah analyzed this portion of the memories, he came to wonder about himself and how he would utilize the True Authority of Quintessence.","It could be utilized on the remaining 3 Dimensions after Noah displaced the ones he could as mentioned by the","Will of Reality- achieving the reality of first displacing the enemies within the Dimensions and then displacing the Dimensions themselves.","It could also be utilized on something that would expand his power stupendously, where he could direct the True Authority of Quintessence to expand the Boundary of LOOT or even further..enact a second Boundary that Noah had to have!","\"The Boundary of QUINTESSENCE...\"","Waves of golden light surged around Noah in this space as he spoke out while viewing the illusory scene of OPPENHEIMER utilizing his authority to split apart Reality itself.","He had spoken about doing this as it would match his aims while also doing what the one called Desiderius wished for!","The 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE, Desiderius!","To face such a being that the Will of Reality itself and the True Emperor of Genesis were wary of, Noah needed to expand his Boundary of LOOT as much as possible while he also wanted to enact the Boundary of QUINTESSENCE.","To expand on this Modus Operandi of exceeding all others towards EXTREMITY as he still needed to have the strength to stave off his enemies while he assimilated all Dimensions!","He had to have such strength as even while he analyzed OPPENHEIMER at the peak of his power splitting apart Reality, he was still forced away from the Desolate Mausoleum soon after!","The memories of those that fell to him illuminated the past and filled in the gaps of knowledge, but that was it.","The past was the past, and Noah had to forge his own future!","SHAA!","The eyes of the clone returned to the memories of the Age of Destiny as a True Emperor carried out an Irreversible Nexus Event, while at this same time- his Main Body was about to carry out multiple Irreversible Nexus Events!","-","Resonance.","Achieving the same wavelength and simply being in tune with another construct!","When one resonated with Nature, they could peer into the secrets of Natural Laws and increase their understanding.","At this juncture, Noah was resonating with multiple different constructs as his overly strong Quintessential","Aeonic Soul felt closely connected to the Fundamental Treasures of Nature, his own Origin, and the Source of Reality as the Authority of this Era permeated through each of these constructs!","BZZZT!","As this occurred, Noah also received prompts on a side quest he was undertaking while he was here.","<Your Understanding of the Fundamental Natural Law of Isochronism has increased.>","<Your Understanding of the Natural Law of Electromagnetism has increased.>","<Your Understanding of the Natural Law of Elasticity has..>","<Your Understanding of the Natural Law of Uncertainty...>","<Your Understanding of the Natural Law of Isotropy....>","His Origin was akin to a dry desert that drank in the surrounding plasmic tendrils of Natural Laws, and he gained understanding at a fast pace as from his Expansive Space, Natural Decretum Seeds were already rising to elevate the understanding of these new laws to completion!","With this accomplishment occurring on the sides, his focus was still on the task at hand as waves of power and authority buzzed joyously while his Will emanated out at this moment.","\"The first one shall be Prana..\"","A point of verdant light erupted at the Prana Dimensional Reality came under focus and outshone all others.","He had gotten the information from the Will of Reality that the Ancestral Descendant Commander known as","Yvonne had Prana along with the Mirror Dimension and Niflheim- and she was personally battling with the 8 Echelon Obsidian NOBLESSE- Desiderius, at this moment in Niflheim!","So the only ones in the Niflheim and Mirror Dimensions were Ancestral Descendants!","\"Ancestral Descendants...”","In the midst of his Resonance, a thought arose in Noah's mind about a different possible direction.","It wasn't a thought brought to fruition through Destiny or Providence that began to churn wildly with opportunity!","It was the Boundary of LOOT.","And it asked...did things really have to play out this way?","As he asked this question, he felt his strong soul become stretched out as it covered all of his Prana Dimensional Reality, and then his 'vision' changed as he felt what his soul could see become expanded even further!","He felt a unique connection as it wasn't just his own Dimensional Layer that he was currently looking at, with his consciousness seemingly melding with the very fabric of Reality as he could see the genuine Prana Dimension!","As if the VOID did not exist, everything was clear.","He saw the rifts of NULLITY stretching throughout.","He felt the vibrant life forms and force of life emanating throughout this Dimension.","And soon enough..he was able to locate the Legion of Ancestral Descendants that belonged to Commander Yvonne- their bodies bright with the Authority of a Boundary!","Noah was gazing at them and their positions as they moved around carefully, where his consciousness was seemingly connected to Reality itself for him to view all this.","And if he wished..he could utilize this unique state brought about with the Resonance of his Origin, Fundamental Treasures of Nature, and the Source of Reality that were all tied with the Authority of this Era to displace these Ancestral Descendants and then this Dimension entirely!","But..he stopped and didn't carry out this step.","He had a set path he wanted to follow.","But he had also gotten new information.","And the Boundary of LOOT saw great opportunity from this information as Noah's initial plan of completely elevating his power to another level before facing the Ancestral Descendants..the Boundary of LOOT wanted it to change!","After getting the information from the Will of Reality that the only enemies he couldn't overcome were the Ancestral Descendant Commanders and that he should be able to match the normal Descendants in their Legions, Noah felt the need to change his set path!","He didn't have to use one of the three chances that allowed him to displace existences and the Dimension they were in if the Dimension...only had the Ancestral Descendants and not their Commanders.","...!","He could follow the original route of him devouring these Dimensions with the Pocket Dimensional Reality as at this moment, Reality had changed to the extent that he could battle and hold off these Descendants- if not possibly kill them due to his ridiculous Boundary of LOOT.","A new path full of grander possibilities opened up before his eyes!"]},{"number":2199,"title":"Chapter 2199: Chapter 2198 Utter Desecration Of Logic! I","paragraphs":["2198 Utter Desecration of Logic! |","A new path to take!","The Boundary of LOOT was like an impatient child sending its thoughts to Noah and saying this was the best way to do it. And Noah was altering his mind and plans on this new path already.","The 3 chances of Displacement..he altered his mind to shift them to the Dimensions that had Ancestral Descendant Commanders, NOBLESSE, and the Quantum Dimension as the last one as if he did it this way, he may not even have to clash with the most powerful enemies before he completely removed the shackles of the Desolate Mausoleum and assimilated all Dimensions!","HOOONG!","Only now did Providence and Destiny begin to buzz wildly.","In his unique state of Resonance, Noah smiled devilishly as he enacted a new path with the lead of a Boundary that was hungry for enemies!","In this path, he wouldn't even have to think about possibly using his prize of the reserves of the True Authority of Quintessence on anything other than himself.","On anything other than what he wanted to use it on- his Boundaries!","\"Good..let's do it this way!\"","HUUM!","His body buzzed as he maintained the state of Resonance and gazed at the vastness of the Prana Dimension, but he didn't act to use the authority of this Era to remove the Anchor.","The Source of Reality that was expectantly waiting for this buzzed to voice its concern even though it knew that it did not make a mistake to continue allowing this being to retain control!","So why...","\"My clones shall personally go to devour and assimilate the Dimensions with only Ancestral Descendants. The 3 chances of Displacement will be utilized for the Dimensions where Desiderius and the Ancestral Descendants Commanders are located...so Niflheim, Elysium, and Quantum Dimensions shall be last!\"","A golden path opened up.","<I Am the Main Character> didn't even have to activate to tell Noah to follow this path!","The Boundary of LOOT pushed for it and sought more as once Noah made this decision, he began to spur his Clones to move while freely doing something he held back on because of the uncertainties.","He ushered towards the True Throne of Quintessence as his Main Body returned to it, the prize for the Age of Quintessence finally having a direction to be taken to!","As Noah did this, the Source of Reality calculatingly observed his actions and the change in the sequence of events as its Will emanated out.","<<I will share what I have learned about the Boundaries from the Sealers that have descended over the Ages, and why they left behind their very Laws of Nature for them.>>","WAA!","Boundaries!","The Will of Reality saw the direction Noah was going as it proactively shared information!","Noah sat on the True Throne of Quintessence while beginning to use it as a key, listening closely at such a critical juncture.","<<Each Boundary is different, and they are designated into different tiers depending on their power, utility, and ease towards EXTREMITY among other factors. Any concept can be taken to EXTREMITY as even Natural Laws could be expanded into Boundaries that seek EXTREMITY. Yet the Natural Laws that make up the fabric of Reality are considered at the extreme lowest tier in the ranking of Sealers due to their nature of needing integration and to be bound by existences, imposing their boundaries upon them as the other reason for them to rank at the lowest possible tier is their extreme difficulty towards EXTREMITY.>>","<<One could have crossed 10 Boundary Layers towards EXTREMITY with other Concepts after years worth of work or the utilization of rare treasures, but if the same was applied to a Boundary of Manadynamics- only a single Boundary Layer would have been crossed.>>","Shocking information about the True nature of this flowed out as Noah looked at his Boundary of LOOT that he had only crossed 2 Boundary Layers towards EXTREMITY as this took the authority of an Era expanding it!","Yet if one tried to expand the limitations of Natural Laws and take them towards Extremity..the difficulty was hundreds of times more.","This was because after passing every Boundary Layer, exceeding the next one was many times harder!","So when Ancestors came across Boundaries and saw how they were bound by Natural Laws along with their high difficulty in making any progress paired up with the heavy losses from their enemies..they could only make the choice to suppress these laws and stop their effect on them.","<<Due to insufficient information, we cannot classify what the Bloodline Boundary of the VOID is considered, nor how it compares to the Boundary of LOOT you have forged. Normally, the Tier of a Boundary cannot be changed. But if you truly do enact the Boundary of QUINTESSENCE, there might be a chance for you to change this due to the nature of such a Boundary. And of course, you have a vastly different understanding of Natural Laws as you were not bound by them like the Sealers. If you do expand any of the Natural Laws towards EXTREMITY, your experience may be entirely different compared to the Sealers who designated them as the worst concepts to expand towards EXTREMITY.>>","BOOM!","A cluster of truly fantastical information came as Noah's mind illuminated greatly.","Boundless possibilities bloomed from this as the Will of Reality didn't need to say anymore!","Noah acted right away as he came upon a moment of truth that other True Emperors also came across Ages past.","The utilization of the Authority of an Age that they lorded over.","The True Emperor of Destiny had split apart Reality.","The True Emperor of Quintessence...","His devilishly handsome face developed a smile full of confidence and ingenuity as while seated on the multicolored throne, his crown released waves of austere light as his command surged forth.","\"Let the glorious True Authority of Quintessence flow.\"","HUUUM!","\"Let them take the path of QUINTESSENCE and LOOT towards Extremity!\"","He knew not what their Tiers would be.","He didn't even know how to look at their comparators!","He only knew...his Boundaries were going to be something that nobody else could fathom!","Change in chapter title!","Tomorrows working chapter titles:","Utter Desecration of Logic! Il & Ill","Adui"]},{"number":2200,"title":"Chapter 2200: Chapter 2199 Utter Desecration Of Logic! II","paragraphs":["2199 Utter Desecration of Logic! II","Within what could be considered the center of the very Barren Lands.","Within the Source of Reality..multicolored radiance overflowed as the True Emperor of this Age utilized his authority!","And it went towards establishing a fantastical Boundary while also elevating an already existing one, Noah monitoring the changes in real time as he felt the cycles of changes.","Normally, one would be relying on their Aeonic Soul Power to illuminate the path forward towards EXTREMITY, with geniuses exceeding their Boundary Layers upon receiving epiphanies or the usage of unfathomable treasures outside the Barren Lands.","The only Treasure within the Barren Lands that had the effect of expanding Boundaries was exactly the True Throne that cycled over the Ages- and most of the True Emperors utilized their authority to expand their Boundary!","True Empress Katya had the Boundary of KARMA, while True Emperor Hideyoshi had the Boundary of FATE.","Now, Noah observed the intricate expansion of the concepts of QUINTESSENCE and LOOT!","All of this was to measure up to the most powerful Ancestral Descendants and achieve the freedom of the Desolate Mausoleum.","And while this process was ongoing, Pure Quintessential Kainos Natural Decretum Seeds burned as all newly learned Laws went towards completion, especially the Fundamental Natural Laws of Continuity and Isochronism that Noah wanted to be among those he could half bind their Source as the Gourmandizing Dimensional Reality swallowed more and more Realities into itself!","The millions of Shards of NULLITY and Pearls of NULLITY that were received after being Decuplicated also burned furiously as Noah's understanding of NULLITY scaled upwards.","Preparations were in full bloom by the True Emperor of Quintessence at this moment!","He had withstood a single Aeonic Damage Value in the Apollyon Dimension from a single Ancestral Descendant over the past day- and this had been a point of surprise for that being as they began to release even more ferocious attacks.","But now, his many advancements in concepts that granted increased multipliers as well as the forging of his Dimensional Layers...it all allowed him to release Aeonic Damage Values exceeding 100 even without putting his Body into account!","This 100 Aeonic Damage Value should be a threshold for the common Ancestral Descendants as after Noah completed all the recent elevations, he expected to be heading towards 200 Aeonic Damage Values and higher.","At such a juncture, he would place the common Ancestral Descendants below his feet.","\"Good...\"","BZZZT!","His Will vibrated joyously as he felt a limitation crack at this moment.","The True Authority of Quintessence was surging out like stellar seas into his body as they wrapped around his soul and elevated it even further!","Noah felt his limitations exceeded as a Boundary Layer was exceeded and soon after..another Boundary was also initiated!","Noah felt his Soul cry out with joy at this moment as uniquely, he felt streams of authority bathe it and elevate it even higher.","This..was a power that came when one went further towards EXTREMITY.","It was the elevation of one's soul on this path as it seemed Noah had passed a critical junction in his Boundary to achieve it!","His Will scrutinized the new changes as he became alarmed at the grandiosity before him.","<The Boundary of LOOT has reached the Third Boundary Layer through the True Authority of Quintessence!>","<The Boundary of QUINTESSENCE has reached the First Boundary Layer through the True Authority of Quintessence!>","<Through the effect of the First Boundary Layer of QUINTESSENCE, the Boundary of Loot has reached the Fourth Boundary Layer!>","...!","\"What!\"","Noah's mind buzzed as he felt an explosion of regality within his soul.","The Boundary of QUINTESSENCE seemed to be utterly ridiculous as Noah had to verify its effect right away, his Will surging into it speedily!","<The First Boundary Layer of QUINTESSENCE> (Passive): A terrifying concept to be forged into a Boundary as its path towards EXTREMITY is to always seek to be the most ideal and perfect example of a Boundary. Its Tier among Boundaries is not fixed as it can change the further it goes towards Extremity. The First Boundary Layer of QUINTESSENCE is a simple one as it seeks to make the Boundaries of its Master unequaled, directly increasing all your current Boundaries one additional Boundary Layer. This passive effect is only applicable to a concept that has already become a Boundary, and this effect is not applicable to the Boundary of QUINTESSENCE itself...","...!","Noah stared at the boons of the First Boundary Layer of QUINTESSENCE in utter surprise due to its sheer effects.","It was a complete destruction of Reality and logic.","An utter desecration of what everyone knew as if the Ancestral Descendants knew such a thing existed..they would question what their hard work for billions of years was for in order to raise just one concept to the Third Boundary Layer, or multiple aspects to the Second Boundary Layer!","Yes.","Billions of years! This was how long it took to raise a single Boundary to the Third Layer, or the Fourth Boundary Layer if one was a genius!","And this number could only be reduced or changed with Treasures that affected Boundaries- which could achieve new Layers instantly after their Absorption or a few years after.","But for Noah..as long as he made any concept into a Boundary, it would instantly be elevated by another Boundary Layer!","It was simply terrifying.","His soul was experiencing the boons of this as it seemed other benchmarks were met with the Boundary of LOOT.","<The Third Boundary Layer of LOOT >(Passive):: The Layer that shall be known as The Glory of LOOT has appeared. The passage of this Boundary is a critical juncture as it elevates your strength, allowing the Authority of LOOT to constantly refine and strengthen your Soul over time as another critical feature is the augmentation of +100% to All Aeonic Parameter Values. This percentage augmentation will change over time as it is dependent on how much glorious Loot you attain from this point onward, where the higher quality and quantity of Loot you attain, the greater the Augmentation Value...","\"...\"","Speechless.","Noah was utterly speechless."]}]);
